<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0077a8d9-2e9d-4626-8dd0-04272b780ea9_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Earliest reference to Jogeśvara Mandira recording a land endowment"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription of Aṃśuvarman at Hā̃ḍigāũ, Kathmandu, records that the Gũ Vihāra (Jogeśvara Mandira) was allocated a grant of 6purāṇas 2paṇas from the state equal to the grants for Paśupati and Cā̃gunārāyaṇa. This is the earliest historical record that has a clear mention of the Gũ Vihāra."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0077a8d9-2e9d-4626-8dd0-04272b780ea9> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription of Aṃśuvarman at Hā̃ḍigāũ, Kathmandu, records that the Gũ Vihāra (Jogeśvara Mandira) was allocated a grant of 6purāṇas 2paṇas from the state equal to the grants for Paśupati and Cā̃gunārāyaṇa. This is the earliest historical record that has a clear mention of the Gũ Vihāra."@en ;
