<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/00c84501-dc97-43c8-b6b5-8b0e9735b8dd_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of Pillar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As previously stated, the Pillar contains a five-line inscription in Nāgarī script, and the execution of the inscription is crude and now severely eroded. P. R. Sharma published the inscription's content (Sharma 2012: 181). The following is his reading and translation: “Oṁ svasti sāke 1422 biju rāut saptani sā wala rāut ... vishnu subhaṁHail! sake 1422 Biju Rāut with his wife Sāwala Rāut ... Vishnu (does) well for all”."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/00c84501-dc97-43c8-b6b5-8b0e9735b8dd> ;
    rdfs:comment "As previously stated, the Pillar contains a five-line inscription in Nāgarī script, and the execution of the inscription is crude and now severely eroded. P. R. Sharma published the inscription's content (Sharma 2012: 181). The following is his reading and translation: “Oṁ svasti sāke 1422 biju rāut saptani sā wala rāut ... vishnu subhaṁHail! sake 1422 Biju Rāut with his wife Sāwala Rāut ... Vishnu (does) well for all”."@en ;
