        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Another inscription, recovered from the house located to the south of Tāpālāchi has been preserved. This inscription is not related to Tāpālāchi Phalcā, but rather records that in 1850 CE (NS 970), a three-bay phalcā was built on the ground floor of the very house from which it was recovered. In the name of Anirudra, his wife had constructed that veryphalcāand endowed land for maintenance by aguṭhī.फल्चामा तापालाछिको दक्षिणतिर भएको घरबाट बरामद अर्को एक अभिलेख सुरक्षित राखिएको छ । उक्त अभिलेख यस फल्चासँग सम्बन्धित नभई बरामद गरिएकै घरको भूमि तलामा नेसं ९७० (सन् १८५०) मा तीन कवलको फल्चा बनाइएको प्रसंग छ । आफ्ना पति अनिरुद्रका नाममा उनकी पत्नीले उक्त फल्चा बनाई जग्गा गुठी राखेका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/013ba068-2100-462c-abb9-29c7a0dc6eef> ;
    rdfs:comment "Another inscription, recovered from the house located to the south of Tāpālāchi has been preserved. This inscription is not related to Tāpālāchi Phalcā, but rather records that in 1850 CE (NS 970), a three-bay phalcā was built on the ground floor of the very house from which it was recovered. In the name of Anirudra, his wife had constructed that veryphalcāand endowed land for maintenance by aguṭhī.फल्चामा तापालाछिको दक्षिणतिर भएको घरबाट बरामद अर्को एक अभिलेख सुरक्षित राखिएको छ । उक्त अभिलेख यस फल्चासँग सम्बन्धित नभई बरामद गरिएकै घरको भूमि तलामा नेसं ९७० (सन् १८५०) मा तीन कवलको फल्चा बनाइएको प्रसंग छ । आफ्ना पति अनिरुद्रका नाममा उनकी पत्नीले उक्त फल्चा बनाई जग्गा गुठी राखेका थिए ।"@en ;
