    rdfs:label "Offering of an oil-balustrade and establishment of new statues"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Guruṅga Maharjana and his family members offered a balustrade (dalūcā) to the Bāhāḥ for lighting up oil-lams and also filled in the empty niches of the Caitya with new statues."@en ;
