    rdfs:label "Formation of a guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription details the formation of aguṭhīto carry out annual rituals for the temple, along with the regulations and names of theguṭhiyāras. However, the portion containing the date is eroded and illegible."@en ;
