<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02da1b3e-8f31-4000-ad9f-d5b5f6b4c2e3_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Conducting of a special worship"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Residents of Patan, Śaṅkhmūla, and Devakhyaḥ Ṭola jointly organized apīṭhaworship ceremony and, upon its completion, installed a copper inscription (tāmrāpatra) at the Indrāyaṇīpīṭha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02da1b3e-8f31-4000-ad9f-d5b5f6b4c2e3> ;
