<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of two ducks"@en ;
    dcterms:description "When the pinnacle was removed during the renovation of the Bhairavī temple at Nuwakot, sacrificial animals—including buffaloes, goats, and ducks—were dispatched for offerings to various deities. On that occasion, Goddess Taleju also received ritual worship accompanied by the offering of two ducks.नुवाकोट भैरवी मन्दिरको जीर्णोद्धार गर्न गजूर निकाल्दा बलि दिनको लागि विभिन्न देवीदेवतालाई राँगो, बोका, हाँस पठाइएको थियो । सोही क्रममा तलेजु भवानीलाई पनि दुईवटा हाँससहित पूजा गर्न पठाइएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "When the pinnacle was removed during the renovation of the Bhairavī temple at Nuwakot, sacrificial animals—including buffaloes, goats, and ducks—were dispatched for offerings to various deities. On that occasion, Goddess Taleju also received ritual worship accompanied by the offering of two ducks.नुवाकोट भैरवी मन्दिरको जीर्णोद्धार गर्न गजूर निकाल्दा बलि दिनको लागि विभिन्न देवीदेवतालाई राँगो, बोका, हाँस पठाइएको थियो । सोही क्रममा तलेजु भवानीलाई पनि दुईवटा हाँससहित पूजा गर्न पठाइएको थियो ।"@en ;
