<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands for daily worship"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In order to ensure the continuity of worship at the Taleju shrine, Dāmodara Pāṇḍe endowed fields yielding a total of fortymurīof produce to the priest Bhājurāma for the performance of rituals at Taleju.दामोदर पाँडेले तलेजुमा हुने पूजालाई निरन्तरता दिनको लागि पुजारी भाजुरामलाई जम्मा ४० मुरी उब्जनी हुने खेत दिएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "In order to ensure the continuity of worship at the Taleju shrine, Dāmodara Pāṇḍe endowed fields yielding a total of fortymurīof produce to the priest Bhājurāma for the performance of rituals at Taleju.दामोदर पाँडेले तलेजुमा हुने पूजालाई निरन्तरता दिनको लागि पुजारी भाजुरामलाई जम्मा ४० मुरी उब्जनी हुने खेत दिएका थिए ।"@en ;
