<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Order to prevent jungle around the Taleju Ghara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Rājendrāvikrama Śāha issued a royal directive to protect Ṛṣivana—the area where the Taleju Ghara stands—recognizing it as a site sanctified by the austerities ofṛṣis and as an important location associated with the Bhairavī Procession.राजा राजेन्द्रविक्रम शाहले ऋषिहरूले तपस्या गरेको र भैरवीको जात्रासँग सम्बन्धित महत्त्वपूर्ण ठाउँ हुनाले तलेजु घर रहेको ऋषिवनलाई संरक्षण गर्न आदेश दिएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "King Rājendrāvikrama Śāha issued a royal directive to protect Ṛṣivana—the area where the Taleju Ghara stands—recognizing it as a site sanctified by the austerities ofṛṣis and as an important location associated with the Bhairavī Procession.राजा राजेन्द्रविक्रम शाहले ऋषिहरूले तपस्या गरेको र भैरवीको जात्रासँग सम्बन्धित महत्त्वपूर्ण ठाउँ हुनाले तलेजु घर रहेको ऋषिवनलाई संरक्षण गर्न आदेश दिएका थिए ।"@en ;
