<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Theft of the statue of Taleju"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The image of the Goddess Taleju, which had been kept in a concealed manner on the second floor of the Taleju Ghara, was stolen. Following the theft, a new image was made and installed; however, the original stolen image has never been recovered.तलेजु घरको दोस्रो तलामा गुह्य रुपले राखिएको तलेजुको मूर्ति चोरी भएको थियो । मूर्ति चोरी भएपछि नयाँ मूर्ति बनाएर स्थापना गरिएको थियो । चोरी भएको पुरानो मूर्ति अहिलेसम्म पनि फेला परेको छैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "The image of the Goddess Taleju, which had been kept in a concealed manner on the second floor of the Taleju Ghara, was stolen. Following the theft, a new image was made and installed; however, the original stolen image has never been recovered.तलेजु घरको दोस्रो तलामा गुह्य रुपले राखिएको तलेजुको मूर्ति चोरी भएको थियो । मूर्ति चोरी भएपछि नयाँ मूर्ति बनाएर स्थापना गरिएको थियो । चोरी भएको पुरानो मूर्ति अहिलेसम्म पनि फेला परेको छैन ।"@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
