<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Taleju Ghara, already in a dilapidated condition, suffered severe cracking during the earthquake. Although the roof on the eastern side sustained damage, the structure itself did not collapse at that time.पहिले नै जीर्ण भइसकेको तलेजु घर भूकम्पले नराम्ररी चर्केको थियो । पूर्वपट्टि छानामा केही क्षति पुगेपनि घर भत्केको थिएन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Taleju Ghara, already in a dilapidated condition, suffered severe cracking during the earthquake. Although the roof on the eastern side sustained damage, the structure itself did not collapse at that time.पहिले नै जीर्ण भइसकेको तलेजु घर भूकम्पले नराम्ररी चर्केको थियो । पूर्वपट्टि छानामा केही क्षति पुगेपनि घर भत्केको थिएन ।"@en ;
