<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_5> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Collapse of the Taleju Ghara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As timely repairs were not undertaken, the building was temporarily covered with plastic sheets to protect it from rain. When these coverings later tore, rainwater entered the structure, resulting in the collapse of the eastern portion of the building.भूकम्पले चर्किसकेको तलेजु घरको समयमै मर्मतसम्भार नभएपछि पानीबाट बचाउनको लागि प्लाष्टिकले छोपेर राखिएको थियो । पछि प्लाष्टिक पनि च्यातिएर वर्षात्‌को पानी पसेपछि पूर्वपट्टिको भाग भत्केको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "As timely repairs were not undertaken, the building was temporarily covered with plastic sheets to protect it from rain. When these coverings later tore, rainwater entered the structure, resulting in the collapse of the eastern portion of the building.भूकम्पले चर्किसकेको तलेजु घरको समयमै मर्मतसम्भार नभएपछि पानीबाट बचाउनको लागि प्लाष्टिकले छोपेर राखिएको थियो । पछि प्लाष्टिक पनि च्यातिएर वर्षात्‌को पानी पसेपछि पूर्वपट्टिको भाग भत्केको थियो ।"@en ;
