<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Agreement between China and Nepal"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Government of China expressed its commitment to assist in the restoration and reconstruction of heritage sites damaged by the earthquake in Nuwakot. Accordingly, an agreement was concluded between China and Nepal for the reconstruction of the Taleju Ghara and the conservation and restoration of other damaged monuments. The agreement was signed on behalf of China’s Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC) by Zhang Fan, and on behalf of Nepal’s National Reconstruction Authority by Pitāmbar Ghimire. Responsibility for the conservation work was entrusted to the Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage, with the stipulation that restoration and reconstruction be completed within forty-five months of the agreement.भूकम्पले क्षति भएका नुवाकोटका सम्पदाहरूको जीर्णोद्धार र पुनर्निर्माण गर्न चीनले सहयोग गर्ने प्रतिबद्धता व्यक्त गरेको थियो । त्यसै क्रममा तलेजु घरको पुनर्निर्माण गर्ने लगायत अन्य सम्पदाहरूको जीर्णोद्धार, पुनर्निर्माण गर्न चीन र नेपालबीच सम्झौता भएको थियो । सम्झौतामा चीनको Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC) को तर्फबाट Zhang Fan ले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए भने नेपालको राष्ट्रिय पुनर्निर्माण प्राधिकरणको तर्फबाट पिताम्बर घिमिरेले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए । जीर्णोद्धारको जिम्मेवारी चीनको Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage लाई सुम्पिएको थियो । सम्झौता भएको ४५ महिनाभित्र सम्पदाहरूको पुनर्निर्माण, जीर्णोद्धार सम्पन्न गर्ने सम्झौता भएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Government of China expressed its commitment to assist in the restoration and reconstruction of heritage sites damaged by the earthquake in Nuwakot. Accordingly, an agreement was concluded between China and Nepal for the reconstruction of the Taleju Ghara and the conservation and restoration of other damaged monuments. The agreement was signed on behalf of China’s Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC) by Zhang Fan, and on behalf of Nepal’s National Reconstruction Authority by Pitāmbar Ghimire. Responsibility for the conservation work was entrusted to the Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage, with the stipulation that restoration and reconstruction be completed within forty-five months of the agreement.भूकम्पले क्षति भएका नुवाकोटका सम्पदाहरूको जीर्णोद्धार र पुनर्निर्माण गर्न चीनले सहयोग गर्ने प्रतिबद्धता व्यक्त गरेको थियो । त्यसै क्रममा तलेजु घरको पुनर्निर्माण गर्ने लगायत अन्य सम्पदाहरूको जीर्णोद्धार, पुनर्निर्माण गर्न चीन र नेपालबीच सम्झौता भएको थियो । सम्झौतामा चीनको Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC) को तर्फबाट Zhang Fan ले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए भने नेपालको राष्ट्रिय पुनर्निर्माण प्राधिकरणको तर्फबाट पिताम्बर घिमिरेले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए । जीर्णोद्धारको जिम्मेवारी चीनको Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage लाई सुम्पिएको थियो । सम्झौता भएको ४५ महिनाभित्र सम्पदाहरूको पुनर्निर्माण, जीर्णोद्धार सम्पन्न गर्ने सम्झौता भएको थियो ।"@en ;
