<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_7> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Kṣamāpūā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As part of the restoration process, akṣamāpūjāwas performed for the reconstruction and conservation of the Taleju Ghara and other earthquake-damaged monuments of Nuwakot. The ceremony was attended by the Mayor of Bidur Municipality, Rājan Śreṣṭha, and the Deputy Mayor, Prabhā Bogaṭī.तलेजु घर लगायत भूकम्पले क्षति भएका नुवाकोटका सम्पदाहरूको पुनर्निर्माण र जीर्णोद्धार गर्न क्षमापूजा गरिएको थियो । उक्त पूजामा बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ र उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "As part of the restoration process, akṣamāpūjāwas performed for the reconstruction and conservation of the Taleju Ghara and other earthquake-damaged monuments of Nuwakot. The ceremony was attended by the Mayor of Bidur Municipality, Rājan Śreṣṭha, and the Deputy Mayor, Prabhā Bogaṭī.तलेजु घर लगायत भूकम्पले क्षति भएका नुवाकोटका सम्पदाहरूको पुनर्निर्माण र जीर्णोद्धार गर्न क्षमापूजा गरिएको थियो । उक्त पूजामा बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ र उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
