<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542_8> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Worship to strengthen the foundation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Abhūmipūjā(worship to strengthen the foundation) was conducted for the protection of the foundations of the Taleju Ghara under reconstruction and the seven-storey palace undergoing conservation, with the support of the Government of China. This ritual was attended by the Director General of the Department of Archaeology, Saubhāgya Pradhānāṅga, the Mayor of Bidur Municipality Rājana Śreṣṭha and Deputy Mayor of Bidur Municipality Prabhā Bogaṭī, and other elected representatives.चीन सरकारको सहयोगमा पुनर्निर्माण भइरहेको तलेजु घर एवं जीर्णोद्धार भइरहेको साततले दरबारको जग संरक्षणको लागि भूमिपूजा गरिएको थियो । उक्त पूजामा पुरातत्त्व विभागका महानिर्देशक सौभाग्य प्रधानाङ्ग, बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ, उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी लगायत जनप्रतिनिधिहरू पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/02f204ae-8a02-4b50-a82c-b7551b103542> ;
    rdfs:comment "Abhūmipūjā(worship to strengthen the foundation) was conducted for the protection of the foundations of the Taleju Ghara under reconstruction and the seven-storey palace undergoing conservation, with the support of the Government of China. This ritual was attended by the Director General of the Department of Archaeology, Saubhāgya Pradhānāṅga, the Mayor of Bidur Municipality Rājana Śreṣṭha and Deputy Mayor of Bidur Municipality Prabhā Bogaṭī, and other elected representatives.चीन सरकारको सहयोगमा पुनर्निर्माण भइरहेको तलेजु घर एवं जीर्णोद्धार भइरहेको साततले दरबारको जग संरक्षणको लागि भूमिपूजा गरिएको थियो । उक्त पूजामा पुरातत्त्व विभागका महानिर्देशक सौभाग्य प्रधानाङ्ग, बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ, उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी लगायत जनप्रतिनिधिहरू पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
