<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/03320d41-173e-4308-b7a2-7f3f6c5c8126_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Prime Minister Bhīmasena Thāpā, together with his wife Bhaktakumārī, constructed the temple at the Janaralabāga (lit. general’s garden). He also endowed lands to form aguṭhīfor performing daily and other periodic rituals at the temple, along with feeding mendicants on various occasions and brahmins on the occasion of Bhīmasena Thāpā’s birthday."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/03320d41-173e-4308-b7a2-7f3f6c5c8126> ;
    rdfs:comment "Prime Minister Bhīmasena Thāpā, together with his wife Bhaktakumārī, constructed the temple at the Janaralabāga (lit. general’s garden). He also endowed lands to form aguṭhīfor performing daily and other periodic rituals at the temple, along with feeding mendicants on various occasions and brahmins on the occasion of Bhīmasena Thāpā’s birthday."@en ;
