<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/03320d41-173e-4308-b7a2-7f3f6c5c8126_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The second wife of Bhīmasena Thāpā endowed 77ropanīs of land from various parts of Nepal for theguṭhīto perform various rituals at the temple. The inscription instructs the concerned persons to keep track of the expenses for the rituals and enter the remainder into the deity’s treasury."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/03320d41-173e-4308-b7a2-7f3f6c5c8126> ;
