<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/03320d41-173e-4308-b7a2-7f3f6c5c8126_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation pūjārī ghara of Bhīmabhakteśvara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The old priest house of theBhīmabhakteśvara Guṭhīwas renovated and the office of the Nepal Hotel Byawasayi Samaj, an organization of hotel entrepreneurs, was set up here with the assistance from the Sundhārā Āmā Samuha, a group of elderly ladies from Sundhārā area."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/03320d41-173e-4308-b7a2-7f3f6c5c8126> ;
