<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/03450b1b-4e03-4331-a079-202719840a5c_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The construction of a temple at the site, previously consisting only of a natural cave, was undertaken in 1859 CE (NS 979) by a Buddhācārya family from Ināco (Indravat Mahāvihāra), Bhaktapur. The inscription preserved in the temple records several names of the donor family, including Amṛtamuni, Dharmavatī, and Maṇithaku, although the portion bearing the name of the principal patron has been worn away. A later inscription dated 1883 CE (NS 1003), recording the construction of asataḥat the same site, reveals that the principal builders of the temple were Jogamuni and his wife Jñānīthaku.गुफामात्र हुने गरेको ठाउँमा मन्दिर बनाउने कार्य नेसं ९७९ (सन् १८५९) मा भक्तपुर इनाचो (इन्द्रवत् महाविहार) निवासी एक बुद्धाचार्य परिवारले गरेका थिए । मन्दिरमा भएको अभिलेखमा निर्माता परिवारमध्ये मुख्य कर्ताको नाम कुँदिएको भाग खिइएको छ । अभिलेखमा अमृतमुनि, धर्मवती, मणिथकु आदि नाम पढ्न सकिन्छ । यस पछि यही स्थानमा सतः बनाई राखिएको नेसं १००३ (सन् १८८३) को अभिलेखमा मुख्य मन्दिर निर्माताको नाम खुल्दछ । ती जोगमुनि र उनकी पत्नी ज्ञानीथकु थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/03450b1b-4e03-4331-a079-202719840a5c> ;
    rdfs:comment "The construction of a temple at the site, previously consisting only of a natural cave, was undertaken in 1859 CE (NS 979) by a Buddhācārya family from Ināco (Indravat Mahāvihāra), Bhaktapur. The inscription preserved in the temple records several names of the donor family, including Amṛtamuni, Dharmavatī, and Maṇithaku, although the portion bearing the name of the principal patron has been worn away. A later inscription dated 1883 CE (NS 1003), recording the construction of asataḥat the same site, reveals that the principal builders of the temple were Jogamuni and his wife Jñānīthaku.गुफामात्र हुने गरेको ठाउँमा मन्दिर बनाउने कार्य नेसं ९७९ (सन् १८५९) मा भक्तपुर इनाचो (इन्द्रवत् महाविहार) निवासी एक बुद्धाचार्य परिवारले गरेका थिए । मन्दिरमा भएको अभिलेखमा निर्माता परिवारमध्ये मुख्य कर्ताको नाम कुँदिएको भाग खिइएको छ । अभिलेखमा अमृतमुनि, धर्मवती, मणिथकु आदि नाम पढ्न सकिन्छ । यस पछि यही स्थानमा सतः बनाई राखिएको नेसं १००३ (सन् १८८३) को अभिलेखमा मुख्य मन्दिर निर्माताको नाम खुल्दछ । ती जोगमुनि र उनकी पत्नी ज्ञानीथकु थिए ।"@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
