<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/03450b1b-4e03-4331-a079-202719840a5c_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation, new construction, land endowment  and guṭhī formation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Further restoration was carried out in 1949 CE (VS 2006) by descendants of the same family. During this work, the temple and the adjacentcaitya(BKT0710-009) were repaired, and ahiti, a boundary wall, and anothersataḥto the left of the temple were constructed. Lands located in Ināco, Bhaktapur, along with properties in other places, were endowed asguṭhīin the name of the temple. According to the inscription, the income from these endowments was intended to support priests, attendants (avāla), and other necessary personnel, who were to reside at the site and annually celebratevarṣavardhanawith a communal feast on the full-moon day of Kārtika.मन्दिर निर्माताकै सन्ततिले विसं २००६ (सन् १९४९) सालमा मन्दिर र मन्दिरसँगैको चैत्य (BKT0710-009) जीर्णोद्धार गर्नुका साथै हिति, पर्खाल र मन्दिरको बायाँ अर्को सतः थपेका थिए । यिनले भक्तपुर, इनाचोस्थित आफ्नो विर्ता र अन्य विविध ठाउँका जग्गा मन्दिरका नाममा गुठी राखेका थिए । तिनको आयबाट पुजारी, अवाल र अन्य आवश्यक व्यक्तिहरू बसी प्रतिवर्ष कर्तिक शुक्ल पूर्णिमाका दिन वर्षवर्धन मनाई भोज खानुपर्ने कुरा अभिलेखमा परेको छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/03450b1b-4e03-4331-a079-202719840a5c> ;
    rdfs:comment "Further restoration was carried out in 1949 CE (VS 2006) by descendants of the same family. During this work, the temple and the adjacentcaitya(BKT0710-009) were repaired, and ahiti, a boundary wall, and anothersataḥto the left of the temple were constructed. Lands located in Ināco, Bhaktapur, along with properties in other places, were endowed asguṭhīin the name of the temple. According to the inscription, the income from these endowments was intended to support priests, attendants (avāla), and other necessary personnel, who were to reside at the site and annually celebratevarṣavardhanawith a communal feast on the full-moon day of Kārtika.मन्दिर निर्माताकै सन्ततिले विसं २००६ (सन् १९४९) सालमा मन्दिर र मन्दिरसँगैको चैत्य (BKT0710-009) जीर्णोद्धार गर्नुका साथै हिति, पर्खाल र मन्दिरको बायाँ अर्को सतः थपेका थिए । यिनले भक्तपुर, इनाचोस्थित आफ्नो विर्ता र अन्य विविध ठाउँका जग्गा मन्दिरका नाममा गुठी राखेका थिए । तिनको आयबाट पुजारी, अवाल र अन्य आवश्यक व्यक्तिहरू बसी प्रतिवर्ष कर्तिक शुक्ल पूर्णिमाका दिन वर्षवर्धन मनाई भोज खानुपर्ने कुरा अभिलेखमा परेको छ ।"@en ;
