<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/03450b1b-4e03-4331-a079-202719840a5c_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of a statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "With the wish for universal well-being, a Mānandhara family from Kathmandu installed a white image of Mañjuśrī in front of the cave within the sanctum.जगत उद्धारको कामनाले काठमाडौंका एक मानन्धर परिवारबाट गर्भगृहको गुफा अगाडि सेतो वर्णको मञ्जुश्री मूर्ति स्थापना भययो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/03450b1b-4e03-4331-a079-202719840a5c> ;
