    rdfs:label "Installation of pedestal for the statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A white marble pedestal was placed within the sanctum, upon which an image of Mañjuśrī was installed in the name of the late Nhuchẽnārāyaṇa Mānandhara of Ḍhokāṭola, Kathmandu.गर्भगृहमा सेतो मार्वलको पेटी हाली त्यसमाथि मञ्जुश्रीको मूर्ति काठमाडौं ढोकाटोल निवासी स्वर्गीय न्हुछेँनारायण मानन्धरको नाममा हालियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/03450b1b-4e03-4331-a079-202719840a5c> ;
