<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0397bc5c-a3f4-42d3-89e4-2b3997dd1f25_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā was built as a concrete structure by Rāma Prasāda Śreṣṭha. He had served aspradhānapañca, a post equivalent to a mayor during the Pañcāyata rule. Before the construction, there was open land and some elements of the Phalcā that proved there used to be aphalcāin traditional architecture."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0397bc5c-a3f4-42d3-89e4-2b3997dd1f25> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Phalcā was built as a concrete structure by Rāma Prasāda Śreṣṭha. He had served aspradhānapañca, a post equivalent to a mayor during the Pañcāyata rule. Before the construction, there was open land and some elements of the Phalcā that proved there used to be aphalcāin traditional architecture."@en ;
