<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/04696efe-cb7c-4059-a28b-9ef11ee516fa_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple had aged over time before the 2015 CE earthquake. Reconstruction was undertaken after the earthquake, funded by the Asian Development Bank and the Urban Development Ministry's Bagmati Civilization conservation committee. Though the overall restoration was completed in October 2022 (Kartik 6, 2079)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/04696efe-cb7c-4059-a28b-9ef11ee516fa> ;
