        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Lakṣmī, a resident of Dāpcā, donated a land parcel with an annual yield of 10murīsspecifically for the worship of Viśvakarmā. However, as of July 2024 CE, no statue of Viśvakarmā is present at the temple. It remains unclear whether the statue was stolen or relocated elsewhere."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0471f8e8-8978-4ed3-9b0e-d83dee7d25ac> ;
