    rdfs:label "Theft of Kṛṣṇa statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following the theft of the original metal Kṛṣṇa statue in 1970 CE (VS 2027), a replacement was installed for the procession. The Kṛṣṇa statue enshrined in thepāṭīwas a personal donation from a local Brahmin named Khilarāja, intended for daily worship (see 'description')."@en ;
