<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/04e62546-0b04-41d7-9651-12189c45e5c6_4> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a dedicated place (pura) to Cakrasamvara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records that Dhanadevaju, Satamuniju, Ratnacandraju, Dhanapatiju, Desarājaju and Ratnadevaju constructed a dedicated place (pura) for Cakrasamvara. This can be found on the topmost floor of one of the buildings in the courtyard. In doing so, they also made an offering of a gilded pinnacle, garlands and three-layered umbrella. The inscription mentions that this cost 140mohora taṃkā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/04e62546-0b04-41d7-9651-12189c45e5c6> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription records that Dhanadevaju, Satamuniju, Ratnacandraju, Dhanapatiju, Desarājaju and Ratnadevaju constructed a dedicated place (pura) for Cakrasamvara. This can be found on the topmost floor of one of the buildings in the courtyard. In doing so, they also made an offering of a gilded pinnacle, garlands and three-layered umbrella. The inscription mentions that this cost 140mohora taṃkā."@en ;
