    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the dyaḥchẽ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mādhavasiṃha and his family from the Vatuṭolaconstructed the god house for Lũmadhi Ajimā and installed a finial. As thedyaḥchẽis known to be already in existence in 1684 CE (NS 804), they may have rebuilt it on this occasion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/051a3dc8-3787-4227-b269-4014a16805fe> ;
