<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/06a4360c-e5ec-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Kṛṣaka Pustakālaya (Library)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Around VS 2040-45, members of the local Jyāpu community established a library in this Capāḥ. The photo published by Pruscha (1975 II: 188) used for describing the Dupāt Gaṇeśa also shows the board of the library.The library is currently housed in the Pichū Phalcā at the rear of the same building."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/06a4360c-e5ec-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Around VS 2040-45, members of the local Jyāpu community established a library in this Capāḥ. The photo published by Pruscha (1975 II: 188) used for describing the Dupāt Gaṇeśa also shows the board of the library.The library is currently housed in the Pichū Phalcā at the rear of the same building."@en ;
