    rdfs:label "Replacing Jhĩgaṭī Roof with Copper Sheets"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The upper two roofs of the temple were already cladded in gold-plated brass. Thejhĩgaṭītiles of the first roof were also replaced with copper sheets. This work was supported by the office of the Ward Number 20, the Department of Archaeology, and local patrons."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/06d2c415-2c7e-4d6f-9617-2b1eb6ab8c4a> ;
