    rdfs:label "Construction of Bhelāchẽ Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Guhya Lakṣmī Brāhmaṇī commissioned this Phalcā. He instructed that beaten rice 1phã, syābaji1mānā, soy beans 1mānā,bean 1prasthafish and 1prasthaginger should be distributed at Bhelāchẽ Phalcā on the full moon day of Bhādra. Three lamps should also be lit on this day."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0706813a-e81d-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
