    dcterms:description "Prabhu Nārāyaṇa, Karga Nārāyaṇa, Tulsī Māyā Śreṣṭha and their family members from Tājāchẽ in Sunṭola erected stone pillars in front of the Temple with figures ofcakra,gadā,śaṅkha, andpadmaon their top."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0826415c-dd5f-4666-aa9e-7ecbb32bfd60> ;
