    rdfs:label "Installation of a Garuḍa statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This Garuḍa statue is installed by Nārāyaṇabhakta Śreṣṭha as a replacement of the initially enshrined Garuḍa statue, which was stolen sometime before 1991 CE. Locals recall that the newly installed statue is half the size of the previous one."@en ;
