        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Inscription of mantra"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The mantraOṃ maṇi padme hūṃis engraved in low relief on the eastern side of the stūpa. It is inscribed in Rañjana script.It does not bar a date but it is possible to compare it with other inscriptions, dated from the 1350's."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/083b9350-1cee-4de0-94f3-8de68dd541dd> ;
