        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction of the first Dharaharā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhīmasena Thāpā constructed the Bhīmasena Stambha in the form of a minaret in front of Bāga Darabāra. The inscription recording the event is at the National Archives. It states that Bhīmasena Thāpā constructed Dharaharā in 1824 CE (VS 1881)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/083ed396-3cc8-41ae-af0f-c4df103305ed> ;
