<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/083ed396-3cc8-41ae-af0f-c4df103305ed_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction of the second (this) Dharaharā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A year after the construction of the first Dharaharā, Queen Lalitatripurāsundarī also built a similar tower a stump of which still survives. A gold-plate inscription posted on top of its entrance mentions that she built the tower and offered a finial in 1825 CE (VS 1882)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/083ed396-3cc8-41ae-af0f-c4df103305ed> ;
