        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Collapse of Bhīmasen's tower"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Within a decade of its construction, the tower constructed by Bhīmasena Thāpā collapsed in the earthquakes of 1833 CE. On the other hand, the tower built by the queen survived the earthquakes but was cracked from top to bottom as seen in a painting byOldfield."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/083ed396-3cc8-41ae-af0f-c4df103305ed> ;
    rdfs:comment "Within a decade of its construction, the tower constructed by Bhīmasena Thāpā collapsed in the earthquakes of 1833 CE. On the other hand, the tower built by the queen survived the earthquakes but was cracked from top to bottom as seen in a painting byOldfield."@en ;
