    rdfs:label "Damages to the roof and renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Local informants say that parts of the roof began leaking during the rainy season in mid-2010 CE. As a temporary solution, the concerned Guthi installed corrugated tin sheets on the roof."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/08e7bdc5-3bfd-43d1-915f-85b53472093b> ;
