<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/08e7bdc5-3bfd-43d1-915f-85b53472093b_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage suffered from the earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Sataḥ was badly damaged in the 2015 earthquakes and subsequently dismantled. It is yet to be reconstructed even after six years of its collapse in the earthquakes. The Department of Archaeology had initiated the administrative process for the reconstruction of the Sataḥ but the process was halted due to the dispute with the Guthi members regarding the Sataḥ’s ownership. The woodworks of the Sataḥ are stored behind the Sataḥ for safety."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/08e7bdc5-3bfd-43d1-915f-85b53472093b> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Sataḥ was badly damaged in the 2015 earthquakes and subsequently dismantled. It is yet to be reconstructed even after six years of its collapse in the earthquakes. The Department of Archaeology had initiated the administrative process for the reconstruction of the Sataḥ but the process was halted due to the dispute with the Guthi members regarding the Sataḥ’s ownership. The woodworks of the Sataḥ are stored behind the Sataḥ for safety."@en ;
