    rdfs:label "Establishment of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Although no records have been found regarding the construction of the temple, local residents say that it was built by Vira Śamśera Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā (1852-1901) and the temple was named after him."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/09cff614-e084-49eb-9fd7-7e4eb20cd37d> ;
