        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Obtainment of stones from Kotkhālvahaṃ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "To build the temple, groups led by soldiers, including Rājaphauḍa, Dhana Khārisā, Śaṃkarasiṃ, and Bhāyadeva, brought in the finest quality stones from Kotkhālvahaṃ (Hāttīvana)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb> ;
