<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb_13> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Performance of koṭyāhuti yajña"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the construction of the temple, King Bhūpatindra Malla performed akoṭyāhutiyajña, a fire oblation of 10 million oblations. He gifted a golden crown to the priest who performed the rituals. This crown is still safely kept by the Karmācārya priests of the Tripura Vidyāpīṭha Āgama."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the construction of the temple, King Bhūpatindra Malla performed akoṭyāhutiyajña, a fire oblation of 10 million oblations. He gifted a golden crown to the priest who performed the rituals. This crown is still safely kept by the Karmācārya priests of the Tripura Vidyāpīṭha Āgama."@en ;
