<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb_14> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Completion of the construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The statue of Siddhilakṣmī, the main deity, was established inside the sanctum on this day. The finial was also installed on top of the uppermost tier on the occasion, marking the completion of the construction. The three miniature temples were also built around the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb> ;
    rdfs:comment "The statue of Siddhilakṣmī, the main deity, was established inside the sanctum on this day. The finial was also installed on top of the uppermost tier on the occasion, marking the completion of the construction. The three miniature temples were also built around the temple."@en ;
