<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb_16> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Collapse of upper tier in 1934 earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The uppermost tier of the temple collapsed in the 1934 earthquakes. The damage inspired a still-popular rhyming proverb: \"Ṅātāpola chatā madu, Bhailaḥdyaḥ patā madu.\" This translates to \"One roof of Ṅātāpola [was lost], and the Bhairava temple was completely gone,\" vividly illustrating the earthquake's impact."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb> ;
    rdfs:comment "The uppermost tier of the temple collapsed in the 1934 earthquakes. The damage inspired a still-popular rhyming proverb: \"Ṅātāpola chatā madu, Bhailaḥdyaḥ patā madu.\" This translates to \"One roof of Ṅātāpola [was lost], and the Bhairava temple was completely gone,\" vividly illustrating the earthquake's impact."@en ;
