<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb_18> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Bhaktapur Municipality renovated the temple, aiming at reducing the roof load. The thickness of the mud layer was decreased, the spacing of the rafters was doubled, and the cross-section of the rafters was reduced. Additionally, the two central struts on the lowest level facing south, thetoraṇafacing north and west, the northern bracket of the western door, and the 36 plaques on the capitals and lintels were all renewed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Bhaktapur Municipality renovated the temple, aiming at reducing the roof load. The thickness of the mud layer was decreased, the spacing of the rafters was doubled, and the cross-section of the rafters was reduced. Additionally, the two central struts on the lowest level facing south, thetoraṇafacing north and west, the northern bracket of the western door, and the 36 plaques on the capitals and lintels were all renewed."@en ;
