    rdfs:label "Obtainment of woods form various places"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Timbers of thethāsĩandmūsĩvariety were obtained from Vābhu and Nhaygāṃ (lit. seven villages, which are Banepā, Nālā, Sāṃgā, Dhulikhela, Panautī, Caukoṭa, and Khaḍpu) for the construction of the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a006229-7e08-4cb2-9883-1527f615bbfb> ;
