<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0a7b6845-c4cc-4fb5-b4ce-3b58837251e9_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "To facilitate the singing of devotional songs at the Tyāṅgā Bhairava sacred site, land was granted to thirteen individuals.त्याङ्गा भैरव देवस्थलमा भजन गाउनको लागि १३ जना व्यक्तिलाई जग्गा दिइएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a7b6845-c4cc-4fb5-b4ce-3b58837251e9> ;
    rdfs:comment "To facilitate the singing of devotional songs at the Tyāṅgā Bhairava sacred site, land was granted to thirteen individuals.त्याङ्गा भैरव देवस्थलमा भजन गाउनको लागि १३ जना व्यक्तिलाई जग्गा दिइएको थियो ।"@en ;
