<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0a7b6845-c4cc-4fb5-b4ce-3b58837251e9_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Performing a fire sacrifice (yajña)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "With the aim of raising funds for the preservation of Tyāṅgā Bhairava and the Rāmeśvara Śivaliṅga, a largeyajñawas organized. The funds collected from this ritual were used to install a brass roof over the Tyāṅgā Bhairava shrine and a copper roof over the Rāmeśvara Śivaliṅga.त्याङ्गा भैरव र रामेश्वर शिवलिङ्गको संरक्षण गर्न चन्दा उठाउने उद्देश्य राखेर ठूलो यज्ञको आयोजना गरिएको थियो । यज्ञबाट संकलित रकमले त्याङ्गा भैरवलाई पित्तलको र रामेश्वर शिवलिङ्गलाई तामाको छाना हालिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0a7b6845-c4cc-4fb5-b4ce-3b58837251e9> ;
    rdfs:comment "With the aim of raising funds for the preservation of Tyāṅgā Bhairava and the Rāmeśvara Śivaliṅga, a largeyajñawas organized. The funds collected from this ritual were used to install a brass roof over the Tyāṅgā Bhairava shrine and a copper roof over the Rāmeśvara Śivaliṅga.त्याङ्गा भैरव र रामेश्वर शिवलिङ्गको संरक्षण गर्न चन्दा उठाउने उद्देश्य राखेर ठूलो यज्ञको आयोजना गरिएको थियो । यज्ञबाट संकलित रकमले त्याङ्गा भैरवलाई पित्तलको र रामेश्वर शिवलिङ्गलाई तामाको छाना हालिएको थियो ।"@en ;
