<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0af56d4b-147e-4edf-9f59-53a0aba19a66_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "At the upper level of thehiti, a west-facing inscription has been placed. The inscription contains the term \"water system\" (jala pranali), indicating that it is related to thehiti. However, due to the illegibility of the text, it is difficult to determine whether the inscription pertains to the construction of the hiti or its renovation. The year mentioned in the inscription is also unclear. The lower part of the inscription appears to be engraved with \"Samvat9??.\""@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0af56d4b-147e-4edf-9f59-53a0aba19a66> ;
    rdfs:comment "At the upper level of thehiti, a west-facing inscription has been placed. The inscription contains the term \"water system\" (jala pranali), indicating that it is related to thehiti. However, due to the illegibility of the text, it is difficult to determine whether the inscription pertains to the construction of the hiti or its renovation. The year mentioned in the inscription is also unclear. The lower part of the inscription appears to be engraved with \"Samvat9??.\""@en ;
