    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the earthquake of 2015 CE (VS 2072), the steps at the lower part of thehitisubsided. With the financial support of Tarkeshwar Municipality, thehitiwas renovated in 2022 CE (VS 2079)."@en ;
