    rdfs:label "Addition of pillar by Pārthivendra Malla"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pārthivendra Malla erected a pillar with a tortoise at its base. It bears the statues of King Pārthivendra, Queen Mother Indramatī, the young Prince Bhūpālendra, Queen Ṛddhilakṣmī, and Queen Rājalakṣmī. However, only four of these figures remain today."@en ;
