    rdfs:label "Construction of a well"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The earliest known record from the Udāsī Akhaḍā is an inscription from 1889 CE (VS 1945) that documents the completion of a well within the premises. The inscription uses both Gurmukhi and Devanāgarī scripts."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0d1f82cf-f79d-46bf-a356-64a93b3ce7ef> ;
