    rdfs:label "Unknown event (perhaps the construction of a Caitya, i.e., SKH0080-001)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription posted on the northern side of the Caitya’s plinth (see object number SKH0080-001 above) is heavily damaged, thus it cannot be deciphered, and its contents remain unclear. According to a local resident, it records the establishment of the Caitya by a person named Jayendra Vajra, who then started living there by buying a house."@en ;
