        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the late 1990s (ca. 1998 CE), local people rebuilt the Phalcā into a modern structure and covered it by a concrete slab. Some parts of the historic Phalcā such asnhāykaṃlvahaṃ, pillars, anddātiaḥpās were reused. The three stone statues are original."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0da8638b-78ef-4431-9b11-fbee618d6863> ;
