    rdfs:label "Offerings of gilded finials"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The deities enshrined in the temple received an offering of gilded finials from Phojasi Mahata, Mildārāma, Daśanārāyaṇa, Siddhisiha, Dharmanātha, Maheśvara, Śrīkṛṣṇa, and the chief of a local religious trust."@en ;
