<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/0f81a5e9-409a-4006-8026-7ae83d2fd17a_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of inscribed stele"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An stele inscribed in Nāgarī script is installed on the right side of the temple's door.Bishwo Pokharel recently published the following reading of the inscription (Pokharel 2011):1. oṁ maṇi padme huṁ2. ālokastimire vipaddibamaṇiḥ pāte ka3. rālambanaṁ yācñākalpatarurjagajjayaratheḥ4. pātheyamanne(nnaṁ)pathi | duḥkhavyādhimahaubadhirbha5. vabhayod vedāntaprayāṇāsanaṃ tāpe  candanakā6. nanaṃ sthirasuhadbhargstatāṃ bāndhavaḥ ||...||7. narakapatitāssatvāṃḥ sukhāvatiṃ modatu || a8. nena puṇyakuśalena | jaisiṃdhena vinirmitāyam9. śrīśāke 1277"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0f81a5e9-409a-4006-8026-7ae83d2fd17a> ;
    rdfs:comment "An stele inscribed in Nāgarī script is installed on the right side of the temple's door.Bishwo Pokharel recently published the following reading of the inscription (Pokharel 2011):1. oṁ maṇi padme huṁ2. ālokastimire vipaddibamaṇiḥ pāte ka3. rālambanaṁ yācñākalpatarurjagajjayaratheḥ4. pātheyamanne(nnaṁ)pathi | duḥkhavyādhimahaubadhirbha5. vabhayod vedāntaprayāṇāsanaṃ tāpe  candanakā6. nanaṃ sthirasuhadbhargstatāṃ bāndhavaḥ ||...||7. narakapatitāssatvāṃḥ sukhāvatiṃ modatu || a8. nena puṇyakuśalena | jaisiṃdhena vinirmitāyam9. śrīśāke 1277"@en ;
