    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā, damaged in the 2015 earthquake, was dismantled and reconstructed by the metropolitan city in 2020 CE. For the reconstruction, original carved wooden materials seem to have been reused.पछिल्लो महाभूकम्पमा क्षति भएको फल्चालाई भत्काई महानगरपालिकाले विसं २०७७ सालमा यसको पुनर्निर्माणकार्य सम्पन्न गरेको थियो । यस पुनर्निर्मानका दौरान पुरानै बुट्टेदार काष्ठसामग्रीलाई पुनः प्रयोगमा ल्याइएको देखिन्छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/0ff1a49f-adcd-43d2-9567-e02a0c709118> ;
