<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1138b75f-7cf0-4087-abc0-67bcd51c6862_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the well"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Individuals such as Govindarāma Bhāvo and Darasiṃha Bhāvo, among others, collectively restored and re-established the well in Dathulāchi ṭola. The group involved in the restoration also arranged to visit Jawalakhel every year on the day of theBhoṭō Jātrā (Jāhvalā Jātrā) of Buṅgadyaḥ, to perform worship and partake in a feast."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1138b75f-7cf0-4087-abc0-67bcd51c6862> ;
