<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1138b75f-7cf0-4087-abc0-67bcd51c6862_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the Gaṇeśa phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The phalcā where Gaṇeśa was installed, located inthathvatvāla(upper ṭola) of Harisiddhi, was restored. After a month-longGuṃlā Dharmacelebration in Harisiddhi, the residents of the ṭola, under the leadership ofThakāliCandrarāma Bhāvo, collectively restored the phalcā housing Gaṇeśa. The responsibility for its upkeep was assigned to Śiva, Siddhirāma, and Darasiṃha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1138b75f-7cf0-4087-abc0-67bcd51c6862> ;
    rdfs:comment "The phalcā where Gaṇeśa was installed, located inthathvatvāla(upper ṭola) of Harisiddhi, was restored. After a month-longGuṃlā Dharmacelebration in Harisiddhi, the residents of the ṭola, under the leadership ofThakāliCandrarāma Bhāvo, collectively restored the phalcā housing Gaṇeśa. The responsibility for its upkeep was assigned to Śiva, Siddhirāma, and Darasiṃha."@en ;
