    rdfs:label "Paving the temple courtyard with stones"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Budhbir Kālu, a resident of Thathukvākva ṭola in Harisiddhi, together with his wife Śaṃlakṣmi and his sons Purnalāl, Śaṅkhalāl, Bekhalāl, and Jītlāl, had paved the stone slabs in front of the Gaṇeśa temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1138b75f-7cf0-4087-abc0-67bcd51c6862> ;
