<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1165bb2e-eb1e-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Funds used for bhajana"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The area behind thisphalcāis calledbāhāḥ,where one can see several Buddhist statues and Hindu shrines. The organisation managing thephalcāis named Laganakhela Bhajana Maṇḍala. It has organisedbhajanain thisbāhāḥfor the last 40 years and is also responsible for renting shop space."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1165bb2e-eb1e-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The area behind thisphalcāis calledbāhāḥ,where one can see several Buddhist statues and Hindu shrines. The organisation managing thephalcāis named Laganakhela Bhajana Maṇḍala. It has organisedbhajanain thisbāhāḥfor the last 40 years and is also responsible for renting shop space."@en ;
