<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of a stone tympanum"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Under the collective initiative of Gopāla Bhāvo (Jyāpu/agricultural community) and other members of the Bhāvo community, a stonetoraṇawas established in the name of Conideva Bhaṭṭāraka. In addition to thistoraṇa, certain stone base structures were also constructed; however, due to the erosion of some letters in the inscription, the precise nature of these structures cannot be clearly ascertained.गोपाल भाव (ज्यापु/कृषक) सहित यस समुदायका अन्य व्यक्तिहरूको सामुहिक प्रयासबाट चोनिदेव भट्टारकको नाममा ढुङ्गाको तोरण स्थापना गरे । यस तोरणका अलावा ढुङ्गाकै केही आधार संरचना निर्माण गरिएको कुरा पनि परेको छ तर केही अक्षर खिइएकाले बनेको वस्तु के हो भन्ने तथ्य स्पष्ट छैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Under the collective initiative of Gopāla Bhāvo (Jyāpu/agricultural community) and other members of the Bhāvo community, a stonetoraṇawas established in the name of Conideva Bhaṭṭāraka. In addition to thistoraṇa, certain stone base structures were also constructed; however, due to the erosion of some letters in the inscription, the precise nature of these structures cannot be clearly ascertained.गोपाल भाव (ज्यापु/कृषक) सहित यस समुदायका अन्य व्यक्तिहरूको सामुहिक प्रयासबाट चोनिदेव भट्टारकको नाममा ढुङ्गाको तोरण स्थापना गरे । यस तोरणका अलावा ढुङ्गाकै केही आधार संरचना निर्माण गरिएको कुरा पनि परेको छ तर केही अक्षर खिइएकाले बनेको वस्तु के हो भन्ने तथ्य स्पष्ट छैन ।"@en ;
