<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of miniature temples"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Under the leadership of Kina Bhāvo (Kṛṣṇa Bhāvo), a group from the Bhāvo community constructed small temples on either side of the central stone revered as Cunadevi.किन भावो (कृष्ण भावो) को प्रमुखत्वमा भावो समुदायका व्यक्तिहरूको समुहले यस देवस्थलमा साना मन्दिरहरू (चुनदेवी मानिने शिलाको दायाँ-बायाँ) निर्माण गरे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Under the leadership of Kina Bhāvo (Kṛṣṇa Bhāvo), a group from the Bhāvo community constructed small temples on either side of the central stone revered as Cunadevi.किन भावो (कृष्ण भावो) को प्रमुखत्वमा भावो समुदायका व्यक्तिहरूको समुहले यस देवस्थलमा साना मन्दिरहरू (चुनदेवी मानिने शिलाको दायाँ-बायाँ) निर्माण गरे ।"@en ;
