<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Spiritual Chanting Week"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Under the leadership of the contemporary Vaiṣṇava activist Kaviprasāda, a week-long spiritual chanting (kīrtana) program was conducted in the Cunadevi precinct, culminating in the erection of adharmastambha.तात्कालिक वैष्णव अभियन्ता कविप्रसादको नेतृत्वमा चुनदेवी परिसरमा एक सप्ताहव्यापि कीर्तन कार्यक्रम सम्पन्न गरी धर्मस्तम्भ खडा गरियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Under the leadership of the contemporary Vaiṣṇava activist Kaviprasāda, a week-long spiritual chanting (kīrtana) program was conducted in the Cunadevi precinct, culminating in the erection of adharmastambha.तात्कालिक वैष्णव अभियन्ता कविप्रसादको नेतृत्वमा चुनदेवी परिसरमा एक सप्ताहव्यापि कीर्तन कार्यक्रम सम्पन्न गरी धर्मस्तम्भ खडा गरियो ।"@en ;
