<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6_3> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a building"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A concrete structure was constructed directly in front of Cundevi and named the “Cunīdevī Bhāgavata Bhavana.” Its inauguration was carried out by the Mayor of Lalitpur Metropolitan City, Ciribābu Maharjana.चुनदेवीको ठिक सामुन्ने एक कंक्रिड संरचना निर्मान गरियो । यस भवनलाई चुनदेवी भागवत भवन नाम दिइएको छ । यसको उत्घाटन ललितपुर महानगरका मयेर चिरिबाबु महर्जनले गरे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/11a492c6-f28e-49f2-8367-bad1333365f6> ;
    rdfs:comment "A concrete structure was constructed directly in front of Cundevi and named the “Cunīdevī Bhāgavata Bhavana.” Its inauguration was carried out by the Mayor of Lalitpur Metropolitan City, Ciribābu Maharjana.चुनदेवीको ठिक सामुन्ने एक कंक्रिड संरचना निर्मान गरियो । यस भवनलाई चुनदेवी भागवत भवन नाम दिइएको छ । यसको उत्घाटन ललितपुर महानगरका मयेर चिरिबाबु महर्जनले गरे ।"@en ;
