    rdfs:label "Renting out the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the Phalcā was reconstructed as a modern into a concrete shed of two rooms, they were rented out to local residents. The Suntvāḥ Ṭola Sudhara Samiti, a local committee for the conservation of the area, collects the rent from the shops."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/11b82f01-2cae-49fc-9fb2-eb6ce6c896bc> ;
