<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/12ad4e23-52f8-4ced-81b6-0787778d5e19_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Both the Phalcā andhitiwere constructed by a person named Viśvanātha Bhaṭṭa in 1863 CE (see the description above for more information). He had also endowed tworopanīsof land and established aguthifor the maintenance of these monuments. However, neither theguthinor land exists for decades."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/12ad4e23-52f8-4ced-81b6-0787778d5e19> ;
