<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/12e25456-4bce-11ea-91df-0242ac130006_7> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of Bahī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Some of the inspired youth from Lalitpur planned to reconstruct the Bahī. They requested the king for help. King Vīrendra Vīravikrama Śāha released a fund and the youths collected donations from the locals. The reconstruction process was started in 1980 and was completed in 1988. The king inaugurated the new Bahī complex."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/12e25456-4bce-11ea-91df-0242ac130006> ;
    rdfs:comment "Some of the inspired youth from Lalitpur planned to reconstruct the Bahī. They requested the king for help. King Vīrendra Vīravikrama Śāha released a fund and the youths collected donations from the locals. The reconstruction process was started in 1980 and was completed in 1988. The king inaugurated the new Bahī complex."@en ;
