    rdfs:label "Demolishing the Preceding Structure"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple had become dilapidated and was replaced around the 1970s with a small modern rectangular building with a cement slab. By the late 1990s, the concrete building had also fallen into disrepair and was eventually demolished."@en ;
