<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1347d2d6-66e1-4884-bc56-a2286a68d4e8_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of an unknown temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription from the Rāṇā period is currently (April 2023) placed here in Kavīndrapura but is not related to the monument. It records the establishment of the Vaikuṇṭheśvara temple and other structures in a village named Sipāduyā (?) by Vīradhvaja Kārkī and his wife Bhaktakumārī. It also records the couple endowing 31ropanīs of land to set up a trust for observing the anniversary and other periodic rituals. The inscription appears to be from some village on the foothill of the Kathmandu valley and was probably placed here on the ground floor of Kavīndrapura."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1347d2d6-66e1-4884-bc56-a2286a68d4e8> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription from the Rāṇā period is currently (April 2023) placed here in Kavīndrapura but is not related to the monument. It records the establishment of the Vaikuṇṭheśvara temple and other structures in a village named Sipāduyā (?) by Vīradhvaja Kārkī and his wife Bhaktakumārī. It also records the couple endowing 31ropanīs of land to set up a trust for observing the anniversary and other periodic rituals. The inscription appears to be from some village on the foothill of the Kathmandu valley and was probably placed here on the ground floor of Kavīndrapura."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 3 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1347d2d6-66e1-4884-bc56-a2286a68d4e8> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1347d2d6-66e1-4884-bc56-a2286a68d4e8_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Collapse of the top two roofs"@en ;
