        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Hanumandhoka Durbar Square Conservation Program of the Kathmandu Metropolis renovated Kavīndrapura at a cost of NRs. 1.76 million (J. Sāha VS 2068,online). The shops on the ground floor were vacated and thephalcāwas closed with wooden enclosures designed like latticed windows."@en ;
