    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kṛṣṇa Bahādura, a resident of Cāku Bāhāḥ and son of Bhīma Kṛṣṇa, and his wife Pārvatī offered a bell to Mahālakṣmī. It was repaired by their daughters Lakṣmī Kumārī Śilākāra and Viṣṇukumārī in NS 1097 and NS 1100 (VS 2036)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/13b0e238-70ba-11ea-b99f-0242ac130006> ;
