        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a shrine for Mahālakṣmī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Mahālakṣmīpīṭhawas located in an open space until this date (NS 821). Vīranārāyaṇa Siṃha, a trader from Mūlacoka, commissioned the construction of the present temple structure and made an offering of a golden pinnacle. Aguṭhīwas also established to perform the anniversary worship in the temple on the day of Śrīpañcamī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/13b0e238-70ba-11ea-b99f-0242ac130006> ;
