<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/13e36370-5101-4455-8284-4796da990a36_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā, which had remained in an endangered state for a long time after the 2015 earthquakes, was reconstructed by Godāvarī Municipality in 2024 CE (VS 2081). The municipality invested 6 million NR in the reconstruction, making the Phalcā grander compared to its earlier form (local resident, Śreṣṭha, male, age 69).भूकम्प पश्चात् लामो समय जोखिमावस्थामा रहेको फल्चा विसं २०८१ सालमा गोदावरी नगरपालिकाद्वारा पुनर्निर्माण भएको हो । नगरपालिकाबाट कूल ६० लाख खर्च गरी विगतको तुलनामा फल्चालाई भव्य तुल्याइएको छ (local resident, Śreṣṭha, male, age 69) ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/13e36370-5101-4455-8284-4796da990a36> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Phalcā, which had remained in an endangered state for a long time after the 2015 earthquakes, was reconstructed by Godāvarī Municipality in 2024 CE (VS 2081). The municipality invested 6 million NR in the reconstruction, making the Phalcā grander compared to its earlier form (local resident, Śreṣṭha, male, age 69).भूकम्प पश्चात् लामो समय जोखिमावस्थामा रहेको फल्चा विसं २०८१ सालमा गोदावरी नगरपालिकाद्वारा पुनर्निर्माण भएको हो । नगरपालिकाबाट कूल ६० लाख खर्च गरी विगतको तुलनामा फल्चालाई भव्य तुल्याइएको छ (local resident, Śreṣṭha, male, age 69) ।"@en ;
