    rdfs:label "Offering silver hegā to kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jujuharṣa, Mohanamāyā, Mayalānī and other people had observed Aṣṭamī Vrata at the bāhāḥ. On the day after the vrata, all of them performed yajña together and offered a silver hegā to Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/147f9da8-5a54-438d-b51e-1d473f23b374> ;
