<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/154297b7-c1ca-4eca-813e-774c28a7f805_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of something to Gaṇeśa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Many letters (akṣara) of this inscription are eroded, thus what is recorded there is not very clear. However, the following information can still be extracted from it: Someone named Katisiṃha Bhā(bo?) together with his wife and sister offered something to Gaṇeśa (note that it is not clear what he exactly offered).Moreover, the date too is not clearly readable in the inscription. However, it looks like Nepāla Saṃvat 890."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/154297b7-c1ca-4eca-813e-774c28a7f805> ;
    rdfs:comment "Many letters (akṣara) of this inscription are eroded, thus what is recorded there is not very clear. However, the following information can still be extracted from it: Someone named Katisiṃha Bhā(bo?) together with his wife and sister offered something to Gaṇeśa (note that it is not clear what he exactly offered).Moreover, the date too is not clearly readable in the inscription. However, it looks like Nepāla Saṃvat 890."@en ;
