    rdfs:label "Offering of a toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Caturdaśī Sevā, a trust of local devotees, offered a woodentoraṇain the name of Bālakumārī. Goddess Bālakumārī is featured with her consort Caṇḍa Bhairava as the central deity of thetoraṇa. The trust is still active and perform monthly worship at the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/166b876b-49b3-480a-b7c4-73694e95b056> ;
