<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/16bd5a23-a211-4ee6-9b4f-c63cd7b0fb5a_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Continuation of Khaṭa Jātrā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The continuation of the Khaṭa Jātrā is based on a written agreement prepared after consultations among the residents of Bāniyā̃ Village, Banthacā Tole, and the concernedguṭhīs, and has been observed annually from the eighth of bright fortnight of Maṅsira to the 10th."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/16bd5a23-a211-4ee6-9b4f-c63cd7b0fb5a> ;
    rdfs:comment "The continuation of the Khaṭa Jātrā is based on a written agreement prepared after consultations among the residents of Bāniyā̃ Village, Banthacā Tole, and the concernedguṭhīs, and has been observed annually from the eighth of bright fortnight of Maṅsira to the 10th."@en ;
