<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/16bd5a23-a211-4ee6-9b4f-c63cd7b0fb5a_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Purchase of metal images"@en ;
    dcterms:description "For the organization of the annual procession, Naikap Ward No. 5 provided support for the purchase of three metal images—Gaṇeśa, Ādikālī, and Bhairava—and for the construction of a building to house thekhaṭas. The remaining expenses were borne by Kāpikā Rānā Magara, in memory of her late father Śrī Nara Bahādura Rānā Magara. In addition, she established a permanent endowment (akṣaya-kośa) of fifteen thousand rupees to ensure the continued operation of thejātrā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/16bd5a23-a211-4ee6-9b4f-c63cd7b0fb5a> ;
    rdfs:comment "For the organization of the annual procession, Naikap Ward No. 5 provided support for the purchase of three metal images—Gaṇeśa, Ādikālī, and Bhairava—and for the construction of a building to house thekhaṭas. The remaining expenses were borne by Kāpikā Rānā Magara, in memory of her late father Śrī Nara Bahādura Rānā Magara. In addition, she established a permanent endowment (akṣaya-kośa) of fifteen thousand rupees to ensure the continued operation of thejātrā."@en ;
