        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Erection of Statue in front of Degutale"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Yognarendra Malla erected the stone pillar in front of Degutale. To show his devotion to the deity, he placed images of himself and his two wives on top of it."@en ;
