<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/178fd214-e67d-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_10> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering"@en ;
    dcterms:description "1700 CE:ThapāḥjuDharmasiṃha and the other ten elderāḥjusof thebāhāḥreplaced the previous regulations with new ones during the reign of King Yoganarendra Malla. According to the new regulations, the initiation ritual of a boy should not take place until he is 5 years old; the seniority system should not be avoided; drying clothes and other items at thebāhāḥplinths was no longer allowed; nails and thread were not allowed in thebāhāḥcourtyard; the bigger copper pot (jaḥsi) of thebāhāḥmay only be used forbāhāḥpurposes and cannot be rented out.Burleigh(1976, 47-48) has written a misleading translation of this inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/178fd214-e67d-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "1700 CE:ThapāḥjuDharmasiṃha and the other ten elderāḥjusof thebāhāḥreplaced the previous regulations with new ones during the reign of King Yoganarendra Malla. According to the new regulations, the initiation ritual of a boy should not take place until he is 5 years old; the seniority system should not be avoided; drying clothes and other items at thebāhāḥplinths was no longer allowed; nails and thread were not allowed in thebāhāḥcourtyard; the bigger copper pot (jaḥsi) of thebāhāḥmay only be used forbāhāḥpurposes and cannot be rented out.Burleigh(1976, 47-48) has written a misleading translation of this inscription."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
