    rdfs:label "Offering"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Āsāmadu and his wife Bhikhvā Thakũ donated a gildedtoraṇacontaining images of Buddha, Prajñāpāramitā and Lokeśvara in the memory of their deceased parents Ratna Dhãju and Rānī Thakũ. This was fixed on top of the entrance of the sanctum where Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara lives.Daśakarmapratiṣṭhāwas also performed after the installation."@en ;
