<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1b1aa798-757c-46e0-bdac-de5ce9d04e9f_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction of the jaḥdhuṃ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This is an inscription indicating its installation by Ajasiṃha during the reign of Mahāsāmanta Jaitarāmajīva under King Bhīmadeva in 1260 CE (NS 381). The inscription does not mention a dharmaśāla or the phalcā itself, suggesting that the jaḥdhuṃ was installed first, with the phalcā being added centuries later.नेसं ३८१ (सन् १२६०) उक्त अभिलेख अनुसार भीमदेव राज्यकालमा फर्फिङ्गका महासामन्त जैतरामजीवको पालामा स्थानीय अजसिंहले जःधुं स्थापना गरेका थिए । अभिलेखमा धर्मशाला अर्थात् फल्चाको कुरा नपरेकाले यहाँ शुरुमा फल्चा नभई जःधुंमात्र स्थापना गरिएको देखिन्छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1b1aa798-757c-46e0-bdac-de5ce9d04e9f> ;
    rdfs:comment "This is an inscription indicating its installation by Ajasiṃha during the reign of Mahāsāmanta Jaitarāmajīva under King Bhīmadeva in 1260 CE (NS 381). The inscription does not mention a dharmaśāla or the phalcā itself, suggesting that the jaḥdhuṃ was installed first, with the phalcā being added centuries later.नेसं ३८१ (सन् १२६०) उक्त अभिलेख अनुसार भीमदेव राज्यकालमा फर्फिङ्गका महासामन्त जैतरामजीवको पालामा स्थानीय अजसिंहले जःधुं स्थापना गरेका थिए । अभिलेखमा धर्मशाला अर्थात् फल्चाको कुरा नपरेकाले यहाँ शुरुमा फल्चा नभई जःधुंमात्र स्थापना गरिएको देखिन्छ ।"@en ;
