        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of dharmadhātujinālaya caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Puruṣaratna, a member of the bāhāḥ, and his family, which included his elder brother Sudharatna, established thedharmadhātujinālayacaityawithin thebāhāḥcourtyard. They also undertook the renovation of the Aśoka Caitya besides laying traditional floor tiles in the courtyard."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1b57a5f0-601e-4225-8b68-1039a590d41c> ;
