<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1db95433-e680-4607-8403-f2109519622e_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A family of the Siṃha caste living near the Phalcā is known to be a descendant of its sponsor. After the Phalcā was badly damaged during the 2015 earthquakes, the Siṃha family sponsored its restoration. The inscription posted on the interior wall of the Phalcā records that Miśrī Devī Siṃha and her family members sponsored its restoration in memory of her husband, Cakramāna Siṃha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1db95433-e680-4607-8403-f2109519622e> ;
    rdfs:comment "A family of the Siṃha caste living near the Phalcā is known to be a descendant of its sponsor. After the Phalcā was badly damaged during the 2015 earthquakes, the Siṃha family sponsored its restoration. The inscription posted on the interior wall of the Phalcā records that Miśrī Devī Siṃha and her family members sponsored its restoration in memory of her husband, Cakramāna Siṃha."@en ;
