<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1e15e17c-ebc8-4da6-a8ed-661acdc89292_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage suffered from the earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple met a tragic fate during the devastating earthquakes of 1934. Its original appearance, however, has been preserved in a photograph captured by Kurt Boeck in 1898 CE and subsequently published by Gutschow (2011, p.460). The photograph serves as a glimpse into the past, showcasing the temple in its full glory before the destructive forces of nature took their toll."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1e15e17c-ebc8-4da6-a8ed-661acdc89292> ;
    rdfs:comment "The temple met a tragic fate during the devastating earthquakes of 1934. Its original appearance, however, has been preserved in a photograph captured by Kurt Boeck in 1898 CE and subsequently published by Gutschow (2011, p.460). The photograph serves as a glimpse into the past, showcasing the temple in its full glory before the destructive forces of nature took their toll."@en ;
