<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1e2335a0-f62a-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Regulations for Agnimaṭha"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Some regulations for the proper maintanance of the Agnimaṭha were established through discussions held by the Pāñcālī group whilst Maṇikādeva of Maṇichẽ and Agnihotrī jūjū of Svaniṃha were the head.The inscription has been effaced, and is no longer readable. The portion that showed the date is broken. Sharma (1984, 25) identifies the last number as 2 and Pruscha (1975, 137) dates it to 1572 CE. On the basis of these vague readings, it is generally assumed that the date read NS 692 (1572 CE)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1e2335a0-f62a-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Some regulations for the proper maintanance of the Agnimaṭha were established through discussions held by the Pāñcālī group whilst Maṇikādeva of Maṇichẽ and Agnihotrī jūjū of Svaniṃha were the head.The inscription has been effaced, and is no longer readable. The portion that showed the date is broken. Sharma (1984, 25) identifies the last number as 2 and Pruscha (1975, 137) dates it to 1572 CE. On the basis of these vague readings, it is generally assumed that the date read NS 692 (1572 CE)."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
