<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1e2335a0-f62a-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of agnikuṇḍa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the time of Prince Dharma Malla and Dvijavara Mūrtyaṅga Ācharya Jayaprakaku, thekūpa(agnikuṇḍa) of the Agnimaṭha was restored.Readings of D.R. Regmi (1966), Sharma (1984) and D. Vajrācārya (2068) could not clarify what was restored and who was the ruler at that time. However, Yogeśa Rāja (2057) has answered these questions. This inscription is no longer available on site."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1e2335a0-f62a-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the time of Prince Dharma Malla and Dvijavara Mūrtyaṅga Ācharya Jayaprakaku, thekūpa(agnikuṇḍa) of the Agnimaṭha was restored.Readings of D.R. Regmi (1966), Sharma (1984) and D. Vajrācārya (2068) could not clarify what was restored and who was the ruler at that time. However, Yogeśa Rāja (2057) has answered these questions. This inscription is no longer available on site."@en ;
