<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1e598519-a2aa-4ea7-83bf-3b4f141b4186_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa by a Bhaktapur Householder"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Cakravira, a resident of Tulāchẽ ṭola in Bhaktapur, together with his wives, Cidhi Thakuṃ and Hari Thakuṃ, installed a statue of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa (object no. BKT0770-002) on the ground-floor wall of the building. To ensure the daily worship of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa and the performance of the annual ritual, the donor endowed land for the founding of aguṭhi."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1e598519-a2aa-4ea7-83bf-3b4f141b4186> ;
    rdfs:comment "Cakravira, a resident of Tulāchẽ ṭola in Bhaktapur, together with his wives, Cidhi Thakuṃ and Hari Thakuṃ, installed a statue of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa (object no. BKT0770-002) on the ground-floor wall of the building. To ensure the daily worship of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa and the performance of the annual ritual, the donor endowed land for the founding of aguṭhi."@en ;
