<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1e770e2e-ee4e-4171-aa26-64114e89ddd7_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his late father Sanaksiṃha Buḍhāthokī and late mother Bhagavatī Buḍhāthokī, Haribhakta Buḍhāthokī offered a bell (ghaṇṭā) to the temple.वंगत बुबा सनकसिंह बुढाथोकी र आमा भगवती बुढाथोकीको स्मृतिमा हरिभक्त बुढाथोकीले मन्दिरमा घण्टा चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1e770e2e-ee4e-4171-aa26-64114e89ddd7> ;
