<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1e770e2e-ee4e-4171-aa26-64114e89ddd7_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As the Dhanvantari Vārāhī temple had become old and dilapidated, it was reconstructed through the active initiative of the Hāḍīgāũ Sampadā Samāja, in collaboration with local residents and the Kathmandu Metropolitan City.धनवन्तरी वाराहीको मन्दिर पुरानो भएर जीर्ण भएकोले हाँडीगाउँ सम्पदा समाजको सक्रियतामा स्थानीबासी, काठमाडौं महानगरपालिकाले मिलेर मन्दिरको पुनर्निर्मान गरेको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1e770e2e-ee4e-4171-aa26-64114e89ddd7> ;
    rdfs:comment "As the Dhanvantari Vārāhī temple had become old and dilapidated, it was reconstructed through the active initiative of the Hāḍīgāũ Sampadā Samāja, in collaboration with local residents and the Kathmandu Metropolitan City.धनवन्तरी वाराहीको मन्दिर पुरानो भएर जीर्ण भएकोले हाँडीगाउँ सम्पदा समाजको सक्रियतामा स्थानीबासी, काठमाडौं महानगरपालिकाले मिलेर मन्दिरको पुनर्निर्मान गरेको थियो ।"@en ;
