<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/1f0b12da-04ba-484b-bc1f-fe84fdcd3c6b_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of sataḥ and hiti"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Subbā Pṛyavarta, Priyalakṣmī, and Ratnabahādura Thāpā built a rest house (sataḥ) and water spout (hiti). The inscription recording the construction of thehitiandsataḥmandates trust land’s income used for feeding brahmins and distributing sherbet on Akṣaya Tṛtīyā, the 3rd of the bright fortnight of Vaiśākha. The pond’s construction date is unclear, but it presumably predates thehitiandsataḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1f0b12da-04ba-484b-bc1f-fe84fdcd3c6b> ;
    rdfs:comment "Subbā Pṛyavarta, Priyalakṣmī, and Ratnabahādura Thāpā built a rest house (sataḥ) and water spout (hiti). The inscription recording the construction of thehitiandsataḥmandates trust land’s income used for feeding brahmins and distributing sherbet on Akṣaya Tṛtīyā, the 3rd of the bright fortnight of Vaiśākha. The pond’s construction date is unclear, but it presumably predates thehitiandsataḥ."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
