        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription in Gāthādyaḥ Phalcā records that the monument was constructed by someone from the Harisiddhi Jyāpu community in 1780 CE. It also mentions the presence of a Gaṇeśa statue from an earlier period. The inscription further mentions the construction of a three-bayed phalcā during the renovation of the Gaṇeśa temple. Additionally, it references the establishment of the Yosiṃ guṭhī (Indradhvaja guṭhī). It is likely that the same community, which also celebrates Indrajātrā in Harisiddhi, was responsible for building the arcaded platform.यस फल्चामा प्राप्त अभिलेख अनुसार नेसं ९०१ मा हिरिसिद्धि निवासी कुनै ज्यापु समुदायका व्यक्तिले यस फल्चाको निर्माण गरेका थिए । यहाँ गणेशको मन्दिर पहिले नै भएको कुरा पनि यस अभिलेखबाट ज्ञात हुन्छ । अभिलेखमा “गणेश मन्दिरलाई जीर्णोद्धार गर्दै तीन कवलको फल्चा बनाइयो’’ भनिएको छ । योसिं गुथि (इन्द्रध्वज गुठी) पनि गठन भएको प्रसंग परेको छ । यसले हरिसिद्धिमा इनद्रजात्रा मनाउन एक समूहबाट यो फल्चा बनेको देखिन्छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/1f46c22f-2afa-4074-b20f-2449502fc1c3> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription in Gāthādyaḥ Phalcā records that the monument was constructed by someone from the Harisiddhi Jyāpu community in 1780 CE. It also mentions the presence of a Gaṇeśa statue from an earlier period. The inscription further mentions the construction of a three-bayed phalcā during the renovation of the Gaṇeśa temple. Additionally, it references the establishment of the Yosiṃ guṭhī (Indradhvaja guṭhī). It is likely that the same community, which also celebrates Indrajātrā in Harisiddhi, was responsible for building the arcaded platform.यस फल्चामा प्राप्त अभिलेख अनुसार नेसं ९०१ मा हिरिसिद्धि निवासी कुनै ज्यापु समुदायका व्यक्तिले यस फल्चाको निर्माण गरेका थिए । यहाँ गणेशको मन्दिर पहिले नै भएको कुरा पनि यस अभिलेखबाट ज्ञात हुन्छ । अभिलेखमा “गणेश मन्दिरलाई जीर्णोद्धार गर्दै तीन कवलको फल्चा बनाइयो’’ भनिएको छ । योसिं गुथि (इन्द्रध्वज गुठी) पनि गठन भएको प्रसंग परेको छ । यसले हरिसिद्धिमा इनद्रजात्रा मनाउन एक समूहबाट यो फल्चा बनेको देखिन्छ ।"@en ;
