    dcterms:description "The Phalcāwas renovated and the ground floor was paved with stone. A fund for the renovation work was collected by Haugaḥ Bhajana Khalaḥ and Viddhyālāla Rājakarṇikāra. The inscription mentions the Phalcāas adegala(temple)."@en ;
