<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2070b496-e729-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_7> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Jarũhiti"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A stonejarũhitihas beenattached to the western wall of the Phalcā byDãju Bhāro and Rājakarṇikāra Cikidhikala Bhāro. Land had also been donated for its annual function. The inscription also mentions about the necessity of giving certain amount of paddy (45 Pāthis) to a person who fills up water in thejarũhitieveryday. According toFurukawa/Shrestha/Bajracharya and Ogasawara 2010(p. 121) the water tank was built in the Malla period."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2070b496-e729-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "A stonejarũhitihas beenattached to the western wall of the Phalcā byDãju Bhāro and Rājakarṇikāra Cikidhikala Bhāro. Land had also been donated for its annual function. The inscription also mentions about the necessity of giving certain amount of paddy (45 Pāthis) to a person who fills up water in thejarũhitieveryday. According toFurukawa/Shrestha/Bajracharya and Ogasawara 2010(p. 121) the water tank was built in the Malla period."@en ;
