        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of Aśoka Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There are no historical records regarding the foundation of the Aśoka Caitya. However, a damaged inscription records that the Caitya was renovated in NS 777. The name of the person responsible for this is not legible, as the letters are broken in many places."@en ;
