    dcterms:description "The name of the donor is not recorded, but according to the locals Viśvavajra Vajrācārya established the Mañjuśrī Pādukā. The donor has arranged for the anniversary worship of this Pādukā to take place on the 8th day of the bright fortnight of Kārttika, on the day of death of his mother Gyana Thakuṃ."@en ;
