<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/20c0e0a0-2b7f-491a-81aa-41dddec3276b_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa Śāha had granted land parcels with an annual produce of 40murīs of crop in Nepālavyāsī to set up a religious trust for the Śyāmapāṭī Śiva temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/20c0e0a0-2b7f-491a-81aa-41dddec3276b> ;
    rdfs:comment "Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa Śāha had granted land parcels with an annual produce of 40murīs of crop in Nepālavyāsī to set up a religious trust for the Śyāmapāṭī Śiva temple."@en ;
