    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The renovation of this temple, including the repair of the northern door, inner seat, door leaves, windows, etc., was completed under the coordination of Tokha Construction Workers Union and M.D.S. Cement Design. The inauguration after the completion of the work was performed by the comedy duo Madan Krishna Shrestha and Hari Bansha Acharya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/21d0cb3c-a698-496c-8807-26338c5d30c8> ;
