<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2255af6c-aeb1-48b1-a5e4-2da8d7deb481_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Pond"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The reconstruction of both Kalaśa Pukhūs was carried out with a fund of NRs. 6 million from the Shankharapur Municipality and NRs. 4 million from the Kathmandu Valley Development Authority. Local residents and businessmen had also contributed financially to the reconstruction, which cost around NRs. 17.5 million.See also the historical events of the Bhagavatī Kalaśa Pukhū 1 (SKH0242)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2255af6c-aeb1-48b1-a5e4-2da8d7deb481> ;
    rdfs:comment "The reconstruction of both Kalaśa Pukhūs was carried out with a fund of NRs. 6 million from the Shankharapur Municipality and NRs. 4 million from the Kathmandu Valley Development Authority. Local residents and businessmen had also contributed financially to the reconstruction, which cost around NRs. 17.5 million.See also the historical events of the Bhagavatī Kalaśa Pukhū 1 (SKH0242)."@en ;
