<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/229532ac-6835-483c-aa66-df0dea0b10cb_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of a statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his deceased ancestors, the son installed within the temple a stone slab bearing the image of Umāmaheśvara. At the center of this slab appears the divine couple Umā and Maheśvara, while on either side and along the lower section are carved the figures and names of the donor’s family members."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/229532ac-6835-483c-aa66-df0dea0b10cb> ;
    rdfs:comment "In memory of his deceased ancestors, the son installed within the temple a stone slab bearing the image of Umāmaheśvara. At the center of this slab appears the divine couple Umā and Maheśvara, while on either side and along the lower section are carved the figures and names of the donor’s family members."@en ;
