    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Government of Nepal provided two million rupees for the reconstruction of the Phalcā.Dinesh Maharjan, a member of the parliament, has helped with this. However, the current installment of funds has almost been entirely used up, meaning that the reconstruction work has been put on hold."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2298db0e-2225-11ea-b9b1-0242ac130002> ;
