    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands and garden"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Ratnadeva Vajrācārya (text: Vajrācāryya Ratnadeva) and Bramha Thakura, a local functionary (pātra), endowed land and garden in the name of Akṣobhya, the main deity of the Bāhāḥ. The construction of the Bāhāḥ was probably coming to an end at that time."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/22b12b9b-2d55-45a8-bc3d-bc5295163f7d> ;
