    rdfs:label "Establishment of Akṣobhya, Aśoka Caitya and Āgama Devatā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the construction of the Bāhāḥ came to an end with the establishment of Akṣobhya, a Caitya, and the esoteric deity (āgaṃdyaḥ), it was formally handed over to Amṛtapāra Vajrācārya and Amṛtacandra Vajrācārya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/22b12b9b-2d55-45a8-bc3d-bc5295163f7d> ;
