<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/23bdf498-e692-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Consecration of the image of the main deity in the sanctum of the Vihāra"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Śākyamuni Buddha's image was constructed inside the courtyard of the Jñānakīrti Vihāra in memory of Jñānavīra Bhāvo's late wives Asala and Guṃchimī (Guṇalakṣmī). A life-giving ritual (prāṇapratiṣthā) was performed for the image withdaśakarmas."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/23bdf498-e692-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Śākyamuni Buddha's image was constructed inside the courtyard of the Jñānakīrti Vihāra in memory of Jñānavīra Bhāvo's late wives Asala and Guṃchimī (Guṇalakṣmī). A life-giving ritual (prāṇapratiṣthā) was performed for the image withdaśakarmas."@en ;
