<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/24001b17-8be8-4a56-82b4-e4191db787ec_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of the sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the earthquakes in 2015 CE (2072 VS), both the Tīnadevala temple and the adjacentsataḥsincurred significant damage. The restoration of thesataḥwas initiated by the Bagmati Civilization Integrated Development Committee, operating under the Ministry of Urban Development, with financial support from a loan provided by the Asian Development Bank. The reconstruction of the temple andsataḥswas successfully concluded on October 23, 2022 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/24001b17-8be8-4a56-82b4-e4191db787ec> ;
    rdfs:comment "After the earthquakes in 2015 CE (2072 VS), both the Tīnadevala temple and the adjacentsataḥsincurred significant damage. The restoration of thesataḥwas initiated by the Bagmati Civilization Integrated Development Committee, operating under the Ministry of Urban Development, with financial support from a loan provided by the Asian Development Bank. The reconstruction of the temple andsataḥswas successfully concluded on October 23, 2022 CE."@en ;
