        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Laying foundation of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The construction of the Phalcā started by digging the foundation as per the treatise on architecture. Khaḍgīkāra Gvārā from the Iti Ṭola, along with Tulasimāyā and the family constructed the Phalcā wishing his deceased grandfather Lāju and father Kuberasīṃ the heavenly abode of Sukhāvatī Bhuvana."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/24226a7a-8efd-4339-bd98-138f2f984801> ;
