    rdfs:label "Construction of a metal fence around Matsyendranātha Mandira (LAL0060)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A committee named Śrī Macchindranātha Mandira Saṃrakṣaṇa Samiti was formed. The Samiti installed metal railings to surround the temple to protect the statues and other historic items from theft."@en ;
