        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "A land endowment to establish a guṭhī for the bathing ceremony of Buṅgadyaḥ and Ādinātha (of Chobhar)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A copper-plate inscription preserved in the National Archives and dated NS 678 states that Melvagha Varma, Hṛdayasiṃha Varma, Jñānasiṃha Varma and Keśavasiṃha Varma from Jyeṣṭhavarṇa Vihāra Patan granted land to establish aguṭhīfor the bathing ceremony of Buṅgadyaḥ and Ādinātha (of Chobhar)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/24afe176-f66a-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
