<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/24afe176-f66a-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of an inscription containing the regulations to govern the cultural events and activities"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Śrīnivāsa Malla installed a long inscription at the temple at Taḥ Bāhāḥ (LAL0050), which provides regulations to govern the cultural events and activities of Karuṇāmaya. The King of Patan must take personal responsibility for the arrangements for the bathing ceremony, the chariot procession and Karuṇāmaya's journey to Patan (Locke1980, 309)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/24afe176-f66a-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Śrīnivāsa Malla installed a long inscription at the temple at Taḥ Bāhāḥ (LAL0050), which provides regulations to govern the cultural events and activities of Karuṇāmaya. The King of Patan must take personal responsibility for the arrangements for the bathing ceremony, the chariot procession and Karuṇāmaya's journey to Patan (Locke1980, 309)."@en ;
