<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/26d29a66-b9bb-4787-9175-479e3cb2c5e9_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Amarakānteśvarī is credited for the construction of the temple in 1856 CE (VS 1913) (M. Thapā VS 2077, p.205). There used to be a bell installed south of the temple in 1856 CE (NS 976). While the year mentioned on the bell may have prompted them to believe that the temple was built in 1856 CE, a later document from 1915 CE (VS 1972) relating to the settlement of a dispute regarding the operation of the temple cites alālamoharaissued in 1852 CE (VS 1909) in connection with Sureśakānteśvara Mandira (K_0131_0001). This suggests that the temple was already in existence in 1852 CE. The exact year of its construction is unclear, as currently (August 2023), there is no other historical source that sheds light on its initial construction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/26d29a66-b9bb-4787-9175-479e3cb2c5e9> ;
    rdfs:comment "Amarakānteśvarī is credited for the construction of the temple in 1856 CE (VS 1913) (M. Thapā VS 2077, p.205). There used to be a bell installed south of the temple in 1856 CE (NS 976). While the year mentioned on the bell may have prompted them to believe that the temple was built in 1856 CE, a later document from 1915 CE (VS 1972) relating to the settlement of a dispute regarding the operation of the temple cites alālamoharaissued in 1852 CE (VS 1909) in connection with Sureśakānteśvara Mandira (K_0131_0001). This suggests that the temple was already in existence in 1852 CE. The exact year of its construction is unclear, as currently (August 2023), there is no other historical source that sheds light on its initial construction."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 0 ;
