    rdfs:label "Paving with tiles"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his late father Madanaprasāda Śreṣṭha, Bindeśaprasāda Śreṣṭha, together with his wife Sajanā Śreṣṭha and daughter Biyaṃkā Rānī Śreṣṭha, paved the floor and stairs inside the Dhūmāvatī shrine with tiles. As the previously laid tiles had deteriorated, he had them repaved with new tiles."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/283342f3-8585-4e60-a605-56189e73bea1> ;
