<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/28a074e0-5a6c-4c69-ab29-6bb2f08c5033_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Devastation and restoration after the 1933 earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription (BKT0250_I_002) bears witness to a significant chapter in the history of the Brahmāyāṇī Pīṭha. It narrates the tale of destruction and resilience that unfolded after the earthquake of 1933 CE (1990 VS). The seismic upheaval had taken a toll on thephalcā, rendering it in ruins. However, the spirit of the local community shone bright in the aftermath of this catastrophe. The inscription details how, in the year 1940 CE (1997 VS), the community united to undertake the restoration of thephalcā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/28a074e0-5a6c-4c69-ab29-6bb2f08c5033> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription (BKT0250_I_002) bears witness to a significant chapter in the history of the Brahmāyāṇī Pīṭha. It narrates the tale of destruction and resilience that unfolded after the earthquake of 1933 CE (1990 VS). The seismic upheaval had taken a toll on thephalcā, rendering it in ruins. However, the spirit of the local community shone bright in the aftermath of this catastrophe. The inscription details how, in the year 1940 CE (1997 VS), the community united to undertake the restoration of thephalcā."@en ;
