    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Renovation under KVPT and DOA (see extensive reports from the KVPT). The HSR stated that funding came from the Andy Warhol Foundation, GTZ/UDLE, KVPT, and Mr Pandey and Mr Dickerman. Thi s was also part of the nationalisation process as the site was taken away from its occupants. The cost estimate mentioned in the HSR was US-$ 38,877.62 (KVPT Report HSR p A22)"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/28f77756-69bc-11ea-8083-0242ac130006> ;
