    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Jayasthiti Malla restored this temple, appointed a Southern Bhaṭṭa to conduct worship, and established an endowment. From that time until now, the worship has been continually performed by the Southern Bhaṭṭa Brāhmaṇas."@en ;
