<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/293c1896-a3bb-454a-8fe9-b56ebfadc51c_10> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Śivaliṅga and endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mahemanisiṃha Bhaṇḍārī, along with his wife Bālakumārī, his sons Navabahādura and Sthiti Bahādura, and three daughters, established Śrī Śiva Meheravāla Bhakteśvara near this temple on the banks of the Bāgmatī. They established agricultural land endowments in various places, and arrangements were made so that the income from that land would cover the expenses for the entire year's activities."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/293c1896-a3bb-454a-8fe9-b56ebfadc51c> ;
