    dcterms:description "Kaviprasād Gautama came here on the new moon day of Bhādra (Father's Day), performed śrāddha, engaged in bhajana-kīrtana (devotional singing), and additionally arranged a feast for 108 priests."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/293c1896-a3bb-454a-8fe9-b56ebfadc51c> ;
