        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Roof rebuilt"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The roofs were reconstructed, and gold-gilded brass roofs were installed on all the temple's roofs. Furthermore, the Savaṅgīṇa Vikāsa Samanvaya Samiti successfully concluded the Śrīmad Bhāgavata Mahāpurāṇa Historical Religious Grand Fair."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/293c1896-a3bb-454a-8fe9-b56ebfadc51c> ;
