    rdfs:label "Establishment of Dharmasālā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of Raṇabahādura Śāha, Dharmanārāyaṇa, with the desire to facilitate the salvation of ancestors, constructed a rest house on the south side of Gokarna on the new moon day of Śrāvaṇa and established a land endowment for the performance of śrāddha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/293c1896-a3bb-454a-8fe9-b56ebfadc51c> ;
