    rdfs:label "Renovation of Eastern gate"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The eastern entrance door of this temple was constructed with gold-gilded copper plates by Balabhañjana Pāṇḍe, together with his wives Viṣṇu Kumārī and Umā Devī, his daughter Khaḍga Kumārī, and the entire family."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/293c1896-a3bb-454a-8fe9-b56ebfadc51c> ;
