    rdfs:label "Establishment of Hem Nārāyaṇa and endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Hemakarna Thapa Godar established agricultural land endowments in various locations for Hemnārāyaṇa, located east of Gokarṇeśvara Mahādeva on the banks of the Bāgmatī, and for Hema Bhakteśvara Mahādeva, located in the northeast direction."@en ;
