    rdfs:label "Offering of a gilt cover"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The gilt cover, adorned with the faces of Śiva, is utilized to envelop the stoneśivalingaduring the annual ritual of Rājarājeśvara Temple. The inscription on this metal cover records the donation of this artifact by a certain Harṣamāna from Jyābāhāḥ, Kathmandu.a."@en ;
