<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2a0b1750-ee3e-11e9-8649-0242ac130002_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Licchavi King Aṃśu Varman issued a decree"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This Licchavi inscription echoes a decree issued by King Aṃśu Varman. It stands at the south-eastern corner of the Pāṭī, though there is no historical relationship between the inscription and the Pāṭī. D.Vajrācārya(VS 2030, 290) mentions that he once saw this inscription somewhere far away from this site, at the banks of a pond in Bungmati. He notes that it later disappeared from there."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2a0b1750-ee3e-11e9-8649-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "This Licchavi inscription echoes a decree issued by King Aṃśu Varman. It stands at the south-eastern corner of the Pāṭī, though there is no historical relationship between the inscription and the Pāṭī. D.Vajrācārya(VS 2030, 290) mentions that he once saw this inscription somewhere far away from this site, at the banks of a pond in Bungmati. He notes that it later disappeared from there."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
