<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2a1ca80c-8b69-43a0-ab19-ac6b126986ee_18> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Land Grant by King Viṣṇu Malla and Establishment of Regulations"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription is hard to decipher. The last numerical figure of the date is not clearly readable. It appears to be number 2.The legible part of the inscription records the land grant by King Viṣṇu Malla to organize the annual worship (which takes place on the first solar day of Bhādrā, also calledsiṃhasaṃkrānti). It also records various regulations regarding the organization of the annual worship."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2a1ca80c-8b69-43a0-ab19-ac6b126986ee> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription is hard to decipher. The last numerical figure of the date is not clearly readable. It appears to be number 2.The legible part of the inscription records the land grant by King Viṣṇu Malla to organize the annual worship (which takes place on the first solar day of Bhādrā, also calledsiṃhasaṃkrānti). It also records various regulations regarding the organization of the annual worship."@en ;
