    rdfs:label "Land Grant and Offering of Silver Jewellery"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kvāthanāyaka Duṇḍirāja Bhāro and his wife Cikuṭi offered some silver jewelry. They also granted some plots of land from four different areas to aguṭhīto maintain lighting the lamp which refer to asmahādīpa(great light) in the inscription."@en ;
