    rdfs:label "Expansion of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "One of the Phalcā's bays is used by the owner of a plot of land behind it.  The owner provided 2 feet of their land so that the Phalcā could be reconstructed with a wider breadth."@en ;
