<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2a5c82ae-d073-11e9-8599-0242ac140006_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Phalcā was rented out"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Homeless people or other strangers used to sleep in the Phalcā at night and allegedly took part in prohibited activities here. The Taṅgaḥ Ṭola Sudhāra Samiti is now renting out nine of the Phalcā's bays. These have been converted into cabins and take the form of nine shops, whilst one bay is kept open for transit."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2a5c82ae-d073-11e9-8599-0242ac140006> ;
    rdfs:comment "Homeless people or other strangers used to sleep in the Phalcā at night and allegedly took part in prohibited activities here. The Taṅgaḥ Ṭola Sudhāra Samiti is now renting out nine of the Phalcā's bays. These have been converted into cabins and take the form of nine shops, whilst one bay is kept open for transit."@en ;
