    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Department of Archaeology in cooperation with the Shankharapur Municipality completely dismantled the temple and rebuilt it at a total cost of a little over NRs. 4.5 million. There used to be atoraṇaon top of each entrance of the temple. They were not installed after the reconstruction."@en ;
