    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Surendra Śāha, aśivaliṅgawas established by Vira Bhāro, his wife Dhaṃcā Thakuṃ and other members of the family. The Śivaliṅga has been stolen. At present, a fragment of a pinnacle of a shrine has been installed at the place theśivaliṅgaused to be."@en ;
