    rdfs:label "Repair of monuments at the Jyotirliṅgeśvara Mandira complex"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Jyotirliṅgeśvara Mandira, along with the water tank,aṣṭamātṛkā pīṭha(Ghorarūpā Yoginī), and other monuments around the area were renovated with the financial assistance provided by organizations from the Netherlands and Vajrayogini Village Development Committee. An local organization named Friends of Sankhu had coordinated the renovation works."@en ;
