    rdfs:label "Laying of gilded sheets on upper roof"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jagotahamāna Siṃha Bhāro (Mulmī), his wife Rānimani, and his son Kṛṣṇamānasiṃha Bhāro overlaid the top roof with gilded sheets."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2af3fc6d-7bc2-4922-b562-7232446814f0> ;
    rdfs:comment "Jagotahamāna Siṃha Bhāro (Mulmī), his wife Rānimani, and his son Kṛṣṇamānasiṃha Bhāro overlaid the top roof with gilded sheets."@en ;
