    rdfs:label "Renovation of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription recounts Prime Minister Juddha Śamśera restoring the temple damaged in the 1934 earthquakes without clearly mentioning if it was a renovation or a reconstruction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2b614d26-2bde-455e-97bc-35eba55d7faf> ;
