<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2bbfcb7d-f2dc-44db-8071-c801bb8ec23a_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As the Phalcā was in a poor state of repair, it was dismantled and rebuilt. Old columns, capitals, windows, and other usable components of the Phalcā were reused. Therefore, the traditional architecture of the Phalcā is retained."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2bbfcb7d-f2dc-44db-8071-c801bb8ec23a> ;
    rdfs:comment "As the Phalcā was in a poor state of repair, it was dismantled and rebuilt. Old columns, capitals, windows, and other usable components of the Phalcā were reused. Therefore, the traditional architecture of the Phalcā is retained."@en ;
