        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the Dharmadhātujinālaya Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription mentions that the founder of the Dharmadhātujinālaya Caitya constructed anothercaityaand adharmadhātu maṇḍala. The inscription does not mention the name of its founder, but locals claim that Harṣamuni Śākya was the one who commissioned it."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2c130982-5fc6-11ea-8083-0242ac130006> ;
