<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2c4ce775-72ec-4621-809f-77c137e58dfc_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of a Garuḍa statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pruscha (1975, p.33) mentions, without citing a source, that the statue of Garuḍa in front of the Temple was erected in 1641 CE. The statue (KAT0830-010) no longer has an inscription. So it's unclear whether the current statue had an inscription when he assessed the site or if the older one was stolen at some point and then replaced with the current one."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2c4ce775-72ec-4621-809f-77c137e58dfc> ;
    rdfs:comment "Pruscha (1975, p.33) mentions, without citing a source, that the statue of Garuḍa in front of the Temple was erected in 1641 CE. The statue (KAT0830-010) no longer has an inscription. So it's unclear whether the current statue had an inscription when he assessed the site or if the older one was stolen at some point and then replaced with the current one."@en ;
