        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction a sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription recording the construction of thesataḥis eroded. As a result, the identity of the donor who commissioned the execution cannot be determined. It is most likely the samesataḥas seen in Pruscha's photograph (Pruscha 1975, p.33). A school building now stands where thesataḥonce stood."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2c4ce775-72ec-4621-809f-77c137e58dfc> ;
