        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a dharmaśālā and endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Dhaṃtanāya Jyeṣṭha Maharjana of the Dalāchi (text: Darāchi) Ṭola constructed the dharmaśālā and endowed oneropanīof land to perform the anniversary ritual (varṣavarddhana) of thedharmaśālāand offer balls of rice (piṇḍa) in memory of Dhaṃtanāya’s deceased mother."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2c4ce775-72ec-4621-809f-77c137e58dfc> ;
