    rdfs:label "Initial construction (or rebuilding?)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As mentioned above in the ‘description, the inscription installed on the Phalcā is not clearly readable due to the oil coating. It ascribes the family of certain Kṛṣṇanārā Bhābo (living at Kothunani of the Cīthū Ṭola, Kirtipur) for the construction (or rebuilding?) of the Phalcā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2e916236-3c01-4ba6-b5ee-cc89ce1044b9> ;
