    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The 2015 earthquakes damaged several monuments in the Cilancva Caitya complex including the Caitya itself. The Department of Archaeology and Jagatapāla Mahāvihāra Conservation Committee signed an agreement in 2017 CE for the renovation of the damaged monuments including the Phalcā and concluded the renovations in 2019 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2e916236-3c01-4ba6-b5ee-cc89ce1044b9> ;
