<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2ead2965-3b73-45b4-8690-ca9cd44cf502_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Monument transformation and modernization"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As of January 2023 CE, the once-standingphalcāhas given way to a two-story concrete building, marking a contemporary shift in the landscape. The transition commenced around 1988 CE (2045 VS), when thephalcāunderwent a conversion into the modern edifice that stands today. An archival photograph from Shokoohy's work (1994, p.186) offers a glimpse of the originalphalcāin its traditional configuration, boasting four bays, before succumbing to eventual demolition."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2ead2965-3b73-45b4-8690-ca9cd44cf502> ;
    rdfs:comment "As of January 2023 CE, the once-standingphalcāhas given way to a two-story concrete building, marking a contemporary shift in the landscape. The transition commenced around 1988 CE (2045 VS), when thephalcāunderwent a conversion into the modern edifice that stands today. An archival photograph from Shokoohy's work (1994, p.186) offers a glimpse of the originalphalcāin its traditional configuration, boasting four bays, before succumbing to eventual demolition."@en ;
