<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/2f6ff45c-890f-4b5f-9c44-864b0b71ca7d_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reconstruction in 2024 CE (VS 2081), an inscription from the Licchavi period was discovered (Source: Ward President, Śreṣṭha, male, age 41). As the stone is completely worn away, the specific date and purpose of the inscription remain unknown. Nevertheless, this record confirms the fact that Tusāla and its surrounding areas were already settled during the Licchavi era."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2f6ff45c-890f-4b5f-9c44-864b0b71ca7d> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the reconstruction in 2024 CE (VS 2081), an inscription from the Licchavi period was discovered (Source: Ward President, Śreṣṭha, male, age 41). As the stone is completely worn away, the specific date and purpose of the inscription remain unknown. Nevertheless, this record confirms the fact that Tusāla and its surrounding areas were already settled during the Licchavi era."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
