    rdfs:label "Construction of the Vajradhātu Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Viśvarāma Bhāro, Viśvanātha Bhāro, Viśveśvara Bhāro and Dhana Bhāro constructed the Caitya in the Bāhāḥ's courtyard during the reign of King Mahendra Malla. The donors offered land and established aguṭhīfor the Caitya's maintenance and regular worship."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/2ff9e759-434c-4ef7-8b79-6dc705e64ae7> ;
