        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction of the present-day temple structure"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kvāṭhanāyaka (Kvāthanāyaka) Lakṣmīsiṃha Bhāro renovated the existing statue of Sarasvatī (see object number KIR0049-001 above) and constructed a stone temple to enshrine her. The renovation work suggests that there must have been a small shrine or temple on the site preceding the present-day stone temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/30972753-7928-4d07-b965-b0f91dca9b7d> ;
