<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/309c85aa-e8ed-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_16> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Buddha Jayanti: Sponsoring of festivals and processions"@en ;
    dcterms:description "On the occasion of Buddha Jayanti, Jagatmān Vaidya (also known as Dharmāditya Dharmācārya) sponsored a procession, acūḍākarmaceremony and a feast for thesaṅgha. In addition to this he donated Rs. 100 and a piece of land as an endowment. This seems to be the first attempt to revive the ancient observance of Buddha Jayanti which has somewhat lapsed amongst the Buddhists in Nepal (Locke1985, 212)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/309c85aa-e8ed-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "On the occasion of Buddha Jayanti, Jagatmān Vaidya (also known as Dharmāditya Dharmācārya) sponsored a procession, acūḍākarmaceremony and a feast for thesaṅgha. In addition to this he donated Rs. 100 and a piece of land as an endowment. This seems to be the first attempt to revive the ancient observance of Buddha Jayanti which has somewhat lapsed amongst the Buddhists in Nepal (Locke1985, 212)."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
