<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/31630d93-680d-4cc7-b1bc-e235371d517a_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the bahī and offering a toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "शाहको राज्यकालमा लक्ष्मि थकुंले छोराहरू पूर्ण्णपति, भीमपति लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर बही जीर्णोद्धार गरी गन्धकुटीभित्र प्रवेश गर्ने ढोकामाथि काष्ठतोरण चढाएकी थिइन् ।\"During the reign of King Pṛthivīvirvikram Śāha, Lakṣmī Thakuṁle, along with her sons Pūrṇṇapati, Bhīmapati, and other family members, repaired the old ledger and placed a woodentoraṇaabove the entrance door to the Gandhakuṭī.\""@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/31630d93-680d-4cc7-b1bc-e235371d517a> ;
    rdfs:comment "शाहको राज्यकालमा लक्ष्मि थकुंले छोराहरू पूर्ण्णपति, भीमपति लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर बही जीर्णोद्धार गरी गन्धकुटीभित्र प्रवेश गर्ने ढोकामाथि काष्ठतोरण चढाएकी थिइन् ।\"During the reign of King Pṛthivīvirvikram Śāha, Lakṣmī Thakuṁle, along with her sons Pūrṇṇapati, Bhīmapati, and other family members, repaired the old ledger and placed a woodentoraṇaabove the entrance door to the Gandhakuṭī.\""@en ;
