<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/316e30ee-9dfd-4deb-a3bb-1cadf3b24876_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of a monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription dating back to 1825 CE (NS 945) documents the restoration of a structure, likely aśivaliṅga, undertaken by Tejanarasiṃha, a resident of Phasikeba. This monument was originally erected by Tejanarasiṃha's forebears."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/316e30ee-9dfd-4deb-a3bb-1cadf3b24876> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription dating back to 1825 CE (NS 945) documents the restoration of a structure, likely aśivaliṅga, undertaken by Tejanarasiṃha, a resident of Phasikeba. This monument was originally erected by Tejanarasiṃha's forebears."@en ;
