<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/32b21dd4-78f4-49a4-89ef-cec4b28c0f6b_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There is a large stone inscription set on the rear wall of the Pañcagaṇeśa Mandira, situated north of Vatsaleśvarī. This inscription, dating back to the Licchavi period, is now considerably eroded but is believed to be associated with the Vatsalā Mandira."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/32b21dd4-78f4-49a4-89ef-cec4b28c0f6b> ;
    rdfs:comment "There is a large stone inscription set on the rear wall of the Pañcagaṇeśa Mandira, situated north of Vatsaleśvarī. This inscription, dating back to the Licchavi period, is now considerably eroded but is believed to be associated with the Vatsalā Mandira."@en ;
