        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a patāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A family from the Dhaṃgu caste offered a narrow oblong banner (patāḥ) to the temple. The name of the donor and the year of the donation are not clearly visible. Only the name of the donor’s wife, Pāravati, can be read."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/32b21dd4-78f4-49a4-89ef-cec4b28c0f6b> ;
