        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Breaking the stone spout"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Wooden pillars and rafters recovered from the ruins of the buildings that collapsed in the 2015 earthquakes were piled up at the Hiti. The Hiti’s spout was broken after coming under the load of the timbers. The broken spout is kept to the northern wall of the Hiti."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/34a4e5bc-0639-4721-abbc-b5a0484c5c01> ;
