<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/34c093f4-d587-4bf5-b659-6f6265289b75_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of land to a Vajrācārya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Sudra Dhrijanārāyana, Muninārāyana, and Bhavāni, three brothers, donated a plot of land to house Vajrācāryya Caṃdrapati. These brothers most likely donated the land so that some of the Vajrācāryas from Musuṃ Bāhāḥ could be permanently relocated to Lhugaḥ Bāhāḥ and serve as 'priests' there."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/34c093f4-d587-4bf5-b659-6f6265289b75> ;
    rdfs:comment "Sudra Dhrijanārāyana, Muninārāyana, and Bhavāni, three brothers, donated a plot of land to house Vajrācāryya Caṃdrapati. These brothers most likely donated the land so that some of the Vajrācāryas from Musuṃ Bāhāḥ could be permanently relocated to Lhugaḥ Bāhāḥ and serve as 'priests' there."@en ;
