<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/34d3a0bc-bf6d-489e-b2a4-9bf09d771740_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Arrangement of grant for Manamāneśvarī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Aṃśuvarmā allotted financial assistance to Māneśvara, along with various temples and monasteries. He classified popular temples of his time into three categories and made arrangements for financial grants from the state. Paśupatinātha, Cā̃gunārāyaṇa, Guṃ Vihāra, Māna Vihāra, and Rāja Vihāra were placed in the first category, and an arrangement was made to grant 6purāṇas 2paṇas. In the second category, Rāmeśvara, Haṃsagṛhadeva, and Māneśvara were also included, and an arrangement was made to grant 3purāṇas 1paṇa."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/34d3a0bc-bf6d-489e-b2a4-9bf09d771740> ;
    rdfs:comment "Aṃśuvarmā allotted financial assistance to Māneśvara, along with various temples and monasteries. He classified popular temples of his time into three categories and made arrangements for financial grants from the state. Paśupatinātha, Cā̃gunārāyaṇa, Guṃ Vihāra, Māna Vihāra, and Rāja Vihāra were placed in the first category, and an arrangement was made to grant 6purāṇas 2paṇas. In the second category, Rāmeśvara, Haṃsagṛhadeva, and Māneśvara were also included, and an arrangement was made to grant 3purāṇas 1paṇa."@en ;
