        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a strut"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A strut with a carving of Bhairava trampling on Vetāla was installed at thedyaḥchẽ. The name of the strut's donor is not inscribed, but it was possibly King Bhāṣkara Malla himself who established the Bhagavatī statue on the same date."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/34d3a0bc-bf6d-489e-b2a4-9bf09d771740> ;
