<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/34d6f310-e5e3-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Dispute regarding priesthood"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kamalākānta Upādhyāye of Patan Svatha Ṭola made a request to the authorities (most probably to the Prime minister Candra Śamśera) to retain his priestly duties in this temple. Sahadatta Miśra from Patan's Mahāpāla Ṭola, and Kṛṣṇacandra Jhā from Cīkaṃmugala Ṭola also claim be the legitimate priest of the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/34d6f310-e5e3-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kamalākānta Upādhyāye of Patan Svatha Ṭola made a request to the authorities (most probably to the Prime minister Candra Śamśera) to retain his priestly duties in this temple. Sahadatta Miśra from Patan's Mahāpāla Ṭola, and Kṛṣṇacandra Jhā from Cīkaṃmugala Ṭola also claim be the legitimate priest of the temple."@en ;
