    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple built by establishing Cakramukteśvara Mahādeva in memory of Lieutenant Cakra Śamśera, the third son of Prime Minister Vīra Śamśera and the first from his second wife Topakumārīdevī. The individual responsible for its construction is, however, unclear from the bell inscription."@en ;
