    rdfs:label "Initial Construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Tīrtha Rāja Śreṣṭha of Paṭko Ṭola initiated the construction of thisphalcā. It is said that he also granted a plot of land to the east of thephalcāto be used for revenue for thephalcā's maintenance."@en ;
