<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/358d5c28-12c4-477a-b2a5-3be3164b7657_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a community library"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In April 2021 construction of a new library buiding was started. The project is managed and financed by the INGO Read Nepal.While installing the heavy concrete foundations, it was discovered that the drawings did not specify the exact location and elevation of the building.Community members became aware that ground floor windows would be located below ground. Concerns were also raised regarding the building's disproportional size and lack of a sensitive design fitting the historic setting.The project was stopped and is currently under review. Communiy representatives requested the donor to develop a more traditional design."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/358d5c28-12c4-477a-b2a5-3be3164b7657> ;
    rdfs:comment "In April 2021 construction of a new library buiding was started. The project is managed and financed by the INGO Read Nepal.While installing the heavy concrete foundations, it was discovered that the drawings did not specify the exact location and elevation of the building.Community members became aware that ground floor windows would be located below ground. Concerns were also raised regarding the building's disproportional size and lack of a sensitive design fitting the historic setting.The project was stopped and is currently under review. Communiy representatives requested the donor to develop a more traditional design."@en ;
