<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/359211db-32de-4942-9808-1023db60054c_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of pillar 002"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The east side of the pillar is inscribed. The inscription contains 5 lines in Nāgarī script. According toPokharel(2011; p. 67) another side contains an inscription bearing the date ŚS 124.... This could not be verified in situ. If true, it would situate the pillar between 1318 and 1327 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/359211db-32de-4942-9808-1023db60054c> ;
    rdfs:comment "The east side of the pillar is inscribed. The inscription contains 5 lines in Nāgarī script. According toPokharel(2011; p. 67) another side contains an inscription bearing the date ŚS 124.... This could not be verified in situ. If true, it would situate the pillar between 1318 and 1327 CE."@en ;
