    rdfs:label "Beautification of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The recent beatification of the Phalcā was carried out by the Kirtipur Municipality. The Municipality desired to give the Phalcā a traditional appearance by using animation sketches. However, the plan did not materialize, and only veneer bricks were used to cover the concrete wall."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/35b04260-ffef-4788-a83e-e45c7d0e8b1f> ;
