    rdfs:label "Rebuilt"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As the temple had become extremely dilapidated, it was reconstructed under the chairmanship of Kedāraprasāda Tvānābāsu, with the support of Khvapa Municipality and the Department of Archaeology, during which thejhiṅgaṭīroofs were once again replaced with copper sheets."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3673daca-9f44-4b12-b1b9-90bc8d26fa6d> ;
