<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/36a68366-9a47-4f1c-b929-14e775f6b361_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of the statue of Durgā (PPK1001-001)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The stone toraṇa that adorns the Durgā statue contains an inscription from 1682 CE (NS 802) suggesting that it was established in that year. The art of the statues of Durgā and Bālakumārī, the main deity, are similar. Therefore, the statue of Bālakumārī may also have been established around that time in the 17th century."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/36a68366-9a47-4f1c-b929-14e775f6b361> ;
