<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/37637b5c-2c47-4579-bfaf-4e6c503a0fca_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage suffered from the earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The reconstruction of the temple is underway after the 2015 CE earthquakes further damaged the temple which was already in poor condition. A private trust operated by the descendants of Upendra Vikrama is carrying out the reconstruction of the temple together with the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/37637b5c-2c47-4579-bfaf-4e6c503a0fca> ;
