<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/37d714e8-29e1-44ec-a474-ab9eb80403c1_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Sataḥ collapsed due to the lack of timely renovations and remained in ruins for a long time. With funds from the Indian Embassy, its reconstruction began but the Lalitpur Metropolitan City also contributed financially, as the fund from the embassy was not sufficient for the reconstruction. Donations were also collected from the locals to meet the total expense of NRs. 5.6 million for the reconstruction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/37d714e8-29e1-44ec-a474-ab9eb80403c1> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Sataḥ collapsed due to the lack of timely renovations and remained in ruins for a long time. With funds from the Indian Embassy, its reconstruction began but the Lalitpur Metropolitan City also contributed financially, as the fund from the embassy was not sufficient for the reconstruction. Donations were also collected from the locals to meet the total expense of NRs. 5.6 million for the reconstruction."@en ;
