<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/38abc657-a1b2-43ba-a181-feec2f846765_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Goddess Bhagavatī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription from the temple that is no longer present at the site confirms that Māthavarasiṃha Thāpā established Goddess Bhagavatī here in 1837 CE (VS 1894)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/38abc657-a1b2-43ba-a181-feec2f846765> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription from the temple that is no longer present at the site confirms that Māthavarasiṃha Thāpā established Goddess Bhagavatī here in 1837 CE (VS 1894)."@en ;
