<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/38abc657-a1b2-43ba-a181-feec2f846765_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the establishment of Goddess Bhagavatī, Māthavarasiṃha Thāpā constructed a temple for the deity in 1844 CE (VS 1901). He also installed a golden finial on the temple after the completion of its construction and endowed 75ropanīs of land to form aguṭhīfor carrying out various rituals at the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/38abc657-a1b2-43ba-a181-feec2f846765> ;
