        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Ritual offering"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As mentioned above in 'description', the inscription from 1849 CE (VS 1906) at the site records that a person named Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa Śreṣṭha of Kulāṃbhulu made some offering to the Temple which was built by General Mathavarasiṃha Thāpā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/38abc657-a1b2-43ba-a181-feec2f846765> ;
