        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription from 1721 CE (NS 841) documents the establishment of thedāphābhajana, a group of devotional singers led by Mānadeva of the Suraṃki dynasty. It also records the construction of the rectangular stone structure at thepīṭha. The contributors proudly trace their lineage to the Suraṃki dynasty."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/390ac54b-f92b-4666-82fc-82543f77755e> ;
