<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/39ae7f90-422a-4c1b-af7e-766ae97dac4b_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A statue of Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara is established on the wall of the house situated on the western side of thisbāhāḥ. An inscription containing details of the statue's installation is carved on its pedestal. Although the remaining text is unreadable due to the letters having worn away, the installation date \"Samvat 901\" is clearly visible."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/39ae7f90-422a-4c1b-af7e-766ae97dac4b> ;
    rdfs:comment "A statue of Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara is established on the wall of the house situated on the western side of thisbāhāḥ. An inscription containing details of the statue's installation is carved on its pedestal. Although the remaining text is unreadable due to the letters having worn away, the installation date \"Samvat 901\" is clearly visible."@en ;
