<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/39ae7f90-422a-4c1b-af7e-766ae97dac4b_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:ConditionAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription is carved on acaitya(KAT2170-002) located in the courtyard of thebāhāḥ; however, because the letters have worn away and become illegible, the specific details contained within are unknown. Since inscriptions of this type primarily document the establishment of thecaitya, it can be assumed that this inscription also contains details regarding thecaitya's installation."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/39ae7f90-422a-4c1b-af7e-766ae97dac4b> ;
