<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/39bb2040-e9fd-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Treaty between Patan, Kantipur and Bhaktapur"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An agreement was reached between the kings of Lalitpur, Bhaktapur and Kantipur that Mahādeva Ojha and his descendents should not be allowed to enter the Valley. This agreement took the form of a treaty. The document further mentions that whoever permits them to enter in the Valley, talks to Mahādeva Ojha or gives him fire, water, money or clothes will be cursed by Taleju Māju and other gods of the Valley."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/39bb2040-e9fd-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "An agreement was reached between the kings of Lalitpur, Bhaktapur and Kantipur that Mahādeva Ojha and his descendents should not be allowed to enter the Valley. This agreement took the form of a treaty. The document further mentions that whoever permits them to enter in the Valley, talks to Mahādeva Ojha or gives him fire, water, money or clothes will be cursed by Taleju Māju and other gods of the Valley."@en ;
