<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/39bb2040-e9fd-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of a gilt toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thislālamoharaof King Gīrvāṇa appropriates 336murīof land for the rituals of Śrī Talejyu of Lalitapatan (Patan). People involved in the donation process were: Saṃkalpavākyavaktā purohita Śrī Daivajña Kesarī Paṃḍita, the 5 ministers of King Gīrvāṇa, namely, Pāḍe Śrī Raṇajit, Pāḍe Śrī Dāmodara, Śrī Tribhuvana, Śri Narasiṃha and Śrī Kīrtimānasiṃha; and Mahākośādhyakṣya: Pāḍe Śrī Bhoṭu and Kośādhyakṣya: Śrī Śyāmalāla Upādhyāya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/39bb2040-e9fd-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Thislālamoharaof King Gīrvāṇa appropriates 336murīof land for the rituals of Śrī Talejyu of Lalitapatan (Patan). People involved in the donation process were: Saṃkalpavākyavaktā purohita Śrī Daivajña Kesarī Paṃḍita, the 5 ministers of King Gīrvāṇa, namely, Pāḍe Śrī Raṇajit, Pāḍe Śrī Dāmodara, Śrī Tribhuvana, Śri Narasiṃha and Śrī Kīrtimānasiṃha; and Mahākośādhyakṣya: Pāḍe Śrī Bhoṭu and Kośādhyakṣya: Śrī Śyāmalāla Upādhyāya."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
