    rdfs:label "Installation of pillar BTD0020-004 in 1387 CE"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pillar BTD0020-004 contains an inscription of three lines indevanāgarīscript. According to D. R. Sharma the reading of the inscription is as follows:Śri sāke 1309 bāghi kot vadā likhitam...gutahatranslated as: \"In saka [śaka] 1309 this... is written by Vadā from Bāghikot\" (Sharma 2012: 350)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3a3599d5-5f94-476d-a80f-4f2d3bb9bf9c> ;
