<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/3a5f3d5c-c235-45e1-9fda-5ac901dee42c_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Rāmajī Sāpakoṭā, the grandson of Janārdana, details that his grandfather Janārdana belonged to the same generation as Pṛthvīvilāsa, that is, to the late Rāṇā-period generation (oral testimony at age of 76, in 2025).जनार्दनकै नाति रामजि सापकोटा आफ्ना बाजेबारे जानकारी राख्छन् र यी तथ्य सुनाउछन् । जनार्दन पृथ्वीविलासकै समकालीन अर्थात् राणाकालको उत्तरार्धतिरका पुस्ता थिए (one of the descendants of the initial constructor, male, age 76) ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3a5f3d5c-c235-45e1-9fda-5ac901dee42c> ;
    rdfs:comment "Rāmajī Sāpakoṭā, the grandson of Janārdana, details that his grandfather Janārdana belonged to the same generation as Pṛthvīvilāsa, that is, to the late Rāṇā-period generation (oral testimony at age of 76, in 2025).जनार्दनकै नाति रामजि सापकोटा आफ्ना बाजेबारे जानकारी राख्छन् र यी तथ्य सुनाउछन् । जनार्दन पृथ्वीविलासकै समकालीन अर्थात् राणाकालको उत्तरार्धतिरका पुस्ता थिए (one of the descendants of the initial constructor, male, age 76) ।"@en ;
