        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of the stone stambha and lion statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The stone pillar, which supported a gilt metal lion, crumbled in the 2015 CE earthquakes, and the upper stone shaft fractured into two pieces. In the period spanning 2015-2016, a team from the University of Applied Arts, Vienna, meticulously carried out the restoration of the pillar and the lion statue."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3b68c5ca-e64a-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
