        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Pavement of the ground floor"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The ground floor was paved withteliyābricks by Vajrācārya Cintāmaṇi and Laghunātha Bhāro. In this inscription, Bhīmasena is referred to asMahābhīma Māṇeśvara."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3b68c5ca-e64a-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The ground floor was paved withteliyābricks by Vajrācārya Cintāmaṇi and Laghunātha Bhāro. In this inscription, Bhīmasena is referred to asMahābhīma Māṇeśvara."@en ;
