        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Six members of Hāthu Guthi including Jīvanarāma Mānandhara (text: Mānāndhala Jevaṇarāma), Bābudeva Mānandhara (text: Mānāndhala Bābudeva), and Viṣṇusiṃha Mānandhara (text: Mānāndhala Viṣṇusiṃha) renovated the Phalcā in the name of their deceased younger brother Dhana."@en ;
