<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/3db42996-337a-11ea-b242-0242ac130002_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription mentions that Vīra Sāhi Kumhara placed a pinnacle on top of the temple and bestowed it with land to fund the anniversary ritual worship.Pruscha(1975 C/P-279) relies upon this inscription and dates the temple to 1681 CE. However, it is not certain whether Vīra Sāhi actually constructed the temple on this date or merely offered a pinnacle."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3db42996-337a-11ea-b242-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription mentions that Vīra Sāhi Kumhara placed a pinnacle on top of the temple and bestowed it with land to fund the anniversary ritual worship.Pruscha(1975 C/P-279) relies upon this inscription and dates the temple to 1681 CE. However, it is not certain whether Vīra Sāhi actually constructed the temple on this date or merely offered a pinnacle."@en ;
