    rdfs:label "Cash donations for various items"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Social worker Jagadiśa Vaidya made separate cash donations for various items to be offered to Mahālakṣmī and Mahābhairava like bells, fly whisks, crowns, trident, palanquins, etc. This inscription is a letter of appreciation issued in the name of the donor by the Department of Archaeology for his financial contributions."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3dc920a0-23a7-4407-994d-d246554bc0be> ;
