<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/3e52c084-1e63-4364-bc59-94d9b8e89e23_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Hiti turned into a pond"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In around 1975 CE, the Hiti had turned into a pond because its drainage system did not work properly. Locals tried to repair the drainage system but were unsuccessful. The pond drained out due course of time, but the Hiti dried up. Thus, locals started digging up the water channel to reach the source of the Hiti. Before they reached the source, the Hiti started to flow again."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3e52c084-1e63-4364-bc59-94d9b8e89e23> ;
    rdfs:comment "In around 1975 CE, the Hiti had turned into a pond because its drainage system did not work properly. Locals tried to repair the drainage system but were unsuccessful. The pond drained out due course of time, but the Hiti dried up. Thus, locals started digging up the water channel to reach the source of the Hiti. Before they reached the source, the Hiti started to flow again."@en ;
