    rdfs:label "Fixing the mask of Mahākālī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A small mask representing Mahākālī was fixed to the south-eastern pillar of the arcade in the 1980s.  In the present, a metal statue of Mahākālī has been fixed to the same pillar where the mask used to be. It attracts a lot of devotees every morning."@en ;
