    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Bhūpatīndra Malla built the stone temple of Taḥdhaṃ Mahādeva and established other deities adhering to the Śiva Pāñcāyana concept in the octagonal structure."@en ;
