<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/3f87ad30-e5d0-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Reconstruction of the Phalcā was carried out by GTZ/udle. Reportedly, there was a marble inscription documenting this event, but today (effective 2019) it is lost. Presumably this happened during the earthquake and the subsequent reconstruction."@en ;
