<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/3f87ad30-e5d0-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Reconstruction of the Phalcā after its collapse folowing the 2015 earthquakes. The reconstruction was financed by photo.circle Kathmandu, UNESCO and local people. Thedhuri pūjāof Nāraṃhiṭi Phalcā was performed by Sānukāji Avāle (52), Kvaylāchi on 9 June 2018. Photo.circle has shared a report about the reconstruction with the NHDP. Photo.circle contributed 12,000 US dollars to the restoration project. Most of these donations came from the PhotoKathmandu festival and UNESCO."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/3f87ad30-e5d0-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Reconstruction of the Phalcā after its collapse folowing the 2015 earthquakes. The reconstruction was financed by photo.circle Kathmandu, UNESCO and local people. Thedhuri pūjāof Nāraṃhiṭi Phalcā was performed by Sānukāji Avāle (52), Kvaylāchi on 9 June 2018. Photo.circle has shared a report about the reconstruction with the NHDP. Photo.circle contributed 12,000 US dollars to the restoration project. Most of these donations came from the PhotoKathmandu festival and UNESCO."@en ;
