<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/409cfb82-e6c3-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of guṭhī and donation of finial and window"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A fire worshipping ritual was organised in the Mūchẽ Āgama. Land was donated to fund the establishment of a Busādhãguṭhī.The pinnacle, flags and golden windows were also offered to the deity on this day. The inscription mentions that avarṣavardhana pūjāof theāgamamust be performed every year on the 14th day of the dark half of Vaiśākha. Specific directions regarding the management of the worship for Buṅgabhaṭṭāraka (Rāto Matsyendranātha), Cābuṅgabhaṭṭāraka (Mīnanātha), Paśupatinātha, Guhyeśvarī and Garuḍa Nārāyana are written in the inscription.Actor: Pātravaṃśa Gaṅgāśaṅkara Rāut"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/409cfb82-e6c3-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "A fire worshipping ritual was organised in the Mūchẽ Āgama. Land was donated to fund the establishment of a Busādhãguṭhī.The pinnacle, flags and golden windows were also offered to the deity on this day. The inscription mentions that avarṣavardhana pūjāof theāgamamust be performed every year on the 14th day of the dark half of Vaiśākha. Specific directions regarding the management of the worship for Buṅgabhaṭṭāraka (Rāto Matsyendranātha), Cābuṅgabhaṭṭāraka (Mīnanātha), Paśupatinātha, Guhyeśvarī and Garuḍa Nārāyana are written in the inscription.Actor: Pātravaṃśa Gaṅgāśaṅkara Rāut"@en ;
