        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Stone paving"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The sons of Śaṅkhamuni, Rājmāna and Mānasiṁha, together with all their family members, paved the ground of thepīṭhaarea with stone slabs. At the same time, during thejātrā, the spot in the settlement where the palanquin halts (capāḥkva) was also paved with stone."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/409d7a33-9b5f-41bf-91cb-e08da1dfdd98> ;
