<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/425bbdb8-54b5-474e-839a-7da85f116aa3_26> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishing new statues of goddesses"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Along with his family, Puruṣottamabahādura Śreṣṭha of Saugal, Patan established new statues of theaṣṭamātṛkādeities inside the sanctum after the previous ones were worn out. He established these statues in the name of his deceased family members Mānabahādura, Gaṇeśakumārī, Śambhūbahādura, and Pūrṇakumārī Śreṣṭha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/425bbdb8-54b5-474e-839a-7da85f116aa3> ;
    rdfs:comment "Along with his family, Puruṣottamabahādura Śreṣṭha of Saugal, Patan established new statues of theaṣṭamātṛkādeities inside the sanctum after the previous ones were worn out. He established these statues in the name of his deceased family members Mānabahādura, Gaṇeśakumārī, Śambhūbahādura, and Pūrṇakumārī Śreṣṭha."@en ;
