    dcterms:description "Jayakṛṣṇa Bhāro, Devidāsa Bhāro, and others jointly offered a woodentoraṇaover the southern entrance of the temple. While the inscription does not contain a date, the donation appears to have taken place in later-medieval period."@en ;
