    rdfs:label "Offering of a brass toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Together with his wife Devi Thaku and the family members, Kāyaṣṭha Akabara Bhāro of the Bhansāra Ṭola in Cāpāgāũ installed a brass toraṇa above the entrance to the temple. He also overlaid the entrance with brass sheets on the occasion."@en ;
