<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4405bb30-4704-432a-9f61-2a7c8912321a_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Thievery and Replacement"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The original Śākyamuni statue consecrated in the sanctum in 1649 CE (NS 769) was stolen in 1984 CE. An individual named Kānchī Vajrācarya from the local community installed the contemporary statue on the empty pedestal in the same year."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4405bb30-4704-432a-9f61-2a7c8912321a> ;
    rdfs:comment "The original Śākyamuni statue consecrated in the sanctum in 1649 CE (NS 769) was stolen in 1984 CE. An individual named Kānchī Vajrācarya from the local community installed the contemporary statue on the empty pedestal in the same year."@en ;
