<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4431b053-3081-43a1-8b28-a028f1ffdf65_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the pond"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The local community initiated the reconstruction of the Pukhū to bring it back to its original size. The Shankharapur Municipality provided NRs. 3.5 million to remove clay deposited in the Pukhū and to build an embankment and walls around it. After the reconstruction of the Pukhū, it is hoped that lotuses will grow again and be used as offerings to Vajrayoginī like in the past."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4431b053-3081-43a1-8b28-a028f1ffdf65> ;
    rdfs:comment "The local community initiated the reconstruction of the Pukhū to bring it back to its original size. The Shankharapur Municipality provided NRs. 3.5 million to remove clay deposited in the Pukhū and to build an embankment and walls around it. After the reconstruction of the Pukhū, it is hoped that lotuses will grow again and be used as offerings to Vajrayoginī like in the past."@en ;
