        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a Hundred Eight Ghyadevās and a Bell, and Encircling the Temple by Adding a Raised Walkway (Peṭī)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Arjun and Bāgirathī Suvedī offered a-hundred-eightghyadevāsand a bell to Sarasvatī. They also added the raised walkway (New.phaḥ, Nep.peṭī) running around all four sides to the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/443544db-8f01-4d16-8f90-1de79f599e98> ;
