<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/443544db-8f01-4d16-8f90-1de79f599e98_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of a Sarasvatī Statue (A)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription from NS 434 (1314 CE) installed in the temple premise records the installation of a Sarasvatī statue.  Another inscription from NS 567 (1447 CE), installed nearby the this inscription, mentions the same event. Therefore, it remains obscure in which date the present-day statue was installed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/443544db-8f01-4d16-8f90-1de79f599e98> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription from NS 434 (1314 CE) installed in the temple premise records the installation of a Sarasvatī statue.  Another inscription from NS 567 (1447 CE), installed nearby the this inscription, mentions the same event. Therefore, it remains obscure in which date the present-day statue was installed."@en ;
