        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of a container, mohara and toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Brahmācārya Bhikṣus of the Bahī, namely Rāja Vidhi, Lakṣmī Vidhi and other 16 people offered a round-shaped pot (bidola) to Akṣobhya and 10 garlands of coins (mohara mālā) to Matsyendranātha.Images of four donors are sculpted at the bottom of the inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/44609e5a-ee3d-11e9-8649-0242ac130002> ;
