        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Inscription on monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The pediment of the temple contains inscribed stone blocks. The inscriptions are very eroded, but it is possible to read the date 1408 of the Śaka era, which corresponds to 1486 CE.The inscription may record the construction of the temple or a later use of it.The inscription was first mentioned by Prayag Raj Sharma (1972)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4563841e-66d6-4de7-a2be-5488c3a078ad> ;
