        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Local residents reconstructed the temple with the help of Bungmati Sāṃskṛtika Adhyayana Kendra, a research center focusing on the cultural history of Bungamti. The reconstruction work started in the 27th of Caitra (VS 2059) and was completed in the 20th of Jyeṣṭha (VS 2060). It was officially inaugurated on the 23rd of Śrāvaṇa (VS 2060)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/45b07460-1787-11ea-b9b1-0242ac130002> ;
