    dcterms:description "The gilded copper plate of the eastern spout (see object number LAL1860-001) of the Hiti got stolen in 2007 CE. Thus, Prabhāta Red Star (Youth) Club renovated the Hiti with the financial support of Lalitpur Metropolitan City and also wrapped the eastern spot with a gilded copper plate."@en ;
