    rdfs:label "Renovation of Bhairava shrine (PPK1306-008)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the name of the deceased Harimāyā Śreṣṭha, the large oblong stone (PPK1306-008) set on a wall north of the shrine was renovated by setting bricks around the stone. The stone is revered as Bhairava."@en ;
