<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/482bf3db-e9d7-4c26-8168-80d1c992ddca_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Demolition of the akhaḍā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The devastating earthquakes in 2015 left the building on the verge of collapse. Consequently, the statues of various deities and the sacredśāligrāmastone housed inside theakhaḍāwere relocated to another building intended for ascetics, known as the Bhāgavata Sanyāsa Āśrama. In 2021 CE, the Pashupati Area Development Trust dismantled the hazardous sections of the building."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/482bf3db-e9d7-4c26-8168-80d1c992ddca> ;
    rdfs:comment "The devastating earthquakes in 2015 left the building on the verge of collapse. Consequently, the statues of various deities and the sacredśāligrāmastone housed inside theakhaḍāwere relocated to another building intended for ascetics, known as the Bhāgavata Sanyāsa Āśrama. In 2021 CE, the Pashupati Area Development Trust dismantled the hazardous sections of the building."@en ;
