        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Theft of the main idol (Viṣṇuvikrāṇta) from the sanctum"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The stone statue of Viṣṇuvikrānta, the main deity of the Temple, was enshrined in a small shrine after the Temple collapsed during the 1833 CE earthquakes. Unfortunately, it was stolen in 1990 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4866412c-db26-4c5c-9a7b-2fba0dff932d> ;
