        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Laying the foundation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the joint rule of King Śivasiṃha Malla and Lakṣmīnarasiṃha Malla, Jayalakṣa of Taḥdhaṃ Bāhāḥ (KAT1420) began the construction of Pinchẽ Bāhāḥ. The foundation was laid by performing a fire oblation."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/487cc7fc-4ccc-4d4e-8274-734cbc2b600f> ;
