        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Completion of the construction of the bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After completing the construction of thebāhāḥ, a stone statue of Akṣobhya was established as the main deity (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ). A gilded statue of Dīpaṅkara, a Mañjuśrī statue, a Halāhala Lokeśvara statue,acaityaand a shrine of Lokeśvara were also established at thebāhāḥpremises."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/487cc7fc-4ccc-4d4e-8274-734cbc2b600f> ;
