<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/48dc7bc9-effe-43fd-ab20-228d51298ccb_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the present Temple structure"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Previously, it used to be a shrine with the statue of Bhagavatī enshrined under an open sky (see, for example the historical photo taken in the early 1970s and published inPursha1975, p. 15). The Maitrī Parivāra Club constructed the present structure keeping the existing shrine at the centre."@en ;
