<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/49d791b2-5a42-4b64-8a7b-526379e8023c_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription on the northern wall of thesataḥcredits Jayanta Kumedāna with the construction of thesataḥwhile documenting the construction of a cremation ground (ghāṭa) by Śivānanda Vaidya in the front. However, an inventory published by the Kathmandu Upatyakā Nagara Vikāsa Yojanā mistakenly indicates that Jayanta Kumedāna built thesataḥin 1826 CE, the same year the cremation ground was established. Śivānanda also established a statue of Mādhavanārāyaṇa in the vicinity and set up a trust by donating land."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/49d791b2-5a42-4b64-8a7b-526379e8023c> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription on the northern wall of thesataḥcredits Jayanta Kumedāna with the construction of thesataḥwhile documenting the construction of a cremation ground (ghāṭa) by Śivānanda Vaidya in the front. However, an inventory published by the Kathmandu Upatyakā Nagara Vikāsa Yojanā mistakenly indicates that Jayanta Kumedāna built thesataḥin 1826 CE, the same year the cremation ground was established. Śivānanda also established a statue of Mādhavanārāyaṇa in the vicinity and set up a trust by donating land."@en ;
