<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4a025a42-e6ea-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of the statue of devotees"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Locke(1985,112) quotes the date as NS 851 butŚākya(1994,111) mentions NS 861. Since the stone inscription is damaged the date cannot be read anymore. Members of the monastery believe that the statue represents the donors who constructed the Buddha temple in the courtyard."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4a025a42-e6ea-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Locke(1985,112) quotes the date as NS 851 butŚākya(1994,111) mentions NS 861. Since the stone inscription is damaged the date cannot be read anymore. Members of the monastery believe that the statue represents the donors who constructed the Buddha temple in the courtyard."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
