<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4a025a42-e6ea-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the Dharmadhātu Maṇḍala"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Cidhimāyā and her two sons Rājamāna and Ratna Bahādur consecrated the Dharmadhātu Maṇḍala. The Dharmadhātu Maṇḍala was originally in front of thekvāḥpāḥdyaḥbut was later moved between the Buddha Temple and the Dharmadhātu Jinālaya Caitya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4a025a42-e6ea-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
