        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Regulations Laid Down for the Organization of Annual Celebrations of the Bhairava Shrine"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription records the regulations laid down for organising various annual celebrations of Ākāśa Bhairava (KIR0050-009). The names of donor couple have been mentioned as Gaṃgānātha Darśandhārī and his wife Chikunī Juginī (Joginī) of Kvathajora (Kutujvaḥ Ṭola). They also formed aguṭhīto sustain the prescribed tradition as mentioned in this inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4a48d563-85d1-4e51-8f78-2254393f85e2> ;
