<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4a48d563-85d1-4e51-8f78-2254393f85e2_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offerings to Gorakhanātha and Bhairava"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Something was offered or built to the name of Gorakhanātha. The part where it is detailed is in poor condition and very hard to decipher. Names of ten donors from the Kapāli community are mentioned in the inscription. The group also offered a pair of lion statues (siṅacāandbyāṅacā) to Bhairava (KIR0050-009)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4a48d563-85d1-4e51-8f78-2254393f85e2> ;
    rdfs:comment "Something was offered or built to the name of Gorakhanātha. The part where it is detailed is in poor condition and very hard to decipher. Names of ten donors from the Kapāli community are mentioned in the inscription. The group also offered a pair of lion statues (siṅacāandbyāṅacā) to Bhairava (KIR0050-009)."@en ;
