    rdfs:label "Initial construction of Bhuyū Cībhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records that Bhuyū Cībhāḥ was commissioned in 1705 CE (NS 825) by Śivarāma Mahān Bhāva, a resident of Mikhabāhāḥ (LAL0810).The inscription is embedded in the wall of the entrance area of the newly constructed shopping center immediately to the east of the caitya. The shopping center replaced the historic Cībhāḥ Phalcā (LAL4211)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4a6c25be-af79-11ea-8ae7-0242ac130005> ;
