<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4a90112b-ef55-4f82-ac30-742c13f49a2c_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kājī Ḍillisiṃha Basneta donated land parcels to establish a trust for the performance of daily and periodic rituals at the temple. King Surendra issued a copperplate inscription detailing the land parcels Ḍillīsiṃha donated in the name of the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4a90112b-ef55-4f82-ac30-742c13f49a2c> ;
