<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4b189a6b-c78f-4aa8-ba35-5a1686ec99e1_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Formation of a committee to reconstruct the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As the temple had fallen into a dilapidated condition, a reconstruction committee was formed under the chairmanship of ward chair Vidyāsundara Śākya.मन्दिर जीर्ण भएकोले पुनर्निर्माण गर्न वडाध्यक्ष विद्यासुन्दर शाक्यको अध्यक्षतामा समिति गठन गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4b189a6b-c78f-4aa8-ba35-5a1686ec99e1> ;
    rdfs:comment "As the temple had fallen into a dilapidated condition, a reconstruction committee was formed under the chairmanship of ward chair Vidyāsundara Śākya.मन्दिर जीर्ण भएकोले पुनर्निर्माण गर्न वडाध्यक्ष विद्यासुन्दर शाक्यको अध्यक्षतामा समिति गठन गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
