<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4b189a6b-c78f-4aa8-ba35-5a1686ec99e1_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Owing to its deteriorated state, the temple was reconstructed with financial assistance from the Kathmandu Metropolitan City and donations collected from devotees. Prior to reconstruction, the temple was a single-storey structure with a tiled roof. During reconstruction, it was rebuilt as a two-storey temple and the roof was clad with brass sheets.मन्दिर जीर्ण भएकोले काठमाडौं महानगरपालिकाको आर्थिक सहयोग र भक्तजनसँग चन्दा उठाएर मन्दिरको पुनर्निर्माण गरिएको थियो । पुनर्निर्माण गर्नुभन्दा अगाडि मन्दिर एक तलाको मात्र थियो र छानामा झिङ्गटी राखिएको थियो । पुनर्निर्माण गर्दा दुईतलाको मन्दिर बनाई छानामा पित्तलको पाता राखिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4b189a6b-c78f-4aa8-ba35-5a1686ec99e1> ;
    rdfs:comment "Owing to its deteriorated state, the temple was reconstructed with financial assistance from the Kathmandu Metropolitan City and donations collected from devotees. Prior to reconstruction, the temple was a single-storey structure with a tiled roof. During reconstruction, it was rebuilt as a two-storey temple and the roof was clad with brass sheets.मन्दिर जीर्ण भएकोले काठमाडौं महानगरपालिकाको आर्थिक सहयोग र भक्तजनसँग चन्दा उठाएर मन्दिरको पुनर्निर्माण गरिएको थियो । पुनर्निर्माण गर्नुभन्दा अगाडि मन्दिर एक तलाको मात्र थियो र छानामा झिङ्गटी राखिएको थियो । पुनर्निर्माण गर्दा दुईतलाको मन्दिर बनाई छानामा पित्तलको पाता राखिएको थियो ।"@en ;
