<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4b189a6b-c78f-4aa8-ba35-5a1686ec99e1_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Covering wall with copper and brass plates"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Sanubhāi Mānan­dhara, together with his wife Jānakīdevī Mānan­dhara, sheathed the interior walls of the sanctorum with copper and brass sheets in memory of his late mother, Lakṣmīdevī Mānan­dhar.सानुभाइ मानन्धरले श्रीमती जानकीदेवी मानन्धरसँग मिलेर दिवंगत आमा लक्ष्मीदेवी मानन्धरको स्मृतिमा मन्दिरको गर्भगृहभित्रको भित्तामा तामा र पित्तलको पाताले मोडिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4b189a6b-c78f-4aa8-ba35-5a1686ec99e1> ;
    rdfs:comment "Sanubhāi Mānan­dhara, together with his wife Jānakīdevī Mānan­dhara, sheathed the interior walls of the sanctorum with copper and brass sheets in memory of his late mother, Lakṣmīdevī Mānan­dhar.सानुभाइ मानन्धरले श्रीमती जानकीदेवी मानन्धरसँग मिलेर दिवंगत आमा लक्ष्मीदेवी मानन्धरको स्मृतिमा मन्दिरको गर्भगृहभित्रको भित्तामा तामा र पित्तलको पाताले मोडिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
