<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4b71b6b4-4b74-4c22-a51a-4955714decf2_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of Candraśamśera, the local moneylender (sāhu) Pṛthvīvilāsa Sāpakoṭā constructed Kālesāhu Pāṭī and the nearby temple (devala) dedicated to Naravadeśvara Mahādeva, and endowed substantial parcels of land asguṭhīto support the performance of annual rites.चन्द्रशम्शेरको शासनकालमा स्थानीय साहु पृथ्वीविलास सापकोटाले यस सतःका साथै समीपैमा नरवदेश्वर महादेवको देवल बनाई वार्षिक कर्मका खातिर प्रसस्त जग्गा गुठी राखे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4b71b6b4-4b74-4c22-a51a-4955714decf2> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the reign of Candraśamśera, the local moneylender (sāhu) Pṛthvīvilāsa Sāpakoṭā constructed Kālesāhu Pāṭī and the nearby temple (devala) dedicated to Naravadeśvara Mahādeva, and endowed substantial parcels of land asguṭhīto support the performance of annual rites.चन्द्रशम्शेरको शासनकालमा स्थानीय साहु पृथ्वीविलास सापकोटाले यस सतःका साथै समीपैमा नरवदेश्वर महादेवको देवल बनाई वार्षिक कर्मका खातिर प्रसस्त जग्गा गुठी राखे ।"@en ;
