    rdfs:label "Installation of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "From the surplus remaining from the income of the lands endowed in 1914 CE( VS 1971) in the name of Kālesāhu Pāṭī  and thedevala, a bell was installed in the name of Naravadeśvara and the lineage deity.पृथ्वीविलासले विसं १९७१ (सन् ९१४) मा  सतः र देवलका नाममा राखेको जग्गाको आयबाट बचेको जगेडाले नरवदेश्वर र कुलदेवताको नाममा एक घण्ट स्थापना गरियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4b71b6b4-4b74-4c22-a51a-4955714decf2> ;
