<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4c6f4501-3d62-4c19-8445-b9927856cee1_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Resume of daily worship (nityapūjā)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "At this shrine, where daily worship had ceased for many years, the daily worship was restarted on the initiative of the 'Daśamahāvidyā Bhaktibhāva Parivāra' organization by a Rājopādhyāya Brāhmaṇa, and it has been continuing without interruption. The same organization is managing the priest's remuneration."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4c6f4501-3d62-4c19-8445-b9927856cee1> ;
    rdfs:comment "At this shrine, where daily worship had ceased for many years, the daily worship was restarted on the initiative of the 'Daśamahāvidyā Bhaktibhāva Parivāra' organization by a Rājopādhyāya Brāhmaṇa, and it has been continuing without interruption. The same organization is managing the priest's remuneration."@en ;
