<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4cddce02-638a-4290-aa8c-41188deed1de_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the wake of the 2015 CE earthquake, thesataḥsuffered extensive damage, necessitating the evacuation of its inhabitants and eventual reconstruction, which were completed by 2022 CE. This revitalization of thesataḥwas made possible through the collaborative efforts of the Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization project, an initiative under the Nepal Government's Ministry of Urban Development, along with financial support from the Asian Development Bank. The restoredsataḥwas inauguration in October 2022 CE (2079 VS)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4cddce02-638a-4290-aa8c-41188deed1de> ;
    rdfs:comment "In the wake of the 2015 CE earthquake, thesataḥsuffered extensive damage, necessitating the evacuation of its inhabitants and eventual reconstruction, which were completed by 2022 CE. This revitalization of thesataḥwas made possible through the collaborative efforts of the Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization project, an initiative under the Nepal Government's Ministry of Urban Development, along with financial support from the Asian Development Bank. The restoredsataḥwas inauguration in October 2022 CE (2079 VS)."@en ;
