    rdfs:label "Restoration of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kalmochanaghāta Sataḥ West underwent renovation in 2014 CE (2017 VS), made possible by donations. The names of major donors are engraved on the marble slab.सतःको पछिल्लो जीर्णोद्धारकार्य विसं २०७१ (सन् २०१४) सालमा चन्दा संकलनबाट गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
