<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4ef6a4bb-88e5-4b4c-a1c7-9e4fb4553a45_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of a house"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Rudrasiṃha Bhāro donated his residential house and adjoining land for religious purposes dedicating to his ancestralāgama-devatā(family tutelary deity). Although the exact date of the inscription is unclear, the language and script suggest that it belongs to the late medieval period."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4ef6a4bb-88e5-4b4c-a1c7-9e4fb4553a45> ;
