    rdfs:label "Construction of a caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription does not originally belong to the temple but has been brought from elsewhere. The upper portion of the stone stele is engraved with avajra(thunderbolt) and the text records that a family of Dhījavirasiṃha from Kāntipura (Kathmandu) constructed avajradhātu caitya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4ef6a4bb-88e5-4b4c-a1c7-9e4fb4553a45> ;
