<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/4f116514-0102-11ea-8f3c-0242ac130002_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription mentions that the temple was destroyed. It was reconstructed by Viṣṇu Siṃha in NS 674. It further informs the readers that his attendants excavated two copper vessels inscribed with the name of the deity Bhṛṅgāreśvara."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4f116514-0102-11ea-8f3c-0242ac130002> ;
