    rdfs:label "Construction of the śivālaya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Hiraṇyagarbhakumārī, also known as Jyeṭhā Maiñā Mahārānī, established thisśivālayaand named it Hiraṇyabhakteśvara in honor of herself. She built the temple five years after her marriage to Jaṅga Bahādura."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/4fa7b353-c9a5-446b-bd7a-439316564a9c> ;
