    rdfs:label "Initial Construction of the Bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The saṅghamembers of thebāhāḥoften recite a religious text,cacā, inside itsdyaḥchẽ. This text also records that a person called Bhāgisiṃha and his family constructed Kvay Bāhāḥ in 1701 CE (NS 821)."@en ;
