<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5111af39-5e02-4674-b7b3-637e7429d27d_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Use of space for classroom of a primary school"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Sankhu Primary School was established in 1976 CE at the Calākhu Ṭola. It ran its classes on Nhāykaṃ Sataḥ. As there was not enough space for the students at the Sataḥ, the Phalcā was used as classrooms for three years."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5111af39-5e02-4674-b7b3-637e7429d27d> ;
