    rdfs:label "Renovation of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A local resident from the Bālakumārī area renovated the north-facing phalcā (object no. THI0110-002) during the reign of King Raṇajita Malla."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/511d9122-2ce9-498a-bac6-0c9b11c528e6> ;
