<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/51368f81-89d6-4645-b031-8eac8bcdcedb_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of the Patan Guṭhī Office"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Before the establishment of the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna in 1964 CE (VS 2021), there were 15 separateguthioffices in operation, each under the jurisdiction of various magistrate offices. The Macchendra Guṭhī Office was one of them. It operated from this building. In 1971 CE (VS 2028), the Lalitpur Branch of the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna was also stationed here."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/51368f81-89d6-4645-b031-8eac8bcdcedb> ;
    rdfs:comment "Before the establishment of the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna in 1964 CE (VS 2021), there were 15 separateguthioffices in operation, each under the jurisdiction of various magistrate offices. The Macchendra Guṭhī Office was one of them. It operated from this building. In 1971 CE (VS 2028), the Lalitpur Branch of the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna was also stationed here."@en ;
