        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Maṇivināyaka statue and construction of phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Śivasiṃha Bhāro installed the Maṇivināyaka statue (BKT0181-006) and built aphalcārest house, wishing for his long life, health, progeny, and wealth. It also warns that anyone harming the Maṇivināyaka orphalcāwill face the consequences of committing the five great sins."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5168f38a-94c4-4e8e-995c-ab7e0e1f11ba> ;
