        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a jaḥdhuṃ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Narendradeva, Viṣṇudeva established ajaḥdhuṇ(stone water spout) for Brahmins and other people to bathe. For thejaḥdhuṇ, he also arranged a water-drawing mechanism and a well."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/517a1bd2-2894-4d02-a2a7-9a8d0ff28cff> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the reign of King Narendradeva, Viṣṇudeva established ajaḥdhuṇ(stone water spout) for Brahmins and other people to bathe. For thejaḥdhuṇ, he also arranged a water-drawing mechanism and a well."@en ;
