    rdfs:label "Offering silver utensils for worship"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the name of his late father Ānanda Maharjana and late mother Śāradā Maharjana, Canaka Maharjana and his wife Līlā Maharjana offered various silver ritual objects necessary for the worship (pūjā) of Naksāla Bhagavatī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/517a1bd2-2894-4d02-a2a7-9a8d0ff28cff> ;
