    rdfs:label "Offering of a pair of flags"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Four devotees—Sāhu Durgādāsa, Dvārikādāsa, Siddhīlāla, and Bhairava Siṃ—performed worship to Naksāla Bhagavatī and dedicated a pair of flags inside the sanctum, spending 482tolas of silver for the purpose."@en ;
