        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Expansion of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The seven-bay Phalcā came into existence only after its reconstruction in 2021 CE. It used to be a three-bay Phalcā that remained in a poor state of repair for some time. A small building of one floor that stood next to the Phalcā was also merged into the Phalcā to expand the rest house into a seven-bay structure in the course of the reconstruction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/51bb73e5-28e7-442f-956f-ad705e533069> ;
    rdfs:comment "The seven-bay Phalcā came into existence only after its reconstruction in 2021 CE. It used to be a three-bay Phalcā that remained in a poor state of repair for some time. A small building of one floor that stood next to the Phalcā was also merged into the Phalcā to expand the rest house into a seven-bay structure in the course of the reconstruction."@en ;
