    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription commemorating the initial construction of this monument records that the two-storeydharmaśālāwas built using bricks, measuring 266 cubits in length and supported by 11 columns, stretching from Kālamocanaghāṭa to Purohitaghāṭa."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/51fcc336-5270-47c3-8ab7-56f82bc96859> ;
