<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/52ea5b64-e318-48bf-9717-30f4536737ef_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Beginning of the initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription documents the installation of a Śivaliṅga in 1813 CE (VS 1869), followed by the excavation for the construction of a boundary wall in 1813 CE (VS 1870) during the eleventh fortnight of Kārtika (N. Panta VS 2022, p.58). Within the inscription, a lady referred to as \"Śrī Sāhīlā Nānīsāheba\" is mentioned among the numerous queens of Raṇabahādura, indicating her position as the third queen in the sequence. She is noted to be the daughter of Gaṇeśadatta Bā̃ḍīdvā’s daughter from ‘Gumiñā’, a village near Patna.क्ष्मीदेवीले विसं १८६९ (सन् १८१३) मा शिवलिङ्ग स्थापना गरिसके पश्चात् विसं १८७० (सन् १८१३) कार्तिक शुक्ल एकादशीका दिन चौघरा सतःका खातिर चौतर्फी जग खन्न लगाएको कुरा अभिलेखमा उल्लेख छ (N. Panta VS 2022, p.58) । राजा रणबहादुरकी अनेकन रानीमध्ये उनीलाई यहाँको अभिलेखमा ‘श्री साहिला नानीसाहेब’ भनिएबाट उनको वरीयता क्रम थाहा हुन्छ । उनलाई यहाँ पटनाबाट अलि परको जिल्लाभित्रको कुनै ‘गुमिञा’ नामक गाउँ निवासी  गणेशदत्त बाँडीद्वाकी छोरी भनिएको छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/52ea5b64-e318-48bf-9717-30f4536737ef> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription documents the installation of a Śivaliṅga in 1813 CE (VS 1869), followed by the excavation for the construction of a boundary wall in 1813 CE (VS 1870) during the eleventh fortnight of Kārtika (N. Panta VS 2022, p.58). Within the inscription, a lady referred to as \"Śrī Sāhīlā Nānīsāheba\" is mentioned among the numerous queens of Raṇabahādura, indicating her position as the third queen in the sequence. She is noted to be the daughter of Gaṇeśadatta Bā̃ḍīdvā’s daughter from ‘Gumiñā’, a village near Patna.क्ष्मीदेवीले विसं १८६९ (सन् १८१३) मा शिवलिङ्ग स्थापना गरिसके पश्चात् विसं १८७० (सन् १८१३) कार्तिक शुक्ल एकादशीका दिन चौघरा सतःका खातिर चौतर्फी जग खन्न लगाएको कुरा अभिलेखमा उल्लेख छ (N. Panta VS 2022, p.58) । राजा रणबहादुरकी अनेकन रानीमध्ये उनीलाई यहाँको अभिलेखमा ‘श्री साहिला नानीसाहेब’ भनिएबाट उनको वरीयता क्रम थाहा हुन्छ । उनलाई यहाँ पटनाबाट अलि परको जिल्लाभित्रको कुनै ‘गुमिञा’ नामक गाउँ निवासी  गणेशदत्त बाँडीद्वाकी छोरी भनिएको छ ।"@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
