<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/52ea5b64-e318-48bf-9717-30f4536737ef_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Partial rebuilding of the north and west wings"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 1982 CE (VS 2039-40), renovations were undertaken on the north and west wings of thesataḥ.विसं २०३९-४० (सन् १९८२-८२) तिर सतःको उत्तरी र पश्चिमी खण्डलाई भत्काई पुनर्निर्माण गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/52ea5b64-e318-48bf-9717-30f4536737ef> ;
    rdfs:comment "In 1982 CE (VS 2039-40), renovations were undertaken on the north and west wings of thesataḥ.विसं २०३९-४० (सन् १९८२-८२) तिर सतःको उत्तरी र पश्चिमी खण्डलाई भत्काई पुनर्निर्माण गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
