<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/52ea5b64-e318-48bf-9717-30f4536737ef_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following the devastation caused by the earthquakes of 2015 CE (VS 2072), both the temple and sataḥ were reconstructed simultaneously. The reconstruction work, completed with the support of the Ministry of Urban Development of Nepal, the empowered Bagmati Civilization Integrated Development Committee, and loan assistance from the Asian Development Bank, was inaugurated by the then Minister of Urban Development, Ramkumari Jhakri, on January 23, 2022 CE (VS 2078).विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्पमा मन्दिर र सतः दुबैलाई क्षति पुर्‍याए पश्चात् दुबै संरचना एकैसाथ पुनर्निमाण गरिएको हो । नेपाल सरकार शहरी विकास मन्त्रालय, अधिकार सम्पन्न वागमती सभ्यता एकीकृत विकास समितिद्वारा एशियाली विकास बैंकको ऋण सहयोगमा पुनर्निनिर्माणकार्य सम्पन्न गरी विसं २०७८ पौष आठ गतेका दिन (सन् २०२२ जनवरी २३) तत्कालीन शहरी विकास मन्त्री रामकुमारी झाक्रीबाट यसको समुद्घाटन गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/52ea5b64-e318-48bf-9717-30f4536737ef> ;
    rdfs:comment "Following the devastation caused by the earthquakes of 2015 CE (VS 2072), both the temple and sataḥ were reconstructed simultaneously. The reconstruction work, completed with the support of the Ministry of Urban Development of Nepal, the empowered Bagmati Civilization Integrated Development Committee, and loan assistance from the Asian Development Bank, was inaugurated by the then Minister of Urban Development, Ramkumari Jhakri, on January 23, 2022 CE (VS 2078).विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्पमा मन्दिर र सतः दुबैलाई क्षति पुर्‍याए पश्चात् दुबै संरचना एकैसाथ पुनर्निमाण गरिएको हो । नेपाल सरकार शहरी विकास मन्त्रालय, अधिकार सम्पन्न वागमती सभ्यता एकीकृत विकास समितिद्वारा एशियाली विकास बैंकको ऋण सहयोगमा पुनर्निनिर्माणकार्य सम्पन्न गरी विसं २०७८ पौष आठ गतेका दिन (सन् २०२२ जनवरी २३) तत्कालीन शहरी विकास मन्त्री रामकुमारी झाक्रीबाट यसको समुद्घाटन गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
