    rdfs:label "Presenting a toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As mentioned above in the 'description, Queen Satajīva offered the wooden toraṇa (placed atop the sanctum door) depicting Nāmasaṅgīti in memory of her husband King Dhaṃta to replace the old dilapidated one."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5332f623-a0dd-4f84-a78c-f540cb0723c6> ;
