<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/54612871-717c-41e1-9a91-cf77d1267bad_10> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Padmakumārī, daughter of Narabhūpāla and sister of Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa, commissioned the construction of aphalcāwithin the Caṇḍeśvarī pīṭha precinct. That the sister of Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa created a work at this location is noteworthy. It is likely that her marital home was in or around Tokha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/54612871-717c-41e1-9a91-cf77d1267bad> ;
    rdfs:comment "Padmakumārī, daughter of Narabhūpāla and sister of Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa, commissioned the construction of aphalcāwithin the Caṇḍeśvarī pīṭha precinct. That the sister of Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa created a work at this location is noteworthy. It is likely that her marital home was in or around Tokha."@en ;
