<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/54612871-717c-41e1-9a91-cf77d1267bad_11> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of a  phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The wife of Bhairavasiṃha, a resident of Pukhūlāchi, Tokha, reconstructed a phalcā within the Caṇḍeśvarī pīṭha precinct that had fallen into a dilapidated state. For its long-term maintenance, aguṭhīwas also established, and annual ritual obligations were prescribed through an inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/54612871-717c-41e1-9a91-cf77d1267bad> ;
    rdfs:comment "The wife of Bhairavasiṃha, a resident of Pukhūlāchi, Tokha, reconstructed a phalcā within the Caṇḍeśvarī pīṭha precinct that had fallen into a dilapidated state. For its long-term maintenance, aguṭhīwas also established, and annual ritual obligations were prescribed through an inscription."@en ;
