        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of a pedestal"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Maniṣarāj Jośī placed a stone seat bearing his name at the feet of the aniconic stone worshipped as Caṇḍeśvarī. Although no date is mentioned, the donor Maniṣarāj is the same individual who offered the metaltoraṇaand flags here in VS 2078 (2022 CE)."@en ;
