<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/54612871-717c-41e1-9a91-cf77d1267bad_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of jewelry"@en ;
    dcterms:description "To please Caṇḍeśvara Mahādeva and Caṇḍeśvarī, one crown, onepira(?), and onepatāsiwere offered. This act of donation was carried out by Viśva Bhāro of Tokha during the reign of Nṛpendra Malla."@en ;
