        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of lion statues"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of Bhūpālendra Malla, a pair of stone lion statues was installed at the front of thepīṭha. Among the donors’ names, Sivakinha (Śivakṛṣṇa) and his wife Si_śvarimayi (Siddheśvarī?) can be read."@en ;
