<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5486b15f-7b52-40db-8996-3110eebd8b37_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Kumārī and Vighneśvara (Gaṇeśa)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mahān (soldier) Bilhāma Bhāro, along with his sons Siddhirāma and Praśurāma (Parśurām), daughter Sarasuti (Sarasvatī), and grandson Kṛṣṇarāma, performed a sacrifice (yajña) and established the deities Kumārī (Bālakumārī) and Vighneśvara (Gaṇeśa)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5486b15f-7b52-40db-8996-3110eebd8b37> ;
    rdfs:comment "Mahān (soldier) Bilhāma Bhāro, along with his sons Siddhirāma and Praśurāma (Parśurām), daughter Sarasuti (Sarasvatī), and grandson Kṛṣṇarāma, performed a sacrifice (yajña) and established the deities Kumārī (Bālakumārī) and Vighneśvara (Gaṇeśa)."@en ;
