<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5486b15f-7b52-40db-8996-3110eebd8b37_7> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The bell installed by Puṇyarāja Śreṣṭha in 1897 CE (NS 1953) later became damaged. The damaged bell was repaired and reinstalled by Buddhimāyā Tāmrakāra’s sons, Ratnalāla Tāmrakāra and Kīrtilāla Tāmrakāra. Buddhimāyā Tāmrakāra had the bell repaired in memory of her late husband, Miṭhāi Tāmrakāra."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5486b15f-7b52-40db-8996-3110eebd8b37> ;
    rdfs:comment "The bell installed by Puṇyarāja Śreṣṭha in 1897 CE (NS 1953) later became damaged. The damaged bell was repaired and reinstalled by Buddhimāyā Tāmrakāra’s sons, Ratnalāla Tāmrakāra and Kīrtilāla Tāmrakāra. Buddhimāyā Tāmrakāra had the bell repaired in memory of her late husband, Miṭhāi Tāmrakāra."@en ;
