<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/54870192-65d3-4156-b188-938b6d3770be_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Narmadādevī and her sons Gumānsiṃ, Māthavarasiṃ, and Ghavojamānasiṃ built the Phalcā near their residence as per the wish of her husband Pratimāna Khatrī (text: Ṣatri), who passed away before fulfilling his wish. They also built ajaḥdhuṃtank and a well to supply water to the tank at the premises. An inscription at the Phalcā recording the event also instructs a person named Suratha Daṅgola from Theco to observe the anniversary of thephalcāout of the income from the land endowment made by the Khatrī family."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/54870192-65d3-4156-b188-938b6d3770be> ;
    rdfs:comment "Narmadādevī and her sons Gumānsiṃ, Māthavarasiṃ, and Ghavojamānasiṃ built the Phalcā near their residence as per the wish of her husband Pratimāna Khatrī (text: Ṣatri), who passed away before fulfilling his wish. They also built ajaḥdhuṃtank and a well to supply water to the tank at the premises. An inscription at the Phalcā recording the event also instructs a person named Suratha Daṅgola from Theco to observe the anniversary of thephalcāout of the income from the land endowment made by the Khatrī family."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
