<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/54870192-65d3-4156-b188-938b6d3770be_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The private trust (guthi) run by the descendants of Pratimāna Khatrī reconstructed the Phalcā. Initially, the three-bayrest house used to stand by fields and a small street. However, when the trust reconstructed it, it was shifted a few meters to the west."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/54870192-65d3-4156-b188-938b6d3770be> ;
    rdfs:comment "The private trust (guthi) run by the descendants of Pratimāna Khatrī reconstructed the Phalcā. Initially, the three-bayrest house used to stand by fields and a small street. However, when the trust reconstructed it, it was shifted a few meters to the west."@en ;
