        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a śivaliṅga (SKH0020-003), a hiti and a phalcā."@en ;
    dcterms:description "A certain individual named Jayanārāyaṇa (text: Jayanārāyana) funded the construction of aśivaliṅgaalong with aphalcāand ahiti. Thephalcāmentioned in the inscription has since vanished, the other two structures remain intact."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/54903008-fc04-46aa-92ac-9b991108224b> ;
