        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Ratna Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A group of eight individuals, led by Raṇhuju, established thecaityaat Kvātha Nani (Kvāḥ Nani). The group included Devasiṃ, Devajoti, Cintāmuni, and Manahorī, who were associated with the Diguri Sivā (a religious trust related to the lineage deity). It was decreed that no one should litter or damage thenaniwhere thecaityastood."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/54b62ce2-a7ef-4d39-aba5-70e9fe731ec6> ;
    rdfs:comment "A group of eight individuals, led by Raṇhuju, established thecaityaat Kvātha Nani (Kvāḥ Nani). The group included Devasiṃ, Devajoti, Cintāmuni, and Manahorī, who were associated with the Diguri Sivā (a religious trust related to the lineage deity). It was decreed that no one should litter or damage thenaniwhere thecaityastood."@en ;
