    rdfs:label "Establishment of three caityas"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Herā, Juju, Puṣpa, Caitya, and Nīlakumārī established threecaityas (BDG0050-003, BDG0050-004, BDG0050-005) surrounding the Ratna Caitya, symbolizing the Buddha, Dharma, and Saṃgha, the Buddhist trinity, respectively."@en ;
