<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/55133c56-e68d-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the phalcā and donation of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the inscription, thephalcāwas built by a couple from Kutu Bāhāḥ in the name of their late son and is dedicated to Śrīnārāyaṇa. Locals say that the statue said to have been installed at the time of construction has since been lost. Threeropaniand 3yavaland of Pākubuṃ, 3ropanis of land of Tasiṃ Dhuṣacābuṃ and 7 karṣa of land of Dholosikvaṃ are offered.The inscription prescribes that the Bhāro (noble) brothers must offer burning wick lamps to the deity of thephalcāduring the entire month of Vaiśākha, including during the festival of the Rato (Red) Matsyendranātha. Moreover,japa(mantra)andpāṭha(sacred texts) shall be recited at this time. A lamp shall be offered for the whole month of Kārtika. Nowadays, these rituals are no longer performed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/55133c56-e68d-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "According to the inscription, thephalcāwas built by a couple from Kutu Bāhāḥ in the name of their late son and is dedicated to Śrīnārāyaṇa. Locals say that the statue said to have been installed at the time of construction has since been lost. Threeropaniand 3yavaland of Pākubuṃ, 3ropanis of land of Tasiṃ Dhuṣacābuṃ and 7 karṣa of land of Dholosikvaṃ are offered.The inscription prescribes that the Bhāro (noble) brothers must offer burning wick lamps to the deity of thephalcāduring the entire month of Vaiśākha, including during the festival of the Rato (Red) Matsyendranātha. Moreover,japa(mantra)andpāṭha(sacred texts) shall be recited at this time. A lamp shall be offered for the whole month of Kārtika. Nowadays, these rituals are no longer performed."@en ;
