        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of Śrīnivāsa Malla, the Caitya was renovated by Jayamaṅgala, Vijayadeva, Jideva and others. Thetrayodaśabhuvana(13 circular shaped portion on top) was replaced. The main priest (purohita) was Śiromuni of Nyākhācoka and the collaborator (as anupādhyāya) was Rachemana."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/553b9314-e687-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
