<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/557a604c-e6a7-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_7> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of Bhīmasena statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The earthquake of 2015 caused a crack to appear on the back of the Bhīmasena statue. The statue began to be refurbished in VS 2075, Āśvina 6. Artist Rajkumar Maharjan performed a worship at the Mhepi temple of Kathmandu and brought soil from the temple to repair this statue. The work ended with a special worship on VS 2075, Phālguna 1-3."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/557a604c-e6a7-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The earthquake of 2015 caused a crack to appear on the back of the Bhīmasena statue. The statue began to be refurbished in VS 2075, Āśvina 6. Artist Rajkumar Maharjan performed a worship at the Mhepi temple of Kathmandu and brought soil from the temple to repair this statue. The work ended with a special worship on VS 2075, Phālguna 1-3."@en ;
