    rdfs:label "Replacing brick steps with stone ones"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bisanārā of the Māhābo Ṭola in Pāṅgā, along with his wife Cidhi and sons Kṛsanbahādura, Jitabahādura, and Lokabahādura, replaced the brick steps leading to the first floor of thedyaḥchẽwith stone steps during the reign of the Rāṇā Prime Minister Candra Śamśera."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/56b69e9c-789f-44ba-8171-7357c8ecbc3c> ;
