<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/56bfc1ff-204d-452c-8c3c-fda34dadc1e1_3> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Destruction of the inscription"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An unfortunate incident occurred when a mentally unstable woman dislodged the inscription that recorded the temple's construction from its original position, causing it to shatter into pieces. In response, the Hanumandhoka Palace Supervision Office promptly collected all the fragmented pieces of the inscription to ensure their safety. Although the broken pieces have been preserved, the restoration of the inscription within the temple is still pending."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/56bfc1ff-204d-452c-8c3c-fda34dadc1e1> ;
    rdfs:comment "An unfortunate incident occurred when a mentally unstable woman dislodged the inscription that recorded the temple's construction from its original position, causing it to shatter into pieces. In response, the Hanumandhoka Palace Supervision Office promptly collected all the fragmented pieces of the inscription to ensure their safety. Although the broken pieces have been preserved, the restoration of the inscription within the temple is still pending."@en ;
