<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "The earliest mention of the Chinnamastā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A treaty was concluded among the sons of King Yakṣa Malla—Ratna Malla, Raṇa Malla, Ari Malla, and Jayabhīma Malla—pledging to live in harmony without internal conflict, and this agreement was recorded on a gold plate. In this inscription, Chinnamastā was listed as a witness alongside Cāṅgunārāyaṇa, and she is referred to as “Yetā Bhaṭṭārikā.”राजा यक्ष मल्लका छोराहरू रत्न मल्ल, रण मल्ल, अरि मल्ल र जयभीम मल्लबीच एकआपसमा झैझगडा नगरी मिलेर बस्ने भनी सन्धि गरी सुवर्णपत्र लेखेर राखिएको थियो । उक्त अभिलेखमा साक्षीको रूपमा चाँगुनारायणसँगै छिन्नमस्तालाई पनि राखिएको थियो । अभिलेखमा छिन्नमस्तालाई 'येता भट्टारिका' भनिएको छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024> ;
    rdfs:comment "A treaty was concluded among the sons of King Yakṣa Malla—Ratna Malla, Raṇa Malla, Ari Malla, and Jayabhīma Malla—pledging to live in harmony without internal conflict, and this agreement was recorded on a gold plate. In this inscription, Chinnamastā was listed as a witness alongside Cāṅgunārāyaṇa, and she is referred to as “Yetā Bhaṭṭārikā.”राजा यक्ष मल्लका छोराहरू रत्न मल्ल, रण मल्ल, अरि मल्ल र जयभीम मल्लबीच एकआपसमा झैझगडा नगरी मिलेर बस्ने भनी सन्धि गरी सुवर्णपत्र लेखेर राखिएको थियो । उक्त अभिलेखमा साक्षीको रूपमा चाँगुनारायणसँगै छिन्नमस्तालाई पनि राखिएको थियो । अभिलेखमा छिन्नमस्तालाई 'येता भट्टारिका' भनिएको छ ।"@en ;
