        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of wooden toraṇa behind the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Khvāramānasiṃha Bhāju, Giridhala Bhāju, together with the temple priest Gaṅgārāma Bhāro, jointly installed a woodentoraṇaabove the door on the rear side of the temple.ख्वारमानसिंह भाजु, गिरिधल भाजु लगायत मन्दिरका पुजारी गंगाराम भारोले मिलेर मन्दिरको पछाडिपट्टि रहेको ढोकामाथि काष्ठतोरण चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024> ;
    rdfs:comment "Khvāramānasiṃha Bhāju, Giridhala Bhāju, together with the temple priest Gaṅgārāma Bhāro, jointly installed a woodentoraṇaabove the door on the rear side of the temple.ख्वारमानसिंह भाजु, गिरिधल भाजु लगायत मन्दिरका पुजारी गंगाराम भारोले मिलेर मन्दिरको पछाडिपट्टि रहेको ढोकामाथि काष्ठतोरण चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
