<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024_10> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Decorating the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kīrtibahādura Amātya, together with his wife Jogamāyādevī, undertook the decoration of the Chinnamastā Temple. The inscription does not specify the particular works carried out for this decoration.कीर्तिबहादुर अमात्यले श्रीमती जोगमायादेवीसँग मिलेर छिन्नमस्ता मन्दिरलाई सजाइदिएका थिए । मन्दिर सजाउनको लागि उनीहरूले के के काम गरेका थिए भन्ने कुरा अभिलेखमा खुलाइएको छैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kīrtibahādura Amātya, together with his wife Jogamāyādevī, undertook the decoration of the Chinnamastā Temple. The inscription does not specify the particular works carried out for this decoration.कीर्तिबहादुर अमात्यले श्रीमती जोगमायादेवीसँग मिलेर छिन्नमस्ता मन्दिरलाई सजाइदिएका थिए । मन्दिर सजाउनको लागि उनीहरूले के के काम गरेका थिए भन्ने कुरा अभिलेखमा खुलाइएको छैन ।"@en ;
