<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024_13> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Covering the walls with brass plates"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Rameśacandra Vaidya of Mahābauddha, Kathmandu, together with his wife Rośanī Vaidya and other family members, lined the interior wall of the sanctum with brass plates.काठमाडौं महाबौद्ध निवासी रमेशचन्द्र वैद्य, उनकी श्रीमती रोशनी वैद्य लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूले मिलेर मन्दिरको गर्भगृहभित्र भित्तामा पित्तलको पाताले मोडिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024> ;
    rdfs:comment "Rameśacandra Vaidya of Mahābauddha, Kathmandu, together with his wife Rośanī Vaidya and other family members, lined the interior wall of the sanctum with brass plates.काठमाडौं महाबौद्ध निवासी रमेशचन्द्र वैद्य, उनकी श्रीमती रोशनी वैद्य लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूले मिलेर मन्दिरको गर्भगृहभित्र भित्तामा पित्तलको पाताले मोडिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
