<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of bhagiṃ and flag"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Girvāṇayuddha, Hanumantasiṃha Amātya, Bhājudhana, Sadāśiva, and Lakṣmīnṛsiṃha jointly installedbhagiṃand flags (dhvajā) on the roof of the Chinnamastā Temple.राजा गीर्वाणयुद्धको शासनकालमा हनुमन्तसिंह अमात्य, भाजुधन, सदाशिव र लक्ष्मीनृसिंह गरी चारजनाले मिलेर छिन्नमस्ता मन्दिरको छानामा भगिं र ध्वजा चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the reign of King Girvāṇayuddha, Hanumantasiṃha Amātya, Bhājudhana, Sadāśiva, and Lakṣmīnṛsiṃha jointly installedbhagiṃand flags (dhvajā) on the roof of the Chinnamastā Temple.राजा गीर्वाणयुद्धको शासनकालमा हनुमन्तसिंह अमात्य, भाजुधन, सदाशिव र लक्ष्मीनृसिंह गरी चारजनाले मिलेर छिन्नमस्ता मन्दिरको छानामा भगिं र ध्वजा चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
