<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of ilāṃ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Nīlasundara Amātya of Daubahā Tole, Lalitpur, son of Mānakumārī and Kṛṣṇagovinda, together with his grandson Jitahari, installed a metalilāṃwithin the sanctum of the temple.मानकुमारी र कृष्णगोविन्दका छोरा ललितपुर, दौबाहाः टोल निवासी नीलसुन्दर अमात्यले नाति जितहरिसँग मिलेर मन्दिरको गर्भगृहभित्र धातुको इलां चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024> ;
    rdfs:comment "Nīlasundara Amātya of Daubahā Tole, Lalitpur, son of Mānakumārī and Kṛṣṇagovinda, together with his grandson Jitahari, installed a metalilāṃwithin the sanctum of the temple.मानकुमारी र कृष्णगोविन्दका छोरा ललितपुर, दौबाहाः टोल निवासी नीलसुन्दर अमात्यले नाति जितहरिसँग मिलेर मन्दिरको गर्भगृहभित्र धातुको इलां चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
