<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell (CAN0030-015)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mānakumārī of Daubahā Tole, Lalitpur, offered a bell (ghaṇṭa) to her personal chosen deity (sveṣṭadevatā), Chinnamastā. In this act, she was assisted by her sons, Jitagovinda Amātya and Harigovinda Amātya.ललितपुर दौबाहाः टोल निवासी मानकुमारीले आफ्नो स्वेष्टदेवता छिन्नमस्तालाई घण्टा चढाएकी थिइन् । त्यस काममा उनलाई छोराहरू जितगोविन्द अमात्य, हरिगोविन्द अमात्यले सहयोग गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790676a-4be7-439e-9904-f6521699b024> ;
    rdfs:comment "Mānakumārī of Daubahā Tole, Lalitpur, offered a bell (ghaṇṭa) to her personal chosen deity (sveṣṭadevatā), Chinnamastā. In this act, she was assisted by her sons, Jitagovinda Amātya and Harigovinda Amātya.ललितपुर दौबाहाः टोल निवासी मानकुमारीले आफ्नो स्वेष्टदेवता छिन्नमस्तालाई घण्टा चढाएकी थिइन् । त्यस काममा उनलाई छोराहरू जितगोविन्द अमात्य, हरिगोविन्द अमात्यले सहयोग गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
