    rdfs:label "Installation of a Pair of Elephant Statues"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple can be accessed through a long flight of stone steps flanked by two stone elephants installed in 1662 CE. They are about five-feet tall including the remains of the broken riding figures on top of them."@en ;
