<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5790999f-7d84-4dc0-b4a9-a65dee5d1481_14> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial Construction, Land Grant, and Establishment of a Guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple was constructed by Viśvanātha Bābu from Tumbāhāḥ, Patan. He also endowed some land to maintain the temple as well as established aguṭhīto perform its annual rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5790999f-7d84-4dc0-b4a9-a65dee5d1481> ;
    rdfs:comment "The temple was constructed by Viśvanātha Bābu from Tumbāhāḥ, Patan. He also endowed some land to maintain the temple as well as established aguṭhīto perform its annual rituals."@en ;
