    rdfs:label "Offering of toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Above thispīṭha, a stonetoraṇafeaturingChepuhas been installed. According to the inscription located on the northern side of thetoraṇa, it is understood that thistoraṇawas offered to Goddess Bālakumārī by an individual named Kājimāna."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/57a467a3-03bc-4f00-9023-5f839dffc4bf> ;
