<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/57a467a3-03bc-4f00-9023-5f839dffc4bf_4> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is located on the northern side of thetoraṇa. The inscription bears the names “Naswalām Nānīmāyā.” Naswalām (Naswarām) and Nānīmāyā are presumed to be the donors who installed thistoraṇa. Beneath the inscription, a carved figure of a couple innamaskāra mudrācan also be observed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/57a467a3-03bc-4f00-9023-5f839dffc4bf> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription is located on the northern side of thetoraṇa. The inscription bears the names “Naswalām Nānīmāyā.” Naswalām (Naswarām) and Nānīmāyā are presumed to be the donors who installed thistoraṇa. Beneath the inscription, a carved figure of a couple innamaskāra mudrācan also be observed."@en ;
