    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/57c22b4c-559d-43bf-b9c6-417f669f4127> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/57c22b4c-559d-43bf-b9c6-417f669f4127_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following the damage sustained by Jitāpura Gaṃcā during the 2015 CE earthquake, the structure was reconstructed in its original form. The reconstruction was funded by Chinīmayā Maharjan, a native of Khokanā who later settled in Dallu, Kathmandu. She donated NPR 700,000 in memory of her late husband, Aṣṭanārāyaṇa Maharjan, and her deceased parents, with the wish that their souls may find rest in the heavenly realm."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/57c22b4c-559d-43bf-b9c6-417f669f4127> ;
    rdfs:comment "Following the damage sustained by Jitāpura Gaṃcā during the 2015 CE earthquake, the structure was reconstructed in its original form. The reconstruction was funded by Chinīmayā Maharjan, a native of Khokanā who later settled in Dallu, Kathmandu. She donated NPR 700,000 in memory of her late husband, Aṣṭanārāyaṇa Maharjan, and her deceased parents, with the wish that their souls may find rest in the heavenly realm."@en ;
