    rdfs:label "Construction of Lālabaiṭhaka"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 1855 Dhīr Śaṃśer Rana had the central Malla-era palace dismantled and replaced with Lālabaiṭhaka, the Bhaktapur governor's reception building.The newly constructed Lālabaiṭhaka is documented in a watercolour by Henry Ambrose Oldfield, dated 1858."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/58201fa0-0b37-4744-af03-0c6aaac21835> ;
