<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/59d6dc2c-0301-4423-8255-82e93892922b_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The 2015 CE earthquakes left the temple in poor condition although it did not collapse. Later in 2018 CE (VS 2076), the Department of Archaeology and the Sanātana Iṣṭadevatā Guṭhī (Maru Jośī), a social trust of the locals, collaborated on the renovation of the temple. Some of the stolen statues of other deities placed inside the niches in the sanctum were also replaced with new ones in the course of the renovation."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/59d6dc2c-0301-4423-8255-82e93892922b> ;
    rdfs:comment "The 2015 CE earthquakes left the temple in poor condition although it did not collapse. Later in 2018 CE (VS 2076), the Department of Archaeology and the Sanātana Iṣṭadevatā Guṭhī (Maru Jośī), a social trust of the locals, collaborated on the renovation of the temple. Some of the stolen statues of other deities placed inside the niches in the sanctum were also replaced with new ones in the course of the renovation."@en ;
