    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Girvāṇayuddha Śāha, lands were endowed to provide a regular income for conducting the deity’s rituals. The endowment was made in the name of the king’s mother."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5a5dd034-c2c9-494a-ba90-c99c59fdd41e> ;
