<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5a5dd034-c2c9-494a-ba90-c99c59fdd41e_5> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Visiting of Candraśamaśera"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A wooden embossed inscription, now in the collection of a local resident, praises the then Prime Minister Candra Śamśera. It is believed that the inscription was installed on the occasion of his visit to the Indrāyaṇī Shrine. During the later reconstruction period, the inscription was collected and preserved by a nearby resident."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5a5dd034-c2c9-494a-ba90-c99c59fdd41e> ;
    rdfs:comment "A wooden embossed inscription, now in the collection of a local resident, praises the then Prime Minister Candra Śamśera. It is believed that the inscription was installed on the occasion of his visit to the Indrāyaṇī Shrine. During the later reconstruction period, the inscription was collected and preserved by a nearby resident."@en ;
