    rdfs:label "Addition of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Under the leadership of Śiva Khatrī, a bell weighing over 28 kilograms was installed in front of the Indrāyaṇī shrine. The names of all contributors and the details of the collected funds for this undertaking are recorded in the inscription."@en ;
