        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Duimāju"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Purandarasiṃha established the Duimāju Shrine at the Bhaṇḍārakhāla garden of the palace in memory of his deceased daughter-in-law Lalitalakṣmī. He also endowed land to form aguthifor the deity’s worship.​​"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5aa92f9a-d874-4b89-89b8-adf291c884c8> ;
    rdfs:comment "King Purandarasiṃha established the Duimāju Shrine at the Bhaṇḍārakhāla garden of the palace in memory of his deceased daughter-in-law Lalitalakṣmī. He also endowed land to form aguthifor the deity’s worship.​​"@en ;
