        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the Duimāju Shrine?"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Chronicles mention that King Śrīnivāsa Malla established the Duimāju Shrine at the Bhaṇḍārakhāla garden. As the Shrine was already established by Purandarasiṃha in 1588 CE, King Śrīnivāsa may have renovated it."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5aa92f9a-d874-4b89-89b8-adf291c884c8> ;
