        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Yoganarendra Malla, his courtier Cikuti Bhāro constructed the Phalcā to enshrine Duimāju and endowed land to form aguthifor the deity. It probably was an open shrine up until then."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5aa92f9a-d874-4b89-89b8-adf291c884c8> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the reign of King Yoganarendra Malla, his courtier Cikuti Bhāro constructed the Phalcā to enshrine Duimāju and endowed land to form aguthifor the deity. It probably was an open shrine up until then."@en ;
