<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5aa92f9a-d874-4b89-89b8-adf291c884c8_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a shrine for Duimāju"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The details of this event are unclear from the inscription. It mentions the construction of a shrine for Duimāju and the installation of the finial. Also, some plots of land were endowed to form aguthito carry out sacrifices of ducks every year. Probably, the stone shrine inside the Phalcā was constructed on the occasion. The name of the donor is not mentioned but the event took place during the reign of King Yogaprakāśa Malla."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5aa92f9a-d874-4b89-89b8-adf291c884c8> ;
    rdfs:comment "The details of this event are unclear from the inscription. It mentions the construction of a shrine for Duimāju and the installation of the finial. Also, some plots of land were endowed to form aguthito carry out sacrifices of ducks every year. Probably, the stone shrine inside the Phalcā was constructed on the occasion. The name of the donor is not mentioned but the event took place during the reign of King Yogaprakāśa Malla."@en ;
