<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5ae13e80-3dfb-4e94-8dbf-a11eb36a9aa3_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Management of guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Gīrvāṇayuddha introduced a new system for the operation of the trust formed for the worship of Gopāleśvara, Śeṣanārāyaṇa, Tilavikrameśvara, Aghoreśvara, Nandikeśvara, Siddhigaṇeśa, and Dakṣiṇakālī. The new system was enforced after the 128ropanīs of land parcels endowed for the trust were misappropriated. He also renovated thejalaharībase of the Gopāleśvara Śivaliṅga."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5ae13e80-3dfb-4e94-8dbf-a11eb36a9aa3> ;
    rdfs:comment "King Gīrvāṇayuddha introduced a new system for the operation of the trust formed for the worship of Gopāleśvara, Śeṣanārāyaṇa, Tilavikrameśvara, Aghoreśvara, Nandikeśvara, Siddhigaṇeśa, and Dakṣiṇakālī. The new system was enforced after the 128ropanīs of land parcels endowed for the trust were misappropriated. He also renovated thejalaharībase of the Gopāleśvara Śivaliṅga."@en ;
