    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple was rebuilt following the 2015 earthquakes, restoring its original tiered design instead of the domed style used in a previous reconstruction. The Department of Archaeology undertook the reconstruction at a cost of approximately NRs. 37.5 million."@en ;
