    rdfs:label "Offering of a Nandī (PRN0020-008)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A brass bull figure of Nandī, Śiva’s animal mount, was established at the temple in memory of the donor’s deceased father Rāmanātha Aryāla and his daughter Mañju Aryāla. The name of the donor is not mentioned in the inscription."@en ;
