    rdfs:label "Consecration of a Vāṇaliṅga by Siddhimāna Before the Constraction of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa Mandira"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Subbā Siddhinārāyaṇa (Rājabhaṇḍārī), along with his wife Lānidhanalakṣmī, and sons Siddhimāna, Ratnamāna, Meharamāna, Baṣatamāna (Bakhatamāna), Kāśīnātha, and other family members, consecrated the Vāṇaliṅga on the bank of the River Bagmati."@en ;
