        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Siddhimāna Rājabhaṇḍārī constructed Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa Temple and endowed some plots of land to sustain the daily worship. Siddhimukteśvara Mandira (KAT2637) and Dhaneśvara Mandira (KAT2638) were also constructed by him."@en ;
