        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Vajrācārya Dhana Bande, Gopisiṃ Bhāro, Jayarāma Bhāro, and others collectively renovated thebāḥāḥ, paving its courtyard with bricks and offering atoraṇato the main deity. After the renovation, Vajrācāryas from Pasu Bāḥāḥ (BKT0220) performed the consecration rituals according to tradition."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5be8db97-ae0a-4ac5-b624-db872d25549a> ;
