    dcterms:description "Thepañcāvaliyuktacaityaat the premises was established by Helamati, Indralakṣmī, Bhājamāsiṃ, and Jyotamāyā. As the inscription is undated, it is unclear when thecaityawas established. However, the first structure of this type came into being only in 1831 CE."@en ;
