<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5bfb6d40-eb4c-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Sanday(1994, 43) andGutschow(2011, 533) mention that the temple was built in 1792 by a merchant named Bhavman Singh Pradhan of Makhan Ṭol, but neither of them has revealed his sources. A stone inscription to the right of the sanctum's entrance is covered by thick layers of ghee and oil and cannot be deciphered. According to the priest, the inscription contains information related to the original construction of the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5bfb6d40-eb4c-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Sanday(1994, 43) andGutschow(2011, 533) mention that the temple was built in 1792 by a merchant named Bhavman Singh Pradhan of Makhan Ṭol, but neither of them has revealed his sources. A stone inscription to the right of the sanctum's entrance is covered by thick layers of ghee and oil and cannot be deciphered. According to the priest, the inscription contains information related to the original construction of the temple."@en ;
