<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5c063668-e5f6-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Police station in the Pāṭī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the 1980s CE, the upper floor of the monument was used as a police station. Afterwards, the Pāṭī became known as \"Thanāpāṭī\" (police-station pāṭī)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5c063668-e5f6-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "In the 1980s CE, the upper floor of the monument was used as a police station. Afterwards, the Pāṭī became known as \"Thanāpāṭī\" (police-station pāṭī)."@en ;
