<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5cb98dcd-6658-4b9c-8990-8c2299397aca_13> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of a Pinnacle and Land Endowment"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Īśvaradāsa Bhāro performed thesahasrāhutifire sacrifice and added a pinnacle to the temple. King Yoganarendra Malla also participated in this event. Iśvaramāna also endowed some plots of land to theguṭhī. It was regulated that theguṭhīincome is used to organise a sacrifice to be conducted by the priests, Jośīs and Karmācāryas, on every fifth lunar day of the bright fortnight of Jeṭha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5cb98dcd-6658-4b9c-8990-8c2299397aca> ;
    rdfs:comment "Īśvaradāsa Bhāro performed thesahasrāhutifire sacrifice and added a pinnacle to the temple. King Yoganarendra Malla also participated in this event. Iśvaramāna also endowed some plots of land to theguṭhī. It was regulated that theguṭhīincome is used to organise a sacrifice to be conducted by the priests, Jośīs and Karmācāryas, on every fifth lunar day of the bright fortnight of Jeṭha."@en ;
