<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5d44f5b8-70f8-11ea-966a-0242ac130006_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Brick paving"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is engraved on a brick located on the southwest edge of the Hiti. Although the inscription does not record an event, it can be assumed that it was intended to record the the hiti's paving with brick. The inscription doesn't record the name of a donor or craftsmen who might have carrfed out the work, however, it does state that Amātya Siddhirāma prepared the inscription with Harirāma, Nandurāma and Rāmeśvara Bhāro as witnesses."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5d44f5b8-70f8-11ea-966a-0242ac130006> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription is engraved on a brick located on the southwest edge of the Hiti. Although the inscription does not record an event, it can be assumed that it was intended to record the the hiti's paving with brick. The inscription doesn't record the name of a donor or craftsmen who might have carrfed out the work, however, it does state that Amātya Siddhirāma prepared the inscription with Harirāma, Nandurāma and Rāmeśvara Bhāro as witnesses."@en ;
