<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5d70f51b-e81b-4d56-b110-2a07aea60bf5_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of road"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Tilakaram Kārkī, a resident of Cobhāra, along with his family, paved and improved the road from the bank of the Balkhu river to the banks of the Viṣṇumati river.चोभार निवासी श्री तिलकराम कार्की र सन्तानहरू मिली बल्खु नदीको पारी किनारादेखि विष्णुमति तीरसम्मको बाटो छापी राम्रो बनाएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5d70f51b-e81b-4d56-b110-2a07aea60bf5> ;
    rdfs:comment "Tilakaram Kārkī, a resident of Cobhāra, along with his family, paved and improved the road from the bank of the Balkhu river to the banks of the Viṣṇumati river.चोभार निवासी श्री तिलकराम कार्की र सन्तानहरू मिली बल्खु नदीको पारी किनारादेखि विष्णुमति तीरसम्मको बाटो छापी राम्रो बनाएको थियो ।"@en ;
