    rdfs:label "Road construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Subedāra Gajesī Kārkī from Cobhāra had built a road from the confluence of the Sundarīghāṭa stream to the confluence of the Balkhu river.चोबार बास्ने सुवेदार गजे कार्कीले सुन्दरीघाट खोल्सी दोभान देखि बल्खु दोभान खोल्सीसम्म बाटो बनाएको थियो ।"@en ;
