<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5d9e8143-340e-4846-a7a9-4f95bfc10421_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering a toraṇa to Gaṇeśa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A group of locals pleased Thankot’s local administration chief of, Kāśīrāja Bhāro, and Cikati Bhāro to adorn the Gaṇeśa shrine with atoraṇa. The work was coordinated by Jevanasiṃ Bhābo, while Bisiṃ Bhābo, Biśvasiṃ Bhābo, and Bhāgisiṃ Bhābo took care of the arrangements."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5d9e8143-340e-4846-a7a9-4f95bfc10421> ;
