        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Lakṣmīmai from the Dattarāche Ṭola built aphalcāin the name of Śiva. She further initiated a tradition of lighting butter lamps at thephalcāonŚivarātrīand distributesamaybajito locals. While the phalcā no longer exists at the site, locals say that it used to stand northeast of the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5d9e8143-340e-4846-a7a9-4f95bfc10421> ;
