    rdfs:label "Installation of four-armed Śiva (PPK0210-002)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The statue of four-armed Śiva (PPK0210-002) was established during the reign of King Pratāpa Malla. Due to the erosion of the text of the inscription, the name of the donor cannot be ascertained. However, his wife's name can be read as Kāmeśvarī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5db43fa7-5ae4-464b-85d8-5c9d6ed437c1> ;
