        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the śivālaya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Prime Minister Vīra Śamśera constructed the temple as his effort to showcase his effectiveness in governance following a tumultuous change in leadership. Vīra Śamśera assumed power by assassinating the incumbent Prime Minister Raṇa Uddīpa Siṃha, who also happened to be his uncle."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5db7c3ad-77d5-4503-a1a2-1eabdd4c7e42> ;
