        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "By the year VS 2030 (1973 CE), the Bāhāḥ had become obsolete. During the reign of King Birendra, in VS 2037 (1980 CE), under the leadership of Bhikṣu Mañjuśasana, the work of demolition of Bāhāḥ was started. Reconstruction work was completed three years later, with donations from various individuals and the labor of the locals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5e9af02d-96f4-42a8-8c91-57d31cd5027b> ;
