<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5f218d0a-4412-11ea-a19a-0242ac130006_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Rudradevī Ṭhakurānī, a daughter of Śrīnivāsa Malla, renovated a Maṇḍapa of Bungmati with the help of her son Rudrendra Malla. The roof of one of the Bhairava temple of Bungmati was paved withteliyābricks. There are two Bhairava temples in Bungmati, Lindekunde Bhairava and Hayagrīva Bhairava. The inscription does not specify which temple was renovated."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5f218d0a-4412-11ea-a19a-0242ac130006> ;
    rdfs:comment "Rudradevī Ṭhakurānī, a daughter of Śrīnivāsa Malla, renovated a Maṇḍapa of Bungmati with the help of her son Rudrendra Malla. The roof of one of the Bhairava temple of Bungmati was paved withteliyābricks. There are two Bhairava temples in Bungmati, Lindekunde Bhairava and Hayagrīva Bhairava. The inscription does not specify which temple was renovated."@en ;
