<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5f218d0a-4412-11ea-a19a-0242ac130006_7> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of pura"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the roof was damaged, the government allowed locals to cut wood in the forest of Kaṭuvāla Daha to use for its restoration. The following year, the roof was restored by thepānejugroup of Bungmati among others (Munirāja, Dhanapati, Siṃhamuni, Buddhi Gubhāḥju, Lekhanadāsa Harṣa, Viṣadhaṃ). 21dhārnīsilver and 41dhārnīcopper was added to various parts of the temple during its reconstruction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5f218d0a-4412-11ea-a19a-0242ac130006> ;
    rdfs:comment "After the roof was damaged, the government allowed locals to cut wood in the forest of Kaṭuvāla Daha to use for its restoration. The following year, the roof was restored by thepānejugroup of Bungmati among others (Munirāja, Dhanapati, Siṃhamuni, Buddhi Gubhāḥju, Lekhanadāsa Harṣa, Viṣadhaṃ). 21dhārnīsilver and 41dhārnīcopper was added to various parts of the temple during its reconstruction."@en ;
