<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5f27520c-348e-43da-8160-a2e2729a37c7_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is badly damaged. The legible part reads as follows: \"If anyone destroys this roof, he will incur sins.\" Since the hiti has no roof, it can be assumed that this inscription is not related to the hiti, but may relate to the Gaṇeśa temple next to it."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5f27520c-348e-43da-8160-a2e2729a37c7> ;
