<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/5f3fcfe9-cdca-4c7c-9504-58cc4e019cd0_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Rādhāmukteśvara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Narendra Śamśera Thāpā Kṣetrī added Rādhāmukteśvara Mahādeva, the fifthśivaliṅgain the sanctum named after his grandmother Rādhākumārīdevī, making it apañcaliṅgaensemble in the sanctum of Dharmamukteśvara. Narendra Śamśera also donated land for various rituals related to Rādhāmukteśvara."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/5f3fcfe9-cdca-4c7c-9504-58cc4e019cd0> ;
    rdfs:comment "Narendra Śamśera Thāpā Kṣetrī added Rādhāmukteśvara Mahādeva, the fifthśivaliṅgain the sanctum named after his grandmother Rādhākumārīdevī, making it apañcaliṅgaensemble in the sanctum of Dharmamukteśvara. Narendra Śamśera also donated land for various rituals related to Rādhāmukteśvara."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
