        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A Śākya family (Motimāyā, Nemakara, Ratnakara, Bhairavakara, Najarakara, Devīmāyā, Jñānabāhādura, Kṛṇamāyā, Canakara, Budharatna, Cirīmāyā, Kīrtilānī etc.) from Patan Bu Bāhāḥ (LAL0440) commissioned the construction of a Dharmadhātujinālaya Caityaat the bank of the confluence."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/600ba6fa-8f77-11ea-bd59-0242ac130005> ;
    rdfs:comment "A Śākya family (Motimāyā, Nemakara, Ratnakara, Bhairavakara, Najarakara, Devīmāyā, Jñānabāhādura, Kṛṇamāyā, Canakara, Budharatna, Cirīmāyā, Kīrtilānī etc.) from Patan Bu Bāhāḥ (LAL0440) commissioned the construction of a Dharmadhātujinālaya Caityaat the bank of the confluence."@en ;
