<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/60bd57eb-8a9a-4fbc-a7d2-a4520a07b533_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the Phalcā and installation of two Viṣṇu statues"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the inscription a certain Kṛṣṇa Mulmī Bhāro of the Cāphare Ṭola in Kirtipur built it and installed two Viṣṇu statues: the Śrīdhara Viṣṇu statue (see object number KIR4049-002) in memory of his father Hākudeva Mulmī Bhāro and mother Annpūrṇā, and the Viṣṇu statue flanked by his consorts Sarasvatī and Lakṣmī (see object number KIR4049-001) in memory of his first wife Kanyāvatī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/60bd57eb-8a9a-4fbc-a7d2-a4520a07b533> ;
    rdfs:comment "According to the inscription a certain Kṛṣṇa Mulmī Bhāro of the Cāphare Ṭola in Kirtipur built it and installed two Viṣṇu statues: the Śrīdhara Viṣṇu statue (see object number KIR4049-002) in memory of his father Hākudeva Mulmī Bhāro and mother Annpūrṇā, and the Viṣṇu statue flanked by his consorts Sarasvatī and Lakṣmī (see object number KIR4049-001) in memory of his first wife Kanyāvatī."@en ;
