    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The 2015 earthquakes damaged the upper floor of the Phalcā. As a result, the Mānandhara family, who lived in the Phalcā, demolished the upper floor and covered it with corrugated tin sheets."@en ;
