        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of a caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Maṃjumuni and his family members established acaityain the name of his deceased parents Amṛtamuni and Lataṃ Thakuṃ. They also endowed land to observe the anniversary ritual of thecaitya. It is not clear which of thecaityas at thebāhāḥis being referred to here."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/61056d43-ee73-47ac-aaef-1fcb44ced05a> ;
