        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Budhācārje Sākebhikṣu Bekhāmuni, the seniormost elder (thapāḥju) of thebāhāḥ, endowed oneropanīof land to continue the tradition of playing musical instruments throughout the holy month of Guṃlā (July-August)."@en ;
