<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/61056d43-ee73-47ac-aaef-1fcb44ced05a_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Replacement of jhĩgaṭī tiles with brass sheets"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Putali Thakuṃ, his son Harṣavajra and others replaced the traditional tiles on the roof of thebāhāḥ’s balconied tower (phucā) with brass sheets. They also covered the struts and other parts of thephucāwith brass sheets. The names of Mahāvaja, Paṃcarāja, Mohanamāyā, Visnumāyā, and others are engraved on the lower part of the struts."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/61056d43-ee73-47ac-aaef-1fcb44ced05a> ;
    rdfs:comment "Putali Thakuṃ, his son Harṣavajra and others replaced the traditional tiles on the roof of thebāhāḥ’s balconied tower (phucā) with brass sheets. They also covered the struts and other parts of thephucāwith brass sheets. The names of Mahāvaja, Paṃcarāja, Mohanamāyā, Visnumāyā, and others are engraved on the lower part of the struts."@en ;
