<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/61056d43-ee73-47ac-aaef-1fcb44ced05a_7> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a pair of metal flags and prayer wheels"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Śākebhikṣu Jñānavajra vowed to offer a pair of brass flags and 10 copper prayer wheels. As he passed away before he could fulfill his vow, his wife Putalimāyā and her family members including son Sugatarājā offered flags and prayer wheels as per the vow of her late husband."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/61056d43-ee73-47ac-aaef-1fcb44ced05a> ;
