<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/62332e5e-8c90-484f-8c98-82e018442939_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As mentioned by D. Vajrācārya in his book 'MadhyakAbhiālakālekha' (2056, 87), an inscription formerly displayed in the Thabũ Phalcā indicated that it was renovated by Śrīmadhusūdana Deva and Govinda Bharo, after taking permission from the Śreṣṭha Bhāros of the Ṭola in 1672 CE (NS 762). The inscription is no longer available."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/62332e5e-8c90-484f-8c98-82e018442939> ;
    rdfs:comment "As mentioned by D. Vajrācārya in his book 'MadhyakAbhiālakālekha' (2056, 87), an inscription formerly displayed in the Thabũ Phalcā indicated that it was renovated by Śrīmadhusūdana Deva and Govinda Bharo, after taking permission from the Śreṣṭha Bhāros of the Ṭola in 1672 CE (NS 762). The inscription is no longer available."@en ;
