<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/62468f09-12aa-4247-b284-6ea6232af470_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Even before the major earthquake of 2015 (VS 2072), thephalcāwas in a severely deteriorated condition. After the earthquake, only the masonry walls remained standing. In 2023 (VS 2079), the structure was reconstructed under the supervision of Ward No. 12 of Kathmandu Metropolitan City. According to a ward representative (Kaḍgī, male, age 52), efforts were made to follow the earlier form; however, in comparison to the previous structure, the height of the rebuiltphalcāhas clearly been increased.पछिल्लो महाभूकम्प अगावै फल्चा निकै दयनीय स्थितिमा थियो । भूकम्पपछि फल्चाको गारोमात्र बचेको स्थितिमा थियो । विसं २०७९ (सन् २०२३) मा काठमाडौं महानगरपालिका वडां नं. १२ को रोहवरमा फल्चाको पुनर्निर्माण गरिएको हो । विगतकै स्वरूपलाई अनुशरण गर्ने प्रयाग गरिएको दाबी वडा सम्बद्ध व्यक्तिको छ (one of the ward members, Kaḍgī, male, age 52) । विगतको तुलनामा फल्चाको उचाईमा भने वृद्धि गरिएको स्पष्ट देखा पर्छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/62468f09-12aa-4247-b284-6ea6232af470> ;
    rdfs:comment "Even before the major earthquake of 2015 (VS 2072), thephalcāwas in a severely deteriorated condition. After the earthquake, only the masonry walls remained standing. In 2023 (VS 2079), the structure was reconstructed under the supervision of Ward No. 12 of Kathmandu Metropolitan City. According to a ward representative (Kaḍgī, male, age 52), efforts were made to follow the earlier form; however, in comparison to the previous structure, the height of the rebuiltphalcāhas clearly been increased.पछिल्लो महाभूकम्प अगावै फल्चा निकै दयनीय स्थितिमा थियो । भूकम्पपछि फल्चाको गारोमात्र बचेको स्थितिमा थियो । विसं २०७९ (सन् २०२३) मा काठमाडौं महानगरपालिका वडां नं. १२ को रोहवरमा फल्चाको पुनर्निर्माण गरिएको हो । विगतकै स्वरूपलाई अनुशरण गर्ने प्रयाग गरिएको दाबी वडा सम्बद्ध व्यक्तिको छ (one of the ward members, Kaḍgī, male, age 52) । विगतको तुलनामा फल्चाको उचाईमा भने वृद्धि गरिएको स्पष्ट देखा पर्छ ।"@en ;
