<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6270b5f8-ea91-41a6-9337-baf8d5928ea6_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Since a significant portion of this inscription has faded, its contents are not entirely clear. It seems to record the establishment of a religious trust in the name of the Śiva and Sarasvatī shrines. The donor’s name is decipherable as Hirānanda, though other details remain uncertain. Based on its style, the inscription likely dates to the Rāṇā period."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6270b5f8-ea91-41a6-9337-baf8d5928ea6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Since a significant portion of this inscription has faded, its contents are not entirely clear. It seems to record the establishment of a religious trust in the name of the Śiva and Sarasvatī shrines. The donor’s name is decipherable as Hirānanda, though other details remain uncertain. Based on its style, the inscription likely dates to the Rāṇā period."@en ;
