    dcterms:description "Sākebhikṣu Jayadhamma (Śākyabhikṣu Jayadharma), his wife Nugulakṣmī and his other family members erected the above-mentioned three Caityas in front of the Bāhāḥ during the reign of Pratāpa Malla."@en ;
