<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/63ee2cfd-8c43-457b-970c-a837cc8f7f11_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Gaṇeśa statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records about the establishment of a Gaṇeśa statue in 1503 CE which is now in the sanctum of this Temple. Since the record shows that the Temple was built only in 1630 CE, it remains obscure where this statue was consecrated before that date."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/63ee2cfd-8c43-457b-970c-a837cc8f7f11> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription records about the establishment of a Gaṇeśa statue in 1503 CE which is now in the sanctum of this Temple. Since the record shows that the Temple was built only in 1630 CE, it remains obscure where this statue was consecrated before that date."@en ;
