<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/643123c2-89d5-4ff5-a1b4-5d9b943d3a7b_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription notes that two months after the installation of the statue, in the month of Bhādra, a maṇḍapa (a 16-bayed quare phalcā, also called 'sohrakhuṭṭe') was constructed. It also mentions that land was granted to maintain the monument, with the income designated for the worship of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa and Valkhu Gaṇeśa, as well as for hosting a feast for Brahmins following the worship. Furthermore, the inscription instructs that lights should be lit in the Phalcā during the Matsyendranātha festival.मूर्ति स्थापनाको दुई महिना पश्चात् भदौमा मण्डप (फल्चा/सोह्रखुट्टे पटी) को निर्माण सम्पन्न गरिएको कुरा खुलाइएको छ । अभिलेखमा यस कृतिका खातिर जग्गा पनि छुट्याइएको र सोको आम्दानीले लक्ष्मीनारायण र वल्खुको गणेशलाई पूजा गरी ब्राह्मणलाई भोज खुवाउनुपर्ने थितिको उल्लेख छ । बुङ्गद्यः जात्राका दौरान पनि फल्चामा बत्ती बाली पुज्नुपर्ने कुराको उल्लेख छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/643123c2-89d5-4ff5-a1b4-5d9b943d3a7b> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription notes that two months after the installation of the statue, in the month of Bhādra, a maṇḍapa (a 16-bayed quare phalcā, also called 'sohrakhuṭṭe') was constructed. It also mentions that land was granted to maintain the monument, with the income designated for the worship of Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa and Valkhu Gaṇeśa, as well as for hosting a feast for Brahmins following the worship. Furthermore, the inscription instructs that lights should be lit in the Phalcā during the Matsyendranātha festival.मूर्ति स्थापनाको दुई महिना पश्चात् भदौमा मण्डप (फल्चा/सोह्रखुट्टे पटी) को निर्माण सम्पन्न गरिएको कुरा खुलाइएको छ । अभिलेखमा यस कृतिका खातिर जग्गा पनि छुट्याइएको र सोको आम्दानीले लक्ष्मीनारायण र वल्खुको गणेशलाई पूजा गरी ब्राह्मणलाई भोज खुवाउनुपर्ने थितिको उल्लेख छ । बुङ्गद्यः जात्राका दौरान पनि फल्चामा बत्ती बाली पुज्नुपर्ने कुराको उल्लेख छ ।"@en ;
