<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6435dbc3-4939-4a8d-b1ba-32d60e416984_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of dyaḥchẽ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After falling into a dilapidated state, thedyaḥchẽwas first reconstructed in 1998 CE (VS 2055) through financial support collected from the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna, the then Village Development Committee, and local residents. The reconstruction was completed in 2019 CE (VS 2076)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6435dbc3-4939-4a8d-b1ba-32d60e416984> ;
    rdfs:comment "After falling into a dilapidated state, thedyaḥchẽwas first reconstructed in 1998 CE (VS 2055) through financial support collected from the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna, the then Village Development Committee, and local residents. The reconstruction was completed in 2019 CE (VS 2076)."@en ;
