<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6435dbc3-4939-4a8d-b1ba-32d60e416984_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Inauguration"@en ;
    dcterms:description "On the occasion of the completion of the reconstruction of thedyaḥchẽand the adjoiningsataḥ, the inauguration ceremony was conducted under the auspices of literary scholar venerable Satyamohana Jośī. This was made possible through the sustained efforts of Dakṣiṇakālī Municipality and local residents."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6435dbc3-4939-4a8d-b1ba-32d60e416984> ;
