<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/643839ec-b5bf-482f-a357-7ffe0d8617ba_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As the inscription has already eroded, its content is unclear. However, ‘samvat 9(?)03 jyeṣṭha kṛṣṇa da’ can be deciphered. Both year and lunar day are unclear. But it probably is the 10th of the dark fortnight of Jyeṣṭha in 903, i.e., 1783 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/643839ec-b5bf-482f-a357-7ffe0d8617ba> ;
