<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/64a2bcf3-96b8-4af7-9a2e-64be0fe4ca39_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of a statue and rebuilding of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Govinda Maharjana, the seniormost member (thakali) of Bulu'sjyāpucommunity, installed a physical Bhairava statue, although, traditionally, such Bhairava temples only featured aniconic stone structures topped with stonetoraṇas. Later, the temple was dismantled and rebuilt on a concrete foundation, resulting in a reduced height."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/64a2bcf3-96b8-4af7-9a2e-64be0fe4ca39> ;
    rdfs:comment "Govinda Maharjana, the seniormost member (thakali) of Bulu'sjyāpucommunity, installed a physical Bhairava statue, although, traditionally, such Bhairava temples only featured aniconic stone structures topped with stonetoraṇas. Later, the temple was dismantled and rebuilt on a concrete foundation, resulting in a reduced height."@en ;
