    rdfs:label "Rebuilding of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As of October 2024, the temple is undergoing renovation with the financial support of the Bagmati Provincial Government. The simple columns from the previous construction are being replaced with ornate, carved wooden columns."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/64a2bcf3-96b8-4af7-9a2e-64be0fe4ca39> ;
