    dcterms:description "The dilapidated temple was dismantled after performing a worship of absolution (kṣamāpūjā) in 2011 CE (VS 2068). The temple was reconstructed with funds from the Kirtipur Municipality, Department of Archaeology, Guṭhī Saṃsthāna, and local donations in 2014 CE (VS 2071)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/655e33f0-7d0e-4011-8ec7-816ef7b3f8ab> ;
