<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6594f9ac-fb26-4e95-8c0e-4957e705df7c_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of the phlacā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 2020, the Nāmasaṅgīti Phalcā was undergoing restoration once again. With the financial support of the Lalitpur Metropolitan City office, a new concrete pitched roof, covered withjhĩgaṭītiles, was added to the flat concrete slab roof, giving the structure a more traditional appearance. The concrete pillars were clad with newly madedāci apābricks."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6594f9ac-fb26-4e95-8c0e-4957e705df7c> ;
    rdfs:comment "In 2020, the Nāmasaṅgīti Phalcā was undergoing restoration once again. With the financial support of the Lalitpur Metropolitan City office, a new concrete pitched roof, covered withjhĩgaṭītiles, was added to the flat concrete slab roof, giving the structure a more traditional appearance. The concrete pillars were clad with newly madedāci apābricks."@en ;
