<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/65ef3af4-9d6a-11ea-82af-0242ac130005_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following its collapse, thephalcāwas restored in VS 1946 by Siddhisudharamātyaya from Bāliphaḥ Ṭola and Ratnakumāra Śreṣṭha from Nabahā Nani. Theguṭhīmembers did not contribute to the restoration. The inscription further stipulates that while any donor may restore thephalcā, no one may claim it as their property."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/65ef3af4-9d6a-11ea-82af-0242ac130005> ;
    rdfs:comment "Following its collapse, thephalcāwas restored in VS 1946 by Siddhisudharamātyaya from Bāliphaḥ Ṭola and Ratnakumāra Śreṣṭha from Nabahā Nani. Theguṭhīmembers did not contribute to the restoration. The inscription further stipulates that while any donor may restore thephalcā, no one may claim it as their property."@en ;
