    rdfs:label "Rebuilding of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Parts of thephalcāwere replaced with brick walls and a slab on top. Members of theguṭhirebuilt thephalcāunder the guidance of Ṭākura Māna Śreṣṭha, a senior member of Cauthī Guṭhī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/65ef3af4-9d6a-11ea-82af-0242ac130005> ;
