<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6700e6dc-ad31-11ea-8ae7-0242ac130005_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of Kṛṣṇa statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The names Toyukhvāla, Dhanamayaju and Lakṣmī are engraved on the base of the Kṛṣṇa statue (LAL0820-014). Small donor figures can be seen below the inscription. This undated statue likey belongs to the late-Malla period."@en ;
