        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the temple and installation of new Sūrya statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following the theft of the Sūrya statue dating back to 1083 CE (NS 203), Īśvaramāna Pradhāna from the Saugaḥ Ṭola established a new statue of Sūrya in memory of his deceased father, Govindamāna Pradhāna, while also renovating the temple on the occasion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/672baa74-d5b1-453d-ab12-d3194c3e5976> ;
