    rdfs:label "Built"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Candrabhakteśvara was constructed by Kṛṣṇa Bahādura Rāṇā, the younger sibling of Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā.यसको निर्माण जङ्गबहादुर राणाका काइँला भाइ कृष्ण बहादुर राणाले निर्माण गरेको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/673a329f-0c56-4439-b29e-57c0596e62ea> ;
