<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/673afbfc-e6f2-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Inauguration"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A group of Avāles led by Kula Bhāro and Lakṣmīsiṃha Bhāro built thesataḥafter dismantling an oldphalcāat this site in 1751 CE. They also donated 68mohorcoins (mohara-rūpaiyā) to finance its upkeep."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/673afbfc-e6f2-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "A group of Avāles led by Kula Bhāro and Lakṣmīsiṃha Bhāro built thesataḥafter dismantling an oldphalcāat this site in 1751 CE. They also donated 68mohorcoins (mohara-rūpaiyā) to finance its upkeep."@en ;
