<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/675f39f1-3142-4ddf-b7d0-dca85bde0a61_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "The earliest mention of the Tokhā Taleju"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The incident in which Jayadeva Pvaha of Banepa seized gold kept in the Tokhā fort (Taleju), prompting a rebellion by the Tokhā fort against him, constitutes the earliest historical evidence attesting to the antiquity of Tokhā Taleju.बनेपाका जयदेव प्वहले तोखा किल्ला (तलेजु) मा राखिएको सुन लिएको हुँदा तोखा किल्लाले उनीविरुद्ध विद्रोह गरेको थियो । यो नै तोखा तलेजुको ऐतिहासिकता पुष्टि गर्ने सबभन्दा पुरानो प्रमाण हो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/675f39f1-3142-4ddf-b7d0-dca85bde0a61> ;
    rdfs:comment "The incident in which Jayadeva Pvaha of Banepa seized gold kept in the Tokhā fort (Taleju), prompting a rebellion by the Tokhā fort against him, constitutes the earliest historical evidence attesting to the antiquity of Tokhā Taleju.बनेपाका जयदेव प्वहले तोखा किल्ला (तलेजु) मा राखिएको सुन लिएको हुँदा तोखा किल्लाले उनीविरुद्ध विद्रोह गरेको थियो । यो नै तोखा तलेजुको ऐतिहासिकता पुष्टि गर्ने सबभन्दा पुरानो प्रमाण हो ।"@en ;
