<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/67bce7a9-f11e-4a15-9fdd-1d78a0110a34_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to local residents, the temple was built by the ancestors of Śaṅkhalāla Śreṣṭha. As there is no record of the construction of the temple, it is not possible to say on what date this temple was built. Looking at the structure and style of the temple, it can be inferred that it was built during the Rana period."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/67bce7a9-f11e-4a15-9fdd-1d78a0110a34> ;
    rdfs:comment "According to local residents, the temple was built by the ancestors of Śaṅkhalāla Śreṣṭha. As there is no record of the construction of the temple, it is not possible to say on what date this temple was built. Looking at the structure and style of the temple, it can be inferred that it was built during the Rana period."@en ;
