<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/67f7ff3b-da0a-4064-969e-53333412edd9_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of Pillar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The eroded inscription on the upper part of pillar three (MUG0030-003) allows a partial reading. The date '1404' has been identified. Since most inscriptions from western Nepal are dated using the Śaka era, this date should correspond to 1482 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/67f7ff3b-da0a-4064-969e-53333412edd9> ;
