<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6841ec23-0b12-4233-bada-cb6c1aa686e9_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell and stone pillar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his father Mohanalāla Daṅgola, his mother Aṣṭamāyā, and his wife Nānīmāyā Daṅgola, Gaṇeśa Bahādura Daṅgola of Sā̃gā offered a bell and stone pillar to the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6841ec23-0b12-4233-bada-cb6c1aa686e9> ;
    rdfs:comment "In memory of his father Mohanalāla Daṅgola, his mother Aṣṭamāyā, and his wife Nānīmāyā Daṅgola, Gaṇeśa Bahādura Daṅgola of Sā̃gā offered a bell and stone pillar to the temple."@en ;
