    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the east wing"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The east wing was completely dismantled and rebuilt between 2018-2021. Project funding was provided by the Hainan Province Cihang Foundation, China. The project was jointly implemented by the Department of Archaeology and the UNESCO, Kathmandu Office, and executed by the Bjrayogini Chaughera Sattal Nirmaan Upabhoka Samiti."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/68934505-5d00-4538-b36a-a74c9c39f58b> ;
