        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Collection of funds for the restoration"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Lalitpur Metropolitan City office provided seven Lakh Rupees for the monument's reconstruction. The descendants of the donor family added fifty thousand Rupees, however, this amount was not sufficiet for the work to begin. The Metropolitan City office has promised to provide an additional three Lakh Rupees."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/69370820-1ef5-11ea-b74e-0242ac130002> ;
