<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/69370820-1ef5-11ea-b74e-0242ac130002_3> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the 2022-2024 restoration, the floor plan was expanded to encompass the full width and length of the previously L-shaped building. Additionally, a second floor was added, topped with a flat, steel-reinforced concrete roof. Thus, the style (typology) of the building was transformed from aphalcato asataḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/69370820-1ef5-11ea-b74e-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "In the 2022-2024 restoration, the floor plan was expanded to encompass the full width and length of the previously L-shaped building. Additionally, a second floor was added, topped with a flat, steel-reinforced concrete roof. Thus, the style (typology) of the building was transformed from aphalcato asataḥ."@en ;
