<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6a68a4bf-4153-4db9-9aa4-c5f78331a414_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilt of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kirtipur Municipality reconstructed Gaḥsi Phalcā in 2021 CE. Before the reconstruction, only a rectangular plinth had remained for decades (no other remnants of the Phalcā were found). Even senior members of the locality do not recall whether a completephalcāwas standing here in their lifetime. This suggests that the Phalcā had already ceased to exist before the 1934 earthquakes. It probably collapsed in the previous great earthquakes and was never rebuilt."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6a68a4bf-4153-4db9-9aa4-c5f78331a414> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kirtipur Municipality reconstructed Gaḥsi Phalcā in 2021 CE. Before the reconstruction, only a rectangular plinth had remained for decades (no other remnants of the Phalcā were found). Even senior members of the locality do not recall whether a completephalcāwas standing here in their lifetime. This suggests that the Phalcā had already ceased to exist before the 1934 earthquakes. It probably collapsed in the previous great earthquakes and was never rebuilt."@en ;
