    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription installed inside the Gaṇeśa shrine opposite to the Navadurgā Mandira predates others, but only part of it remains legible, indicating '853caitrakṛṣṇaaṣṭamī'(the 8th day of the dark fortnight of Caitra in NS 853).यो अभिलेख मन्दिर अगाडि रहेको गणेश देवालय (shrine) भित्र रहेको छ । अधिकांश अक्षरहरू नबुझिने भइसके तापनि अभिलेखको तल्लो भागमा '८५३ चैत्र कृष्ण अष्टमी' पढ्न सकिन्छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6ab370ab-d00c-4748-9b02-a8f045cde7ae> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription installed inside the Gaṇeśa shrine opposite to the Navadurgā Mandira predates others, but only part of it remains legible, indicating '853caitrakṛṣṇaaṣṭamī'(the 8th day of the dark fortnight of Caitra in NS 853).यो अभिलेख मन्दिर अगाडि रहेको गणेश देवालय (shrine) भित्र रहेको छ । अधिकांश अक्षरहरू नबुझिने भइसके तापनि अभिलेखको तल्लो भागमा '८५३ चैत्र कृष्ण अष्टमी' पढ्न सकिन्छ ।"@en ;
