    dcterms:description "Vaṃśā Rāutta, his father Bābu Narasiṃha, his wife Maijulakṣmī, and his sons Nandalāla, Jujulāla, Kājilāla, Tulasīlāla and Candralāla offered a brasstoraṇato the Pīṭha. All are residents of Mvaḥmadugallī."@en ;
