    rdfs:label "Offering by late Matīrāja"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records that the late Matīraja, Bālagopāla, and a son of Mātā Helathakũ and his wife, sons (Vidyālāla and Lakṣmīlāla) and daughters (Gaṅgāmāyā and Gaṇeśamāyā) made offerings of a brasstoraṇa, stone line, silver water vessel and so forth to the Chinnamastā Pīṭha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6c19dd43-3e02-4f62-8636-0b3e5971ef4d> ;
