    dcterms:description "Ghanaśyāma Rājakarṇikāra and his wife Bindrā, both residents of Haugala Ṭola, replaced the old bell which was hanging on a Rāṇā-period pillar erected in the Pīṭha's premises with a new one in NS 1131."@en ;
