    rdfs:label "Collapse"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following its collapse in the 1934 earthquakes, the Temple was rebuilt in its current form. The corrugated metal sheets that were used to cover the ambulatory outside the sanctum and the pillars that supported it have now been removed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6c63cbb9-8044-4497-830c-f8ee4fad398e> ;
    rdfs:comment "Following its collapse in the 1934 earthquakes, the Temple was rebuilt in its current form. The corrugated metal sheets that were used to cover the ambulatory outside the sanctum and the pillars that supported it have now been removed."@en ;
