<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6c9ebe00-7b9d-424f-a9d7-f58b3cbde686_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a finial"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An entry in athyāsaphūmanuscript chronicles Mādheju’s offering of the finial to Tāmraliṃga in Goro, a derivative of Gvala, the vernacular name of Devapattana. Mādheju was the elder brother of Cikuti, an influential courtier during the medieval period."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6c9ebe00-7b9d-424f-a9d7-f58b3cbde686> ;
    rdfs:comment "An entry in athyāsaphūmanuscript chronicles Mādheju’s offering of the finial to Tāmraliṃga in Goro, a derivative of Gvala, the vernacular name of Devapattana. Mādheju was the elder brother of Cikuti, an influential courtier during the medieval period."@en ;
