    rdfs:label "Beginning of the initial construction of the Temple and caugharā sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhājurāma, who was born on the lineage of the sage Kaśyapa started the construction of this Temple in order to consecrate avāṇaliṅgain the sanctum. He also started the construction thecaugharāḥ sataḥon the same date,which encircles the Temple from all four sides."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6cb38691-558a-4bdc-89b6-74f2dd0c9420> ;
