    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Temple and concecration of a new liṅga after the old one was stolen"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Temple had fallen into disrepair due to lack of proper care and maintenance and had become a latrine. The descendants of Bhājurāma commissioned the reconstruction of the Temple in 2006 CE. The originalśivaliṅgaof crystal was stolen and has now been replaced by a new one."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6cb38691-558a-4bdc-89b6-74f2dd0c9420> ;
