<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/6da9c621-521e-41d0-97b4-a3a8c2a9c960_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilt of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhaktapur municipality carried out the reconstruction of the temple damaged in the devastating earthquake of April 2015.  The newly rebuilt temple had been inaugurated by Prema Suvāla, parliamentary member and secretary of the Nepal Workers and Peasants Party. On the occasion, Rāma Kṛṣṇa Tvāynāy, chairperson of the Kedārnātha temple reconstruction consumers committee, which took care of the reconstruction, handed the symbolic key of the temple to mayor Sunila Prajāpati."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/6da9c621-521e-41d0-97b4-a3a8c2a9c960> ;
