    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Dīrghalakṣmī Kũvara, the second wife of Balabhadra's brother Vīrabhadra, established Dīrghabhakteśvara Mahādeva in her and her son Hemamukteśvara Mahādeva's name. She also built this Sataḥ facing the river."@en ;
