        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Monument damage caused by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the upper floor collapsed during the 2015 earthquake, a single-storey structure was built, incorporating the two remaining old columns. A family with the Nagarkoti surname, who had been living there for decades, took the initiative to reconstruct the one-storey rectangular room at their own expense."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/71d1fd85-b9ac-4ebf-bc1b-0006d6da7f9e> ;
