<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7243bcb4-7faf-4042-bb6a-e42dfeb04a3c_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Originally, thisphalcāfeatured three bays but was transformed into a concrete structure in the late 1980s. Later, the municipality replaced the one-story concrete structure with a two-story version. In 2023 CE (VS 2080), the building was renovated, incorporatingdaci appā,jhiṃgaṭī, andsãjhyāḥto restore a traditional appearance."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7243bcb4-7faf-4042-bb6a-e42dfeb04a3c> ;
    rdfs:comment "Originally, thisphalcāfeatured three bays but was transformed into a concrete structure in the late 1980s. Later, the municipality replaced the one-story concrete structure with a two-story version. In 2023 CE (VS 2080), the building was renovated, incorporatingdaci appā,jhiṃgaṭī, andsãjhyāḥto restore a traditional appearance."@en ;
