    rdfs:label "Establishment of National Braille Library"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The National Braille Library was established at the printing house building. The western wing was also rebuilt as a modern brick and concrete structure and only retains a few historic pillars from the original Sataḥ. The reconstruction was funded by a Japanese organization and houses the Nepal Association for the Welfare of the Blind (NAWB)."@en ;
