    rdfs:label "Rebuilding"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Due to the damages caused by the 2015 earthquakes, the Ward No. 8 office of the Kathmandu Metropolis undertook its reconstruction in 2022 CE (VS 2079), and the final phase of reconstruction work is currently in progress as of July 2023."@en ;
