<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/73040155-8b11-4ee3-ad7a-ff273ba88b0f_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Theft"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Candradeva's statue was installed inside the niche in the hiti premises. The statue was stolen during the lockdown of 2020 CE, and a new one was installed in its place. Due to lack of knowledge, a sun statue was mistakenly installed instead of the moon statue.हिति परिसरमा चन्द्रदेवको मूर्ति हितिमाथिको खोपोमा स्थापित थियो । उक्त चन्द्रको मूर्ति सन् २०२० मा लकडाउनको दौरान चोरी भएको थियो । चोरी पश्चात् सो खोपोमा नयाँ मूर्ति प्रतिस्थापन गरिएको छ । तर अज्ञानतावस् चन्द्रको मूर्तिलाई सूर्यको ठानी सूर्यमूर्ति स्थापना हुन पुगेको छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/73040155-8b11-4ee3-ad7a-ff273ba88b0f> ;
    rdfs:comment "Candradeva's statue was installed inside the niche in the hiti premises. The statue was stolen during the lockdown of 2020 CE, and a new one was installed in its place. Due to lack of knowledge, a sun statue was mistakenly installed instead of the moon statue.हिति परिसरमा चन्द्रदेवको मूर्ति हितिमाथिको खोपोमा स्थापित थियो । उक्त चन्द्रको मूर्ति सन् २०२० मा लकडाउनको दौरान चोरी भएको थियो । चोरी पश्चात् सो खोपोमा नयाँ मूर्ति प्रतिस्थापन गरिएको छ । तर अज्ञानतावस् चन्द्रको मूर्तिलाई सूर्यको ठानी सूर्यमूर्ति स्थापना हुन पुगेको छ ।"@en ;
