    rdfs:label "Offering oil lamp balustrade"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Najaramāna, Cinī, Sūryamāna, and their family members installeddalūlampstands around the temple as a gesture to honor and remember their deceased family members, with the intention of wishing for their eternal peace."@en ;
