<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/737cb161-8db7-4e7d-a315-4f6fdf29d047_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The dilapidatedphalcāwas renovated for a total amount of Rupees 240,432. The Lalitpur Metropolitan City provided Rs. 2 lakh and the remaining amount was collected through local fundraising. After the renovation, new statues of Sarasvatī and Bhīmsena were installed in the niches."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/737cb161-8db7-4e7d-a315-4f6fdf29d047> ;
    rdfs:comment "The dilapidatedphalcāwas renovated for a total amount of Rupees 240,432. The Lalitpur Metropolitan City provided Rs. 2 lakh and the remaining amount was collected through local fundraising. After the renovation, new statues of Sarasvatī and Bhīmsena were installed in the niches."@en ;
