<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7386096b-0e01-4d96-b18b-d529d4e97b2f_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Above the doorway of thedevalahousing theKvāḥpā Dyaḥthere is a woodentoraṇabearing the inscription “Śrī Ratnapura Mahāvihāra 1981 (VS)” corresponding to 1924–25 CE. Although the inscription itself does not fully express the circumstances of the construction, the descendants of Ratnākara maintain that they possess oral knowledge transmitted from their grandfather regarding the establishment of thebāhāḥ. According to this tradition, their ancestor Ratnākara was a gold merchant who constructed thisbāhāḥbehind his residence and named it after himself.क्वाःपाःद्यः भएको देवलको ढोकामाथि काँठको तोरण छ । यस तोरणमा ‘श्री रत्नपुर महाविहार १९८१’ लेखिएको छ । अभिलेखको अपूर्ण वाक्यले पूर्ण भाव अभिव्यक्ति नगरे तापनि रत्नाकरका पनातिहरू बाहाःको निर्माणबारे ज्ञात भएको बताउछन् । उनीहरूसँग मौखिक रूपमा बाजेबाट सुनाइएको पूर्ण जानकारी भएको दाबी गर्छन् । तिनका जिजुबाजे रत्नाकर सुन व्यापारी भएको र उनले घर पछाडि आफ्नै नाममा यो बाहाः खडा गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7386096b-0e01-4d96-b18b-d529d4e97b2f> ;
    rdfs:comment "Above the doorway of thedevalahousing theKvāḥpā Dyaḥthere is a woodentoraṇabearing the inscription “Śrī Ratnapura Mahāvihāra 1981 (VS)” corresponding to 1924–25 CE. Although the inscription itself does not fully express the circumstances of the construction, the descendants of Ratnākara maintain that they possess oral knowledge transmitted from their grandfather regarding the establishment of thebāhāḥ. According to this tradition, their ancestor Ratnākara was a gold merchant who constructed thisbāhāḥbehind his residence and named it after himself.क्वाःपाःद्यः भएको देवलको ढोकामाथि काँठको तोरण छ । यस तोरणमा ‘श्री रत्नपुर महाविहार १९८१’ लेखिएको छ । अभिलेखको अपूर्ण वाक्यले पूर्ण भाव अभिव्यक्ति नगरे तापनि रत्नाकरका पनातिहरू बाहाःको निर्माणबारे ज्ञात भएको बताउछन् । उनीहरूसँग मौखिक रूपमा बाजेबाट सुनाइएको पूर्ण जानकारी भएको दाबी गर्छन् । तिनका जिजुबाजे रत्नाकर सुन व्यापारी भएको र उनले घर पछाडि आफ्नै नाममा यो बाहाः खडा गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
