<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7386096b-0e01-4d96-b18b-d529d4e97b2f_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of the caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription is also present on the Dharmadhātu Jinālaya Caitya (KAT2220-004) associated with the shrine of Akṣobhya, although the portion containing the date is no longer legible. The descendants of the founder state that thiscaityawas added only after the construction of the bāhāḥ in 1924–25 CE (VS 1981). On the pedestal of the caitya, small sculpted figures representing members of the founder’s family have been carved, along with their names.अक्षोभ्यको मूर्ति रहेको धर्मधातु जिनालय चैत्य (KAT2220-004) मा अभिलेख छ तर मिति भएको भाग पढ्न सकिएको छैन । यो विसं १९८१ (सन् १९२४-२५) मा बाहाः निर्माणपछि मात्र थपिएको जानकारी निर्माताका सन्तान बताउछन् । चैत्यको वेदीका भागमा निर्माताका परिवार सदस्यहरूको साना प्रतिमा निर्माण गरी तिनको नाम पनि कुँदिएका छन् ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7386096b-0e01-4d96-b18b-d529d4e97b2f> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription is also present on the Dharmadhātu Jinālaya Caitya (KAT2220-004) associated with the shrine of Akṣobhya, although the portion containing the date is no longer legible. The descendants of the founder state that thiscaityawas added only after the construction of the bāhāḥ in 1924–25 CE (VS 1981). On the pedestal of the caitya, small sculpted figures representing members of the founder’s family have been carved, along with their names.अक्षोभ्यको मूर्ति रहेको धर्मधातु जिनालय चैत्य (KAT2220-004) मा अभिलेख छ तर मिति भएको भाग पढ्न सकिएको छैन । यो विसं १९८१ (सन् १९२४-२५) मा बाहाः निर्माणपछि मात्र थपिएको जानकारी निर्माताका सन्तान बताउछन् । चैत्यको वेदीका भागमा निर्माताका परिवार सदस्यहरूको साना प्रतिमा निर्माण गरी तिनको नाम पनि कुँदिएका छन् ।"@en ;
