    rdfs:label "Installation of wooden pillar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription, which predates the current building by over two centuries, mentions the installation of a wooden pillar. This suggests a prior structure on the site that likely collapsed over time. Motirāja may have incorporated remnants of this earlier building into the new construction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/742a774c-956c-42bf-b944-a9c02e81c4b5> ;
