<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/74763c55-e9d7-447b-9520-14b2adf86c2b_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Temple Collapse"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple suffered a collapse during the devastating earthquake of 1934 CE. Subsequently, the gilded statue of Mahāviṣṇu was relocated to Nāsaḥ Cuka, where it remains to this day (as of January 2023 CE)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/74763c55-e9d7-447b-9520-14b2adf86c2b> ;
    rdfs:comment "The temple suffered a collapse during the devastating earthquake of 1934 CE. Subsequently, the gilded statue of Mahāviṣṇu was relocated to Nāsaḥ Cuka, where it remains to this day (as of January 2023 CE)."@en ;
