    rdfs:label "Original construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Yogamatī, the daughter of King Yoganarendra Malla donated this temple in memory of her father. The inscription mentions that the 31 queens of King Yoganarendra Malla performedsatī(self-immolation) after his death."@en ;
