<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/75171568-d049-4c63-9fce-ddf40dc4e157_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Department of Archaeology (DoA) with financial support from UNESCO and technical guidance from John Sanday and Wolfgang Korn decided to dismantle the northern part of the tower, including the two corner pavilions to uproot apipaltree.The lintel above the arcade was replaced and the tower was rebuilt in cement mortar. In the photo, taken by Rich Pfau, the temple can be seen under the renovation project (psroundsimaging.com/Rich Pfau)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/75171568-d049-4c63-9fce-ddf40dc4e157> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Department of Archaeology (DoA) with financial support from UNESCO and technical guidance from John Sanday and Wolfgang Korn decided to dismantle the northern part of the tower, including the two corner pavilions to uproot apipaltree.The lintel above the arcade was replaced and the tower was rebuilt in cement mortar. In the photo, taken by Rich Pfau, the temple can be seen under the renovation project (psroundsimaging.com/Rich Pfau)."@en ;
