<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/761ec68c-9d39-4e1d-91a5-f3bce014d451_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of unknown object and brick paving of courtyard"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription from 1717 CE (NS 837) suggests additions made by two local brothers, but the exact nature of these additions remains unclear due to the illegibility of the inscription. The courtyard's brick paving around this time further confirms thecaitya's pre-inscription existence."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/761ec68c-9d39-4e1d-91a5-f3bce014d451> ;
