<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7622d302-70a1-4462-be78-6e4258382122_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Three brothers—Viśvadeva Bhābo, Bhāgīrāma, and Satyadeva—built Cvaylāchi Chakavaḥ Phalcā in honor of their father, Phachi Bhābo, and installed a deity, likely Sukhāvatī Lokeśvara, currently enshrined in a niche inside the arcaded platform.They also established a religious trust to perpetuate thehāthuhāyketradition."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7622d302-70a1-4462-be78-6e4258382122> ;
    rdfs:comment "Three brothers—Viśvadeva Bhābo, Bhāgīrāma, and Satyadeva—built Cvaylāchi Chakavaḥ Phalcā in honor of their father, Phachi Bhābo, and installed a deity, likely Sukhāvatī Lokeśvara, currently enshrined in a niche inside the arcaded platform.They also established a religious trust to perpetuate thehāthuhāyketradition."@en ;
