<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/77324817-37bf-452e-a41b-d1dc705432b3_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of Śadāśiva in hiti premises"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A family from Dugāḥ Hiti installed a statue of Sadāśiva, a multi-faced and multi-armed form of Lord Śiva, and formed aguthifor performing yearly rituals. However, there is no statue of Śiva at the Hiti except aśivaliṅga. Probably, the donor family had established this Śivaliṅga as Sadāśiva."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/77324817-37bf-452e-a41b-d1dc705432b3> ;
    rdfs:comment "A family from Dugāḥ Hiti installed a statue of Sadāśiva, a multi-faced and multi-armed form of Lord Śiva, and formed aguthifor performing yearly rituals. However, there is no statue of Śiva at the Hiti except aśivaliṅga. Probably, the donor family had established this Śivaliṅga as Sadāśiva."@en ;
