        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription embedded in thejaḥdhuṃ’s upper section records its inauguration on Akṣaya Tṛtīyā, the 3rd of the bright fortnight of Vaiśākha in 1659 CE (NS 779). It was built by Kālirāma Bhāro and his wife Vimalāmayi Bhari of Khalachẽ, with land allocated for maintenance under Vāvusiṃ Bhavo’s care."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/786393d1-ac85-4854-8d3e-e7bdf047389e> ;
