<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/786fe3c9-b65a-4bee-9432-867ae7d7be39_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the Phalcā, establishment of a Bhavānīśaṅkara statue and a land grant"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription from 1716 CE records its renovation and establishment of a Bhavānīśaṅkara statue by Vaṃśīdharadeva Śarmā and his wife Lāvatī Brāhmaṇī, the descendants of its founder Jayasiṃhadeva. The Bhavānīśaṅkara statue mentioned in the inscription does not exist in or around the Phalcā at present. The inscription also records a land grant by them for celebrating the Phalcā’s anniversary rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/786fe3c9-b65a-4bee-9432-867ae7d7be39> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription from 1716 CE records its renovation and establishment of a Bhavānīśaṅkara statue by Vaṃśīdharadeva Śarmā and his wife Lāvatī Brāhmaṇī, the descendants of its founder Jayasiṃhadeva. The Bhavānīśaṅkara statue mentioned in the inscription does not exist in or around the Phalcā at present. The inscription also records a land grant by them for celebrating the Phalcā’s anniversary rituals."@en ;
