    dcterms:description "Puncali Phalcā was completely dismantled and reconstructed in 2003 CE (cf.Bāsukala & Gutschow2018). During the reconstruction, it was moved a few cubic feet back from its original location because it allegedly narrowed down the street too much."@en ;
