<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/788cd320-e6a8-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_5> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Laying the foundations"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Those involved in laying the foundations of the Vihāra were as follows:1. Śrī Dakṣina Vihāra kulumbaja Mahāpātra Rājasiṃha Malla Varmā, who calls himself a devotee of Lokeśvara,2. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Udayasiṃha Malla Varmā3. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Jayadharmasiṃha Malla Varmā4. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Rudrasiṃha Malla Varmā5. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Jayabhīma Malla Varmā(Vajrācārya2011, 277-278)"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/788cd320-e6a8-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Those involved in laying the foundations of the Vihāra were as follows:1. Śrī Dakṣina Vihāra kulumbaja Mahāpātra Rājasiṃha Malla Varmā, who calls himself a devotee of Lokeśvara,2. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Udayasiṃha Malla Varmā3. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Jayadharmasiṃha Malla Varmā4. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Rudrasiṃha Malla Varmā5. Pradhāna Mahāpātra Śrī Jayabhīma Malla Varmā(Vajrācārya2011, 277-278)"@en ;
