<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/788cd320-e6a8-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_9> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The restoration was completed in two phases. The first phase (1990-1993) saw restoration carried out on sections of the eastern and northern buildings. During this phase, technical assistance was offered by the Agency for Cultural Affairs of Japan, and the cost of restoration was borne jointly by the government of Nepal and the Nippon Institute of Technology. During the second phase (1993-1995) restoration work was carried out on the southern and western buildings. The cost of restoration for the second phase was borne solely by the Nippon Institute of Technology."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/788cd320-e6a8-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The restoration was completed in two phases. The first phase (1990-1993) saw restoration carried out on sections of the eastern and northern buildings. During this phase, technical assistance was offered by the Agency for Cultural Affairs of Japan, and the cost of restoration was borne jointly by the government of Nepal and the Nippon Institute of Technology. During the second phase (1993-1995) restoration work was carried out on the southern and western buildings. The cost of restoration for the second phase was borne solely by the Nippon Institute of Technology."@en ;
