<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/790c0a2a-5e10-11ea-8083-0242ac130006_15> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the main entrance, addition of praying wheels, addition of agilt pinnacle, minor renovations"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Aśoka Stupā Sudhāra Samiti commissioned minor renovations of the Stūpa. An entrance gate was made on the bank of the main road and a garden was constructed to the east of the Stūpa. Prayer wheels were added to the surroundingdharmadhātujinālaya caitya. Bābujāji Śākya also offered a golden pinnacle with a parasol, which was placed on top of the Stūpa."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/790c0a2a-5e10-11ea-8083-0242ac130006> ;
    rdfs:comment "Aśoka Stupā Sudhāra Samiti commissioned minor renovations of the Stūpa. An entrance gate was made on the bank of the main road and a garden was constructed to the east of the Stūpa. Prayer wheels were added to the surroundingdharmadhātujinālaya caitya. Bābujāji Śākya also offered a golden pinnacle with a parasol, which was placed on top of the Stūpa."@en ;
