<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7a1244a0-f644-42c7-ad7a-30307d056cb6_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Members of the same Pradhāna lineage, including Īśvaralāla, Maheśvaralāla, Bekhalāla, and others, who were responsible for the brass-sheet embellishment of the wooden elements surrounding the Gaṇeśa image, also installed a bell (ghaṇṭā) in front of the temple.गणेश मूर्ति वरिपरिका काष्ठ सामग्रीमा पित्तलको पाताले मोडी सजाउने उही प्रधान खलकका इश्वरलाल, महेश्वरलाल, बेखालाल आदिले मन्दिर अगाडि एक घण्ट स्थापना गरे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7a1244a0-f644-42c7-ad7a-30307d056cb6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Members of the same Pradhāna lineage, including Īśvaralāla, Maheśvaralāla, Bekhalāla, and others, who were responsible for the brass-sheet embellishment of the wooden elements surrounding the Gaṇeśa image, also installed a bell (ghaṇṭā) in front of the temple.गणेश मूर्ति वरिपरिका काष्ठ सामग्रीमा पित्तलको पाताले मोडी सजाउने उही प्रधान खलकका इश्वरलाल, महेश्वरलाल, बेखालाल आदिले मन्दिर अगाडि एक घण्ट स्थापना गरे ।"@en ;
