<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7a1244a0-f644-42c7-ad7a-30307d056cb6_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration work and covering the temple's roof with copper sheets."@en ;
    dcterms:description "Demolition of the old structure began in September 2008 CE (Bhādra, VS 2065), and the reconstruction was completed in 2009 CE (Bhādra, VS 2066), at which time the roof was re-clad with copper sheets. This reconstruction was carried out through local donations and with the articipation of the Lalitpur Metropolitan City.विसं २०६५ (सन् २००८) को भाद्र महिनाबाट मन्दिर भत्काउने काम सुरु गरी वेिसं २०६६ (सन् २००९) को भाद्रमा तामाको पाताले छानो छाई पुनर्निर्माणकार्य सम्पन्न गरियो । यस कार्य स्थानीयको चन्दा र ललितपुर उपमहानगरपालिकाको सहभागितामा गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7a1244a0-f644-42c7-ad7a-30307d056cb6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Demolition of the old structure began in September 2008 CE (Bhādra, VS 2065), and the reconstruction was completed in 2009 CE (Bhādra, VS 2066), at which time the roof was re-clad with copper sheets. This reconstruction was carried out through local donations and with the articipation of the Lalitpur Metropolitan City.विसं २०६५ (सन् २००८) को भाद्र महिनाबाट मन्दिर भत्काउने काम सुरु गरी वेिसं २०६६ (सन् २००९) को भाद्रमा तामाको पाताले छानो छाई पुनर्निर्माणकार्य सम्पन्न गरियो । यस कार्य स्थानीयको चन्दा र ललितपुर उपमहानगरपालिकाको सहभागितामा गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
