<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7a1244a0-f644-42c7-ad7a-30307d056cb6_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of the iron gate"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pradyumna Bahādura Pradhāna, together with other family members, installed an iron gate at the temple for security purposes in memory of their deceased ancestors. In addition, Mandirā Pradhāna donated NPR 5,000 in cash for repainting the nearby Nārāyaṇa Temple (LAL2200).प्रद्युम्नबहादुर प्रधान र उनका अन्य सदस्यले आफ्ना दीवंगत पुर्खाका नाममा मन्दिरमा सुरक्षार्थ फलामको ढोका हाल्ने कार्य गरे । साथै मन्दिरा प्रधानले नजिकैको नारायण मन्दिर (LAL2200) मा रङ्गरोदन गर्न नगद रू ५०००/- दान गरे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7a1244a0-f644-42c7-ad7a-30307d056cb6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Pradyumna Bahādura Pradhāna, together with other family members, installed an iron gate at the temple for security purposes in memory of their deceased ancestors. In addition, Mandirā Pradhāna donated NPR 5,000 in cash for repainting the nearby Nārāyaṇa Temple (LAL2200).प्रद्युम्नबहादुर प्रधान र उनका अन्य सदस्यले आफ्ना दीवंगत पुर्खाका नाममा मन्दिरमा सुरक्षार्थ फलामको ढोका हाल्ने कार्य गरे । साथै मन्दिरा प्रधानले नजिकैको नारायण मन्दिर (LAL2200) मा रङ्गरोदन गर्न नगद रू ५०००/- दान गरे ।"@en ;
