<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7ad947d3-1af5-4679-bd76-3ac73650bb08_12> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Overlaying of door-leaves with brass sheets"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is from the door-leaves of the entrance to thedigudyaḥshrine. The door-leaves are overlaid with brass sheets, bearing multiple names of donors like Ratathaku, Heradevī, Harṣabahādura, among others. As the inscription is incomplete, other details are unclear, but it apparently records the overlaying of door-leaves with brass sheets."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7ad947d3-1af5-4679-bd76-3ac73650bb08> ;
