    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Royal astrologer (rājadaivajña) Lakṣmaṇa Bhāro, with others, constructed the Jñāneśvara temple and asataḥrest house. This was done to liberate a deceased person, whose name is now illegible due to erosion of the inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7b54dc62-aa23-47c0-8387-ce9a32bbbf84> ;
