    dcterms:description "Lakṣmaṇa Bhāro's grandson, with his wives Devīlakṣmī and Śubhalakṣmī, donated a golden finial and trident to the temple. Like his grandfather, the donor was also a royal astrologer (rājadaivajña) but his name cannot be deciphered due to the erosion of the text."@en ;
