<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7d2ffd60-b1d3-42ba-9773-07c4f4be3d03_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "On the birthday of King Mahendra, the pond was renovated and the temple premises was laid with stone slabs. He also constructed a new cement pathway with stone steps leading up to the temple. Given that both pillars in the temple compound are inscribed with the letter 'M', it is likely that they were also renovated around the same time."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7d2ffd60-b1d3-42ba-9773-07c4f4be3d03> ;
    rdfs:comment "On the birthday of King Mahendra, the pond was renovated and the temple premises was laid with stone slabs. He also constructed a new cement pathway with stone steps leading up to the temple. Given that both pillars in the temple compound are inscribed with the letter 'M', it is likely that they were also renovated around the same time."@en ;
