<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7e3598e9-13d4-4973-a880-4874fdb67368_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pūrṇasiṃha Bhāro, Basundharā Mayī, and Dhanadeva Bhāro were individuals who renovated aphalcāwithin thepīṭhapremises, although it is not known whichphalcāwas specifically renovated. In addition, Basundharā Mayī established aguthiby making a land endowment in Ithari, Bhaktapur to commemorate the anniversary ritual of thephalcā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7e3598e9-13d4-4973-a880-4874fdb67368> ;
