        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a gilt gilded pinnacle and construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the inscription, King Raṇajit Malla and other noblemen (pañca, lit. 'five elders') wrote a play called Rukmiṇīharaṇa and presented thepīṭhawith a gilded pinnacle. Additionally, they constructed a five-bayedphalcāwithin thepīṭhapremises and directed that the occasion be commemorated every year on the 2nd day of the bright fortnight of Jyeṣṭha (Jeṭha)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7e3598e9-13d4-4973-a880-4874fdb67368> ;
