    rdfs:label "Construction of the Present-Day Temple Structure"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Previously, there was no temple to house Vagalāmukhī. Prime Minister Bhīma Śamśera constructed the present-day temple to house her. Following the completion of the temple, a hundred and eight goats were sacrificed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7f398f5a-a97b-4bb8-9261-b8a0cd448ae7> ;
