    rdfs:label "Pavement with Stone Slabs"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pātravaṃśa Gaṇeśa Lāla Rāvata from the Pātravaṃśa clan, who is the eldest son of Kṛṣṇa Sundara of Tum Bāhāḥ Ṭola, paved the Vagalāmukhī compound with stone slabs. On that occasion, he also repaired the shrine of the Goddess."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7f398f5a-a97b-4bb8-9261-b8a0cd448ae7> ;
