        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of a Guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Some devotees of Vagalāmukhī established aguṭhīby collecting donations. Their aim was to buy threeropanīsof land to sponsor the ghee and oil required for the daily worship andbhajanachanting. The names of the donors are inscribed on the pillar."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7f398f5a-a97b-4bb8-9261-b8a0cd448ae7> ;
