    rdfs:label "Mention of khaṭajātrā of Mhāsukhvāḥmāju"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mhāsukhvāḥmāju was dismounted from her seat at the Dyaḥchẽ and brought to the town of Sankhu. This probably is the earliest historic record of thekhaṭajātrāof Mhāsukhvāḥmāju."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7f65c791-011e-43e9-8249-60d1c8614c2f> ;
