<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7f65c791-011e-43e9-8249-60d1c8614c2f_12> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The family of Lieutenant Colonel Indra Bahādura Śāha of Bāhuna Gāũ in Sakuna Maijā of Salyāna offers a bell. As a portion of the inscription is covered by some substance, the full content of the inscription is unclear. But there is a name, Major Iśvarī Bahādura Śāha, inscribed above the main inscription, which is a later addition. Probably, Iśvarī Bahādura Śāha was the main donor and his name was inscribed again after it was covered by the substance in the original inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7f65c791-011e-43e9-8249-60d1c8614c2f> ;
    rdfs:comment "The family of Lieutenant Colonel Indra Bahādura Śāha of Bāhuna Gāũ in Sakuna Maijā of Salyāna offers a bell. As a portion of the inscription is covered by some substance, the full content of the inscription is unclear. But there is a name, Major Iśvarī Bahādura Śāha, inscribed above the main inscription, which is a later addition. Probably, Iśvarī Bahādura Śāha was the main donor and his name was inscribed again after it was covered by the substance in the original inscription."@en ;
