<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7f65c791-011e-43e9-8249-60d1c8614c2f_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Death of King Pratāpa Malla halts Mhāsukhvāḥmāju's procession"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Pratāpa Malla died on the 11th/12th of the bright fortnight of Caitra in 1674 CE (NS 794). The annual procession of Mhāsukhvāḥmāju was not observed that year. It was possibly the only occasion in history when the procession was not taken out."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7f65c791-011e-43e9-8249-60d1c8614c2f> ;
    rdfs:comment "King Pratāpa Malla died on the 11th/12th of the bright fortnight of Caitra in 1674 CE (NS 794). The annual procession of Mhāsukhvāḥmāju was not observed that year. It was possibly the only occasion in history when the procession was not taken out."@en ;
