<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7f65c791-011e-43e9-8249-60d1c8614c2f_5> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Palanquin of Svayambhū Caitya lands on the ground"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The palanquin of Svayambhū Caitya lands on the ground, as the people carrying it failed to maintain their balance. It was not taken to be a serious incident and no ritual for auspiciousness was performed. Shortly afterward, King Pārthivendra Malla’s mother passed away in 1683 CE (NS 803)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7f65c791-011e-43e9-8249-60d1c8614c2f> ;
    rdfs:comment "The palanquin of Svayambhū Caitya lands on the ground, as the people carrying it failed to maintain their balance. It was not taken to be a serious incident and no ritual for auspiciousness was performed. Shortly afterward, King Pārthivendra Malla’s mother passed away in 1683 CE (NS 803)."@en ;
