    rdfs:label "Offering of stone lions"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription on the pedestal of the guardian lion (A) [see object number SAT0010-002 above] can hardly be deciphered due to erosion. Only the date when the inscription was issued and a few other letters are readable. Thus, its actual content remains obscure."@en ;
