<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7fd5e55f-876c-48f9-b974-357b58fec2c3_4> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A copper-plate inscription posted on the door of the Temple records the offering of atoraṇain 1888 CE (VS 1945) [cf.Pruscha 1975, p. 265]. After the Temple was rebuilt in 2018 CE, the old door with the inscription was replaced by a new one. Thetoraṇaatop of the new door contains an inscription with the same date of the cooper-plate inscription. Thus, it is most likely that the newtoraṇainscription is a copy of the copper-plate."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7fd5e55f-876c-48f9-b974-357b58fec2c3> ;
    rdfs:comment "A copper-plate inscription posted on the door of the Temple records the offering of atoraṇain 1888 CE (VS 1945) [cf.Pruscha 1975, p. 265]. After the Temple was rebuilt in 2018 CE, the old door with the inscription was replaced by a new one. Thetoraṇaatop of the new door contains an inscription with the same date of the cooper-plate inscription. Thus, it is most likely that the newtoraṇainscription is a copy of the copper-plate."@en ;
