<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7fd5e55f-876c-48f9-b974-357b58fec2c3_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Hosting of Śrīmadbhāgavata Saptāhā to collect funds for renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the Temple remained in poor condition for a long period, the locals organized a religious program (week-long recitation of theŚrībhāgavata Mahāpurāṇa) in 2014 CE to collect donations and began the renovation in 2015 CE. However, the renovation was halted due to a massive earthquake that struck two days after the works began."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7fd5e55f-876c-48f9-b974-357b58fec2c3> ;
    rdfs:comment "After the Temple remained in poor condition for a long period, the locals organized a religious program (week-long recitation of theŚrībhāgavata Mahāpurāṇa) in 2014 CE to collect donations and began the renovation in 2015 CE. However, the renovation was halted due to a massive earthquake that struck two days after the works began."@en ;
