        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Temple after the 2015 earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 2018, the Śrī Viṣṇudevī Mandira Jīrṇoddhāra tathā Vyavasthāpana Samiti and the Department of Archaeology jointly reconstructed the Temple, which had suffered heavy damages during the 2015 earthquakes."@en ;
