<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/7ff507a0-e6dc-42c8-b60b-0d55098f1ae9_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of pillar 004"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Inscription of four or more lines at the basis of pillar 004.According to Dilli Raj Sharma, the inscription bears the date ŚS 1423 (1501 AD) (Sharma 2012, p. 183). According to the same author, this pillar, or pillar 005 inscription's reads the following:sakunamālā puṇyākrit putra suvaṃ, translated as 'on the pious work of Sakunmālā (her) son be well'."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7ff507a0-e6dc-42c8-b60b-0d55098f1ae9> ;
    rdfs:comment "Inscription of four or more lines at the basis of pillar 004.According to Dilli Raj Sharma, the inscription bears the date ŚS 1423 (1501 AD) (Sharma 2012, p. 183). According to the same author, this pillar, or pillar 005 inscription's reads the following:sakunamālā puṇyākrit putra suvaṃ, translated as 'on the pious work of Sakunmālā (her) son be well'."@en ;
