        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation and donation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A group led by Dāphā leaders Devanārāyaṇa Bāsukalā and Ratnavīra Suvāra of Byāsī collectively restored this arcaded platform. They also established an endowment in the name of the adjacenthiti(water spout), stipulating that the annual maintenance of both the Phalcāandhitishould be funded from the interest generated by this capital."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/7ff6b8c8-7d01-4e4c-bd40-cbae9cba70c7> ;
