    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After suffering damage from the 2015 CE earthquakes, the temple underwent renovation through collaborative efforts. The Kathmandu Valley Preservation Trust led the restoration, with funding from the US Ambassadors Fund for Cultural Preservation, and in cooperation with the Department of Archaeology."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8030a639-84d3-43eb-8eea-6f9a505c056a> ;
