<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/81196e13-6df7-43aa-8a21-8f6200b14b65_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction and endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Siddhimāna Rājabhaṇḍārī built the temple in the memory of his father Siddhinārāyaṇa Rājabhaṇḍārī and endowed some plots of land to aguṭhīto sustain the performance of the daily rituals. He also built Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa (KAT2636) and Siddhimukteśvara Mandira (KAT2637)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/81196e13-6df7-43aa-8a21-8f6200b14b65> ;
    rdfs:comment "Siddhimāna Rājabhaṇḍārī built the temple in the memory of his father Siddhinārāyaṇa Rājabhaṇḍārī and endowed some plots of land to aguṭhīto sustain the performance of the daily rituals. He also built Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa (KAT2636) and Siddhimukteśvara Mandira (KAT2637)."@en ;
