<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/81196e13-6df7-43aa-8a21-8f6200b14b65_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of Siddhi Sevā Āśrama"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Viṣṇudevī Rājabhaṇḍārī, a fifth-generation daughter-in-law of Siddhimāna, established a home for the elderly as ‘Siddhi Sevā Āśrama’ in thesataḥnext to the temple. As of January 2021, Siddhi Sevā Āśrama hosts seven elderly people. Viṣṇudevī together with her son and daughter-in-law take care of the temple and the elderly. They also perform the daily rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/81196e13-6df7-43aa-8a21-8f6200b14b65> ;
    rdfs:comment "Viṣṇudevī Rājabhaṇḍārī, a fifth-generation daughter-in-law of Siddhimāna, established a home for the elderly as ‘Siddhi Sevā Āśrama’ in thesataḥnext to the temple. As of January 2021, Siddhi Sevā Āśrama hosts seven elderly people. Viṣṇudevī together with her son and daughter-in-law take care of the temple and the elderly. They also perform the daily rituals."@en ;
