<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/81b361fb-d1f6-480c-8741-e08d7a1ec834_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the Bāhāḥ's dyaḥchẽ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Raṇa Bahādura Śāha, Ghanavīramāna (text: Ghnavilamāna) along with his wife Gunamati, son Vīrasiṃhadeva (text: Virasiṃghadeo), and daughter Pammalakṣmī renovated the Bāhāḥ’s main building (kvāḥpāḥchẽ). A broken arm of the Kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ was also fixed by performing the ten rites of passage (daśakarma) on the statue on the occasion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/81b361fb-d1f6-480c-8741-e08d7a1ec834> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the reign of King Raṇa Bahādura Śāha, Ghanavīramāna (text: Ghnavilamāna) along with his wife Gunamati, son Vīrasiṃhadeva (text: Virasiṃghadeo), and daughter Pammalakṣmī renovated the Bāhāḥ’s main building (kvāḥpāḥchẽ). A broken arm of the Kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ was also fixed by performing the ten rites of passage (daśakarma) on the statue on the occasion."@en ;
