    rdfs:label "Replacing wooden kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ with stone one"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Rājendra Vikrama Śāha, Amṛtamuni Vajrācārya and others replaced the worn-out statue of the Kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ made of wood with a stone one."@en ;
