<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/834f87e7-78a7-4012-a388-cfe5bb6f51c7_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the temple, land endowment, and cash donation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mukti Mādhava and his wife Cikidhi Thakuni of Kilāgala Ṭola, from the house called Sālaṅhechẽ, renovated the temple, endowed some plots of land, and donated two-hundredmohorasfor the continuation of the annual rituals. The inscription also records the position of the planets and a list of things that must be used in the annual rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/834f87e7-78a7-4012-a388-cfe5bb6f51c7> ;
