        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the śivālaya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Commander Colonel Śoṇajaṅga Rāṇā built the Bakhatamukteśvara temple in memory of his father Bakhatajaṅga Kũvara Rāṇā, along with anotherśivālaya, Rakṣāmukteśvara, together on a single plinth."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/83a32702-2c1c-424a-93e2-8bcd2adbea74> ;
    rdfs:comment "Commander Colonel Śoṇajaṅga Rāṇā built the Bakhatamukteśvara temple in memory of his father Bakhatajaṅga Kũvara Rāṇā, along with anotherśivālaya, Rakṣāmukteśvara, together on a single plinth."@en ;
