<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/83d25607-b6cf-4031-bb2a-36e1532ced6a_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Dismantling of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There was a three-bayed Phalcā exactly at the place where the concrete building has been erected today. As remains from the older phalcā, an inscription and a statue of Triratna have been embedded into the new building. The Phalcā was dismantled and replaced by a water tank in the middle of the 1990s. Thereafter, a two-storeyed building was erected on the water tank. That building has been using by a social organization - Kirtipur Vācanālaya for decades."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/83d25607-b6cf-4031-bb2a-36e1532ced6a> ;
    rdfs:comment "There was a three-bayed Phalcā exactly at the place where the concrete building has been erected today. As remains from the older phalcā, an inscription and a statue of Triratna have been embedded into the new building. The Phalcā was dismantled and replaced by a water tank in the middle of the 1990s. Thereafter, a two-storeyed building was erected on the water tank. That building has been using by a social organization - Kirtipur Vācanālaya for decades."@en ;
