<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/83d25607-b6cf-4031-bb2a-36e1532ced6a_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Beautification of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kirtipur municipality planned to beautify the two-storey building in a \"traditional\" way. The facade of the building was covered withdāci appā, struts and sãjhyāḥ were installed and the concrete slab of the top was replaced with a tiled roof. The task was completed in 2020 September and inaugurated by the Mayor of the municipality on the 30th day of November 2020."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/83d25607-b6cf-4031-bb2a-36e1532ced6a> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kirtipur municipality planned to beautify the two-storey building in a \"traditional\" way. The facade of the building was covered withdāci appā, struts and sãjhyāḥ were installed and the concrete slab of the top was replaced with a tiled roof. The task was completed in 2020 September and inaugurated by the Mayor of the municipality on the 30th day of November 2020."@en ;
