<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/83ea2b07-c61b-4ee3-8eac-5f3da57c9142_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The phalcā was built by Kṛṣṇanārāṃ Dhvaṃvacā, together with his son and nephews. He also endowed a plot of land to establish aguṭhīfor thephalcā’s upkeep and to support associated social and religious activities. These included the daily lighting of a lamp at the Kvasimāināy Gaṇeśa Mandira and the distribution of rice, paddy, andcatāṃmarī(thick pancake made of rice flour) on the 1st day of Vaiśākha during the Biskeṭa Jātrā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/83ea2b07-c61b-4ee3-8eac-5f3da57c9142> ;
    rdfs:comment "The phalcā was built by Kṛṣṇanārāṃ Dhvaṃvacā, together with his son and nephews. He also endowed a plot of land to establish aguṭhīfor thephalcā’s upkeep and to support associated social and religious activities. These included the daily lighting of a lamp at the Kvasimāināy Gaṇeśa Mandira and the distribution of rice, paddy, andcatāṃmarī(thick pancake made of rice flour) on the 1st day of Vaiśākha during the Biskeṭa Jātrā."@en ;
