<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/85bd4cee-da51-4014-8b9b-b7d18e47ba23_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thecaityawas established by families living southeast of Yaśodharā Mahāvihāra, including Jagajyoti Vajrācārya and Lakṣmījyoti Vajrācārya. Statue of Mahāmañjuśrī, Gaṇeśa, and Mahākāla were also installed to the east of thecaitya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/85bd4cee-da51-4014-8b9b-b7d18e47ba23> ;
    rdfs:comment "Thecaityawas established by families living southeast of Yaśodharā Mahāvihāra, including Jagajyoti Vajrācārya and Lakṣmījyoti Vajrācārya. Statue of Mahāmañjuśrī, Gaṇeśa, and Mahākāla were also installed to the east of thecaitya."@en ;
