    rdfs:label "Renovation of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the 1980s, Götz Hagmüller, who was leading the Bhaktapur Development Project, obtained permission from the thenmahantato use two floors of the monastery for residential purposes. He renovated themaṭhaduring that decade to make it more suitable for living. He continued to carry out minor renovations from time to time thereafter."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/85bddcbe-1dbd-43e6-9ff8-58053a32d834> ;
