    rdfs:label "Construction of Dharmadhātu Maṇḍala"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Harṣarāja and his family established twodharmadhātu maṇḍalasin two different places on the same date. One was established in Mū Guitaḥ Bahī and the other was established in the nearby Cīdhã Bahī (LAL1970). The inscription regarding the establishment of themaṇḍalais located in Cīdhã Bahī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/870f3118-e67b-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
