        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a capāḥ ?"@en ;
    dcterms:description "One of the inscriptions in the Phalcā from 1806 CE (NS 927) records something done to acapāḥby Cikidhika Mānandhara (text: Mannadhara), the donor from Phasikyaba in Thãhiti, and others from Kathmandu. Unfortunately, the content of the inscription is not clear due to the illegibility of the text. It refers to acapāḥbut it is unclear if a newcapāḥwas constructed or a pre-existing one was renovated."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8720230c-b399-41b7-a0db-08f7116f4612> ;
