        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thesataḥwas already in a dilapidated state prior to the earthquakes of 2015 CE. The seismic events in 2015 CE inflicted further severe damage upon thesataḥ. Consequently, the Vāgamatī Sabhyatā Ekīkṛta Vikāsa Samiti, operating under the Ministry of Urban Development, undertook the reconstruction efforts with financial support from the Asian Development Bank. The reconstruction project was completed on October 23, 2022 CE (Kartik 6, VS 2079)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8720f8e8-8c02-4a67-914d-743cbc876535> ;
