<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/87e25c28-82d3-4774-bfb4-808e6eb07ace_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Signing over the Bāhāḥ to a Bhikṣu Saṅgha"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Since it was not possible to run the daily operations of the Bāhāḥ, itssaṅghamembers, Yogaratna Śākya, Munirāja Śākya, Teja Bahādura Śākya, and others, handed over the Bāhāḥ to a Bhikṣu Saṅgha (an organization of some monks who practice at the Therāvāda school of Buddhism)in 2000 VS (1943 CE). Later in 2007 VS (1950 CE), it came under the jurisdiction of this organization."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/87e25c28-82d3-4774-bfb4-808e6eb07ace> ;
    rdfs:comment "Since it was not possible to run the daily operations of the Bāhāḥ, itssaṅghamembers, Yogaratna Śākya, Munirāja Śākya, Teja Bahādura Śākya, and others, handed over the Bāhāḥ to a Bhikṣu Saṅgha (an organization of some monks who practice at the Therāvāda school of Buddhism)in 2000 VS (1943 CE). Later in 2007 VS (1950 CE), it came under the jurisdiction of this organization."@en ;
