    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Descendants of Narabahādura, together with the daughters and sisters of Motilāla, undertook the cleaning of the spring source and installed the water pipe system to restore thehiti’s function.ताहाखेल बस्ने नरबहादुरको सन्तानहरु र मोतीलालको छोरीहरू र बहिनी सबै मिली यस हितिको मुहान सफा गरी पाईप लगाई जीर्णोद्धार गरेको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/88c4a88e-36ad-4694-b5cc-e099cca143f4> ;
