    rdfs:label "Construction of the well and Śivaliṅga"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription from 1799 CE (NS 840) mentions that a Śivaliṅga and a well were constructed here in the names of Makaranda Purī and his disciple Sundara Purī.नेसं ८४० (सन् १७१९) को अभिलेखमा मकरन्द पुरी र उनका शिष्य सुन्दर पुरी दुईका नाममा यहाँ शिवलिङ्ग र इनार निर्माणको कुरा परेको।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/89c37d61-e8db-4b2d-9550-d8879f02d514> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription from 1799 CE (NS 840) mentions that a Śivaliṅga and a well were constructed here in the names of Makaranda Purī and his disciple Sundara Purī.नेसं ८४० (सन् १७१९) को अभिलेखमा मकरन्द पुरी र उनका शिष्य सुन्दर पुरी दुईका नाममा यहाँ शिवलिङ्ग र इनार निर्माणको कुरा परेको।"@en ;
