<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/89c37d61-e8db-4b2d-9550-d8879f02d514_10> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the earthquake in 2015 (V.S. 2072), the western building of the maṭha was severely damaged and completely demolished. As of December 2024, it has not yet been rebuilt.विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्पमा मठको पश्चिमी भवनमा क्षति पुगे पश्चात् पूर्णतः भत्काई पाताल पारिएको थियो जुन हालसम्म (डेसेम्बर 2024) बन्न सकेको छैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/89c37d61-e8db-4b2d-9550-d8879f02d514> ;
    rdfs:comment "After the earthquake in 2015 (V.S. 2072), the western building of the maṭha was severely damaged and completely demolished. As of December 2024, it has not yet been rebuilt.विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्पमा मठको पश्चिमी भवनमा क्षति पुगे पश्चात् पूर्णतः भत्काई पाताल पारिएको थियो जुन हालसम्म (डेसेम्बर 2024) बन्न सकेको छैन ।"@en ;
