    rdfs:label "Issuing Lālamohara by the King"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Rājendra issued a lālamohara to Pahalamānā Purī, authorizing him to manage the income from all the maṭha’s lands and oversee its traditional customs and practices (K_0117_0004).पहलमान पुरीलाई राजा राजेन्द्रले मठका सम्पूर्ण जग्गाको आय र चली आएको चाल-चलन व्यवस्थापन गर्न लालमोहर सुम्पेका थिए (K_0117_0004) ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/89c37d61-e8db-4b2d-9550-d8879f02d514> ;
