<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/89c37d61-e8db-4b2d-9550-d8879f02d514_8> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of a statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A stone statue of Mahanta Pahalamāna was installed. As with previous statues of mahantas, which were installed by their disciples, it is likely that the statue of Pahalamāna was also installed by one of his disciples. However, due to significant damage to the inscription, details about the individual who installed the statue are illegible.महन्त पहलमानको शिलाको प्रतिमा स्थापना गरियो । यहाँ भएका विगत स्थापित महन्तका प्रतिमाहरू शिष्यहरूबाट स्थापित भएकाले पहलमानको यस प्रतिमा पनि कुनै शिष्यबाट स्थापित जस्तो देखिन्छ । अभिलेखको धेरै भाग खिइसकेकाले प्रतिमा राख्ने व्यक्तिको विवरण जान्न सकिएको छैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/89c37d61-e8db-4b2d-9550-d8879f02d514> ;
    rdfs:comment "A stone statue of Mahanta Pahalamāna was installed. As with previous statues of mahantas, which were installed by their disciples, it is likely that the statue of Pahalamāna was also installed by one of his disciples. However, due to significant damage to the inscription, details about the individual who installed the statue are illegible.महन्त पहलमानको शिलाको प्रतिमा स्थापना गरियो । यहाँ भएका विगत स्थापित महन्तका प्रतिमाहरू शिष्यहरूबाट स्थापित भएकाले पहलमानको यस प्रतिमा पनि कुनै शिष्यबाट स्थापित जस्तो देखिन्छ । अभिलेखको धेरै भाग खिइसकेकाले प्रतिमा राख्ने व्यक्तिको विवरण जान्न सकिएको छैन ।"@en ;
