<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/89c9360f-f709-4ff5-91fc-955e3263562a_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Rāya Bhāratī Gosāīṃ (text: Rāya Bhārathi Gosāyi) endowed land to form aguthifor performing daily rituals and other activities at the Maṭha. He arranged for providing 1 kuruvā of rice and some salt for the devotees coming for worship at the Maṭha to be served dinner. Sitārāma Bhaṭṭa was the priest at the time."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/89c9360f-f709-4ff5-91fc-955e3263562a> ;
    rdfs:comment "Rāya Bhāratī Gosāīṃ (text: Rāya Bhārathi Gosāyi) endowed land to form aguthifor performing daily rituals and other activities at the Maṭha. He arranged for providing 1 kuruvā of rice and some salt for the devotees coming for worship at the Maṭha to be served dinner. Sitārāma Bhaṭṭa was the priest at the time."@en ;
