<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/89c9360f-f709-4ff5-91fc-955e3263562a_7> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of oil lamp balustrade and steps"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mahanta Hirālāla Bhāratī offered lamps (dalūpāḥ) together with Mohanamāyā Devī in 1907 CE (VS 1964). Later in 1915 CE (VS 1972), Nandalāla Bhāratī renovated the lamps. Kharidāra Bhāvalāla Bhāratī again renovated the lamps by installing stone balusters for them. He also renovated the steps of the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/89c9360f-f709-4ff5-91fc-955e3263562a> ;
    rdfs:comment "Mahanta Hirālāla Bhāratī offered lamps (dalūpāḥ) together with Mohanamāyā Devī in 1907 CE (VS 1964). Later in 1915 CE (VS 1972), Nandalāla Bhāratī renovated the lamps. Kharidāra Bhāvalāla Bhāratī again renovated the lamps by installing stone balusters for them. He also renovated the steps of the temple."@en ;
