    rdfs:label "Establishment of Saptarṣi Shrine"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Sahayogī Mahilā Didī Bahinī Samūha (a local social organisation working for women) established a Saptarṣi  Shrine. It is mentioned that the Shrine was constructed for theTījafestival, which is widely celebrated on the third day of the bright fortnight of Bhādra."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8ad6f527-a10b-4452-95dc-9d3ed9f9912d> ;
