    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Viṣṇu, Narasiṃha Bābu, Nārāyaṇa Bābu and other residents of Lagana Ṭola, Kathmandu donated funds for the construction of thesataḥand also bestowed land upon the monument. The inscription instructs devotees to perform a fire ritual (homa) and a sacrifice (bali) on the anniversary day of thesataḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8ad6f527-a10b-4452-95dc-9d3ed9f9912d> ;
