    rdfs:label "Set up a guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple priest Abhayānanda Rājopādhyāya (also known as Abhayānandopādhyāya) set up a trust for performing daily rituals on Dakṣiṇāmūrti by donating 20ropanīs of land that he received as a royal grant three years earlier. He also intended the donation to be used for cleaning the temple area and renovating the rest house there."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8b2107e2-946c-456f-871a-efda1f470838> ;
