    rdfs:label "Repairing the Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A fire broke out in the Vagalāmukhī Temple on March 15th, 2009 CE. It caused extensive damage to the Vagalāmukhī Temple and partial damage to the Temple of Unmatta Bhairava. Donations were raised for the renovation of the temple by forming Vagalāmukhī Temple Renovation Committee. In care of donations, both ​​temples were renovated."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8bd0dd8f-8bee-4b91-a977-d2b40db4a23c> ;
