    rdfs:label "Restoration"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Cvachẽ Phalcā was renovated using a donation of 90,000 Nep. Rupees. These funds were donated by Urban Development Through Local Effort (udle) and GTZ, and bricks were donated by a kiln. The local people assisted in the reconstruction as volunteers. The original beams and pillars were kept."@en ;
