    rdfs:label "Installation of a New Akṣobhya Statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The stone statue of Akṣobhya, enshrined in the sanctum inside thegandhakuṭī,was stolen long ago. Around VS 2072-2073 (2015-2016 CE), Satya Vajrācārya, a resident of Bhindya Bāhāḥ (LAL1880), installed a new Akṣobhya statue at the same place where the stolen statue was enshrined."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8c5e73b9-f669-4839-b375-093e33198b93> ;
