    rdfs:label "Addition of Lion statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Under the leadership ofduvāra(guard?) Saterāma (Satyarāma?) and his wife Vimmarā, residents of Macchegāũ, two lion images were consecrated in the name of Viṣṇudevī and Indrāyaṇī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8d927bbc-dbda-4ce1-b186-23a58e990fb6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Under the leadership ofduvāra(guard?) Saterāma (Satyarāma?) and his wife Vimmarā, residents of Macchegāũ, two lion images were consecrated in the name of Viṣṇudevī and Indrāyaṇī."@en ;
