<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/8d927bbc-dbda-4ce1-b186-23a58e990fb6_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thedāphā khalaḥ(musical association) of Nhutanikvātha (Macchegāũ) offered a bell (ghaṇṭa) in the name of Viṣṇudevī. This act was led by Manahora Thārra and Yatimanisiṃha Tharrā. In addition, several men and women together presented silver coins as offerings to Viṣṇudevī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8d927bbc-dbda-4ce1-b186-23a58e990fb6> ;
    rdfs:comment "Thedāphā khalaḥ(musical association) of Nhutanikvātha (Macchegāũ) offered a bell (ghaṇṭa) in the name of Viṣṇudevī. This act was led by Manahora Thārra and Yatimanisiṃha Tharrā. In addition, several men and women together presented silver coins as offerings to Viṣṇudevī."@en ;
