<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/8dcbb3fa-adcb-44ba-a375-698e466bb94d_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repair of the main deity (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ), construction of balconied pinnacle and installation of Vajrasattva statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bālagovindasiṃha Tulādhara (text: Tulādhara Bālagoviṃdasiṃha) refurbished the Bāhāḥ's main statue (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) in memory of his father Dharmānaṃdasiṃna, mother Vinayaśvarī, and elder brother Chatrasiṃha. He also built a balconied pinnacle (phucā) on the Bāhāḥ’s roof and installed a statue of Vajrasattva there."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8dcbb3fa-adcb-44ba-a375-698e466bb94d> ;
    rdfs:comment "Bālagovindasiṃha Tulādhara (text: Tulādhara Bālagoviṃdasiṃha) refurbished the Bāhāḥ's main statue (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) in memory of his father Dharmānaṃdasiṃna, mother Vinayaśvarī, and elder brother Chatrasiṃha. He also built a balconied pinnacle (phucā) on the Bāhāḥ’s roof and installed a statue of Vajrasattva there."@en ;
