    rdfs:label "Foundation of the Bāhāḥ and establishment of a Dharmadhātu Manḍala"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Two brothers, Kuladeva and Caityarāja (supported by Kuladeva’s son Mānadeva), had jointly built this Bāhāḥ, installed the aforementioned stone statue of Akṣobhya in the sanctum, and established a Dharmadhātu Manḍala in the Bāhāḥ’s courtyard in 1928 CE (NS 1048)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8e38f1ef-d6ec-4d1f-ae8f-e94e5d425013> ;
