    rdfs:label "Installation of a new statue of Akṣobhya as Bāhāḥ's primary deity (kvāḥpāḥdydaḥ) and renovation of the temple (kvāpāḥdegaḥ)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the previous stone statue of Akṣobhya enshrined askvāḥpāḥdyaḥwas stolen in 2012 CE, Jñānadeva Śākya, a resident of the area, installed the current brass made Akṣobhya statue in the sanctum. During this time, thekvāḥpāḥdegaḥwas also renovated."@en ;
