        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of new statue of kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thekvāḥpāḥdyaḥstatues of Gaganagañja and Samantabhadra Bodhisattva were stolen.ThapāḥjuLakṣmījyoti Śākya installed this new statue of thekvāḥpāḥdyaḥ.To commemorate this, an anniversary ritual worship of the deity is performed on the 12th day of the bright fortnight of Phālguna. Lakṣmījyoti Śākya also donated Rs 4000 for this worship."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8eeabc38-6103-11ea-8083-0242ac130006> ;
