    rdfs:label "Beautification of the chariot's roof  (B)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The roof of the chariot (Gaṇeśa khata), which is used during Indrāyaṇī jātrā had been covered with brass sheets. The readable names of the donors in the inscription are Jaganārāṃ Bhāvo and Bālakṛsna."@en ;
