        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Replacement of new statue after the theft"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After been stolen of the older statue, a newly made brass statue with an elephant throne was established in thedyaḥchẽ. It is mentioned in the inscription that the statue with the throne bears 10dhāranīand 8-pound weight."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8ef7a2bb-be68-438f-9902-2914c6ebc9f1> ;
