<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/8ef7a2bb-be68-438f-9902-2914c6ebc9f1_5> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of other objects"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The same Maharjana family (who had rebuilt the temple a year ago) added a pair of the lion in front of thedyaḥchẽand also established a bell at the upper plinth. Moreover, a newly made wooden toraṇa was also fixed over the entrance. The toraṇa was funded by Gaṇeśa Taṇḍukāra of Kutujvaḥ tole and entire task was handeled by United Youth Club."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8ef7a2bb-be68-438f-9902-2914c6ebc9f1> ;
