<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/8f5e6a23-ea42-4a90-b496-cca35276d255_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction after the earthquake of 2015 CE"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The metal-plate inscription records that following the damage caused by the 2015 CE earthquake, a committee was formed to oversee the reconstruction of the temple. The reconstruction work was inaugurated in 2016 CE (VS 2073, on the 14th day of the month), and the temple was reconsecrated in 2020 CE (VS 2077, on the 11th day of the month of Āṣāḍha). The inscription also lists the institutions and individuals who contributed donations toward the reconstruction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8f5e6a23-ea42-4a90-b496-cca35276d255> ;
    rdfs:comment "The metal-plate inscription records that following the damage caused by the 2015 CE earthquake, a committee was formed to oversee the reconstruction of the temple. The reconstruction work was inaugurated in 2016 CE (VS 2073, on the 14th day of the month), and the temple was reconsecrated in 2020 CE (VS 2077, on the 11th day of the month of Āṣāḍha). The inscription also lists the institutions and individuals who contributed donations toward the reconstruction."@en ;
