        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of golden kalaśa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Siddhinarasingh Malla, the chief monk of the Bahī (Thapaḥju) offered a goldenkalaśato the main deity of the Bahī. Mukundarāja Bhāro, Jivasaṃkha Bhāro, Viṣṇuśrī Kalyāṇa and Vitu Siṃha were given the responsibility of caring for it."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8f639858-8eec-11ea-8e56-0242ac130005> ;
