    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the esoteric god house"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The esoteric god house (dyaḥchẽ) of the Bahī was dilapidated and so rebuilt with the financial support of the Lalitpur Sub-Metropolitan Municipality. The locals bore 15 per cent of the cost and the Municipality took on 85 per cent of the cost."@en ;
