<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/8f7a0db3-8133-4eb5-97b0-8b0c8703aa82_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Handover of the Historical Statues to National Museum of Chhauni and Guṭhī Saṃsthāna"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Several historical statues were stored in this Bahāḥ, one of which dates between sixth and seventh century. A long internal debate amongst thesaṅghamembers took place in 1980 CE and resulted in the division of thesaṅghain two different groups. These groups decided to hand over some of the historical statues to the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna in 1980s and some to the National Museum on a later date."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8f7a0db3-8133-4eb5-97b0-8b0c8703aa82> ;
    rdfs:comment "Several historical statues were stored in this Bahāḥ, one of which dates between sixth and seventh century. A long internal debate amongst thesaṅghamembers took place in 1980 CE and resulted in the division of thesaṅghain two different groups. These groups decided to hand over some of the historical statues to the Guṭhī Saṃsthāna in 1980s and some to the National Museum on a later date."@en ;
