        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding the Dyaḥchẽ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following the 2015 CE earthquakes, the Department of Archaeology and thesaṅghamembers of the Bāhāḥ signed an agreement on the thirty-first day of Aṣāḍha, VS 2074 (2018 CE) for dismantling and rebuilding thedyaḥchẽ.The project had been successfully completed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8f7a0db3-8133-4eb5-97b0-8b0c8703aa82> ;
