    rdfs:label "Offering of Struts (C)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Ś. Śreṣṭha(VS 2057, 120) mentions that one of the struts supporting the balcony was replaced in NS ‘800 Caitra’ (1680 CE) by Paṇḍava. It is likely that thedyaḥchẽwas renovated at that time."@en ;
