<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/8fe22382-065c-4547-ad28-742223bf25e6_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Jagannātha temple, along with other structures surrounding the Tīna Devala complex, underwent reconstruction following the earthquakes of 2015 CE. The High-Powered Committee for Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization, operating under the Ministry of Urban Development, received financial support from the Asian Development Bank for the reconstruction efforts. The completion of the reconstruction works was officially declared in October 2022 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8fe22382-065c-4547-ad28-742223bf25e6> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Jagannātha temple, along with other structures surrounding the Tīna Devala complex, underwent reconstruction following the earthquakes of 2015 CE. The High-Powered Committee for Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization, operating under the Ministry of Urban Development, received financial support from the Asian Development Bank for the reconstruction efforts. The completion of the reconstruction works was officially declared in October 2022 CE."@en ;
