<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/8fe3c368-1cbc-11ea-b74e-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temporary shrine of Buṅgadyaḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The collapse of Karuṇāmaya Mandira (BUN0001) in the devastating earthquakes of 2015 left Buṅgadyaḥ without a home. Thesaṅghaof 31pānejusof Bungmati built this shrine on the dance platform to temporarely house the deity. Four stone lions and a bell were also moved to this temporary shrine."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/8fe3c368-1cbc-11ea-b74e-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The collapse of Karuṇāmaya Mandira (BUN0001) in the devastating earthquakes of 2015 left Buṅgadyaḥ without a home. Thesaṅghaof 31pānejusof Bungmati built this shrine on the dance platform to temporarely house the deity. Four stone lions and a bell were also moved to this temporary shrine."@en ;
