    rdfs:label "Erection of a stone pillar with statue of shrew"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his deceased father Kṛṣṇa Prajāpatī and mothers Purṇamāyā and Jñānamāyā, Tīrtha Prajāpatī, along with his family members, installed a stone pillar with a cast metal figure of a shrew, the animal mount of Gaṇeśa."@en ;
