<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/911c76c5-2991-472c-9412-af01e78ef9ac_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of toraṇa and gilded pinnacle to Nāsaḥdyaḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mukundasiṃ, Rudrasiṃ, and other members of the Dāphā group jointly offered a toraṇa and a gilded finial to Nāsaḥdyaḥ. At that time, the Nāsaḥdyaḥ temple had not yet been built, it existed only as a shrine.मुकुन्दसिं, रुद्रसिं लगायतका दाफा खलकका सदस्यहरूले मिलेर नासःद्यःलाई तोरण र सुनको मोलम्बा लगाइएको गजूर चढाएका थिए । त्यस बेलासम्म नासःद्यःको मन्दिर बनेको थिएन, देवस्थलको रूपमा मात्र स्थापना गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/911c76c5-2991-472c-9412-af01e78ef9ac> ;
    rdfs:comment "Mukundasiṃ, Rudrasiṃ, and other members of the Dāphā group jointly offered a toraṇa and a gilded finial to Nāsaḥdyaḥ. At that time, the Nāsaḥdyaḥ temple had not yet been built, it existed only as a shrine.मुकुन्दसिं, रुद्रसिं लगायतका दाफा खलकका सदस्यहरूले मिलेर नासःद्यःलाई तोरण र सुनको मोलम्बा लगाइएको गजूर चढाएका थिए । त्यस बेलासम्म नासःद्यःको मन्दिर बनेको थिएन, देवस्थलको रूपमा मात्र स्थापना गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
