    rdfs:label "Additional endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The king added an additional 25ropanīs of land grant to Hanumantasiṃha Amātya, who previously received 150ropanīs of land grant, and mandated that anyone settling on this land must contribute to the upkeep of the bridge. The inscription can be found at the Hanumān Devala (LAL2851) in Kupondole."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/91ae947b-5f53-49ec-82f2-a6e9445ead42> ;
