    rdfs:label "Installation of inscription"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Candra Śamśera installed an inscription recording the construction of the bridge that was completed in only 131 days. This is the longest inscription with embossed text. This iron bridge was known as \"Red Bridge\" due to its color."@en ;
