    rdfs:label "Renovation of caityas"@en ;
    dcterms:description "At the reigning period of King Śivasiṃha Malla, Minister Luṃguḍo Bhāro and his wife Jayamayi renovated thesecaityas. They also performed fire ritual worship and installed the statues of Five Buddhas."@en ;
