    rdfs:label "Paving the courtyard and establishment deities"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The reconstruction committee installed the statue of Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara. At the same time, the committee paved stones on the courtyard and made a compound wall with praying wheels. The committee also installed statues of 16 gods which are placed inside the tiny rooms made at the southern corner of the courtyard."@en ;
