<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/937ecfa8-3a1d-45c5-b900-96a71cfd3a23_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Vatsalā Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Bhaktapur Municipality reconstructed the Vatsalā temple, which had been severely damaged in the 2015 CE (VS 2072) earthquake.भक्तपुर नगरपालिकाले विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्पले क्षति पुगेको वत्सला मन्दिरको पुनर्निर्माण गरेको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/937ecfa8-3a1d-45c5-b900-96a71cfd3a23> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Bhaktapur Municipality reconstructed the Vatsalā temple, which had been severely damaged in the 2015 CE (VS 2072) earthquake.भक्तपुर नगरपालिकाले विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्पले क्षति पुगेको वत्सला मन्दिरको पुनर्निर्माण गरेको थियो ।"@en ;
