<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/937f42c4-d4a7-41c8-b259-3272b9a37638_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jñana Bahādura Maharjana, the caretaker of the Temple, took initiative to renovate it in 1997 CE (VS 2054). During that renovation, the lower part of theśivaliṅga, which is called Brahmā section, was brought above the ground. Usually, as mentioned before, the Brahmā section of aśivaliṅgaremains underneath the ground."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/937f42c4-d4a7-41c8-b259-3272b9a37638> ;
