    rdfs:label "Initial construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Viśvasiṃha (also spelled as Visvasiṃha) Bhāro of the Bāghabhairava temple area erected the stone shrine of Bhājaṅgāla Degudyaḥ by installing a Gaṇeśa statue. This construction was undertaken to appease his tutelary deity Bhavānī, who was already present at the location."@en ;
