    rdfs:label "Offering of Brass Flags"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 1996 CE, Purṇamāna Nakarmī and his family members offered two bronze flags in front of the main entrance of the temple, in the name of his late parents, Rājamāna Nakarmī and Nānī Nakarmī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/95211cfa-694d-4f3b-8f94-fe9191041187> ;
