<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/95211cfa-694d-4f3b-8f94-fe9191041187_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 1997 CE, the temple was renovated under the leadership of Vijaya Bahādura Mālī. The Kathmandu Municipality Ward Number 17 funded 380,000 rupess, and other necessary expenses were covered by collecting offerings from the devotees. This temple did not suffer any damages in the 2015 CE earthquakes."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/95211cfa-694d-4f3b-8f94-fe9191041187> ;
