    rdfs:label "Installation of the Mouse Pillar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A pillar was installed in front of the temple. Avāhana(vehicle) of the lord Gaṇeśa, the mouse, was placed atop of the pillar which was built by Rāma Dāsa Mānandhara and his family members in 2003 CE."@en ;
