    dcterms:description "The resident of Dhobīcaur, Rāmdās Mānandhara, financed and built the Rāma-Sītā-Laksmaṇa Temple, Rādhā-Kṛṣṇa Temple, and installed a statue of Hanumān at the back of Bhuḍe Gaṇeśa in 2010 CE."@en ;
