        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of Rāma-Lakṣmaṇa-Sītā and Rādhā Kṛṣṇa Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The resident of Dhovīcaur, Rāmdāsa Mānandhara, built the Rāma-Lakṣmaṇa-Sītā and Rādhā Kṛṣṇa temples. Moreover, he installed a statue of Hanumān behind Bhodikha Gaṇeśa temple. The Mānandhara family also covered the roof of the newly built temple with brass plates."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/95211cfa-694d-4f3b-8f94-fe9191041187> ;
