<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/95ae1a0f-e0e0-42bf-8101-4507d5462b17_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The construction date of the original Guru Nānaka Ghara is not documented. According to the Maharaja of the Akhaḍā (male, age 65), Guru Nānaka (1469–1539) visited Kathmandu and stayed at this place and a temple to Guru Nānaka must have existed here for hundreds of years. Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā built the surroundingsataḥ(KAT2831 Udāsī Akhadā) in the late 1870s."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/95ae1a0f-e0e0-42bf-8101-4507d5462b17> ;
    rdfs:comment "The construction date of the original Guru Nānaka Ghara is not documented. According to the Maharaja of the Akhaḍā (male, age 65), Guru Nānaka (1469–1539) visited Kathmandu and stayed at this place and a temple to Guru Nānaka must have existed here for hundreds of years. Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā built the surroundingsataḥ(KAT2831 Udāsī Akhadā) in the late 1870s."@en ;
