    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "On the thirty-first day of Aṣāḍha, 2018 CE (VS 2074), the Department of Archaeology and thesaṅghamembers of Cilancva Bāhāḥ signed an agreement to restore the caitya,dyaḥchẽand thisPhalcā. The project was successfully completed in 2019."@en ;
