<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9678e772-3686-4850-9458-f8f5cea7ea44_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Surendra, through alālamoharaissued in the name of Badrīnarasiṃha Kũvara, endorses the donation of land parcels in favor of Jyotirbhakteśvara, along with two adjacentśivālayas, Līlābhakteśvara and Badrībhakteśvara in Mṛgasthalī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9678e772-3686-4850-9458-f8f5cea7ea44> ;
