<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/97276b3d-0f4d-4844-8d79-08aa48295358_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Offering statue of Amitābha"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the reconstruction of the ground floor of thedyaḥchẽ, Nirakumārī Vajrācārya, a resident of the Naudvã Ṭola, Lalitpur, along with her husband Mānavira Śākya and family members, donated a statue of Amitābha (BDG0030-001) to be enshrined in the sanctum. She also donated statues of Śākyamuni Buddha, Ṣaḍakṣarī Lokeśvara, and Āryatārā for the establishment in the sanctum."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/97276b3d-0f4d-4844-8d79-08aa48295358> ;
