        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Loss of the historic building"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The historicsataḥwas badly damaged in the 2015 earthquake, consequently demolished, and rebuilt as a simple brick and mortar shack, covered with a corrugated metal roof.Only one historic carved window was reused in the new building. All other historic materials, such as carved windows, doors, columns etc., were lost."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/972f5123-13f3-4fc6-b812-3592870cd4cf> ;
