        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of the statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to later chronicles, particularly theBhāṣāVaṃśāvalī, this statue was established by Amara Malla during his reign from 1529 to 1560 CE. The year of its construction is unknown due to the lack of an inscription."@en ;
