<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/97945f3f-64f5-4560-b611-1bc997a00710_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial Construction of the Temple and Land Endowment to GAuṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Siddhimāna Rājabhaṇḍārī constructed this temple in the memory of his deceased father Siddhinārāyaṇa Rājabhaṇḍārī and endowed some plots of land to aguṭhīto sustain the performance of the daily rituals. He also constructed Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa (KAT2636) and Dhaneśvara Mandira (KAT2638) on the same date."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/97945f3f-64f5-4560-b611-1bc997a00710> ;
    rdfs:comment "Siddhimāna Rājabhaṇḍārī constructed this temple in the memory of his deceased father Siddhinārāyaṇa Rājabhaṇḍārī and endowed some plots of land to aguṭhīto sustain the performance of the daily rituals. He also constructed Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa (KAT2636) and Dhaneśvara Mandira (KAT2638) on the same date."@en ;
