<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9808e800-1ed6-4791-9011-d0f79e47e57b_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā was badly damaged by the 2015 earthquakes. Therefore, Uttama Nārāyaṇa Śreṣṭha-the grandson of Candra Nārāyaṇa Śreṣṭha, got the Phalcā dismantled and rebuilt in 2016 CE. According to local oral tradition, Candra Nārāyaṇa had sponsored the construction of the Phalcā during the partyless Pañcāyata rule."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9808e800-1ed6-4791-9011-d0f79e47e57b> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Phalcā was badly damaged by the 2015 earthquakes. Therefore, Uttama Nārāyaṇa Śreṣṭha-the grandson of Candra Nārāyaṇa Śreṣṭha, got the Phalcā dismantled and rebuilt in 2016 CE. According to local oral tradition, Candra Nārāyaṇa had sponsored the construction of the Phalcā during the partyless Pañcāyata rule."@en ;
