    rdfs:label "Offering a patāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Ajay Bajaj and Mukta Bajaj from India offered brasspatāḥ(metal banners) to the deity. Local resident Yogendra Tandukar assisted them with this, and so the name of his mother (Ganga Devi) has also been engraved on the banner."@en ;
