        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of Śikharakūṭa Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Śākyas from the Cola Nani constructed the Śikharakūṭacaitya(BUN0023-003) and established aguṭhīfor its management. The names of the main donors could not be deciphered due to the poor condition of the inscription. However, it appears that Namo Siṃju, Ranhāvatī, Dhanasiṃ Jyoti, Śrī Bhāgi Siṃja and others made thecaitya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/990ceb20-1c32-11ea-b9b1-0242ac130002> ;
