<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/995c1376-9e84-42a2-8f05-38b8d8a32a23_8> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Formation of organization for Guṃlā Bājā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "To ensure the continuity of the Guṃlā Bājā (a traditional musical procession held during the holy month Guṃlā), a non-expendable fund (akṣayakoṣa) was established through collective donations while also forming an organization to oversee the musical performances."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/995c1376-9e84-42a2-8f05-38b8d8a32a23> ;
    rdfs:comment "To ensure the continuity of the Guṃlā Bājā (a traditional musical procession held during the holy month Guṃlā), a non-expendable fund (akṣayakoṣa) was established through collective donations while also forming an organization to oversee the musical performances."@en ;
