    rdfs:label "Installation of marble inscription"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A marble inscription commemorates the formation of an organization by setting up a non-expendable trust by the locals, highlighting the community’s efforts to institutionalize the tradition of performing the Guṃlā Bājā ensemble of drums and cymbals."@en ;
