    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Along with his family members, Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa Bhāro constructed the two-tiered temple with a gilded finial and enshrined a statue of Lokeśvara. He also established agūṭhīof NRs 201 to fund daily and annual rituals at the temple."@en ;
