    rdfs:label "Repairing of brass cover of threshold"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The brass sheet with embossed designs that clads the threshold of the main entrance was renovated. It was originally installed by Bhājumuni, his wife Devi Thakuṃ and Punerāja in memory of their deceased family member Gajaratna Śākya. The name of the person to renovate it is not mentioned in the inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9a058b9e-b8bf-48aa-97a1-2535bee09bb4> ;
