    rdfs:label "Restoration of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In a collaborative initiative, the Kathmandu Valley Preservation Trust carried out the restoration of the temple during the period of 2004-2005 CE, in collaboration with the Department of Archaeology and the Kathmandu Metropolis. This endeavor was made possible through financial support generously provided by the US Ambassadors Fund for Cultural Preservation."@en ;
