    rdfs:label "Repair of shrine"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Heramba Bahādura Rājabhaṇḍārī and his family renovated the Vajrayoginī shrine, adding a new door, in memory of his parents, Dhīrja Bahādura and mother Cinīyālakṣmī Rājabhaṇḍārī. He also had the shrine's courtyard paved with marble."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9a66be05-ea61-4fe9-a286-724147fbf7b8> ;
