    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The bell that initially belonged to the nearby Indrabhakteśvara temple (KAT2650) has been relocated and installed on the plinth of this temple. This was likely intended as a temporary measure, given the collapsed stone bell support at the Indrabhakteśvara temple. However, it has remained in its current location since then."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9bf90959-b808-41dc-be3a-7a6d151d7fb2> ;
