        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a stone caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription embedded into the wall of the Phalcā does not belong to the Phalcā itself, but it records the construction of a stonecaityaaround the Svayambhūnātha area by Kāji Vaṃdhu Rāṇā and his wife Kājinī Jayakumār. However, thecaityacould not be identified at present."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9d4436ef-a0b8-44e1-9090-2ebc3e2a8bf0> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription embedded into the wall of the Phalcā does not belong to the Phalcā itself, but it records the construction of a stonecaityaaround the Svayambhūnātha area by Kāji Vaṃdhu Rāṇā and his wife Kājinī Jayakumār. However, thecaityacould not be identified at present."@en ;
