<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9d4436ef-a0b8-44e1-9090-2ebc3e2a8bf0_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Svayambhū Vyavasthāpana ra Saṃrakṣaṇa Mahāsamiti began reconstructing the dilapidated Phalcā right before the 2015 earthquakes. By the time of the 2015 earthquakes, the brick walls were already completed. The walls built with newdāciaḥpāandmāaḥpābricks laid in cement mortar suffered no damages. After a break of about a year due to the earthquakes, the reconstruction concluded in around October 2016 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9d4436ef-a0b8-44e1-9090-2ebc3e2a8bf0> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Svayambhū Vyavasthāpana ra Saṃrakṣaṇa Mahāsamiti began reconstructing the dilapidated Phalcā right before the 2015 earthquakes. By the time of the 2015 earthquakes, the brick walls were already completed. The walls built with newdāciaḥpāandmāaḥpābricks laid in cement mortar suffered no damages. After a break of about a year due to the earthquakes, the reconstruction concluded in around October 2016 CE."@en ;
