<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9d5039d0-e979-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_5> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The earthquake of 2015 severely affected the temple. The temple was badly damaged and was about to collapse. Local people immediately launched a restoration project without any government support. The restoration work is now finished and preparations for a ceremony to celebrate its completion are underway."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9d5039d0-e979-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The earthquake of 2015 severely affected the temple. The temple was badly damaged and was about to collapse. Local people immediately launched a restoration project without any government support. The restoration work is now finished and preparations for a ceremony to celebrate its completion are underway."@en ;
