    rdfs:label "Initial construction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription placed at the west wall of the temple mentions that the initial construction of this temple took place in 1699 CE. At the same time, the land was also endowed as a source of its annual rituals and take care of the monument."@en ;
