    dcterms:description "There is a deteriorated inscription on the eastern wall of the temple. The inscription inscribed in the Newari script is hardly readable. A phrase ‘yasa madakāra khalaka’ could be deciphered. It expresses that a Madakāra family performed some activity in the temple."@en ;
