    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the earthquakes, the High-Powered Committee for Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization, under the Ministry of Urban Development, spearheaded the reconstruction of this temple, along with several others in the Tīna Devala premises. The project, funded by the Asian Development Bank, was successfully concluded in October 2022 CE."@en ;
