<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9f7d86ba-e6c5-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Aśoka Stūpa Phalcā was dismantled and rebuilt without the incorporation of any of the original materials. The construction was funded by Lalitpur Metropolitan city (7,370,749 NRS) and undertaken by people from Kvaylāchi Cyāsal Tole. The marble inscription has been incorporated into the western side of the front façade (S)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9f7d86ba-e6c5-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Aśoka Stūpa Phalcā was dismantled and rebuilt without the incorporation of any of the original materials. The construction was funded by Lalitpur Metropolitan city (7,370,749 NRS) and undertaken by people from Kvaylāchi Cyāsal Tole. The marble inscription has been incorporated into the western side of the front façade (S)."@en ;
