<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9f7e7e0a-af62-47e3-991d-e1efdddaba8d_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage suffered from the earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Despite surviving the 2015 earthquakes, thesataḥsustained significant structural damage from the tremors. Presently, a substantial tarpaulin has been employed to shield the roof from rainwater. According to local accounts, the ownership of thesataḥlies in private hands and the renovation of thesataḥremains in a state of uncertainty due to an ongoing family dispute."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9f7e7e0a-af62-47e3-991d-e1efdddaba8d> ;
