<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9fd3dca8-39d8-40ad-a48f-02fd56e43b83_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of a stone inscription"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After completing the construction of thedyaḥchẽ, installing the images of the deities, and arranging theguṭhīfor land and festival management, Viṣṇumāna Siṃha Śreṣṭha commemorated his benefaction by inscribing a stone tablet recording his contributions in 1865 (VS 1922).विष्णुमान सिं श्रेष्ठले भद्रकालीको लागि द्यःछेँ बनाई जात्रा गर्ने देवीदेवताको मूर्ति स्थापना गरी खेत गुठी राखेर जात्राको लागि सबै व्यवस्था मिलाइसकेपछि आफूले राखेको कीर्तिबारे शिलालेख कुँदाएर स्थापना गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9fd3dca8-39d8-40ad-a48f-02fd56e43b83> ;
    rdfs:comment "After completing the construction of thedyaḥchẽ, installing the images of the deities, and arranging theguṭhīfor land and festival management, Viṣṇumāna Siṃha Śreṣṭha commemorated his benefaction by inscribing a stone tablet recording his contributions in 1865 (VS 1922).विष्णुमान सिं श्रेष्ठले भद्रकालीको लागि द्यःछेँ बनाई जात्रा गर्ने देवीदेवताको मूर्ति स्थापना गरी खेत गुठी राखेर जात्राको लागि सबै व्यवस्था मिलाइसकेपछि आफूले राखेको कीर्तिबारे शिलालेख कुँदाएर स्थापना गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
