<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/9ff7fad8-e68b-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Dhanajoti of Mayūravarṇa Mahāvihāra endowed aguṭhīin his father Dhana's name. Using the income of theguṭhīland, Daśapāramitā Ājus of Mayūravarṇa Mahāvihāra are given presents and fed annually on 12th day of the bright half Pauṣa  Similarly,piṇḍais offered to Dhanaon the 13th day. Harṣamuni takes care of these rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/9ff7fad8-e68b-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Dhanajoti of Mayūravarṇa Mahāvihāra endowed aguṭhīin his father Dhana's name. Using the income of theguṭhīland, Daśapāramitā Ājus of Mayūravarṇa Mahāvihāra are given presents and fed annually on 12th day of the bright half Pauṣa  Similarly,piṇḍais offered to Dhanaon the 13th day. Harṣamuni takes care of these rituals."@en ;
