<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a0067903-e67a-4795-97b3-1e943372ca47_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The major festival of Kirtipur- Indrāyaṇī Jātrā starts from this place (where this Phalcā is located). Hence, this place is culturally very important for the people of Kirtipur. That is why KIrtipur Municipality decided to build a newphalcāhere. It was constructed in 2019 CE by the Municipality and the help of local residents and formally inaugurated by the Mayor, Ramesh Maharjan."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a0067903-e67a-4795-97b3-1e943372ca47> ;
    rdfs:comment "The major festival of Kirtipur- Indrāyaṇī Jātrā starts from this place (where this Phalcā is located). Hence, this place is culturally very important for the people of Kirtipur. That is why KIrtipur Municipality decided to build a newphalcāhere. It was constructed in 2019 CE by the Municipality and the help of local residents and formally inaugurated by the Mayor, Ramesh Maharjan."@en ;
