<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a0a959a5-3d62-4bf3-bca7-baf976e2cc2f_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Acaityawas constructed in thebahīcourtyard. The donor family also made an arrangement of regular income for the annual rituals and the renovation of thecaityawhen necessary. A group of four people, including Mayanasiṃṅa, Govardhanasiṃṅa, and Jinideva, are responsible to take care of the temple.The name of the priest for theguṭhīis mentioned as Jitrasiṃha. Other details recorded are the position of the planets and the list of things that must be used in the annual rituals. Unfortunately, the part where the date was inscribed is damaged."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a0a959a5-3d62-4bf3-bca7-baf976e2cc2f> ;
    rdfs:comment "Acaityawas constructed in thebahīcourtyard. The donor family also made an arrangement of regular income for the annual rituals and the renovation of thecaityawhen necessary. A group of four people, including Mayanasiṃṅa, Govardhanasiṃṅa, and Jinideva, are responsible to take care of the temple.The name of the priest for theguṭhīis mentioned as Jitrasiṃha. Other details recorded are the position of the planets and the list of things that must be used in the annual rituals. Unfortunately, the part where the date was inscribed is damaged."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 0 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a0a959a5-3d62-4bf3-bca7-baf976e2cc2f> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a0a959a5-3d62-4bf3-bca7-baf976e2cc2f_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a Yajñaśālā and Pavement of Tiles"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Ayajñaśālāwas constructed and tiles were laid inside the sanctum by Buddhagīta Guṭhī. Devaratna, Jīvarāja, Deva, Devajyoti, Bāsiṃha, ..ṇḍava, Mani, Gopinātha, Śivadāsa, Ratnasiṃha, and Dalamaṃsiṃ financed the construction and the pavement."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a0a959a5-3d62-4bf3-bca7-baf976e2cc2f> ;
    rdfs:comment "Ayajñaśālāwas constructed and tiles were laid inside the sanctum by Buddhagīta Guṭhī. Devaratna, Jīvarāja, Deva, Devajyoti, Bāsiṃha, ..ṇḍava, Mani, Gopinātha, Śivadāsa, Ratnasiṃha, and Dalamaṃsiṃ financed the construction and the pavement."@en ;
