    rdfs:label "Addition of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Under the leadership of Prabhu Bhāro of Tokhā, a bell was offered in front of thedyaḥchẽto propitiate Caṇḍeśvarī.तोखाका प्रभु भारोको प्रमुखत्वमा चण्डेश्वरीलाई प्रसन्न पर्न द्यःछेँ अगाडि एक घण्ट चढाइयो ।"@en ;
