<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a0c8744f-2928-4961-b072-638c22e48522_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Replacement of pillars"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his deceased parents, Milana Ḍaṅgola of Tokhā installed a new stone pillar in front of thedyaḥchẽ, replacing the damaged base of the bell.आफ्ना स्वर्गवासी मातापिताको सम्झनामा तोखाका मिलन डङ्गोलले द्यःछेँ अगाडि भएको घण्टको थामो बिग्रेकाले नयाँ शिलाको थामो हाल्ने कार्य गरे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a0c8744f-2928-4961-b072-638c22e48522> ;
