    rdfs:label "Land Grant to Sponsor the Annual Death Rites for Ratnasiṃha"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After Ratnasiṃha Śākya, the founder of the Bāhāḥ, passed away, his son Ratnapati, brothers Mukundasiṃha (text: Mukuṇḍasiṃha) and Lakṣmījyoti (text Lakṣmijoti), and wife Siddhi Mayaju created together a land grant to sponsor his annual death rites."@en ;
