<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a267b280-49e6-4d8c-8768-ffa9686afb74_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of Jaḥdhuṃ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Raṇodyota Śāha (text: Raṇaudyou Sāhaba) built ajaḥdhuṃwater tank by the main road in Thecva. He also endowed land yielding 20muris annually for thejaḥdhuṃ's upkeep. The income was also designated for the worship of Bālakumārī and Brahmāyaṇī on Yaḥmari Punhi, the full moon day of Mārgaśīrṣa. On this day, thejaḥdhuṃwas to be cleaned, lime-coated, andsamaybajioffered to the trust members."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a267b280-49e6-4d8c-8768-ffa9686afb74> ;
    rdfs:comment "Raṇodyota Śāha (text: Raṇaudyou Sāhaba) built ajaḥdhuṃwater tank by the main road in Thecva. He also endowed land yielding 20muris annually for thejaḥdhuṃ's upkeep. The income was also designated for the worship of Bālakumārī and Brahmāyaṇī on Yaḥmari Punhi, the full moon day of Mārgaśīrṣa. On this day, thejaḥdhuṃwas to be cleaned, lime-coated, andsamaybajioffered to the trust members."@en ;
