        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding the Kvātha Chẽ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Kvātha Chẽ remained in ruins for many years after it collapsed during the 1934 earthquakes. The present structure was built only in 1988 CE at the initiation of the locals. Due to the lack of enough funds, they constructed a two-story building with corrugated tin roof."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a2680407-903e-42bc-b4ae-a07ab0ee7155> ;
