    rdfs:label "Eastern staircase construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "On the stone located on the eastern staircase of the temple, an inscription is carved. According to this inscription, Nara­siṃka of Cochẽ ṭola constructed the stairs to make access to the temple easier from the eastern side."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a26fce6a-a88a-490d-b7af-0f1f556caeb1> ;
