<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a2b60b1a-1760-11ea-b9b1-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 2019, reconstruction work began. This was funded by Rs. 50 Lakh as provided by Jñānendra Śākya, a representative of province no. 3. However, at the end of the fiscal year VS 2074-75, the progress of the reconstruction work deemed unsatisfactory and the fund was cut off. A new fund has been provided from the budget of fiscal year VS 2075-76."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a2b60b1a-1760-11ea-b9b1-0242ac130002> ;
