<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a423a365-f6bf-4745-9a4a-f8747e978f73_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Land grant and installation of a sculpture"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The only inscription at the site is found on the broken base of a stone sculpture (BTD0030-013). The inscription is written indevanāgarīscript and contains six lines.D. R. Sharma read the inscription as follows (Sharma 2012: 349):Oṁ śri bahatari ra na ka sri karlla māhā maṇdalika rāni śri yaṃ debi putra śri Garbha deva sutra dhāra ha ra de be na pyādina nena pyādinala deva kāyana pradattam bhumiand translated it as:In Bahatadi (Baitadi), consecration of... mahāmandalika sri... queen's son, Garbha deva, and Hara Deva the architect... has offered land... as for religious merits."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a423a365-f6bf-4745-9a4a-f8747e978f73> ;
    rdfs:comment "The only inscription at the site is found on the broken base of a stone sculpture (BTD0030-013). The inscription is written indevanāgarīscript and contains six lines.D. R. Sharma read the inscription as follows (Sharma 2012: 349):Oṁ śri bahatari ra na ka sri karlla māhā maṇdalika rāni śri yaṃ debi putra śri Garbha deva sutra dhāra ha ra de be na pyādina nena pyādinala deva kāyana pradattam bhumiand translated it as:In Bahatadi (Baitadi), consecration of... mahāmandalika sri... queen's son, Garbha deva, and Hara Deva the architect... has offered land... as for religious merits."@en ;
