<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a4710aa7-1d29-41a9-9098-fe6cf805e357_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "One year after the construction of the temple and the consecration of theśivaliṅga, Raṇodyota Śāha and his wife Bhuvanakumārīdevī offered the bell to the temple.The inscription is edited in D. Vajrācārya and Ṭ. Śreṣṭha VS 2032, second part, pp. 52, and their edition reads as follows:स्वस्ति श्रीशाके १७४७ सम्वत् १८८२ मिति मार्गकृष्णदशम्यां तिथौ हस्तनक्षत्रे सौभाग्य-योगे सोमवासरे तस्मिन् दिने श्री ५ रणभूवनेश्वर प्रिति गरी श्रीरणोद्योतसाह श्रीभुवन-कुमारी देवीले चह्रायाको घंट हो । शुभम् ॥"@en ;
