    dcterms:description "Kīrtimāna Siṃha installed a Gaṇeśa staute in front of the Sataḥ and also allocated land for repair and maintenance of Sataḥ and to perform anniversary rituals.कीर्तिमान सिंहले सतः अगाडि गणेश मूर्तिको स्थापना गरे एवं सतः र घाट मर्मत, वार्षिक पूजा र भोज आयोजनाको खातिर गुठीमा आयको व्यवस्था गरियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a4be84b1-aabe-47a1-8f4c-cdd8e819f781> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kīrtimāna Siṃha installed a Gaṇeśa staute in front of the Sataḥ and also allocated land for repair and maintenance of Sataḥ and to perform anniversary rituals.कीर्तिमान सिंहले सतः अगाडि गणेश मूर्तिको स्थापना गरे एवं सतः र घाट मर्मत, वार्षिक पूजा र भोज आयोजनाको खातिर गुठीमा आयको व्यवस्था गरियो ।"@en ;
