<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a4be84b1-aabe-47a1-8f4c-cdd8e819f781_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of Viṣṇu and donor statues"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A stone tablet featuring a Viṣṇu statue surrounded by depictions of seven family members of the donor was installed.विष्णुमूर्ति केन्द्रमा राखी सतः निर्माताका परिवार सदस्यको प्रतिमा कुँदिएको शिलाफलक स्थापना गरियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a4be84b1-aabe-47a1-8f4c-cdd8e819f781> ;
