<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a4df4e50-f6f0-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Placement of dhaḥmā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Historical photos of the Phalcā (taken by Niels Gutschow in 1992) show adhaḥmā(beam of the chariot used for religious processions) in front of the structure. The olddhaḥmāplaced at the Taḥ Bāhāḥ (LAL0050) was carried here by the locals of Kutisaugaḥṭola. Locals stated that the olddhaḥmāburned down some years back on the evening of Śivarātri."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a4df4e50-f6f0-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Historical photos of the Phalcā (taken by Niels Gutschow in 1992) show adhaḥmā(beam of the chariot used for religious processions) in front of the structure. The olddhaḥmāplaced at the Taḥ Bāhāḥ (LAL0050) was carried here by the locals of Kutisaugaḥṭola. Locals stated that the olddhaḥmāburned down some years back on the evening of Śivarātri."@en ;
