<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a4df4e50-f6f0-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction 2019"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā is now (in October 2019) under reconstruction. Lalitpur Metropolitan Office has provided Rs 28,00,000 to fund this. According to the president of the Sthānīya Upabhoktā Samiti (Local Consumer’s Committee), the committee collecting these donations added 10% to this amount."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a4df4e50-f6f0-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
