    rdfs:label "Offering of a goat"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The text at the end of this inscription mentions that Jugideva Bhāvo and his sons offered Bhairava a male goat (bhairavasake thva khasi tayā juro). The meaning and context of the phrase is not clear."@en ;
