<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a5df6af2-eb05-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_5> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Formation of Caturdaśī Sevā Guṭhī and construction of a new building behind the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Caturdaśī Sevā Guṭhī is aguṭhīwhich performspūjāto the Bhairava on the 14th day of the dark half of every month. At the same time as they were established, a new building was constructed behind the temple by the same group. This included members Jitrasĩha Prajāpati, Punasĩha, Dhantulimālasĩha, Devasĩha Bhāvo and others."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a5df6af2-eb05-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Caturdaśī Sevā Guṭhī is aguṭhīwhich performspūjāto the Bhairava on the 14th day of the dark half of every month. At the same time as they were established, a new building was constructed behind the temple by the same group. This included members Jitrasĩha Prajāpati, Punasĩha, Dhantulimālasĩha, Devasĩha Bhāvo and others."@en ;
