    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Under Prime Minister Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā, the Jaṅge Hiraṇya Hema Nārāyaṇa temple (KAT2800) was built along with three sataḥs intended to accommodate ascetics from different religious orders."@en ;
