<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a648d429-c887-4210-8dfa-bb946841b1e9_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the akhaḍā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Although theakhaḍādid not collapse in the 2015 earthquakes, it was deemed unsafe to live in due to the damage it sustained and was completely dismantled. The reconstruction of the Sataḥ was carried out by the High-Powered Committee for Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization under the Ministry of Urban Development with the loan assistance of the Asian Development Bank."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a648d429-c887-4210-8dfa-bb946841b1e9> ;
