<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a7417ecf-fb51-4bf5-a738-86cff632bdf8_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Dismantling of phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Government of Nepal has proposed a plan to expand the main road in Bāḍegāũ, which will require the demolition of properties, private homes, and other structures along the western side of the roadway. As the road-widening project would result in the unavoidable destruction of the existingphalcā, the trustees of Śvetavārāhī jointly agreed to dismantle it. Additionally, arrangements have been made to build a newphalcāon the neighboring vacant plot to the west."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a7417ecf-fb51-4bf5-a738-86cff632bdf8> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Government of Nepal has proposed a plan to expand the main road in Bāḍegāũ, which will require the demolition of properties, private homes, and other structures along the western side of the roadway. As the road-widening project would result in the unavoidable destruction of the existingphalcā, the trustees of Śvetavārāhī jointly agreed to dismantle it. Additionally, arrangements have been made to build a newphalcāon the neighboring vacant plot to the west."@en ;
