    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a7417ecf-fb51-4bf5-a738-86cff632bdf8> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a792be02-0ac6-42d1-876d-07285e738424_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of pillar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The pillar contains at least 7 lines of inscription in Devanagari script. The content of the text is not readable because of the heavy erosion of the stone. Yogi Naraharinath provided a reading of an inscribed pillar from Rāmrīkaḍā but it reamins difficult to ascertain if this is the pillar in question (Naraharinath 1956, 2.1. p. 173). The text provided by Naraharinath is:Oṁ swosti śri sāke 1037 vaishākhe māse 8 titḥau vivida...śwosti...jayutra malla va da kṣhe rāja...vakṣhe...putra jayakṣhe rājādhiraja jayakṣhe malla deva śri...rāgṇyi satya rupā dei sapatnikasya śri vishnuja putrasya mahārāja... subhamastu(transliteration published inSharma 2012, p. 129)"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a792be02-0ac6-42d1-876d-07285e738424> ;
    rdfs:comment "The pillar contains at least 7 lines of inscription in Devanagari script. The content of the text is not readable because of the heavy erosion of the stone. Yogi Naraharinath provided a reading of an inscribed pillar from Rāmrīkaḍā but it reamins difficult to ascertain if this is the pillar in question (Naraharinath 1956, 2.1. p. 173). The text provided by Naraharinath is:Oṁ swosti śri sāke 1037 vaishākhe māse 8 titḥau vivida...śwosti...jayutra malla va da kṣhe rāja...vakṣhe...putra jayakṣhe rājādhiraja jayakṣhe malla deva śri...rāgṇyi satya rupā dei sapatnikasya śri vishnuja putrasya mahārāja... subhamastu(transliteration published inSharma 2012, p. 129)"@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 0 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a792be02-0ac6-42d1-876d-07285e738424> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/a799360d-b2f7-44d3-9da0-5b2e215ab4df_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of Land for an Anniversary Ritual (Varṣavardhanapūjā)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription, located to the northern side of the finial,  records that oneropānīof land was endowed for the performance of thevarṣavardhanapūjā(annual worship) of thejaḥdhuṃ. The ritual was to be conducted annually on the fifth day of the bright fortnight of Śrāvaṇa. Due to surface erosion, however, the name of the donor is no longer legible."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a799360d-b2f7-44d3-9da0-5b2e215ab4df> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription, located to the northern side of the finial,  records that oneropānīof land was endowed for the performance of thevarṣavardhanapūjā(annual worship) of thejaḥdhuṃ. The ritual was to be conducted annually on the fifth day of the bright fortnight of Śrāvaṇa. Due to surface erosion, however, the name of the donor is no longer legible."@en ;
