        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Land endowment"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Gumānasiṃha Kārkī and his spouse Bhuvaneśvarī instituted a trust by granting parcels of land at different locations in Bhaktapur. This trust's purpose was to facilitate the observance of annual rituals and ensure the timely restoration of both the temple and thesataḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a7ca999e-bcea-48b2-a579-714101819dd3> ;
