        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Guṇabhuvaneśvara temple, along with other monuments in the vicinity, underwent reconstruction after the 2015 earthquakes. The High-Powered Committee for Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization, a body functioning under the Ministry of Urban Development, received financial assistance from the Asian Development Bank for the reconstruction. The reconstruction works were officially completed in October 2022."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a7ca999e-bcea-48b2-a579-714101819dd3> ;
