    rdfs:label "New pavement of the courtyard"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thebāhāḥcourtyard and the plinths were paved withteliyābricks. Vajrācārya Guṇavanta Siṃha, his wife Devi Lakṣmī, his brother Dhanaju, his brother's wife Mahanta Lakṣmī and other family members donated money for this to be carried out."@en ;
