        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction of Cidhaṃ Bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thebāhāḥwas established by Tuyū Āḥju, a resident of Taḥdhaṃ Bāhāḥ (KAT1420), along with his brothers Śākyabhikṣu Rūparāja, Śākyabhikṣu Maṇirāja, and Śākyabhikṣu Jakarāja. In addition, they laid floor tiles inside the sanctum."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a9dcf214-13cc-4b71-8b0c-488ff996713b> ;
    rdfs:comment "Thebāhāḥwas established by Tuyū Āḥju, a resident of Taḥdhaṃ Bāhāḥ (KAT1420), along with his brothers Śākyabhikṣu Rūparāja, Śākyabhikṣu Maṇirāja, and Śākyabhikṣu Jakarāja. In addition, they laid floor tiles inside the sanctum."@en ;
