        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Starting the reconstruction of the dyaḥchẽ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the collapse of thedyaḥchẽ, Subhadhara, Jitanara, Jñānavarasiṃ, Āsākājī, and others initiated the reconstruction efforts. Prior to the start of the reconstruction, the essence of the main deity and other deities were removed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/a9dcf214-13cc-4b71-8b0c-488ff996713b> ;
