<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/aa14d11d-0581-4e51-87e6-9ce54d7efe13_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Cleaning the Pond and installation of stone spouts"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Locals made some efforts in giving the Ponds their lives back. The Maṇicūḍa Yūvā Klaba (a local youth club) took initiation for conservative measures by starting to clean the Ponds on multiple occasions. In 2017 CE, the Ward No. 6 Office of the Shankharapur Municipality began cleaning the Ponds and installed stone spouts while also building a portion of their wall."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/aa14d11d-0581-4e51-87e6-9ce54d7efe13> ;
    rdfs:comment "Locals made some efforts in giving the Ponds their lives back. The Maṇicūḍa Yūvā Klaba (a local youth club) took initiation for conservative measures by starting to clean the Ponds on multiple occasions. In 2017 CE, the Ward No. 6 Office of the Shankharapur Municipality began cleaning the Ponds and installed stone spouts while also building a portion of their wall."@en ;
