        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding the Ponds"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Both Ponds were rebuilt, which concluded in 2021 CE. The reconstruction was carried out with a fund of NRs. 6 million from the Shankharapur Municipality and NRs. 4 million from the Kathmandu Valley Development Authority. Local residents and businessmen had also contributed financially to the reconstruction."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/aa14d11d-0581-4e51-87e6-9ce54d7efe13> ;
