<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/aabd2eaa-8fcb-4043-b307-0b431934f800_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of land allocation inscription"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 1951 CE (2008 VS), an inscription was affixed to the Sataḥ's wall, outlining allocated lands for the Sataḥ. This measure was taken to prevent the loss of these lands. Following the Sataḥ's completion in the early 20th century, provisions were established for daily rituals and an annual observance on Kṛṣṇaṣṭamī. This inscription bears testament that any descendant of Sardāra Haribhakta Māthema carries the responsibility of its future restoration."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/aabd2eaa-8fcb-4043-b307-0b431934f800> ;
    rdfs:comment "In 1951 CE (2008 VS), an inscription was affixed to the Sataḥ's wall, outlining allocated lands for the Sataḥ. This measure was taken to prevent the loss of these lands. Following the Sataḥ's completion in the early 20th century, provisions were established for daily rituals and an annual observance on Kṛṣṇaṣṭamī. This inscription bears testament that any descendant of Sardāra Haribhakta Māthema carries the responsibility of its future restoration."@en ;
