<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/aabd2eaa-8fcb-4043-b307-0b431934f800_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Sataḥ Restoration Post-2015 CE Earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the aftermath of the 2015 CE earthquake, the Sataḥ encountered extensive damage, necessitating the evacuation of its inhabitants and eventual reconstruction, which concluded by 2022 CE. This revival of the Sataḥ was facilitated through the collaborative efforts of the Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization project, an initiative under Nepal Government's Ministry of Urban Development, along with financial support from the Asian Development Bank. The Sataḥ's refurbishment was successfully accomplished, culminating in its inauguration in October 2022 CE (2079 VS)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/aabd2eaa-8fcb-4043-b307-0b431934f800> ;
    rdfs:comment "In the aftermath of the 2015 CE earthquake, the Sataḥ encountered extensive damage, necessitating the evacuation of its inhabitants and eventual reconstruction, which concluded by 2022 CE. This revival of the Sataḥ was facilitated through the collaborative efforts of the Integrated Development of the Bagmati Civilization project, an initiative under Nepal Government's Ministry of Urban Development, along with financial support from the Asian Development Bank. The Sataḥ's refurbishment was successfully accomplished, culminating in its inauguration in October 2022 CE (2079 VS)."@en ;
