<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ab447a19-9343-4be4-87a7-a7b17fefa93a_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Sataḥ was constructed in the name of Kṛṣṇasaṃkala, Viṣṇusaṃkala and Maheśvarī Mayī by Jayasaṃkara and other family members. The donor family also made arrangements for regular income for annual rituals to be performed. Other details recorded in the inscription are the position of the planets and list of things required for the annual rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ab447a19-9343-4be4-87a7-a7b17fefa93a> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Sataḥ was constructed in the name of Kṛṣṇasaṃkala, Viṣṇusaṃkala and Maheśvarī Mayī by Jayasaṃkara and other family members. The donor family also made arrangements for regular income for annual rituals to be performed. Other details recorded in the inscription are the position of the planets and list of things required for the annual rituals."@en ;
