<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ab92a4a9-4f0b-4895-80bb-7af83dd2878f_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Viṣṇurāja Bhāro, a resident of Cāpāgāũ Bhansāra Ṭola, renovated the temple along with his wives Maṃgarārakṣmī and Caṇḍikārakṣmī. A statue of Vaṃśagopāla (Kṛṣṇa) was also established in the nearby Kṛṣṇa temple on the same occasion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ab92a4a9-4f0b-4895-80bb-7af83dd2878f> ;
