<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/abc0bacd-08c7-4755-9b28-213452d31c04_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Consecration of the śivaliṅga"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Vārtta Pratihāra Dhruvasaṅgha established the Bhadreśvara Śivaliṅga along with four otherśivaliṅgas revered as Nātheśvara, Sthiteśvara, Ravīśvara, and Śubheśvara. He also endowed plots of land to fund regular worship of theseśivaliṅgas."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/abc0bacd-08c7-4755-9b28-213452d31c04> ;
