<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ac2862e2-1666-11ea-bc0e-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Lalitpur Metropolitan City provided 10 Lakh rupees for the reconstruction of the temple. Locals worked on the reconstruction. Thejhĩgaṭī-tiled roof was replaced with a copper plate. The struts,toraṇasand other woodworks were made by locals. The Gaṇesa statue of the sanctum was also cleaned by removing the cement plaster that had fallen in."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ac2862e2-1666-11ea-bc0e-0242ac130002> ;
