<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ad08a0da-dad2-4e48-a61f-399a681fcfdc_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the shrine (KAT2360-005)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thedevalahousing the Aśoka Caitya (KAT2360-005), which suffered severe structural damage and was on the verge of collapse during the most recent major earthquake, was reconstructed with funds from the Constituency Development Programme of the Bagmatī Provincial Government and through public donations. The reconstructed structure was inaugurated by Provincial Assembly Member Ajaykrānti Śākya.पछिल्लो महाभूकम्पमा भत्किने अवस्थामा पुग्ने गरी पूर्ण क्षति भएको अशोक चैत्यको देवल (KAT2360-005) लाई वागमती प्रदेश सरकारको निर्वाचन क्षेत्र विकास कार्यक्रम अन्तर्गतको बजेट र चन्दाबाट पुनर्निर्माण गरियो । यसको उत्घाटन प्रदेशसभा सदस्य अजयक्रान्ति शाक्यले गरे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ad08a0da-dad2-4e48-a61f-399a681fcfdc> ;
    rdfs:comment "Thedevalahousing the Aśoka Caitya (KAT2360-005), which suffered severe structural damage and was on the verge of collapse during the most recent major earthquake, was reconstructed with funds from the Constituency Development Programme of the Bagmatī Provincial Government and through public donations. The reconstructed structure was inaugurated by Provincial Assembly Member Ajaykrānti Śākya.पछिल्लो महाभूकम्पमा भत्किने अवस्थामा पुग्ने गरी पूर्ण क्षति भएको अशोक चैत्यको देवल (KAT2360-005) लाई वागमती प्रदेश सरकारको निर्वाचन क्षेत्र विकास कार्यक्रम अन्तर्गतको बजेट र चन्दाबाट पुनर्निर्माण गरियो । यसको उत्घाटन प्रदेशसभा सदस्य अजयक्रान्ति शाक्यले गरे ।"@en ;
