<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ad08a0da-dad2-4e48-a61f-399a681fcfdc_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Paving of terracotta tiles"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Traditional terracotta tiles were laid across the courtyard of thebāhāḥ. This work, financed by the provincial government, was inaugurated upon completion by Provincial Assembly Members Suraja Bajrācārya and Samitā Khaḍgī.बाहाः परिसरमा टेराकोटाको परम्परागत टायल बिच्छाउने कार्य भयो । प्रदेश सरकारको बजेटबाट भएको यस कार्य समापन पश्चात प्रदेशसभा सदस्य द्वय सुरज बज्राचार्य र समिता खड्गीले उत्घाटन गरे ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ad08a0da-dad2-4e48-a61f-399a681fcfdc> ;
    rdfs:comment "Traditional terracotta tiles were laid across the courtyard of thebāhāḥ. This work, financed by the provincial government, was inaugurated upon completion by Provincial Assembly Members Suraja Bajrācārya and Samitā Khaḍgī.बाहाः परिसरमा टेराकोटाको परम्परागत टायल बिच्छाउने कार्य भयो । प्रदेश सरकारको बजेटबाट भएको यस कार्य समापन पश्चात प्रदेशसभा सदस्य द्वय सुरज बज्राचार्य र समिता खड्गीले उत्घाटन गरे ।"@en ;
