<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ad1fdb35-7451-40e3-a06f-5423bc025d6d_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā at Pacalī Bhairava"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription, currently located within the premises of the Purohita Ghāṭa Śivālaya, documents the construction of a newphalcā(resting place or pavilion) in front of the Svacchanda Bhairava temple (Pacalī Bhairava, KAT2580). This construction involved the dismantling of the oldphalcāthat previously stood in the same location. Notably, the inscription is not directly associated with any of the temples in the vicinity."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ad1fdb35-7451-40e3-a06f-5423bc025d6d> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription, currently located within the premises of the Purohita Ghāṭa Śivālaya, documents the construction of a newphalcā(resting place or pavilion) in front of the Svacchanda Bhairava temple (Pacalī Bhairava, KAT2580). This construction involved the dismantling of the oldphalcāthat previously stood in the same location. Notably, the inscription is not directly associated with any of the temples in the vicinity."@en ;
