<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/adad44a2-9ffc-4a05-ba82-ad6d39f10c17_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of inscription with verses praising Brahmeśvara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pārthivendra Malla, having sincere devotion to Śiva, visited the Brahmeśvara Śivaliṅga, the 27th among the 64śivaliṅgas located in the valley of the Kabilāsa hill. He probably went up the hill and visited Kapileśvara Mahādeva as well. This inscription with verses dedicated to Brahmeśvara Mahādeva that he composed himself was probably installed during this visit."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/adad44a2-9ffc-4a05-ba82-ad6d39f10c17> ;
    rdfs:comment "Pārthivendra Malla, having sincere devotion to Śiva, visited the Brahmeśvara Śivaliṅga, the 27th among the 64śivaliṅgas located in the valley of the Kabilāsa hill. He probably went up the hill and visited Kapileśvara Mahādeva as well. This inscription with verses dedicated to Brahmeśvara Mahādeva that he composed himself was probably installed during this visit."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
