    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Together with his family, Colonel Yajña Śamśera, grandson of Dhīra Śamśera and son of Bhīma Śamśera, offered a bell to Sarasvatī, the goddess of wisdom, enshrined near Kabilāsa Nāsaḥdyaḥ."@en ;
