    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "It was rebuilt with funds from the National Reconstruction Authority and the cooperation of local people. Before the earthquake, the temple had a stone roof, but after reconstruction, it was replaced with a copper roof."@en ;
