        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a dyaḥchẽ for lineage deity"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the stone inscription from NS 774 (1654 CE) affixed to the backside of thedyaḥchẽ, three people, including Narasiṃhadeva, built a god house (dyaḥchẽ) fordigudyaḥ. This suggests thatdigudyaḥwas initially an open shrine, and thedyaḥchẽwas constructed only in 1654 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ae46da6b-090a-4862-9c95-cdacce669242> ;
