    rdfs:label "Construction of Pañcāvaliyukta Caitya (object no. KAT1200-015)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Rājendra Vikrama Śāha, Bhājuvīra Śākyabhikṣu (text: Sākebhikṣu Bhājubila) constructed the Caitya in memory of his father Bekhāsiṃhadeva (text: Bekhāsiṃdeo). He also endowed some plots of land to make periodic offerings (śrāddha) to six of his ancestors and perform the anniversary ritual of the Caitya."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ae46da6b-090a-4862-9c95-cdacce669242> ;
