        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The exact date of construction of the Kālikā Devī Mandira is unknown but it can be situtated in the second half of the 20th century CE. This is indicated by the monument's absence from Marc Gaborieau's 1968 photos. On the other hand, one can make out the temple in a photo published in Dilli Raj Sharma's 2012Heritage of Western Nepal. Art and Architecture(Sharma 2012, p. 226, Pl. 60b.)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ae51c727-28ce-4062-896a-a84a2655ecdd> ;
    rdfs:comment "The exact date of construction of the Kālikā Devī Mandira is unknown but it can be situtated in the second half of the 20th century CE. This is indicated by the monument's absence from Marc Gaborieau's 1968 photos. On the other hand, one can make out the temple in a photo published in Dilli Raj Sharma's 2012Heritage of Western Nepal. Art and Architecture(Sharma 2012, p. 226, Pl. 60b.)."@en ;
