    dcterms:description "Siṅgarāja and his family members (wife Aṣṭamāyā, sons Śrīrāja and Bhimarāja, and daughter Punamāyā) constructed the Dharmadhātu Maṇdala in the Bāhāḥ’s courtyard. They also donated a crown andlhegāto thekvāḥpāḥdyaḥ."@en ;
