<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/afa386ca-8eea-11ea-bd59-0242ac130005_5> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Distribution of water"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the bone factory closed in VS 2057, locals became more conscious of the need to conserve and protect the monument. The stakeholders formed a committee named Ālko Hiti Saṃrakṣaṇa Tathā Khānepānī Vikāsa Upasamiti (Ālko Hiti Conservation and Water Supply Users’ Committee). The committee has now managed to collect the water in a big tank so that it can be distributed to locals via pipes. The committee collected Rs. 2,000 from every household to raise funds for the construction of this system."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/afa386ca-8eea-11ea-bd59-0242ac130005> ;
    rdfs:comment "After the bone factory closed in VS 2057, locals became more conscious of the need to conserve and protect the monument. The stakeholders formed a committee named Ālko Hiti Saṃrakṣaṇa Tathā Khānepānī Vikāsa Upasamiti (Ālko Hiti Conservation and Water Supply Users’ Committee). The committee has now managed to collect the water in a big tank so that it can be distributed to locals via pipes. The committee collected Rs. 2,000 from every household to raise funds for the construction of this system."@en ;
