    rdfs:label "Name  list of the donors"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription on the eaves fascia (mhuraḥpau) reveals that theāgaṃchẽwas renovated in 2006 CE (VS 2063). There is another inscription from 2007 CE (VS 2064) set on the back of theāgaṃchẽ. This inscription does not mention the event but lists the names of donors, who probably contributed to the renovation the previous year."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/affdfc0b-621a-491a-84dc-41757d1d0909> ;
