    rdfs:label "Addition of lion statues"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple is flanked by a pair of stone lion statues. An inscription carved on the lower part (pedestal) of the statues records that they were installed in front of the temple by Bisamā and twelve other individuals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b071cb98-09af-42ce-8334-6ea037aacb5e> ;
