        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Beautification of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhājumāna Ranjitakāra, along with his family members who resided near the temple, installed a brass banner inside the sanctum. The walls of the temple’s ground floor were decorated with imported tiles. Furthermore, they also installed sixty oil lamps surrounding the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b071cb98-09af-42ce-8334-6ea037aacb5e> ;
