    rdfs:label "reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In VS 2040 (1983–84), the temple was jointly rebuilt by all concerned bodies. Local residents, the elected ward committee, and the priestly clan collectively contributed to its reconstruction."@en ;
