    rdfs:label "Landgrant"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Probably, this inscription does not belong to this Sataḥ, despite being embedded in its facade. It says that in the name of late Raghunātha Ujhā, Sundarī Brāhmaṇī 6ropanīsof land were granted from an area calledNhulakvāṭha. It also records the regulations for organising different religious events forthe Patan Kumārī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b088faf0-5abf-4b86-be5c-8386de2d9fda> ;
