    rdfs:label "Organizing Samyaka Bhojana"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jayadhana had organized Samyaka Bhojana and invited King Nṛpendra Malla on that occasion. The donor had offered a golden throne with a golden umbrella surrounded by goldenprabhāmaṇḍala. Pārthivendra Malla and Mahīpatīndra Malla were also present on the occasion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b0d6e090-8be2-4dac-91c6-9931976a73d8> ;
