    rdfs:label "Renovation of the monuments"@en ;
    dcterms:description "On the occasion of his birthday, King Mahendra installed stone slabs in the temple courtyard. He also commissioned the construction of a new cemented path with steps leading to the Śikharanārāyaṇa temple. During this renovation, the ponds in the area were also restored."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b1db9a43-c69d-4054-b063-57a9d72eb2d9> ;
