    rdfs:label "Addition of a Garuḍa pillar, a bell and an oil-lamp balustrade"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Lalitpur sub-metropolitan city, Cakravarti Ṭola Sudhāra Samiti and local people installed the Garuda pillar in front of the temple as well as an oil-lamp balustrade, a bell, and a wind vane together with icons of Viṣṇu's weapons."@en ;
