<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b3998110-1199-4200-a785-b06a94d0d8f2_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Mānadeva established the statue of Viṣṇuvikrānta by building a grand temple for it here in the Paśupati area in memory of his mother Rājyavatī. He established a similar statue in Lazimpat, Kathmandu on the same day with a similar inscription on their pedestal. Although the inscription of the statue mentions the construction of a grand temple, it no longer survives in the vicinity."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b3998110-1199-4200-a785-b06a94d0d8f2> ;
    rdfs:comment "King Mānadeva established the statue of Viṣṇuvikrānta by building a grand temple for it here in the Paśupati area in memory of his mother Rājyavatī. He established a similar statue in Lazimpat, Kathmandu on the same day with a similar inscription on their pedestal. Although the inscription of the statue mentions the construction of a grand temple, it no longer survives in the vicinity."@en ;
