<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b3c83d8b-5c91-4876-90ad-d7ba0614da71_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Roofing of the Bhairava shrine with tiles"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A group led by Budha Baṃde and Kṛṣṇa Siṃha Bhāro laid traditional tiles on the roof of the Bhairava shrine. Other individuals like Jivarāja Bhābo, Jikisiṃṅa, Rūparāma, Budhacanda, and others also assisted the work. One-fourth of the tiles required for the roof was sponsored by a person named Rūpa, while the rest were contributed by other members of the group. This record suggests that the open shrine was covered with a tiled roof."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b3c83d8b-5c91-4876-90ad-d7ba0614da71> ;
    rdfs:comment "A group led by Budha Baṃde and Kṛṣṇa Siṃha Bhāro laid traditional tiles on the roof of the Bhairava shrine. Other individuals like Jivarāja Bhābo, Jikisiṃṅa, Rūparāma, Budhacanda, and others also assisted the work. One-fourth of the tiles required for the roof was sponsored by a person named Rūpa, while the rest were contributed by other members of the group. This record suggests that the open shrine was covered with a tiled roof."@en ;
