        hg:Consecration ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a throne"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The family of Jita Govinda Amātya from Daubāhāḥ Ṭol offered a brass throne (siṃhāsana) to Kwayna Gaṇeśa, inviting the deity’s presence into their neighborhood through the consecration of the mask (mukhākṛti)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b4d596ce-e31d-45d7-a9af-40f7cc1b568b> ;
