<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b4d596ce-e31d-45d7-a9af-40f7cc1b568b_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The construction of the presentdyaḥcheṃwas completed with financial support from Prince Dhirendra Śāha, on the occasion of King Virendra’s 39th birthday. The project was carried out under the supervision of the then Minister Jogmeyara Śreṣṭha, with additional material and financial contributions from the local community. A detailed record documenting the nature and extent of local donations was inscribed and preserved at the site."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b4d596ce-e31d-45d7-a9af-40f7cc1b568b> ;
    rdfs:comment "The construction of the presentdyaḥcheṃwas completed with financial support from Prince Dhirendra Śāha, on the occasion of King Virendra’s 39th birthday. The project was carried out under the supervision of the then Minister Jogmeyara Śreṣṭha, with additional material and financial contributions from the local community. A detailed record documenting the nature and extent of local donations was inscribed and preserved at the site."@en ;
