    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b591fd8e-c93c-4ddc-929d-f8ae35c530a0> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b5da89bd-350e-4b9f-9d8a-098d94e21249_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuild of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Following the earthquake of 2015 CE (2072 VS), the Paśupatī Development Fund issued an appeal for assistance, allowing those individuals who were willing to privately reconstruct the damaged heritage to do so. Based on this appeal, the Phalcā was reconstructed with the financial support from Ratna Stephenson (Maske), an person based in the United States of America.विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्प लगत्तै पशुपति विकास कोषले क्षति भएका सम्पदाहरूको निजी तवरमा पुनर्निर्मान गर्न इच्छुक भएमा गर्न सकिने प्रावधानका साथ सहयोगको आह्वान गरेको थियो । यसै आह्वानको आधारमा अमेरिका बस्दै आएकी रत्ना स्टेपहेन्सन (मास्के)को आर्थिक सहयोगमा यो फल्चा पुननिर्मान गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b5da89bd-350e-4b9f-9d8a-098d94e21249> ;
    rdfs:comment "Following the earthquake of 2015 CE (2072 VS), the Paśupatī Development Fund issued an appeal for assistance, allowing those individuals who were willing to privately reconstruct the damaged heritage to do so. Based on this appeal, the Phalcā was reconstructed with the financial support from Ratna Stephenson (Maske), an person based in the United States of America.विसं २०७२ (सन् २०१५) को भूकम्प लगत्तै पशुपति विकास कोषले क्षति भएका सम्पदाहरूको निजी तवरमा पुनर्निर्मान गर्न इच्छुक भएमा गर्न सकिने प्रावधानका साथ सहयोगको आह्वान गरेको थियो । यसै आह्वानको आधारमा अमेरिका बस्दै आएकी रत्ना स्टेपहेन्सन (मास्के)को आर्थिक सहयोगमा यो फल्चा पुननिर्मान गरिएको थियो ।"@en ;
