    rdfs:label "Construction of the Hiti"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jayanārāyaṇa (text: Jayanārāyana) constructed the Hiti along with aphalcāwhile establishing aśivaliṅga(SKH0020-003) at Mahādeva Mandira (see the description above for more information)."@en ;
