    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b7024813-cfb9-4485-b76c-fe67ba7ec8ea> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b7910d9c-e915-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E12_Production,
