        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription states that Bhikṣu Maṇiratna Vaidya and his wife Indralakṣmī commissioned the Phalcā in the hope that their descendants “may get an abode in Sukhāvati heaven”."@en ;
