<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b7a28a89-94d9-4b40-9e51-e5afdfc4e759_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of pillar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription is written in Devanagari script. It is eroded but it remains possible to read, on the third line from the top: [sa]ke 1240 (or 1242).This date situates the installation of the pillar in the year 1318 or 1320 CE, during the reign of the Khaśa Malla emperor Āditya Malla."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b7a28a89-94d9-4b40-9e51-e5afdfc4e759> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription is written in Devanagari script. It is eroded but it remains possible to read, on the third line from the top: [sa]ke 1240 (or 1242).This date situates the installation of the pillar in the year 1318 or 1320 CE, during the reign of the Khaśa Malla emperor Āditya Malla."@en ;
