<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b7adbd29-8528-4609-9ec5-fb8db9579d4d_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the chairman of Kathmandu Municipality Ward Number 20, thephalcāis under reconstruction with funding from the Hanumāna Dokhā Darabāra Conservation Programme in early 2021. Earlier, it was under the patronage of the Pradhāna Guṭhī. It was converted into a public monument after the 2015 CE earthquakes and its rebuilding was handled by the municipality."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b7adbd29-8528-4609-9ec5-fb8db9579d4d> ;
    rdfs:comment "According to the chairman of Kathmandu Municipality Ward Number 20, thephalcāis under reconstruction with funding from the Hanumāna Dokhā Darabāra Conservation Programme in early 2021. Earlier, it was under the patronage of the Pradhāna Guṭhī. It was converted into a public monument after the 2015 CE earthquakes and its rebuilding was handled by the municipality."@en ;
