    rdfs:label "Initial Construction of the Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Five Bhāro caste members from different city quarters (Ṭola) of Kirtipur built a new temple to house the Gaṇeśa statue. They installed a gilt pinnacle with a parasol and performed a fire sacrifice calledsahasrāhutiyajñaon the same occasion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b83ff19b-0e10-4281-8bbc-92cff905383f> ;
