    rdfs:label "Offering of a gilded caduvā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription is engraved around the gildedcaduvāof the Dakṣiṇakālī Temple. Although the text is no longer fully legible, the surviving portions indicate that thecaduvā(ilāṃ) was offered to the goddess by General Amṛtasiṃha Thāpā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b8c5d7c9-4fb2-4c4d-ac48-4f42756f1174> ;
