<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b8c5d7c9-4fb2-4c4d-ac48-4f42756f1174_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Pañcabalī sacrifice"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to details contained in a letter sent to General Jītajaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā, the Kāhilā Rānī organized apañcabalisacrifice and requested that the necessary ritual materials be dispatched. The letter further instructs that, after the completion of the ritual, an account be kept of the garments offered to the goddess and that the sacrificial buffalo be distributed among the localdvāreandpradhāna."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b8c5d7c9-4fb2-4c4d-ac48-4f42756f1174> ;
