<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b8c5d7c9-4fb2-4c4d-ac48-4f42756f1174_9> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "offering of a gilded caduvā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Acting upon a vow (saṅkalpa) made by Cautariyā Chibhadhoja Śāha, Cautāriyā Jaṅgapratāpa Śāha, together with his family, offered to the goddess a gildedcaduvāadorned with fournāgafigures. To ensure the preservation of the nāga images and the uninterrupted continuation of worship, aguṭhīwas established to cover maintenance and ritual expenses."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b8c5d7c9-4fb2-4c4d-ac48-4f42756f1174> ;
    rdfs:comment "Acting upon a vow (saṅkalpa) made by Cautariyā Chibhadhoja Śāha, Cautāriyā Jaṅgapratāpa Śāha, together with his family, offered to the goddess a gildedcaduvāadorned with fournāgafigures. To ensure the preservation of the nāga images and the uninterrupted continuation of worship, aguṭhīwas established to cover maintenance and ritual expenses."@en ;
