<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b8f4c2b9-7ba1-4c7d-bc70-40d99b5c4a81_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of bridge"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Candravīra Kũvara (son of Jayakṛṣṇa) and Raṇajita Kũvara (son of Rāmakṛṣṇa) built a bridge at the Ārya Ghāṭa cremation site with the permission of King Raṇabahādura Śāha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b8f4c2b9-7ba1-4c7d-bc70-40d99b5c4a81> ;
    rdfs:comment "Candravīra Kũvara (son of Jayakṛṣṇa) and Raṇajita Kũvara (son of Rāmakṛṣṇa) built a bridge at the Ārya Ghāṭa cremation site with the permission of King Raṇabahādura Śāha."@en ;
