    rdfs:label "Completion of the Copying of a Prajñāpāramitā Manuscript"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Prajñāpāramitā manuscript, which is recited during the Guṃlā (Kārtika), is kept in the Bāhāḥ. Its colophon mentions that Parikhadeva, Guṇajyoti’s grandson, sponsored for the copying of this manuscript."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b92b7a0f-0268-43e8-bbe2-d83d39d6e54b> ;
