    dcterms:description "The inscription records the construction of acapāḥnear Chusyā Bāhāḥ by Jñānajoti and family members in the name of Maricī Devī. Jñānajoti was from Dhvākhā Bāhāḥ and the father of Guṇajyoti, the founder of Chusyā Bāhāḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b92b7a0f-0268-43e8-bbe2-d83d39d6e54b> ;
