        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Minor Repairing"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 2008 CE, the stone objects that were kept in the courtyard were rearranged on new pedestals. The statues of Parikhadeva and his two wives were placed on a new base and protected under a masonry arch. Tīrthadhara Tulādhara of Jana Bāhāḥ, Kathmandu, sponsored all the necessary expenses for this intervention."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b92b7a0f-0268-43e8-bbe2-d83d39d6e54b> ;
