    rdfs:label "The Initial Construction of the Bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription (date unreadable) issued during the reign of King Pratāpa Malla (r. 1641-1674 CE) mentions that ‘this Vihāra is constructed’ (thva vihara dayakā). It most likely refers to the initial construction of Chusyā Bāhāḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b92b7a0f-0268-43e8-bbe2-d83d39d6e54b> ;
