<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b93745f4-f585-4b60-bd59-8e84850f652b_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Dedication of monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "On the north-eastern side of the reservoir, above the main door's lintel, there is an inscription in Nāgarī script. The inscription is missing the right side. It is housed in a block on the structure's northwestern side.The inscription's text is as follows:śrīsake || śrīrājādhirājāpṛthvīmallaś ciraṃ jayatu || śrīdevavarmajayapuṇyena sarve satvā sukhino bhavaṃtuPant 2009 published an English translation:\"In the glorious [year of] Śake 1276. May the glorious supreme king of kings Pṛthvīmalla long be victorious. May all beings be happy through the glorious Davarmā's victory [and] merit\""@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b93745f4-f585-4b60-bd59-8e84850f652b> ;
    rdfs:comment "On the north-eastern side of the reservoir, above the main door's lintel, there is an inscription in Nāgarī script. The inscription is missing the right side. It is housed in a block on the structure's northwestern side.The inscription's text is as follows:śrīsake || śrīrājādhirājāpṛthvīmallaś ciraṃ jayatu || śrīdevavarmajayapuṇyena sarve satvā sukhino bhavaṃtuPant 2009 published an English translation:\"In the glorious [year of] Śake 1276. May the glorious supreme king of kings Pṛthvīmalla long be victorious. May all beings be happy through the glorious Davarmā's victory [and] merit\""@en ;
