<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b93745f4-f585-4b60-bd59-8e84850f652b_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Inscription recording a Buddhist mantra"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The mantra of Avalokiteśvara,oṃ maṇi padme hūṃ, is inscribed in Rañjanā script on the slabs in the upper niches of the building. Only the south-west side lacks an inscribed slab. On the south-western side, the mantra is most visible. The inscriptions must be from the time the monument was built, which was 1354 CE. The same mantra is also inscribed in Rañjanā script on other monuments dating from the mid-1350s."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b93745f4-f585-4b60-bd59-8e84850f652b> ;
    rdfs:comment "The mantra of Avalokiteśvara,oṃ maṇi padme hūṃ, is inscribed in Rañjanā script on the slabs in the upper niches of the building. Only the south-west side lacks an inscribed slab. On the south-western side, the mantra is most visible. The inscriptions must be from the time the monument was built, which was 1354 CE. The same mantra is also inscribed in Rañjanā script on other monuments dating from the mid-1350s."@en ;
