        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of the Umāmaheśvara statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Narendra Malla, Kesarāma, Jayakīta Bhāro, Bhārasiṃṅa Bhāro, and others installed an Umāmaheśvara statue, which is now lost, with only thejalaharī(KAT3080-002) remaining in the southeastern corner of the sanctum."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b947bd74-dc11-46f3-afd4-189d70f64e3c> ;
    rdfs:comment "During the reign of King Narendra Malla, Kesarāma, Jayakīta Bhāro, Bhārasiṃṅa Bhāro, and others installed an Umāmaheśvara statue, which is now lost, with only thejalaharī(KAT3080-002) remaining in the southeastern corner of the sanctum."@en ;
