<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/b947bd74-dc11-46f3-afd4-189d70f64e3c_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a metal statue of Nārāyaṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his late father Buddhimāna Maharjana and mother Nānīcā Maharjana, Pañcanārāyaṇa Maharjana, along with his family members from Hā̃ḍīgāũ, offered a full-sized copper statue of Nārāyaṇa to cover the original Lichhavi-era statue."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/b947bd74-dc11-46f3-afd4-189d70f64e3c> ;
    rdfs:comment "In memory of his late father Buddhimāna Maharjana and mother Nānīcā Maharjana, Pañcanārāyaṇa Maharjana, along with his family members from Hā̃ḍīgāũ, offered a full-sized copper statue of Nārāyaṇa to cover the original Lichhavi-era statue."@en ;
