    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple, initially constructed by the royal astrologer Bhānu Aryāla, was established with significant endowments to ensure the sustainability of its rituals. Bhānu Aryāla dedicated various land parcels to fund both the daily rituals and special periodic ceremonies at the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bac35fbc-b725-48a1-b24a-bfa91ef8e095> ;
