        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of brass roof and laying of tiles"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Gopāladāsa, the grandson of Tusīṃ Bhāṣkara and son of Janakalāla, commissioned the installation of the brass roof at Dhũllā Gaṇeśa and laying of tiles at the Shrine. Locals say that Gopāladāsa had won a lottery he had bought in the name of Dhũllā Gaṇeśa, therefore he donated some parts of his lottery to Gaṇeśa."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bb21b677-3f21-4f9d-abc1-fe269c816609> ;
