<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bb3aed92-de61-4b7e-972d-99c7c89c1bf8_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Inscribing a Buddhist verse"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A Buddhist verse was inscribed on this inscription without recording any historical event. AlthoughD. Vajrācārya(VS 2030, p.587) has mentioned that the verse was inscribed on a smallcaityaat Dhvākhā Bāhāḥ, locals say that it was inscribed on the Caturvyūha Caitya (KAT0250-010). The inscription is no longer at the site."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bb3aed92-de61-4b7e-972d-99c7c89c1bf8> ;
    rdfs:comment "A Buddhist verse was inscribed on this inscription without recording any historical event. AlthoughD. Vajrācārya(VS 2030, p.587) has mentioned that the verse was inscribed on a smallcaityaat Dhvākhā Bāhāḥ, locals say that it was inscribed on the Caturvyūha Caitya (KAT0250-010). The inscription is no longer at the site."@en ;
