        hg:ConditionAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "The earliest mention of the Bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As discussed in ‘description’ above, a palm-leaf document mentions the name of Guṇavajra of Dhvākhā Bāhāḥ (text: Dhvākhā Bahāra). This is so far the earliest record that mentions the name Dhvākhā Bāhāḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bb3aed92-de61-4b7e-972d-99c7c89c1bf8> ;
