<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bb3aed92-de61-4b7e-972d-99c7c89c1bf8_10> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering a kikiṃpā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the name of her deceased father Yādiratna Vajrācārya, Rūpaśobhā offered a leaf like ornament adorned on the main deity’s crown (kikiṃpā) together with her husband Sugata Śākya and the children."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bb3aed92-de61-4b7e-972d-99c7c89c1bf8> ;
