        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Organizing Samyak Mahādāna"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jñānajoti of Henākara Mahāvihāra organized theSamyakMahādānaceremony together with his son Guṇajoti, grandson Dhanasiṃha, and great-grandson Parikhadeva. King Pratāpa Malla, too, was invited to the ceremony. A total of 7,500 Śākyas and the Dīpaṅkaras statues received various items in alms.​"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bb3aed92-de61-4b7e-972d-99c7c89c1bf8> ;
