<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bb7c0f44-35d0-11ea-a67f-0242ac130002_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Donation and beautification"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Samvarasiṃ and Maṇirāja offered flags, a golden pinnacle and garlands in memory of their father Dharmasiṃha. They also established a statue of Prajñāpāramitā in memory of their mothers Lakṣmī and Lakṣavatī. Rakṣasiṃ, Guṇākarasiṃ, Jñānīkarasiṃ, Lakṣavatī, Vasundharā, Apsarā, Sūryavatī and other family members are also mentioned."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bb7c0f44-35d0-11ea-a67f-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Samvarasiṃ and Maṇirāja offered flags, a golden pinnacle and garlands in memory of their father Dharmasiṃha. They also established a statue of Prajñāpāramitā in memory of their mothers Lakṣmī and Lakṣavatī. Rakṣasiṃ, Guṇākarasiṃ, Jñānīkarasiṃ, Lakṣavatī, Vasundharā, Apsarā, Sūryavatī and other family members are also mentioned."@en ;
