<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bba70d79-c208-408d-97b7-9872385c6376_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Covering of the dome with brass sheets"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The upper part of this caitya’s harmikā is decorated with a copper sheet covering. On that sheet is inscribed: “In 1899 CE (VS 1956), thecaityawas established by the family of Kulanārāṃ (Kula Nārāyaṇa) Citrakāra.” From this statement, it is difficult to determine whether the entirecaityawas constructed in that year, or only the upper caitya portion was covered with the sheet; the inscriptional language does not make this clear."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bba70d79-c208-408d-97b7-9872385c6376> ;
    rdfs:comment "The upper part of this caitya’s harmikā is decorated with a copper sheet covering. On that sheet is inscribed: “In 1899 CE (VS 1956), thecaityawas established by the family of Kulanārāṃ (Kula Nārāyaṇa) Citrakāra.” From this statement, it is difficult to determine whether the entirecaityawas constructed in that year, or only the upper caitya portion was covered with the sheet; the inscriptional language does not make this clear."@en ;
