    rdfs:label "Construction of the golden gate"@en ;
    dcterms:description "At the main entrance to the courtyard, a golden gate was offered by Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā. The inscription mentions that the golden gate costmoha rū3,212. Some of the money was raised from selling an old gilt pinnacle, a bell and copper pots."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bbe0fc5e-d632-11e9-a1bd-0242ac140006> ;
