    rdfs:label "Collapse of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā had been in a poor condition. Due to the lack of repair, the roof collapsed during the heavy monsoon of 1987 CE. It remained in a ruinuous condition for 32 years."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bbf0265a-2f5e-46cf-a7b1-321c77b3d84b> ;
