<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bbf0265a-2f5e-46cf-a7b1-321c77b3d84b_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There is an inscription on the base of a niche embedded in the back wall of the Phalcā. The inscription documents the renovation work in 1743 CE by a person named Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa Amātya. Most likely, we can assume that a Phalcā stood there before this date."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bbf0265a-2f5e-46cf-a7b1-321c77b3d84b> ;
