<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bbf0265a-2f5e-46cf-a7b1-321c77b3d84b_3> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of a Viṣṇu statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There is another inscription from 1779 CE on the base of a niche which is embedded into the back wall of the Phalcā. The incomplete inscription reads \"......has been placed..........\" and doesn't mention what exactly was placed. It has been inscribed on the base of niche and statue of Viṣṇu can be seen at the centre of atoraṇainstalled over the niche. Most probably, it refers to the act of installing a statue of Viṣnu in the niche."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bbf0265a-2f5e-46cf-a7b1-321c77b3d84b> ;
    rdfs:comment "There is another inscription from 1779 CE on the base of a niche which is embedded into the back wall of the Phalcā. The incomplete inscription reads \"......has been placed..........\" and doesn't mention what exactly was placed. It has been inscribed on the base of niche and statue of Viṣṇu can be seen at the centre of atoraṇainstalled over the niche. Most probably, it refers to the act of installing a statue of Viṣnu in the niche."@en ;
