    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā was completely dismantled and reconstructed in a 'traditional style' again. New carved pillars were used and the platform was raised in height. The inscription is still there, but the candle stand has been lost."@en ;
