    rdfs:label "Offering of three toraṇas"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Five brothers—Dhana, Hāku, Kṛṣṇa, Siri, and Sukula, the sons of a man named Mani—jointly offered threetoraṇainside the temple."@en ;
