    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell (PNT0050-007)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of his late father Rāmakṛṣṇa Ghulu and late mother Īśvarīlakṣmī Ghulu, Śyāmakṛṣṇa Ghulu, together with his wife Bālakumārī Ghulū, donated a bell (PNT0050-007)."@en ;
