        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial Construction of the Bāhāḥ and Donations Made by Dhanasiṃ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Dhanasiṃ Tāmrākāra constructed thisbāhāḥinside his private house after he returned from Tibet. He offered this house to the Svayambhū Caitya and Vajrayogīnī.He also donated some cash to aguṭhīassociated withtheSvayambhū Caitya and contributed to the renovation of the large clay image at Buddhabārī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bc7fbe06-eec3-4f9d-8bf0-e72186e51e0b> ;
