<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bcb297bf-c0dc-4a2b-96f3-f4a8228683c9_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Residing Buṅgadyaḥ during Covid-19"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Covid-19 pandemic disrupted the chariot festival of Buṅgadyaḥ in 2020 CE. The statue of Buṅgadyaḥ was supposed to be accessioned to the chariot on the 1stof the bright fortnight of Vaiśākha but the chariot was not constructed due to the pandemic. Therefore, the statue was placed here on Dabū Phalcā until it was accessioned to the chariot on July 25, 2020."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bcb297bf-c0dc-4a2b-96f3-f4a8228683c9> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Covid-19 pandemic disrupted the chariot festival of Buṅgadyaḥ in 2020 CE. The statue of Buṅgadyaḥ was supposed to be accessioned to the chariot on the 1stof the bright fortnight of Vaiśākha but the chariot was not constructed due to the pandemic. Therefore, the statue was placed here on Dabū Phalcā until it was accessioned to the chariot on July 25, 2020."@en ;
