        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of Śrīnivāsa Malla,PramānaViśvambhara Bhāro of Cākra Bāhāra, Lalitpur, donated one and a halfropanīs of land to set up a trust for performing daily worship at the Bāḍegāũ Caitya. Of the income from this land, 20pāthīs of the harvest were allocated for the priest and 10pāthīs for the deity's worship."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bcb98cfb-bc5a-44a0-b497-d6b87ac4e77d> ;
