    rdfs:label "Offering a pair of lions"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jayadeva Vajrācārya, Dharaṃsiṅa Vajrācārya, Gopirāma Bhābo, and other members of the “Purṇimā Sevā Guthi” jointly established a pair of stone lions on either side of Ṣaḍakṣarī Lokeśvara."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bcb98cfb-bc5a-44a0-b497-d6b87ac4e77d> ;
