<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bcb98cfb-bc5a-44a0-b497-d6b87ac4e77d_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rearrangement of the guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A certain religious trust operated by Ranajita Kārki and Kavirāja Kārki was subsequently reorganized and brought back into operation. The income from the trust was to be used for conducting worships and hosting feasts. Individuals such as Siṃhamāna Kārki, Citradhoja Kārki, and Jagabira Kārki were involved in the management of the trust. Due to the erosion of text, the content of the inscription cannot be fully understood."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bcb98cfb-bc5a-44a0-b497-d6b87ac4e77d> ;
    rdfs:comment "A certain religious trust operated by Ranajita Kārki and Kavirāja Kārki was subsequently reorganized and brought back into operation. The income from the trust was to be used for conducting worships and hosting feasts. Individuals such as Siṃhamāna Kārki, Citradhoja Kārki, and Jagabira Kārki were involved in the management of the trust. Due to the erosion of text, the content of the inscription cannot be fully understood."@en ;
