    rdfs:label "Covering dharmadhātu maṇḍala with copper sheets"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Together with his sons Nīramuni and Tejamuni, Jujumuni established adharmadhātumaṇḍalain front of the Ṣaḍakṣarī Lokeśvara statue. With the permission of Jujumuni’s grandsons Kabiramuni, Kānchāmuni, and Maṃgalamuni, Bhimarāja Daṃgu of Dhvākhā Nani, Bāḍegāũ covered thedharmadhātumaṇḍalawith copper sheets."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bcb98cfb-bc5a-44a0-b497-d6b87ac4e77d> ;
