        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 2009, a house attached to the temple was dismantled to be reconstructed. During this process, the temple was damaged. Śrī Kvālkhu Ṭola Sudhāra Samiti therefore began renovations of the temple in 2009. This was completed in 2010 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bdca6826-e8d3-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
