<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bddc9722-2a25-48d6-a849-f9d0ae2b3f26_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription from 1746 CE (NS 866) documents the offering of a golden pinnacle to the temple at the premises and the construction of the five-bay arcade during the reign of King Raṇajita Malla. It is not clear whether the inscription found at the Maheśvarī Mandira (BKT0300) is related to the Sataḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bddc9722-2a25-48d6-a849-f9d0ae2b3f26> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription from 1746 CE (NS 866) documents the offering of a golden pinnacle to the temple at the premises and the construction of the five-bay arcade during the reign of King Raṇajita Malla. It is not clear whether the inscription found at the Maheśvarī Mandira (BKT0300) is related to the Sataḥ."@en ;
