<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bddc9722-2a25-48d6-a849-f9d0ae2b3f26_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Sataḥ underwent a significant transformation, as it was dismantled and reconstructed into its current form. In the 1970s, its previous structure featured jhĩgaṭī tiles on the roof and a bay window on the first floor. A photograph published by Pruscha in 1974 (p. 224) provides a visual record of this earlier appearance."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bddc9722-2a25-48d6-a849-f9d0ae2b3f26> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Sataḥ underwent a significant transformation, as it was dismantled and reconstructed into its current form. In the 1970s, its previous structure featured jhĩgaṭī tiles on the roof and a bay window on the first floor. A photograph published by Pruscha in 1974 (p. 224) provides a visual record of this earlier appearance."@en ;
