<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/be4d2749-ab41-429f-971c-aa80f2b8acd7_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of the Kṛṣṇa statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As mentioned in the 'description,' an inscription that used to be at the temple but has since been relocated to an unknown location** mentions a certain Siddheśvara Brāhmaṇa erecting a statue of Kṛṣṇa at his own residence. The Kṛṣṇa statue appears to have been installed on the ground floor of the donor's house before being relocated to where the temple now stands (November 2022 CE). The donor, Siddheśvara, was most likely a member of the clan of the renowned tantric Lambakarṇa Bhaṭṭa.** The inscription was published by S. Rājavaṃśī (VS 2027, p.114)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/be4d2749-ab41-429f-971c-aa80f2b8acd7> ;
    rdfs:comment "As mentioned in the 'description,' an inscription that used to be at the temple but has since been relocated to an unknown location** mentions a certain Siddheśvara Brāhmaṇa erecting a statue of Kṛṣṇa at his own residence. The Kṛṣṇa statue appears to have been installed on the ground floor of the donor's house before being relocated to where the temple now stands (November 2022 CE). The donor, Siddheśvara, was most likely a member of the clan of the renowned tantric Lambakarṇa Bhaṭṭa.** The inscription was published by S. Rājavaṃśī (VS 2027, p.114)."@en ;
