        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Inauguration of the renovated Deryang (courtyard building)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The brass plaque records the foundation laying by His Holiness the Dzarong Trulshik Shatrul Rinpoche in 2006 and the inauguration of the building by His Holiness the Dilgo Khyentse Rinpoche Yangsi in May 2011.The main donors to the project are listed. It is interesting to see how many of the area's former residents have emmigrated to foreign countries."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/be9d31f0-2cb2-40d0-8af9-3df0fcbb0040> ;
