    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In VS 2078 (2022 CE), Madhyapur Thimi Municipality allocated a budget for the simultaneous reconstruction of thephalchās, hiti, pond, and surrounding structures. At the same time, the ground was upgraded with stone paving."@en ;
