<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bee5d202-74c6-11ea-a71c-0242ac130006_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Funds were raised for the reconstruction of the building in 2017. The Lalitpur Metropolitan City provided 12lākhrupees (ca. 9,000 Euros), the descendants of the founder donated some additional money and locals contributed through charity works. The reconstruction work was completed in early 2020, but as of summer 2020 the formal inauguration had taken place."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bee5d202-74c6-11ea-a71c-0242ac130006> ;
    rdfs:comment "Funds were raised for the reconstruction of the building in 2017. The Lalitpur Metropolitan City provided 12lākhrupees (ca. 9,000 Euros), the descendants of the founder donated some additional money and locals contributed through charity works. The reconstruction work was completed in early 2020, but as of summer 2020 the formal inauguration had taken place."@en ;
