    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The phalcā was already in need of repair before it was further damaged in the 2015 earthquakes. A tree in front of the Gaṇeśa Mandira (LAL0840) fell on the building  and damaged its roof."@en ;
