    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jaṅga Bahādura offered a bell to the temple after its establishment. The bell inscription refers to the main deity as Kāmakāmeśvarī instead of Viśvarūpa."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bf182f12-6d0a-4fd9-b0bc-228d66eb7f76> ;
