    rdfs:label "Offering of gilt sheet"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Dhaṃcāthaku, Kānchīmāyā, Jagatamāyā and other family members offered a gilded metal sheet for upper roof of the temple during the reign of King Pṛthvīvikrama Śāha.राजा पृथ्वीविक्रम शाहको पालामा धंचाथकु, कान्छीमाया, जगतमाया आदि जाहान परिवारले मन्दिरको माथिल्लो छानामा सुवर्ण पाता हाले ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bf48c196-193c-4385-a752-4ff1b28870e1> ;
