<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bf48c196-193c-4385-a752-4ff1b28870e1_4> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of gilded roof embellishments"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Āśāmadu, Śivalāla, Bhaktalāla and other family members added a gilded embellishments to the edge of the roof they had donated six years earlier.आशामदु, शिवलाल, भक्तलाल आदि परिवारका सदस्य मिली आफूले छ वर्षपूर्व चढाएको सुवर्ण छानोको किनारमा सुवर्ण झलर हाले ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bf48c196-193c-4385-a752-4ff1b28870e1> ;
    rdfs:comment "Āśāmadu, Śivalāla, Bhaktalāla and other family members added a gilded embellishments to the edge of the roof they had donated six years earlier.आशामदु, शिवलाल, भक्तलाल आदि परिवारका सदस्य मिली आफूले छ वर्षपूर्व चढाएको सुवर्ण छानोको किनारमा सुवर्ण झलर हाले ।"@en ;
