<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bf48c196-193c-4385-a752-4ff1b28870e1_5> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of gilt roof sheet"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The fascia board on the middle roof displays the dates VS 1980 and VS 1985. Only the name Śivalāla is clearly legible on the inscription. It appears that during this period, the donor offered the gilded roof sheets. Śivalāla's family also offered gilded roof sheets with embellishments on the edge for the upper roof.मध्य तहको छानाको म्हुतःपौमा विसं १९८० र विसं १९८५ गरी दुई मिति उल्लेख छ । उक्त अभिलेखमा सीवलाल (शिवलाल) पढ्न सकिन्छ । यो अवधिमा यी दाताले दोस्रो तलाको छानो सुवर्ण पाताले मोडेको देखिन्छ । शिवलालकै परिवारले यस अघि माथिल्लो तलामा सुवर्ण छानो र झलर हालेका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bf48c196-193c-4385-a752-4ff1b28870e1> ;
    rdfs:comment "The fascia board on the middle roof displays the dates VS 1980 and VS 1985. Only the name Śivalāla is clearly legible on the inscription. It appears that during this period, the donor offered the gilded roof sheets. Śivalāla's family also offered gilded roof sheets with embellishments on the edge for the upper roof.मध्य तहको छानाको म्हुतःपौमा विसं १९८० र विसं १९८५ गरी दुई मिति उल्लेख छ । उक्त अभिलेखमा सीवलाल (शिवलाल) पढ्न सकिन्छ । यो अवधिमा यी दाताले दोस्रो तलाको छानो सुवर्ण पाताले मोडेको देखिन्छ । शिवलालकै परिवारले यस अघि माथिल्लो तलामा सुवर्ण छानो र झलर हालेका थिए ।"@en ;
