<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bff0fee1-3132-4993-9917-efa66f595c3a_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is no longer in readable condition. It records the family of Dayālakṣmī renovating some item or the temple itself that was made by Mahanta Siṃ in the name of Lord Gaṇeśa. Due to the illegibility of the text, the item that was renovated and the year the event took place are unclear. The inscription appears to belong to the 17th-18thcentury."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bff0fee1-3132-4993-9917-efa66f595c3a> ;
