<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/bff0fee1-3132-4993-9917-efa66f595c3a_4> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Formed in 1979 CE (VS 2036), the Śveta Gaṇeśa Yuvā Klaba started the renovation of the temple in 1980 CE (VS 2037). Thejhĩgaṭītiles on the temple’s roof were replaced with metal sheets painted in golden color during the renovation, which concluded in 1983 CE (VS 2040)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/bff0fee1-3132-4993-9917-efa66f595c3a> ;
    rdfs:comment "Formed in 1979 CE (VS 2036), the Śveta Gaṇeśa Yuvā Klaba started the renovation of the temple in 1980 CE (VS 2037). Thejhĩgaṭītiles on the temple’s roof were replaced with metal sheets painted in golden color during the renovation, which concluded in 1983 CE (VS 2040)."@en ;
