<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c0754b90-e124-4d81-a943-62db5de58de1_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A significant portion of the temple was damaged by the devastating 2015 CE earthquakes. The Department of Archaeology, acting on behalf of the Nepal Government, engaged the Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage (CACH) of the Chinese Government to oversee the restoration of the temple along with other adjacent monuments. Scaffoldings were erected around these structures, and the roofs were shielded with corrugated metal sheets to safeguard against rain. However, as of March 2024 CE, restoration work is yet to commence."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c0754b90-e124-4d81-a943-62db5de58de1> ;
    rdfs:comment "A significant portion of the temple was damaged by the devastating 2015 CE earthquakes. The Department of Archaeology, acting on behalf of the Nepal Government, engaged the Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage (CACH) of the Chinese Government to oversee the restoration of the temple along with other adjacent monuments. Scaffoldings were erected around these structures, and the roofs were shielded with corrugated metal sheets to safeguard against rain. However, as of March 2024 CE, restoration work is yet to commence."@en ;
