    rdfs:label "Damaged in earthquakes"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple was slightly damaged in the earthquakes of 2015. Navin Mangal Joshi, the chairman of the Kobāhāla Ṭola Sudhāra Samiti, is an engineer himself; he and his friends renovated the temple free of charge."@en ;
