    rdfs:label "Donation of 13 pinnacles"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The day after the statue of Vaṃśagopāla was installed in the sanctum, 13 pinnacles were fixed on top of the temple. Kīrtimaṅgalā and her husband also bestowed 30ropanīof land on the temple and established theguṭhī."@en ;
