<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c180db65-fd81-4bcf-bf53-0fb0bfd58564_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "With the support from the local community and Kirtipur Municipality, thephalcāunderwent restoration decades later a structure was erected on the platform of thephalcā. Theinscriptionthat records the construction of thephalcāis presently located in the nearby Nārāyaṇa Mandira (KIR0005). As part of this reconstruction effort, a statue of Tārā was installed in thephalcā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c180db65-fd81-4bcf-bf53-0fb0bfd58564> ;
    rdfs:comment "With the support from the local community and Kirtipur Municipality, thephalcāunderwent restoration decades later a structure was erected on the platform of thephalcā. Theinscriptionthat records the construction of thephalcāis presently located in the nearby Nārāyaṇa Mandira (KIR0005). As part of this reconstruction effort, a statue of Tārā was installed in thephalcā."@en ;
