<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c1954813-ad29-4e1c-b1a9-7447ac81ade3_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As Pāsikva Ajimā was originally apīṭha, no temple structure existed initially. Only an aniconic stone was installed in an open space beneath a pear tree. Since thepīṭhalay below the level of the road, worshippers had to descend seven steps to perform rituals, and during rainfall the site would become completely submerged. Consequently, funds were collected from devotees to raise thepīṭhaup to the level of the road. Thereafter, a small temple was constructed over the site, to which members of the royal family also contributed donations.पासिक्व अजिमा पीठ भएकोले कुनै मन्दिर निर्माण गरिएको थियो । नासपातीको रूखमुनि खुल्ला ठाउँमा आकृतिविहीन ढुङ्गा मात्र स्थापना गरिएको थियो । बाटोको सतहभन्दा पीठ तलपट्टि रहेकोले पूजा गर्नको लागि सातवटा खुड्किला झर्नुपर्थ्यो । पानी पर्दा पीठ पूरै डुब्ने गर्थ्यो । त्यसैले भक्तजनसँग चन्दा उठाएर पीठलाई बाटोको सतहसम्म उठाइएर स्थापना गरिएको थियो । त्यसपछि पीठको लागि सानो मन्दिर बनाइएको थियो । मन्दिर बनाउन राजपरिवारका सदस्यहरूले पनि चन्दा दिएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c1954813-ad29-4e1c-b1a9-7447ac81ade3> ;
    rdfs:comment "As Pāsikva Ajimā was originally apīṭha, no temple structure existed initially. Only an aniconic stone was installed in an open space beneath a pear tree. Since thepīṭhalay below the level of the road, worshippers had to descend seven steps to perform rituals, and during rainfall the site would become completely submerged. Consequently, funds were collected from devotees to raise thepīṭhaup to the level of the road. Thereafter, a small temple was constructed over the site, to which members of the royal family also contributed donations.पासिक्व अजिमा पीठ भएकोले कुनै मन्दिर निर्माण गरिएको थियो । नासपातीको रूखमुनि खुल्ला ठाउँमा आकृतिविहीन ढुङ्गा मात्र स्थापना गरिएको थियो । बाटोको सतहभन्दा पीठ तलपट्टि रहेकोले पूजा गर्नको लागि सातवटा खुड्किला झर्नुपर्थ्यो । पानी पर्दा पीठ पूरै डुब्ने गर्थ्यो । त्यसैले भक्तजनसँग चन्दा उठाएर पीठलाई बाटोको सतहसम्म उठाइएर स्थापना गरिएको थियो । त्यसपछि पीठको लागि सानो मन्दिर बनाइएको थियो । मन्दिर बनाउन राजपरिवारका सदस्यहरूले पनि चन्दा दिएका थिए ।"@en ;
