<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c1c37f40-b4fa-4cc7-89ab-ab47dd29262e_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā was dismantled in 1992 CE and integrated into a three-storied concrete building keeping the earlier three bays open. The Subāhāḥ Ṭola Development Committee had managed the reconstruction project with the financial support from Lalitpur Sub-metropolitan City. The local community also donated for this purpose."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c1c37f40-b4fa-4cc7-89ab-ab47dd29262e> ;
