<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c232bdac-f1a0-11e9-8649-0242ac130002_11> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the Bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This Bāhāḥ was damaged due to the earthquake in 1934. The temple situated at the center of the Vihāra'scourtyard was also damaged. When the temple was renovated, its lower roof was removed. Now it is just a single-roofed temple."@en ;
