<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c3ab5e57-1cd7-4a6c-9762-42fa0a1128ce_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the Śikharakūṭa Caitya and establishment of Gaṇeśa and Mahākāla"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Śikharakūṭa Caitya was renovated and statues of Gaṇeśa and Mahākāla were established. At that time Gyānapāra (Jñānapāla) was the thapāḥju of the bāhāḥ. The name of the donor could not be ascertained as the inscription is heavily damaged."@en ;
