    dcterms:description "Bāhaḥ was damaged by an earthquake in VS 2072 (2015).Kvāḥpāḥchẽof the bāhāḥ have been rebuilt at a cost of Rs 90 lakhs received from the Kathmandu Metropolitan City and Rs 19 lakhs collected from raising funds. Although the reconstruction work has been completed, it has not been inaugurated yet."@en ;
