<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c473d060-68b2-4ac2-9625-d83b71151062_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of an information board"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The information board installed by PURPP/LMC records the initial construction of thehitiand itsguthi. It reads: “Thishitiwas built in Nepal Sambat 870. The Makara headed Hiti faces north (sic). There is aguthiassociate with thehiti. The source of water of thishitiis Emudon, a hillock on the backside of thehiti.”There is no evidence to verify the information recorded on this board."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c473d060-68b2-4ac2-9625-d83b71151062> ;
    rdfs:comment "The information board installed by PURPP/LMC records the initial construction of thehitiand itsguthi. It reads: “Thishitiwas built in Nepal Sambat 870. The Makara headed Hiti faces north (sic). There is aguthiassociate with thehiti. The source of water of thishitiis Emudon, a hillock on the backside of thehiti.”There is no evidence to verify the information recorded on this board."@en ;
