        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a pair of metal flags"@en ;
    dcterms:description "At the entrance of the Bhuvaneśvara shrine, a pair of metal flags was installed on either side of the doorway through the joint efforts of Sidhīrāja (Siddhirāja), Lakṣmījoti, and Muni Thakuṃ."@en ;
