    dcterms:description "Kājī Ḍillisiṃha Basneta donated land parcels to establish a trust for the performance of daily and periodic rituals at the temple. King Surendra issued a copperplate inscription detailing the land parcels Ḍillīsiṃha donated in the name of the temple."@en ;
