        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Repairs of the stūpa, repair of six caityas and the courtyard paving."@en ;
    dcterms:description "Siṃhavīr Bhāvo, resident of Gaḥchẽ, during the reign of King Rajendra Vikarama Śāhadeva, repaired thestūpaby applyingvajralepaand changing the central pole. He alsorepaired sixcaityasin the courtyard (three at the north-east corner, two at the south-east corner and one at the north-west corner) and paved thestūpacourtyardwithteliyābricks."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c65d730c-e80b-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
