        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installing new statue of Gaṇeśa (THC0030-002)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As the previous Gaṇeśa statue was in poor state, Jitāsiṃ Bhābo, Tulsī Bhābo, Nasiṃ Bhābo, Kīrtimāna Bhābo, and others offered a new statue. They also established a religious trust by donating land for the worship of Gaṇeśa on the 8th of the dark fortnight of Phālguna. Rājamāna Śākya was the artist who crafted the new statue."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c6a2761c-ee3a-48c6-ab37-10c5bb775af3> ;
    rdfs:comment "As the previous Gaṇeśa statue was in poor state, Jitāsiṃ Bhābo, Tulsī Bhābo, Nasiṃ Bhābo, Kīrtimāna Bhābo, and others offered a new statue. They also established a religious trust by donating land for the worship of Gaṇeśa on the 8th of the dark fortnight of Phālguna. Rājamāna Śākya was the artist who crafted the new statue."@en ;
