    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple damaged by the 2015 earthquakes was reconstructed and the Brahmāyaṇī statue temporarily relocated to a nearbysataḥwas re-enshrined back to her usual seat in the temple after the installation of finial. The reconstruction was carried out by the Department of Archaeology."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c6a2761c-ee3a-48c6-ab37-10c5bb775af3> ;
