    rdfs:label "Construction of the śivālaya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple was constructed in honor of Yajñeśvarīdevī, the wife of Prime Minister Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā, and thus, it acquired the name Yajñeśvara."@en ;
