<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c6ce5cc1-ed5f-468a-90e7-4afe5d723128_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Commencement of reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The first elected local body following the promulgation of Nepal's new constitution allocated a budget for the reconstruction. Nearly 5 decades after thephalcā’s dismantling, reconstruction commenced in September 2021."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c6ce5cc1-ed5f-468a-90e7-4afe5d723128> ;
    rdfs:comment "The first elected local body following the promulgation of Nepal's new constitution allocated a budget for the reconstruction. Nearly 5 decades after thephalcā’s dismantling, reconstruction commenced in September 2021."@en ;
