<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c6f2a2cb-5131-4248-bd60-e28df97c4d71_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Indian Embassy provided financial assistance of around NRs. 1.56 million while the Lalitpur Metropolitan City contributed NRs. 600,000. Donations were collected from the locals as well to meet the shortfall. The Sataḥ was reconstructed at a total cost of NRs. 4 million."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c6f2a2cb-5131-4248-bd60-e28df97c4d71> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Indian Embassy provided financial assistance of around NRs. 1.56 million while the Lalitpur Metropolitan City contributed NRs. 600,000. Donations were collected from the locals as well to meet the shortfall. The Sataḥ was reconstructed at a total cost of NRs. 4 million."@en ;
