<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c6f2a2cb-5131-4248-bd60-e28df97c4d71_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of the Nyakū Jātrā Matayāḥ Central Management Committee's office"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Nyakūjātrā Matayāḥ Central Management Committee, the organization that manages the annualMatayāḥprocession in Patan, has established its office here at the Sataḥ. A contract was signed between the representatives of the Building Department of the Ministry of Urban Development and the committee that allowed the use of the Sataḥ by the latter. Senior culture expert Satyamohana Jośī inaugurated the office."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c6f2a2cb-5131-4248-bd60-e28df97c4d71> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Nyakūjātrā Matayāḥ Central Management Committee, the organization that manages the annualMatayāḥprocession in Patan, has established its office here at the Sataḥ. A contract was signed between the representatives of the Building Department of the Ministry of Urban Development and the committee that allowed the use of the Sataḥ by the latter. Senior culture expert Satyamohana Jośī inaugurated the office."@en ;
