        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhājunarasiṃha of the Śākya lineage from Dyaḥnanī (LAL2650), together with his family members, dedicated a bell in the name of the Mahālakṣmīpīṭha. The same individual also built the stonecaitya(object no. LAL2651-006) at Taḥdhananī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c76fb177-1c2d-4e05-9bb8-3a0764a5abcd> ;
