    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument (?)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The rectangular superstructure erected above thepīṭhabears \"19 Mahālakṣmī 97\" on its façade. This indicates that the structure was built in 1940–41 CE (NS 1097). It may have been reconstructed in this year, possibly following damage from the great earthquake of 1934 CE."@en ;
