<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/c82f05dc-3cca-41f1-8a32-e21c95676dcf_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As discussed in 'description', thissattalawas erected by Kājī Phaudavīra Rānā. After its construction, he installed a statue and established agūṭhīfor daily ritual worship. The lower part of the inscription lists the names Karavīra Rānā, Jvālā, Nanda, Trivinā, Buddhimatā, Ṣaḍgavīra (Khaḍgavīra) Rānā, Hematā, Saravarasiṃha Rānā, Lachimā, Raṇavīra Rānā, and Buddhilakṣmī, along with their figures. Karavīra Rānā and Khaḍgavīra Rānā are noted as siblings of Kājī Phaudavīra Rānā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c82f05dc-3cca-41f1-8a32-e21c95676dcf> ;
    rdfs:comment "As discussed in 'description', thissattalawas erected by Kājī Phaudavīra Rānā. After its construction, he installed a statue and established agūṭhīfor daily ritual worship. The lower part of the inscription lists the names Karavīra Rānā, Jvālā, Nanda, Trivinā, Buddhimatā, Ṣaḍgavīra (Khaḍgavīra) Rānā, Hematā, Saravarasiṃha Rānā, Lachimā, Raṇavīra Rānā, and Buddhilakṣmī, along with their figures. Karavīra Rānā and Khaḍgavīra Rānā are noted as siblings of Kājī Phaudavīra Rānā."@en ;
