    rdfs:label "Refurbishment of the palanquin"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhuvanesa Pradhāna undertook the refurbishment of the palanquin that holds significance in the yearly procession of the Gaṇeśa Mandira. This palanquin, a gift from his forebears, received the renovation under his care."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c8aa02e8-8f4e-45a2-8830-558edb70c685> ;
