    rdfs:label "Initial Construction of the Bāhāḥ, Construction of the Dharmadhātujinālaya Caitya, and the Establishment of the Esoteric Deity"@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of King Surendra Vikrama Śāha, Harṣanarasiṃha and his older brother Jīvanarasiṃha constructed this Bāhāḥ. On that occasion, Harṣanarasiṃha also established an esoteric deity (āgamadevatā) in the Bāhāḥ’skvāḥpāḥechẽ,and constructed a Dharmadhātujinālaya Caitya in the courtyard."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c9073acf-a4d3-42a6-b3e0-64bba8d596e3> ;
