    rdfs:label "Restoration of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 2020, the Lalitpur Municipality sponsered the restoration of thephalcā. Rather than reconstructing itfrom ground-up, the existing concrete structure was covered with traditional bricks, and a new pitched concrete roof, adorned with terracotta tiles reminiscent of historicjhĩgaṭīroof tiles, was added."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c955a75b-f223-473f-a256-82f8a1d068f5> ;
