    rdfs:label "Construction of the phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the details mentioned in the inscription, it is evident that apāṭī, orphalcā, was constructed; however, due to the erosion of the inscription’s letters, the construction date mentioned therein is no longer legible. The inscription records the names of donors such as Junā Mahārānī, Indra Bahādura Siṃha, and Kaviratna Narendranātha."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/c9f59910-4796-447e-9f21-7109cb16b2c0> ;
