<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ca61f6c0-e681-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Destruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Vihāra completely collapsed in the 1934 earthquake. The Saṅgha members and the surrounding Jyāpu community renovated it. Due to the 2015 earthquake, the back side of the monastic building also collapsed, and the front facade was severely cracked. The local residents therefore decided to demolish it."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ca61f6c0-e681-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Vihāra completely collapsed in the 1934 earthquake. The Saṅgha members and the surrounding Jyāpu community renovated it. Due to the 2015 earthquake, the back side of the monastic building also collapsed, and the front facade was severely cracked. The local residents therefore decided to demolish it."@en ;
