    rdfs:label "Theft of Hanumān and Garuḍa statues"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The statues of Hanumān and Garuḍa were stolen. Some days later, the statue of Hanumān was found on the banks of the Bagmati close to Kālamocana."@en ;
