<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/cb1604cc-eb5d-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "The earliest mention of Taḥ Bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A copperplate inscription at Ibāḥ Bahī mentions Taḥ Bāhāḥ as Śrīṭavabahāra. The inscription records the building of the esoteric shrine of Ibāḥ Bahī (LAL2730) in NS 547 (CE 1427) and that Lokarāma of Taḥ Bāhāḥ played a vital role as avajrācāryaduring the accomplishment ritual.The orifginal copperplate inscription could not be found at Ibāḥ Bahī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cb1604cc-eb5d-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "A copperplate inscription at Ibāḥ Bahī mentions Taḥ Bāhāḥ as Śrīṭavabahāra. The inscription records the building of the esoteric shrine of Ibāḥ Bahī (LAL2730) in NS 547 (CE 1427) and that Lokarāma of Taḥ Bāhāḥ played a vital role as avajrācāryaduring the accomplishment ritual.The orifginal copperplate inscription could not be found at Ibāḥ Bahī."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
