<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/cbae4fa5-4717-4c6c-9b34-eb8d696a09ba_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of a Nandī Statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "?? Kṛṣṇa Bhāro[1](text: Bhāvo), Laṃsiha Bhāro, Mālasika Bhāro, Kutu Bhāro, and other Bhāros jointly installed this stone statue of Nandī in front of the Cvaḥpvaḥ Gaṇeśa temple.Footnotes^Two characters of this name are illegible in the inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cbae4fa5-4717-4c6c-9b34-eb8d696a09ba> ;
