<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/cbb04376-e0c4-40df-a2fb-3e734bb02f3a_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction and land endowment"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the now-lost inscription found on the site (refer to D. Vajrācārya and Ṭ. Śreṣṭha, VS 2032, second part, p. 9), a Brahmin constructed the Maṭha and allocated lands for its upkeep during the reign of Pratāpa Malla. When Vajrācārya and Ṭ. Śreṣṭha read the inscription, it was already eroded, with only the number seven visible.The inscription in their edition reads as follows:[L1.] शुभ ॥ सम्वत् ७ …. वैशाख … राजराजेन्द्र कवीन्द्र जयप्रतापमल्ल प्रभु ठाकुरस विजयराज्ये[L2.] श्रीनिवक्वाठया व्राह्मन …. तुलसिया मठ दयका …. वु ….[L3.] पिक दुंता थो वुया ओलसानन, गुथि …. (म)न्दिर दयके माल । थो सेनकुम्हया महापातक"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cbb04376-e0c4-40df-a2fb-3e734bb02f3a> ;
    rdfs:comment "According to the now-lost inscription found on the site (refer to D. Vajrācārya and Ṭ. Śreṣṭha, VS 2032, second part, p. 9), a Brahmin constructed the Maṭha and allocated lands for its upkeep during the reign of Pratāpa Malla. When Vajrācārya and Ṭ. Śreṣṭha read the inscription, it was already eroded, with only the number seven visible.The inscription in their edition reads as follows:[L1.] शुभ ॥ सम्वत् ७ …. वैशाख … राजराजेन्द्र कवीन्द्र जयप्रतापमल्ल प्रभु ठाकुरस विजयराज्ये[L2.] श्रीनिवक्वाठया व्राह्मन …. तुलसिया मठ दयका …. वु ….[L3.] पिक दुंता थो वुया ओलसानन, गुथि …. (म)न्दिर दयके माल । थो सेनकुम्हया महापातक"@en ;
