    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Centre for Integrated Urban Development (CIUD) rebuilt the Phalcā from the ground up using entirely new materials. After the reconstruction, the Gaṇeśa Mandira (BUN0021) and this Phalcā were both inaugurated simultaneously."@en ;
