<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/cc0b67f5-5907-4b7a-8283-9fffb779ba91_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Added water spout"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Later, by adding one more spout to the existing twenty-one, Raṇabahādura Śāha expanded it into a set of twenty-two spouts. From that time onwards, the site came to be known as Balaju Bāisadhara (Balaju Twenty-Two Spouts).एक्काईवटा हिति भएको ठाउँमा थप एकवटा हितिको निर्माण गरी रण बहादुर शाहले बाइसधारा बनाएको थियो । त्यस बेलादेखि यस धारालाई 'बालाजु बाइसधारा\" भन्न थालेको हो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cc0b67f5-5907-4b7a-8283-9fffb779ba91> ;
    rdfs:comment "Later, by adding one more spout to the existing twenty-one, Raṇabahādura Śāha expanded it into a set of twenty-two spouts. From that time onwards, the site came to be known as Balaju Bāisadhara (Balaju Twenty-Two Spouts).एक्काईवटा हिति भएको ठाउँमा थप एकवटा हितिको निर्माण गरी रण बहादुर शाहले बाइसधारा बनाएको थियो । त्यस बेलादेखि यस धारालाई 'बालाजु बाइसधारा\" भन्न थालेको हो ।"@en ;
