        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Inauguration"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Bāisadhārā Udyāna (Twenty-Two Spouts Garden), constructed through the Valley Development Committee and public cooperation, was formally inaugurated by Dr. Tulśī Giri, the Chairman of the Cabinet.उपत्यका निर्माण समिति र जनसहयोजद्वारा निर्मित 'बाइसधारा उद्यान' को उद्घाटन मन्त्री परिषदका अध्धक्ष डा. तुल्शी गिरिले गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cc0b67f5-5907-4b7a-8283-9fffb779ba91> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Bāisadhārā Udyāna (Twenty-Two Spouts Garden), constructed through the Valley Development Committee and public cooperation, was formally inaugurated by Dr. Tulśī Giri, the Chairman of the Cabinet.उपत्यका निर्माण समिति र जनसहयोजद्वारा निर्मित 'बाइसधारा उद्यान' को उद्घाटन मन्त्री परिषदका अध्धक्ष डा. तुल्शी गिरिले गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
