<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/cc74e5d8-b70a-4612-8c34-ea4e721f1d4c_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of money"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription posted on the plinth of the statue of Nandī deals with the donation of money by some devotees to form aguthifor worshipping Sumeśvara Mahādeva on Śivarātrī and offering animal sacrifice to the Gaṇeśa enshrined nearby. The donation took place on the 13th of the dark fortnight of Māgha but the year is illegible due to the erosion of the text. The donor’s name is also unreadable due to the same reason."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cc74e5d8-b70a-4612-8c34-ea4e721f1d4c> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription posted on the plinth of the statue of Nandī deals with the donation of money by some devotees to form aguthifor worshipping Sumeśvara Mahādeva on Śivarātrī and offering animal sacrifice to the Gaṇeśa enshrined nearby. The donation took place on the 13th of the dark fortnight of Māgha but the year is illegible due to the erosion of the text. The donor’s name is also unreadable due to the same reason."@en ;
