    rdfs:label "Renovation of Sumeśvara Mahādeva Shrine"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A marble inscription posted on the western side of the plinth of the statue of Nandī records the renovation of Sumeśvara Mahādeva Shrine by Lakṣmībhakta Śreṣṭha and his family in memory of his deceased parents Haribhakta Śhreṣṭha and Ṭikāmāyā Śhreṣṭha."@en ;
