    dcterms:description "To the left of the sanctum door, below the Gaṇeśa statue, one can find a stone inscription. In 2014,Śākya(1134, 118) read four lines of the inscription. These lines recorded the anniversary ritual worship of thebāhāḥand some names of thesaṅghamembers. Tthe inscription is now far too damaged to be legible."@en ;
