        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding the entrance gate to pīṭha"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As the original wooden entrance door to the pīṭha had decayed and broken, it was reconstructed in cement with the support of Indra Bahādura, Caṅkha Māyā, and their associates. Since the inscription lacks a date, the precise year of reconstruction cannot be determined."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cdf3de81-c5a5-4f35-85cc-d61ecaacdf9d> ;
