    rdfs:label "Donation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Nārja Māyā, wife of Harimāna, along with Nārāyaṇa of Putalisadak, his wife, and other donors, contributed funds to the Taḥdhaṃ Guṭhī of Khićā Pokharī, assigning the responsibility to Harimāna Taṇḍukāra and other members to perform annual ancestral rites after their deaths. However, no date is inscribed on this record."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cdf3de81-c5a5-4f35-85cc-d61ecaacdf9d> ;
