        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā and establishment of statues of Umā-Maheśvara and Lakṣmī-Nārāyaṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Vidyānanda Śarmā established aphalcāalong with images of Umā-Maheśvara and Lakṣmī-Nārāyaṇa at Corcā Hiti. The pavilion and the Umā-Maheśvara sculpture no longer survive, but the Lakṣmī-Nārāyaṇa image mentioned in the inscription may correspond to the Lakṣmī-Nārāyaṇa (BKT0820-007) still visible on the northern wall of the Hiti."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/cf84f4a3-7758-4f8a-8a73-ca33b2c49ea9> ;
