<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d024e070-e7f5-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_8> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovations and donations"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Between NS 1000 and 1081 several renovations and restd donations took place, e.g.NS 1000: The roof of the temple (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) was renovated by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha members.NS 1000: Roofs of the temple (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) were covered with gilded copper by Yoga Vīra Siṃha and Byakhārā Vajrācārya.NS 1000: In front of the main entrance of the temple (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) a brass Yajñasālā was installed by Harṣa Vīra.NS 1013: The main deity (kvaḥpāḥdyaḥ) was temporarily shifted by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha members.NS 1025: Rebuiling of a house by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha members with funding from the BāhāḥNS 1030: Addition oftoraṇasba DanakutũNS 1030: Donation of Bhikku statues by Tataḥ Guṭhī members of Haka BāhāḥNS 1034: Installation of a Prajñāpāramitā statue by Dharma rāj and Ratna VajrācāryaNS 1046: Donation of a Vajra by TrailokyamuniNS 1054: Donation of an oil-lamp balustradeNS 1055: Renovation work started by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha membersNS 1056: Donation of lions and Lokeśvara by Pūrṇa Bahādura VajrācāryaNS 1059: Donation of a gate with oil-lamps by Dharmarāj VajrācāryaNS 1060: Donation of stone elephants by TrailokyamuniNS 1060: Donation of a Dharmadhātu Maṇḍala by Cidhimāya"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d024e070-e7f5-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Between NS 1000 and 1081 several renovations and restd donations took place, e.g.NS 1000: The roof of the temple (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) was renovated by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha members.NS 1000: Roofs of the temple (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) were covered with gilded copper by Yoga Vīra Siṃha and Byakhārā Vajrācārya.NS 1000: In front of the main entrance of the temple (kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ) a brass Yajñasālā was installed by Harṣa Vīra.NS 1013: The main deity (kvaḥpāḥdyaḥ) was temporarily shifted by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha members.NS 1025: Rebuiling of a house by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha members with funding from the BāhāḥNS 1030: Addition oftoraṇasba DanakutũNS 1030: Donation of Bhikku statues by Tataḥ Guṭhī members of Haka BāhāḥNS 1034: Installation of a Prajñāpāramitā statue by Dharma rāj and Ratna VajrācāryaNS 1046: Donation of a Vajra by TrailokyamuniNS 1054: Donation of an oil-lamp balustradeNS 1055: Renovation work started by Cakreśvara and other Saṅgha membersNS 1056: Donation of lions and Lokeśvara by Pūrṇa Bahādura VajrācāryaNS 1059: Donation of a gate with oil-lamps by Dharmarāj VajrācāryaNS 1060: Donation of stone elephants by TrailokyamuniNS 1060: Donation of a Dharmadhātu Maṇḍala by Cidhimāya"@en ;
