<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d13507a3-aaee-4f4a-9f55-8546a8a801d8_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Destruction and rebuilt"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Theśikhara-style temple built by Pratāpa Malla was badly damaged in the 1934 CE (1990 VS) earthquake and was subsequently reconstructed by Juddha Śamaśera Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d13507a3-aaee-4f4a-9f55-8546a8a801d8> ;
    rdfs:comment "Theśikhara-style temple built by Pratāpa Malla was badly damaged in the 1934 CE (1990 VS) earthquake and was subsequently reconstructed by Juddha Śamaśera Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā."@en ;
