<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d1fe9550-9469-487a-b0b1-6aa5b6513dd0_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding"@en ;
    dcterms:description "As mentioned above in the description, a vehicle, while clearing away the debris of the buildings that collapsed in the 2015 earthquakes, knocked the Shrine down. As the locals threatened to keep the vehicle in their possession until the Shrine was rebuilt, the vehicle owner got the Shrine reconstructed soon after the incident."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d1fe9550-9469-487a-b0b1-6aa5b6513dd0> ;
