<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d292d972-7a85-4e3e-8af6-75db779adaab_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a chaitya (near to the phalcā)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A stone inscription from NS 931 does not belong to this Phalcā even though has been embedded into the eastern wall. However, it belongs to the nearby stone caitya (KIR0073) and informs about its construction.  The full text and ink impression of this inscription has published by Shokoohy and others (VS 2014, 289-290)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d292d972-7a85-4e3e-8af6-75db779adaab> ;
    rdfs:comment "A stone inscription from NS 931 does not belong to this Phalcā even though has been embedded into the eastern wall. However, it belongs to the nearby stone caitya (KIR0073) and informs about its construction.  The full text and ink impression of this inscription has published by Shokoohy and others (VS 2014, 289-290)."@en ;
