        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of ?"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Locals of Asana (text: Aśvaka Maṇḍapa) renovated thenipathapuli(?) of Annapūrṇā (text: Asaṃmaru Ajimā) temple. Harṣabhadra Vajrācārya of Taḥchẽ Bāhāḥ was the priest who officiated various rituals involved in the course of the renovation."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77> ;
    rdfs:comment "Locals of Asana (text: Aśvaka Maṇḍapa) renovated thenipathapuli(?) of Annapūrṇā (text: Asaṃmaru Ajimā) temple. Harṣabhadra Vajrācārya of Taḥchẽ Bāhāḥ was the priest who officiated various rituals involved in the course of the renovation."@en ;
