<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77_10> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of gilt toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mohanavīrasiṃha (text: Mohanavīrasiṃ) and his wife Bekhālāni installed a goldentoraṇaon top of the northern entrance of the temple. His father Cakravīrasiṃha (text: Cakravirasiṃ) had wished to make the offering that was fulfilled by his son and daughter-in-law."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77> ;
    rdfs:comment "Mohanavīrasiṃha (text: Mohanavīrasiṃ) and his wife Bekhālāni installed a goldentoraṇaon top of the northern entrance of the temple. His father Cakravīrasiṃha (text: Cakravirasiṃ) had wished to make the offering that was fulfilled by his son and daughter-in-law."@en ;
