<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77_11> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of toraṇa (B)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A donor from the Tulādhara community offered a goldentoraṇaon top of the southern entrance of the temple. The name of the donor, a resident of Ontāchẽ (lit. eastern house) at Bākunani in Asana, is unclear as the name is covered in the inscription."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77> ;
