    rdfs:label "Covering of wooden frame with silver plate"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Residents of Bhoṭāhiṭī, Balarāma Śreṣṭha, his younger brother Kṛṣṇalāla Śreṣṭha, and the family installed a silver cover on the wooden frame of the front entrance to the sanctum."@en ;
