    dcterms:description "Mohanavīrasiṃha (text: Mohanavirasiṃ), his wife Bekhālāni, and the family installed covers of brass sheets on the statues ofaṣṭamātṛkā, Siṃhinī, Vyāghrinī, the five Tārās, along with the beams, capitals, cornices, etc. of the temple."@en ;
