<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77_23> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of many objects and beautification of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Asana Sevā Samiti, another local organization, collected donations to improve the temple aesthetically. Silver statues of theaṣṭamātṛkādeities were installed inside the sanctum along with the addition of theaṣṭamaṅgalaemblems together with silverkalaśas on either side. The statue of the serpent in the sanctum was gilded. Two largekalaśas were established in front of the temple with a smallerkalaśaeach on the other three sides. Brass sheets were set on the steps by the main entrance. The Patāḥ hanging from the finial was also cleaned and regilded on the occasion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77> ;
    rdfs:comment "Asana Sevā Samiti, another local organization, collected donations to improve the temple aesthetically. Silver statues of theaṣṭamātṛkādeities were installed inside the sanctum along with the addition of theaṣṭamaṅgalaemblems together with silverkalaśas on either side. The statue of the serpent in the sanctum was gilded. Two largekalaśas were established in front of the temple with a smallerkalaśaeach on the other three sides. Brass sheets were set on the steps by the main entrance. The Patāḥ hanging from the finial was also cleaned and regilded on the occasion."@en ;
