<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Arrange of fund for rituals"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A royal decree set aside the rent obtained from certain shops at the Asana square to be used for observing various socio-cultural activities in the area including the annual procession of Annapūrṇā. The content of the decree issued through a document was also ordered to be placed at the temple in the form of an inscription. Besides the enforcement of the decree, the inscription also records Hākyā Kaṭuvāla pledging to offer 1dhārnīof vermillion powder to the deity during her annual procession while submitting Rs. 100 to the government."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d30593b5-c63b-47d9-90a0-b101b2ebac77> ;
    rdfs:comment "A royal decree set aside the rent obtained from certain shops at the Asana square to be used for observing various socio-cultural activities in the area including the annual procession of Annapūrṇā. The content of the decree issued through a document was also ordered to be placed at the temple in the form of an inscription. Besides the enforcement of the decree, the inscription also records Hākyā Kaṭuvāla pledging to offer 1dhārnīof vermillion powder to the deity during her annual procession while submitting Rs. 100 to the government."@en ;
