    rdfs:label "Replacement of roof (B)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jayanarasiṃhalakṣmī (text: Jayanarasiṃlakṣmi), his wife, and other family members laid the second tier of the temple with gilded sheets, fulfilling the pledge of his deceased elder brother Manorathasiṃha (text: Manorathasiṃ)."@en ;
