    rdfs:label "Renovation and addition  of a statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In CE 2005 (NS 1125), the Lalitpur Sub-Metropolitan City restored the temple. During this restoration, local Dharma Maharjana installed a new statue of Hariśaṅkara in place of the one that had been lost (local resident, Maharjana, male, age 64)."@en ;
