<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d3c6eaf6-e76f-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The construction of Bhelāchẽ Phalcā was funded by a Khusaḥ (Taṇḍukār) family, the descendents of Mangal Tandukar. However, Mr. Tandukar could not remember the name of his ancestor who actually commissioned the Phalcā. According to the house owner, the Phalcā was rebuilt some 20 years ago (around 1995/2000 CE). Niels Gutschow estimates 1980 to be the date of reconstruction, but this could not be confirmed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d3c6eaf6-e76f-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The construction of Bhelāchẽ Phalcā was funded by a Khusaḥ (Taṇḍukār) family, the descendents of Mangal Tandukar. However, Mr. Tandukar could not remember the name of his ancestor who actually commissioned the Phalcā. According to the house owner, the Phalcā was rebuilt some 20 years ago (around 1995/2000 CE). Niels Gutschow estimates 1980 to be the date of reconstruction, but this could not be confirmed."@en ;
