        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Concrete reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Phalcā was in a bad condition and on the verge of collapse. Mr Tandukar had it dismantled and rebuilt in its present structure in the late 1990s. The Bhelāchẽ Phalcā was converted into a concrete Phalcā with a terrace on top."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d3c6eaf6-e76f-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Phalcā was in a bad condition and on the verge of collapse. Mr Tandukar had it dismantled and rebuilt in its present structure in the late 1990s. The Bhelāchẽ Phalcā was converted into a concrete Phalcā with a terrace on top."@en ;
