    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Dhanamaiju Bhavānī Sundarī Śāhī Śreṣṭha reconstructed it from the ground up by collecting donations. The roof was laid with copper sheets and a metal banner (patāḥ) was also offered on the same occasion. Ceramic tiles were also set on the walls of the Temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d3d8374d-b008-48d8-a2cf-591261ea56b2> ;
