    rdfs:label "Renovation of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Although there is a stone inscription from NS 812 (1692 CE) embedded in the eastern wall of the compound, it is not associated with the shrine. Rather, the inscription commemorates the restoration of aphalcāby Danasiṃha Bhāro and Gaṃgārāma from the Kvahiti Ṭola. The current or former location of thephalcāis unknown."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d4647012-a10e-4bba-b9c3-487dffc969ca> ;
