    dcterms:description "A joint effort by the descendants of donor Kularāja Pā̃ḍe and the Kulabhakteśvara Saṃrakṣaṇa Samiti, a local committee formed for the conservation of the temple, led to the reconstruction of the rest houses in the temple premises."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d4b910cb-6665-466f-8211-9f1525a07057> ;
