<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d52dcb5c-6f3b-4b23-86d0-de4e40dddda0_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the sattalas around the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Lakṣmīdevī, the third concubine of King Raṇabahādura Śāha, initiated the construction ofcaugharā sataḥ, a series of rest houses encircling the temple. This space served as both a refuge for devotees and a place to house additional deities."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d52dcb5c-6f3b-4b23-86d0-de4e40dddda0> ;
    rdfs:comment "Lakṣmīdevī, the third concubine of King Raṇabahādura Śāha, initiated the construction ofcaugharā sataḥ, a series of rest houses encircling the temple. This space served as both a refuge for devotees and a place to house additional deities."@en ;
