<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d52dcb5c-6f3b-4b23-86d0-de4e40dddda0_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Department of Archaeology began rebuilding the temple andcaugharāsataḥaround it in 2017 CE (VS 2074), two years after the earthquake. However, the reconstruction was completed only in 2021 CE (VS 2078). The rebuilt structures were formally inaugurated amid a formal ceremony."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d52dcb5c-6f3b-4b23-86d0-de4e40dddda0> ;
