    rdfs:label "Bhāi Degaḥ, destruction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple was levelled in the 1934 earthquake. It was later rebuilt as a simple one-storey structure with a domed roof. The KVPT is now reconstructing the temple in its original pagoda style (in 2019)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d5354d0a-fb98-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
