        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of guardian lion"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A pair of guardian lions, flanking the sanctum was installed (note that name of the donor who commissioned these statues is not readable in the inscription). The legible part of the inscription records that Vijaya Bhāva, Ṅakurisiṃ Bhāva and Manasiṃṅa Bhāva are supposed to take care of these guardian lions."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d62e32fe-b78c-43af-817c-edb16e6d7ae8> ;
