<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d62e32fe-b78c-43af-817c-edb16e6d7ae8_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Constructing road, its renovation and pavements of stones"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records that Bhāginātha (Bhāgīnātha) Bhāva, Dharmmanātha Bhāva, Dhanadeva Bhāva and Siddhinātha Bhāv renovated the stone-paved road which was constructed by their grandfather, Vijaya Bhāro of Thaṃbāhāḥ. The inscription further mentions that Vijaya Bhāro had also paved the courtyards of other nearby shrines with stones."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d62e32fe-b78c-43af-817c-edb16e6d7ae8> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription records that Bhāginātha (Bhāgīnātha) Bhāva, Dharmmanātha Bhāva, Dhanadeva Bhāva and Siddhinātha Bhāv renovated the stone-paved road which was constructed by their grandfather, Vijaya Bhāro of Thaṃbāhāḥ. The inscription further mentions that Vijaya Bhāro had also paved the courtyards of other nearby shrines with stones."@en ;
