    rdfs:label "Establishment of a maṭha"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Although situated within the temple premises, the inscription documenting this event is not directly related to the monument itself. The inscription commemorates the establishment of a monastic retreat (maṭha) for ascetics by Harikeśara Vana Gusāyi. However, the exact identity of themaṭharemains unclear."@en ;
