    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d7e3c28c-e1ab-430b-9b2d-9b69475905a9> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d7e3c28c-e1ab-430b-9b2d-9b69475905a9_3> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilt of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Based on the photograph showing the remnants of the Phalcā and memories of the community’s older members, the Phalcā was reconstructed in 2015 CE (2075 VS). During this reconstruction, one of the inscriptions taken to the nearby Nārāyaṇa temple was reinstalled in the Phalcā. but the other inscription and the Umāmaheśvara statue have not been moved."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d7e3c28c-e1ab-430b-9b2d-9b69475905a9> ;
    rdfs:comment "Based on the photograph showing the remnants of the Phalcā and memories of the community’s older members, the Phalcā was reconstructed in 2015 CE (2075 VS). During this reconstruction, one of the inscriptions taken to the nearby Nārāyaṇa temple was reinstalled in the Phalcā. but the other inscription and the Umāmaheśvara statue have not been moved."@en ;
