        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Enhancement with golden doorway and gilded artifacts"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Maṃgalalāla Bhomī from Yātāchẽ Ṭola added a touch of grandeur to the temple by affixing a gilded covering to the entrance andtoraṇas, and gilding the statue of a goddess."@en ;
