<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d86c93ef-871c-4c0f-b33f-b44361137d5b_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a stone toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhānna Siṃha, Siṃgha Bhālo, his wife Budhi Thakuṃ, Jagatamā Siṃha, and others jointly dedicated a stonetoraṇa(ornamental gateway) to Dakṣiṇa Vārāhī.भान्नसिं, सिंघ भालो, उनकी श्रीमती बुधि थकुं, जगतमासिं लगायतका व्यक्तिहरूले मिलेर दक्षिण वाराहीलाई ढुङ्गाको तोरण चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d86c93ef-871c-4c0f-b33f-b44361137d5b> ;
    rdfs:comment "Bhānna Siṃha, Siṃgha Bhālo, his wife Budhi Thakuṃ, Jagatamā Siṃha, and others jointly dedicated a stonetoraṇa(ornamental gateway) to Dakṣiṇa Vārāhī.भान्नसिं, सिंघ भालो, उनकी श्रीमती बुधि थकुं, जगतमासिं लगायतका व्यक्तिहरूले मिलेर दक्षिण वाराहीलाई ढुङ्गाको तोरण चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
