<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d86c93ef-871c-4c0f-b33f-b44361137d5b_5> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering a patāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kṛṣṇa Kāji Bhāsimā and Pañcalakṣmī Bhāsimā of Nayā Thimi, along with others, jointly offered a metalpatāḥ(ritual plate or plaque) to the Dakṣiṇa Vārāhī temple.नयाँ थिमि निवासी कृष्ण काजी भासिमा, पञ्चलक्ष्मी भासिमा लगायतका व्यक्तिहरूले मिलेर दक्षिण वाराही मन्दिरमा धातुको पताः चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d86c93ef-871c-4c0f-b33f-b44361137d5b> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kṛṣṇa Kāji Bhāsimā and Pañcalakṣmī Bhāsimā of Nayā Thimi, along with others, jointly offered a metalpatāḥ(ritual plate or plaque) to the Dakṣiṇa Vārāhī temple.नयाँ थिमि निवासी कृष्ण काजी भासिमा, पञ्चलक्ष्मी भासिमा लगायतका व्यक्तिहरूले मिलेर दक्षिण वाराही मन्दिरमा धातुको पताः चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
