<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d86c93ef-871c-4c0f-b33f-b44361137d5b_8> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a flag (THI0170-004)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Rameśa Kumāra Śreṣṭha offered a metal flag (THI0170-004) to the Dakṣiṇa Vārāhī temple.रमेश कुमार श्रेष्ठले दक्षिण वाराही मन्दिरमा धातुको झण्डा (THI0170-004) चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
