<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d8892589-6d9d-40e5-83e8-d41ea7410385_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The 2015 earthquakes completely destroyed the arcaded platform, which, at that time, was already in a dilapidated condition. The Department of Archaeology reconstructed Sāmarī Pauvā and installed a colored metal sheet roof in place of the original tiled roof. Despite the completion of the reconstruction, it has not yet been formally inaugurated (as of June 2024)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d8892589-6d9d-40e5-83e8-d41ea7410385> ;
    rdfs:comment "The 2015 earthquakes completely destroyed the arcaded platform, which, at that time, was already in a dilapidated condition. The Department of Archaeology reconstructed Sāmarī Pauvā and installed a colored metal sheet roof in place of the original tiled roof. Despite the completion of the reconstruction, it has not yet been formally inaugurated (as of June 2024)."@en ;
