<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d966be8e-e82b-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Restoration of the sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 1851 CE, thesataḥwas restored by members of the Jośī family from Nhulachẽnani on the eastern side of Kvālkhu Ṭola. The following names could be gleaned from the inscription: Daivajña Jaya Kṛṣna, Dhana Kṛṣna, Rāma Kṛṣna and Rāma Sundhara."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d966be8e-e82b-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "In 1851 CE, thesataḥwas restored by members of the Jośī family from Nhulachẽnani on the eastern side of Kvālkhu Ṭola. The following names could be gleaned from the inscription: Daivajña Jaya Kṛṣna, Dhana Kṛṣna, Rāma Kṛṣna and Rāma Sundhara."@en ;
