<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/d991b1bf-0841-4c1a-b4a6-a9a3cd9c56e9_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The erosion of the inscription has made it difficult to read. The mention of Vaṃśīdhara Nārāyaṇa suggests he may have built the temple, while another name, with the ascetic caste title Gusāyi, appears below, possibly indicating his role in temple rituals and care (see'description')."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/d991b1bf-0841-4c1a-b4a6-a9a3cd9c56e9> ;
