<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/da572af6-f404-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the phalcā near the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription dated NS 843 can be found inside the sanctum. This mentions that Siddhinātha made aphalcāand donated some land. The top image of Nārāyaṇa shows that thephalcāwas related to the deity. Local elder people say that there was once aphalcāclose to the temple. It seems that thephalcāinscription was placed inside the temple after thephalcāwas destroyed."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/da572af6-f404-11e9-a3c8-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription dated NS 843 can be found inside the sanctum. This mentions that Siddhinātha made aphalcāand donated some land. The top image of Nārāyaṇa shows that thephalcāwas related to the deity. Local elder people say that there was once aphalcāclose to the temple. It seems that thephalcāinscription was placed inside the temple after thephalcāwas destroyed."@en ;
