    rdfs:label "Construction (probably the initial construction of the temple)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There is an inscription on the base of a strutat the south-west corner of the first floor. It mentions that a group of nine member led by Keśavarāja Bhāro constructed something in NS 802. The construction work it refers to was most likely the initial construction of the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/dbee183c-e72c-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
