<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/dbee183c-e72c-11e9-b125-0242ac130002_6> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the two lower roofs by replacing the tiles with copper plates"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There used to be a tiled roof (jhĩgaṭī) on the two lower storeys. However, the tiles were removed from roofs and replaced with copper plates by ValkhuGaṇeśa Upabhokttā Samiti. The President of the Samiti was Mohana Prasāda Jośī. The old tiled roofs can be seen inPruscha's (1975, 177) inventory."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/dbee183c-e72c-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
    rdfs:comment "There used to be a tiled roof (jhĩgaṭī) on the two lower storeys. However, the tiles were removed from roofs and replaced with copper plates by ValkhuGaṇeśa Upabhokttā Samiti. The President of the Samiti was Mohana Prasāda Jośī. The old tiled roofs can be seen inPruscha's (1975, 177) inventory."@en ;
