        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Covering of the crafted wooden frame with embossed brass plate"@en ;
    dcterms:description "There is a niche at the centre of the sanctum where the main images of Gaṇeśa are kept. The outer part of the niche is decorated in a crafted wooden frame. This frame was covered with embossed brass plate by Kīrtimāna and his wife Padmāvatī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/dbee183c-e72c-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
