<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/dc4fbbf9-6714-46c6-95ca-bb0dc5174b85_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction (?)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is from the late Malla period, but is too eroded to decipher its content. As it features a carving of a trident, Śiva’s implement, suggesting a connection to this Śiva temple. This suggests the temple’s late Malla origins."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/dc4fbbf9-6714-46c6-95ca-bb0dc5174b85> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription is from the late Malla period, but is too eroded to decipher its content. As it features a carving of a trident, Śiva’s implement, suggesting a connection to this Śiva temple. This suggests the temple’s late Malla origins."@en ;
