        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the pīṭha"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thepīṭhawas renovated through donations collected from devotees. The shrine, which had previously been open, was covered with a roof and fitted with a door after renovation.भक्तजनसँग चन्दा उठाएर पीठको जीर्णोद्धार गरिएको थियो । पहिले खुल्ला रहेको पीठलाई जीर्णोद्धारपछि छाना राखेर छोप्नुका साथै ढोका पनि राखिएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/dcca854a-7b22-4bce-abf9-226ee7fa1993> ;
