        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Offering utensils to guthi"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The male donor, Siddhisiṃha, offered relevant utensils related to the Caitya in front of the Phalcā to theguthi. He also started the tradition of lighting up oil lamps around the Caitya and distributingsamaybaji,syāḥbaji, meat and rice bearfrom here on the day of arrival of Buṅgadyaḥ at Lagankhel."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/dcf4fb94-4f23-4804-967a-f9c7b13910bc> ;
