<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/dd9d659e-3b0e-40e5-9008-cf5005c945c2_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of Akṣobhya statue (initial construction of the bāhāḥ)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription on the pedestal records its installation by Pūrṇamāna (text: Purnamāna) and his wife Ratnamāna in memory of his father-in-law, also marking the initial construction of thebāhāḥ. Due to erosion, the date in the inscription can no longer be deciphered. Pruscha, writing in 1975 CE, reads the date as 1936 CE (NS 1056), which contradicts the account of thebāhāḥ'ssenior-most elder who claims thebāhāḥwas built in 1926 CE (NS 1046)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/dd9d659e-3b0e-40e5-9008-cf5005c945c2> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription on the pedestal records its installation by Pūrṇamāna (text: Purnamāna) and his wife Ratnamāna in memory of his father-in-law, also marking the initial construction of thebāhāḥ. Due to erosion, the date in the inscription can no longer be deciphered. Pruscha, writing in 1975 CE, reads the date as 1936 CE (NS 1056), which contradicts the account of thebāhāḥ'ssenior-most elder who claims thebāhāḥwas built in 1926 CE (NS 1046)."@en ;
