        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of Cāravināyaka shrine"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In memory of the late military officer (senānī) Tilaka Bahādura Kārkī and other deceased members of his family, sixphalcā(resting pavilions) and shrines of four Nārāyaṇa and four Vināyaka deities were constructed along the stairway leading to the Ādīnātha temple. This work was undertaken by his descendants."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/de1f3dd8-735a-4dcc-99e0-511c861ae0fb> ;
