<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/de276e42-6b9c-11ea-b4c2-0242ac130006_5> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donation of a toraṇa?"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription only mentions that it was offered in honor of the goddess Pūrṇacaṇdī, but it is not written who offered what. The inscription is inscribed on the lower part of the metal toraṇa on the back of the goddess Pūrṇacaṇdī inside the sanctum sanctorum, so the toraṇa should be placed on the occasion of the donation of the toraṇa."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/de276e42-6b9c-11ea-b4c2-0242ac130006> ;
