    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Together with his wives Lānidhaṃ and Cakralakṣmī, Jagannātha Kāyaṣṭha, resident of Khaumā Ṭola, had the Phalcā constructed. Then he endowed 2ropanīs and 2karṣas of land for observing the anniversary and other rituals, along with offering meals to the five elders of the localdāphābhajanagroup."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/de9fc000-acf9-447f-a1b6-51cc0e8bcd07> ;
