    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Near the Sarasvatī Kuṇḍa, some inscriptions can be seen carved on the base of a stone structure. The names of some donors are mentioned in the inscription, but as some parts are cracked and unclear, further details cannot be discerned."@en ;
