<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e0659b0d-4f7f-4f56-a3ff-09b266dc3518_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Department of Archaeology reconstructed Kutisāḥ Gaṇeśa Phalcā in 2021 CE. Until the early 1990s, only a rectangular plinth existed at the location (no other remnants of the Phalcā were found). Even senior members of the locality do not recall a complete phalcā on the site. The Kutisāḥ Gaṇeśa Phalcā was inaugurated by the Mayor of the Kiritpur municipality on August 30, 2021."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e0659b0d-4f7f-4f56-a3ff-09b266dc3518> ;
    rdfs:comment "The Department of Archaeology reconstructed Kutisāḥ Gaṇeśa Phalcā in 2021 CE. Until the early 1990s, only a rectangular plinth existed at the location (no other remnants of the Phalcā were found). Even senior members of the locality do not recall a complete phalcā on the site. The Kutisāḥ Gaṇeśa Phalcā was inaugurated by the Mayor of the Kiritpur municipality on August 30, 2021."@en ;
