    rdfs:label "Offering of a patāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bīrena Khaḍgī, Rośanī Khaḍgī, and others from Kumbheśvara Ṭola, Lalitpur, jointly installed brasspatāḥs (decorative metal leaves) on the temple."@en ;
