    rdfs:label "Installation of a marble inscription commemorating offerings"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In place of the stolen image of Vārāhī, Kṛṣṇanātha Māske and his wife Śakuntalā Māske installed a new cast-metal image. On this occasion, they also tiled the sanctum floor, applied copper sheeting (ilāṃ), and gilded thetoraṇa(jalapa). To commemorate these works, a marble inscription was placed inside the sanctum."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e277eff9-5f7a-405c-908b-e3d13cda743e> ;
