<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e2a4580b-0699-44bf-b0b3-561da8d9fa93_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Licchavi inscription 3"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is unrelated to thehiti. It records the retention ofbirtālands by King Narendradeva in the name of the residents of Dakṣiṇakolīgrāma. This retention is granted as a recognition of their service in caring for the temple of Māneśvara. The land was seized from them by Bhaumagupta (D. Vajrācārya, VS 2030, p. 467)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e2a4580b-0699-44bf-b0b3-561da8d9fa93> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription is unrelated to thehiti. It records the retention ofbirtālands by King Narendradeva in the name of the residents of Dakṣiṇakolīgrāma. This retention is granted as a recognition of their service in caring for the temple of Māneśvara. The land was seized from them by Bhaumagupta (D. Vajrācārya, VS 2030, p. 467)."@en ;
