<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e2a4580b-0699-44bf-b0b3-561da8d9fa93_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Cleaning of the hiti"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In 2018 CE, in commemoration of the anniversary of their movement, the Save Nepa Valley group organized the cleaning of thehiti. Thehitihad been neglected, leading to an overgrowth of weeds and bushes, and the poor drainage system resulted in a flooded floor. The Nepal Army actively contributed to the cleaning initiative, and the deputy mayor of the Kathmandu Metropolitan City attended the program."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e2a4580b-0699-44bf-b0b3-561da8d9fa93> ;
    rdfs:comment "In 2018 CE, in commemoration of the anniversary of their movement, the Save Nepa Valley group organized the cleaning of thehiti. Thehitihad been neglected, leading to an overgrowth of weeds and bushes, and the poor drainage system resulted in a flooded floor. The Nepal Army actively contributed to the cleaning initiative, and the deputy mayor of the Kathmandu Metropolitan City attended the program."@en ;
