<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e3f05128-990f-4936-a54b-8dc13ac4822b_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Laying of dyaḥchẽ's foundation stone"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The foundation stone laid for the reconstruction of thedyaḥchẽ, after the Bhaktapur Municipality funded the process due to the building’s poor state of repair. As of April 2025, the reconstruction is nearly complete, but the Gaṇeśa statue, temporarily moved to Bhaṇḍārakhāla garden in Bhaktapur, has not yet been reinstated."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e3f05128-990f-4936-a54b-8dc13ac4822b> ;
