    rdfs:label "Installation of statues of Nāmasaṅgīti and Sarasvatī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Statues of Nāmasaṅgīti and Sarasvatī were installed on the northern wall of Nāmasaṅgīti Phalcā, in memory of someone's late parents Mangala Lāl Maharjan and Aṣṭamāya Maharjan."@en ;
