        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A member of the Śākya clan named Kutuju led the construction works of thephalcā. The inscription in thephalcāalso contains a remark, which suggests that Kutuju might have given up a part of his own residence to build thephalcā."@en ;
