    rdfs:label "Reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Lũchẽ Nani Phalcā was reconstructed after being damaged in the 2015 earthquakes, with the support of the Barbara and Wilfried Mohr Fundation, Hamburg. The inauguration took place in March 2017. The South Asia Institute's HelpNepal initiative accompanied the process."@en ;
