        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Exhibition during the Photo Kathmandu Festival"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Calakhu Bhairava Phalcā was part of the first Photo Kathmandu exhibition organised by Photo.Circle. It was part of the exhibition \"Patis in Patan\", co-curated by Christiane Brosius, Sujan Chitrakar and Rajendra Shakya. Two portrait photographs of people frequently using thephalcāwere exhibited in thephalcāfrom November-December 2015."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e6f72884-e774-11e9-b125-0242ac130002> ;
