    rdfs:label "Renovation of the Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Caitya was renovated in 1983 CE (VS 2040) after a tree sprouting out of thecaitya’s upper part,trayodaśabhuvana, threatened to topple it. During the renovation, various archaeological finds were unearthed in thecaitya's dome,garbha, which are kept at the back inside the dome, including some gold coins and other items."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e73522eb-0ce8-4bca-99a2-add0f09eb964> ;
