<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e7546e28-a0f1-43af-aa05-e0d76db5dd14_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Śakyabhikṣu Jñānadeva (text: Śākebhikṣu Gyānadeva), Bhikṣu Jñāna (text: Bhikṣu Gyāna), and Sikhrākāra Puna (text: Sikharākāra Puna) renovated the monastic building of the Bāhāḥ. Subharathanasiṃha, Narasiṃha Bhāro, and Ranhaśīha Bhāro also pitched in to help with the restoration work."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e7546e28-a0f1-43af-aa05-e0d76db5dd14> ;
    rdfs:comment "Śakyabhikṣu Jñānadeva (text: Śākebhikṣu Gyānadeva), Bhikṣu Jñāna (text: Bhikṣu Gyāna), and Sikhrākāra Puna (text: Sikharākāra Puna) renovated the monastic building of the Bāhāḥ. Subharathanasiṃha, Narasiṃha Bhāro, and Ranhaśīha Bhāro also pitched in to help with the restoration work."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
