<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e7546e28-a0f1-43af-aa05-e0d76db5dd14_2> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation and offering of a gilded crown etc."@en ;
    dcterms:description "During King Rājendra Vikrama Śāha's reign, Jñānavanta Sikhrākāra (text: Siglikāla Jñānaonta) renovated the Bāhāḥ and installed a finial. Jñānavīra Vajrācārya (text: Vajācāryya Gyānavīra), Bimānanda, Jñānasiṃha (text: Gyānasiṃha), Jayavīrasiṃha (text: Jayavirasiṃ), and others helped with the renovation. A crown, a necklace, and fly whisks (cāmara) were also offered to the Kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ on the occasion, in addition to the establishment of a statue of Vajrasattva and two bells."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e7546e28-a0f1-43af-aa05-e0d76db5dd14> ;
    rdfs:comment "During King Rājendra Vikrama Śāha's reign, Jñānavanta Sikhrākāra (text: Siglikāla Jñānaonta) renovated the Bāhāḥ and installed a finial. Jñānavīra Vajrācārya (text: Vajācāryya Gyānavīra), Bimānanda, Jñānasiṃha (text: Gyānasiṃha), Jayavīrasiṃha (text: Jayavirasiṃ), and others helped with the renovation. A crown, a necklace, and fly whisks (cāmara) were also offered to the Kvāḥpāḥdyaḥ on the occasion, in addition to the establishment of a statue of Vajrasattva and two bells."@en ;
