    rdfs:label "Offering a stone throne (object number KAT1170-004)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to the inscription on the stone throne, a person named Nārāyaṇa (text: Nārāyana) and his son Dhīrjanārāyaṇa (text: Dhijanārā) of the Takhā Ṭola offered the throne (siṃhāsana) to Kaṅgaḥ Ajimā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e77be04f-be3a-4445-b751-0cb7995daf6a> ;
