    dcterms:description "Kṛṣṇagopāla, Bekhālakṣṃī, and Lakṣmīnānī, along with their family members, presented a brass cover for the entrance to the sanctum on the first floor of the Dyaḥchẽ. They also gave 21 brass lamps and two small drums (ḍamaru)."@en ;
