<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e78429eb-76fd-429a-869b-d06884f69467_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Initial Construction of Htigāḥcā, Śiva Mandira, and Phalcā, and Establishment of a Guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records that a certain donor from Kirtipur constructed Hitigāḥcā along with the nearby Śiva Mandira (KIR0078) and one of the twophalcās,and established aguṭhī.Unfortunately, the part of the inscription where the date and the name of the constructor were recorded, is badly damaged. Its preserved part mentions thatKvāṭha NāyakaCaṇḍī Rāja Bhāro as one of theguṭhīmembers (cf.Ś. ŚreṣṭhaVS 2057 182-183)."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e78429eb-76fd-429a-869b-d06884f69467> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription records that a certain donor from Kirtipur constructed Hitigāḥcā along with the nearby Śiva Mandira (KIR0078) and one of the twophalcās,and established aguṭhī.Unfortunately, the part of the inscription where the date and the name of the constructor were recorded, is badly damaged. Its preserved part mentions thatKvāṭha NāyakaCaṇḍī Rāja Bhāro as one of theguṭhīmembers (cf.Ś. ŚreṣṭhaVS 2057 182-183)."@en ;
