<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e862d312-eb57-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "The earliest mention of Guji Bāhāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The name Guji Bāhāḥ was mentioned in a manuscript entitledKriyāsaṃgrahapañjikā,preserved in the Asiatic Society, Calcutta. This was written during the reign of King Abhaya Malla. In this manuscript, Guji Bāhāḥ is referred to as Vaiśya Śrī Divākara Varmma Mahāvihāra."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e862d312-eb57-11e9-8bc4-0242ac130002> ;
