        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Donating toraṇa?"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thetoraṇa, as stated above in the description, is only surviving remnant of the old Bāhāḥ architecture. Except for the date, the inscription on it is illegible. Therefore, what is recorded there remains a mystery. We can assume, however, that the inscription must have recorded the name(s) of the person(s)  who donated  thetoraṇato the Bāhāḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e8ec698c-b853-412f-b59e-851b664465b3> ;
    rdfs:comment "Thetoraṇa, as stated above in the description, is only surviving remnant of the old Bāhāḥ architecture. Except for the date, the inscription on it is illegible. Therefore, what is recorded there remains a mystery. We can assume, however, that the inscription must have recorded the name(s) of the person(s)  who donated  thetoraṇato the Bāhāḥ."@en ;
