<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e93b5856-91a6-4ba9-98dc-842f6183bb1f_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription details thephalcā's original construction. It states that Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa, a resident of Capāḥkva ṭola near thephalcā, built it with the belief that the merit from constructing thisphalcāwould ensure his deceased ancestors and future generations would attain heaven after death."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e93b5856-91a6-4ba9-98dc-842f6183bb1f> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription details thephalcā's original construction. It states that Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa, a resident of Capāḥkva ṭola near thephalcā, built it with the belief that the merit from constructing thisphalcāwould ensure his deceased ancestors and future generations would attain heaven after death."@en ;
