<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/e93b5856-91a6-4ba9-98dc-842f6183bb1f_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Prior to the earthquake of VS 2072, thephalcāwas in a dilapidated state. The earthquake caused significant damage to the upper portion of the structure, and it remained in disrepair for nearly seven years. In 2024 CE (VS 2081), Godavarī Municipality undertook the reconstruction of thephalcā, restoring it to its original form."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/e93b5856-91a6-4ba9-98dc-842f6183bb1f> ;
