<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Donation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "An inscription indicates that Guṇasiṃha Bābu had endowed some money and land asguṭhīfor this site. However, the letters are unclear, and it is not possible to determine the exact purpose for which the money and land were endowed.गुणसिंह बाबुले केहि पैसा र खेत गुठी राखेको अभिलेखबाटा थाहा हुन्छ तर अक्षरहरू स्पष्ट नभएको हुनाले के प्रयोजनका लागि पैसा र खेत राखेको हो बुझिँदैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a> ;
    rdfs:comment "An inscription indicates that Guṇasiṃha Bābu had endowed some money and land asguṭhīfor this site. However, the letters are unclear, and it is not possible to determine the exact purpose for which the money and land were endowed.गुणसिंह बाबुले केहि पैसा र खेत गुठी राखेको अभिलेखबाटा थाहा हुन्छ तर अक्षरहरू स्पष्ट नभएको हुनाले के प्रयोजनका लागि पैसा र खेत राखेको हो बुझिँदैन ।"@en ;
