<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a_3> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of hiti"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Mahendra later restored thehitispouts where water had stopped flowing, reactivating the water supply from these spouts.राजा महेन्द्रले पानी आउन बन्द भएका यहाँका हितिहरूको जीर्णोद्धार गरी हितिहरूबाट पुन: पानी आउने बनाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a> ;
    rdfs:comment "King Mahendra later restored thehitispouts where water had stopped flowing, reactivating the water supply from these spouts.राजा महेन्द्रले पानी आउन बन्द भएका यहाँका हितिहरूको जीर्णोद्धार गरी हितिहरूबाट पुन: पानी आउने बनाएका थिए ।"@en ;
