<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This inscription is one among several affixed to the upper part of Narāyaṇa Hiti. The upper portion of this particular inscription is decorated with a carved image of Buddha, which suggests that some activities of Buddhist devotees may have taken place here.यो अभिलेख नारायण हितिको माथिल्लो भागमा रहेको अभिलेखहरूमध्ये एउटा हो । यस अभिलेखको माथिल्लो भागमा बुद्धको आकृति कुदिएको छ । यसबाट के अनुमान लगाउन सकिन्छ भने बौद्ध धर्मावलम्बीहरूले यहाँ केहि गतिविधि गरेको हुनुपर्दछ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a> ;
    rdfs:comment "This inscription is one among several affixed to the upper part of Narāyaṇa Hiti. The upper portion of this particular inscription is decorated with a carved image of Buddha, which suggests that some activities of Buddhist devotees may have taken place here.यो अभिलेख नारायण हितिको माथिल्लो भागमा रहेको अभिलेखहरूमध्ये एउटा हो । यस अभिलेखको माथिल्लो भागमा बुद्धको आकृति कुदिएको छ । यसबाट के अनुमान लगाउन सकिन्छ भने बौद्ध धर्मावलम्बीहरूले यहाँ केहि गतिविधि गरेको हुनुपर्दछ ।"@en ;
