<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a_5> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Unknown event"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription is badly damaged, and many of its letters are illegible, making it difficult to discern the full details of its content. The mention of “gājola dayakā” appears in the text, from which it can be inferred that some construction or installation for ritual worship was carried out at Narāyaṇa Hiti.यस अभिलेख पनि नराम्रोसंग फुटेको र अक्षरहरू नदेखिने भएकोले यसमा उल्लेख भएको विवरण प्रष्ट हुँदैन । यद्दपि 'गाजोल दयका' भन्ने प्रशंग आएको छ, यसबाट नारायणहितिमा केहि निर्माण गरी पूजा गरेको कुरा उल्लेख गरिएको हो को भनी अनुमान लगाउन सकिन्छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ea45ba64-015e-4bba-93f2-590b10d3123a> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription is badly damaged, and many of its letters are illegible, making it difficult to discern the full details of its content. The mention of “gājola dayakā” appears in the text, from which it can be inferred that some construction or installation for ritual worship was carried out at Narāyaṇa Hiti.यस अभिलेख पनि नराम्रोसंग फुटेको र अक्षरहरू नदेखिने भएकोले यसमा उल्लेख भएको विवरण प्रष्ट हुँदैन । यद्दपि 'गाजोल दयका' भन्ने प्रशंग आएको छ, यसबाट नारायणहितिमा केहि निर्माण गरी पूजा गरेको कुरा उल्लेख गरिएको हो को भनी अनुमान लगाउन सकिन्छ ।"@en ;
