    rdfs:label "Restoring the supply of water to the spout"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Building activities – likely te construction of new homes – damaged the water supply channels from the source in  Mulī. The government water corporation office in Bidur Municipality installed new metal pipes to restore the spout's functionality."@en ;
