<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Formation of a guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kapardāra Bhoṭu Pā̃ḍe made a solemn vow to offer special worship and make charitable contributions to Ṅatamaru Ajimā. This commitment arose during his detention in China while serving on a diplomatic mission in response to an offer of a treaty from the Chinese army that had already entered Nepalese territory named Ghaibung in 1792 CE (VS 1849). After his release, he honored his pledge by endowing numerous parcels of land and various brass items in the goddess's name, designating them as a source of income for daily and annual rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kapardāra Bhoṭu Pā̃ḍe made a solemn vow to offer special worship and make charitable contributions to Ṅatamaru Ajimā. This commitment arose during his detention in China while serving on a diplomatic mission in response to an offer of a treaty from the Chinese army that had already entered Nepalese territory named Ghaibung in 1792 CE (VS 1849). After his release, he honored his pledge by endowing numerous parcels of land and various brass items in the goddess's name, designating them as a source of income for daily and annual rituals."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 2 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Addition of the upper roof"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kapardāra Bhoṭu Pā̃ḍe enriched the two-tiered temple by adding a gilded roof and made a generous donation of more than 150ropanīs of land. As per the inscription, the income generated from these land parcels was earmarked for the exhibition of the mask dance and the execution of various rituals during major festivals. Interestingly, a historical document at the Guṭhī Lagata Jā̃ca Aḍḍā, a government office that formerly oversaw religious trusts, dating back to 1932 CE (VS 1989), provides insights into the financial transactions of this trust."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kapardāra Bhoṭu Pā̃ḍe enriched the two-tiered temple by adding a gilded roof and made a generous donation of more than 150ropanīs of land. As per the inscription, the income generated from these land parcels was earmarked for the exhibition of the mask dance and the execution of various rituals during major festivals. Interestingly, a historical document at the Guṭhī Lagata Jā̃ca Aḍḍā, a government office that formerly oversaw religious trusts, dating back to 1932 CE (VS 1989), provides insights into the financial transactions of this trust."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 3 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Formation of a guṭhī"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhoṭu Pā̃ḍe also contributed 12ropanīs of land to establish a trust dedicated to laying a special carpet along the path of the dancers during the mask dance procession when it departed from the Ākhāḥchẽ and when the troupe performed at other locations in the valley. Remarkably, a record preserved at the Guṭhī Lagata Jā̃ca Aḍḍā from 1878 CE (VS 1935) elucidates the financial activities of this trust."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08> ;
    rdfs:comment "Bhoṭu Pā̃ḍe also contributed 12ropanīs of land to establish a trust dedicated to laying a special carpet along the path of the dancers during the mask dance procession when it departed from the Ākhāḥchẽ and when the troupe performed at other locations in the valley. Remarkably, a record preserved at the Guṭhī Lagata Jā̃ca Aḍḍā from 1878 CE (VS 1935) elucidates the financial activities of this trust."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 4 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
