<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08_6> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Endowment of land"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A separate copperplate inscription, bearing the seal of King Gīrvāṇayuddha, is stored within the private collection of one of the dance troupe members. This inscription commemorates Bhoṭu Pā̃ḍe's donation of 6ropanīs of land for the maintenance of the aforementioned banners utilized during the 12-yearly performance of Ṅatamaru Ajimā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ec08dc4c-646f-45bd-b152-4781e312bd08> ;
