    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mānasiṃha Bhāro of the Solaṃkī dynasty built thephalcā(BLG0020-002) to the east of the Bālāgāũ Caitya in the name of his deceased parents. He also installed a statue of Bhavānīśaṅkara in thephalcāand established a trust for the deity’s worship."@en ;
