        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Pandava Bhāro and his wife Dharmmāvatī of the Solaṃkī dynasty, residents of Pithagāma, built aphalcāand donated 2ropanīs of land to set up a trust for thephalcā’s upkeep. The income from the land was also to be used for hosting a feast for the trust members on the new moon day of Caitra."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ec42c643-32d9-4c20-a3a5-037c9d910382> ;
