        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering a bell (PPK1969-017)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "King Gīrvāṇayuddha Vikrama Śāha and his mother Suvarṇaprabhādevī offered a bell (PPK1969-017) weighing 59dhārnīs (approx. 134 kgs) to the temple. The bell was crafted by Taodhikaju and his son Dhanividhiju from Naḥ Bāhāḥ Nani (LAL0520) of Patan."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ed6d9432-4c5c-4125-b9fe-f60c92138df0> ;
    rdfs:comment "King Gīrvāṇayuddha Vikrama Śāha and his mother Suvarṇaprabhādevī offered a bell (PPK1969-017) weighing 59dhārnīs (approx. 134 kgs) to the temple. The bell was crafted by Taodhikaju and his son Dhanividhiju from Naḥ Bāhāḥ Nani (LAL0520) of Patan."@en ;
