        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Renovation of the temple and endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Rakṣakumārī, the last wife of Jaṅga Bahādura’s father Bālanarasiṃha Kũvara, renovated the temple and offered a golden finial. She also donated over 22ropanīs of land she received from her father Nayanasiṃha Thāpā to set up a trust for future renovations of the temple and the performance of various rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ed6d9432-4c5c-4125-b9fe-f60c92138df0> ;
