        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Indra Vadana, the last wife of Prime Minister Bama Bahādura Kũvara, built the temple along with asataḥ(KAT2651) to the north and a garden in close proximity. The main deity, aśivaliṅga, is revered as Indrabhakteśvara Mahādeva, named after her."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/edc2f9a3-2786-446a-b150-1018d3fe7382> ;
