    rdfs:label "Initial construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Subedāra Jāiphala Adhikārī built the Hastikeśvara temple in the name of his mother Hastikā. He also built the Kālikā shrine (object no. NWK0530-012) and a rest house at the temple premises besides setting up a trust by donating land parcels."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ee74a9e1-343b-4285-9752-5fcc12969625> ;
