    rdfs:label "Construction of the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Dīpakumārī Śāha initiated the construction of this temple in memory of her late husband, Prāṇa Śāha. She was also instrumental in setting up a trust by filing a petition to Prime Minister Jaṅga Bahādura Rāṇā to conduct religious and cultural activities in the temple."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ee91d97c-5f2d-450d-9ab4-327210bd09dd> ;
