        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Installation of statues of Umāmaheśvara and Lakṣmīnārāyaṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription on the Sarasvatī statue records that a certain Jayarāma Bhāro installed Hariśaṅkara and Umāmaheśvara inside the Shrine. As mentioned above in the description, the Statue of Hariśaṅkara could not be found at the site."@en ;
