    rdfs:label "Construction of the Dolã Māju Shrine"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The shrine of Dolã Māju must have been initially constructed in an open space. In 1704 CE (NS 824), the present-day temple was built on the same spot and developed as a shrine."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ef7069e0-9e23-4cb6-8af4-b5220d7197b0> ;
