    rdfs:label "Renovation of the hiti"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the 1980s, thehiticeased flowing and became buried due to prolonged neglect. A pipal tree grew on thehiti, surrounded by bushes around the spout (local resident, Śreṣṭha, male, age 66/see photo). The Ward Number 6 Office of the Shankharapur Municipality undertook the restoration of thehitiin 2021 CE."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/efb892c0-467c-48ef-862f-275bdb8b44ac> ;
