        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Preliminary worship for the Phalcā’s reconstruction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Preliminary worship (kṣamāpuja) was performed at the site ahead of the commencement of the Phalcā’s restoration due to take place with the financial assistance of the US Embassy. The ‘Khyālidyaḥ Saṃrakṣaṇa Guthi’, an association of the locals formed for the conservation of Khyālidyaḥ, and the Kirtipur Municipality are also involved in the reconstruction of the Phalcā that will also see the seismic strengthening of the Phalcā pavilion."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/efbf285a-653c-4ba7-ad8d-49448c0fc01f> ;
