    rdfs:label "Establishment of Ekādaśarudra and endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Harṣanārāyaṇa Dhaubhaḍela established 11śivaliṅgas (Ekādaśarudra) behind the temple and donated 32ropanīs of farmland to sustain daily and anniversary rituals at the Śiva temple, along with timely renovations and upkeep of the temple andsataḥ."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f1b969ea-f1ed-44dd-8304-154e7eb89195> ;
