    rdfs:label "Construction of phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Member of Parliament Jagadiśa Śamaśera Rāṇā allocated NRs. 250,000 from the MP Fund for the construction of aphalcānortheast of the temple. Thephalcāwas built to host singing and musical instrument performances by the Department of Music at the Kathmandu University."@en ;
