    dcterms:description "Dhanapati, his wife Vidyā, and their sons Jñānapati, Dinapati, Padmapati and Cakrapati reconstructed the statue of Cakrasaṃvara which is located in theāgamaof thebāhāḥ. The statue was painted and consecreted after a fire ritual worship was performed in which an offering of flesh was made."@en ;
