<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Developing the palace as a museum"@en ;
    dcterms:description "With the aim of preserving and exhibiting historical objects, images, and other archaeological materials from the time of Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa Śāha, the Sātatale Durbar was developed as a museum. The inauguration of the museum was carried out by the then Minister for Information and Communications and government spokesperson, Gaṅgālāla Tulādhāra.पृथ्वीनारायण शाहको पालाका ऐतिहासिक सामग्री, मूर्ति र अन्य पुरातात्विक वस्तुहरूको संरक्षण र प्रदर्शन गर्ने उद्देश्यले साततले दरबारलाई संग्रहालयको रूपमा विकास गरिएको थियो । तत्कालीन सूचना तथा सञ्चार मन्त्री एवं सरकारका प्रबक्ता गंगालाल तुलाधारले संग्रहालयको उद्घाटन गर्नुभएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272> ;
    rdfs:comment "With the aim of preserving and exhibiting historical objects, images, and other archaeological materials from the time of Pṛthvīnārāyaṇa Śāha, the Sātatale Durbar was developed as a museum. The inauguration of the museum was carried out by the then Minister for Information and Communications and government spokesperson, Gaṅgālāla Tulādhāra.पृथ्वीनारायण शाहको पालाका ऐतिहासिक सामग्री, मूर्ति र अन्य पुरातात्विक वस्तुहरूको संरक्षण र प्रदर्शन गर्ने उद्देश्यले साततले दरबारलाई संग्रहालयको रूपमा विकास गरिएको थियो । तत्कालीन सूचना तथा सञ्चार मन्त्री एवं सरकारका प्रबक्ता गंगालाल तुलाधारले संग्रहालयको उद्घाटन गर्नुभएको थियो ।"@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 2 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Agreement between China and Nepal"@en ;
    dcterms:description "China expressed its commitment to assist in the restoration and reconstruction of Nuwakot’s heritage sites damaged by the earthquake. Accordingly, an agreement was signed between China and Nepal for the restoration of the Sātatale Durbar. On behalf of China’s Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC), Zhang Fan signed the agreement, while Pitāmbara Ghimire signed on behalf of Nepal’s National Reconstruction Authority. Responsibility for the restoration was assigned to the Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage. The agreement stipulated that the restoration would be completed within 45 months of the signing.भूकम्पले क्षति भएका नुवाकोटका सम्पदाहरूको जीर्णोद्धार र पुनर्निर्माण गर्न चीनले सहयोग गर्ने प्रतिबद्धता व्यक्त गरेको थियो । त्यसै क्रममा साततले दरबारको जीर्णोद्धार गर्न चीन र नेपालबीच सम्झौता भएको थियो । सम्झौतामा चीनको Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC) को तर्फबाट Zhang Fan ले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए भने नेपालको राष्ट्रिय पुनर्निर्माण प्राधिकरणको तर्फबाट पिताम्बर घिमिरेले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए । जीर्णोद्धारको जिम्मेवारी चीनको Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage लाई सुम्पिएको थियो । सम्झौता भएको ४५ महिनाभित्र दरबारको जीर्णोद्धार सम्पन्न गर्ने सम्झौता भएको थियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272> ;
    rdfs:comment "China expressed its commitment to assist in the restoration and reconstruction of Nuwakot’s heritage sites damaged by the earthquake. Accordingly, an agreement was signed between China and Nepal for the restoration of the Sātatale Durbar. On behalf of China’s Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC), Zhang Fan signed the agreement, while Pitāmbara Ghimire signed on behalf of Nepal’s National Reconstruction Authority. Responsibility for the restoration was assigned to the Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage. The agreement stipulated that the restoration would be completed within 45 months of the signing.भूकम्पले क्षति भएका नुवाकोटका सम्पदाहरूको जीर्णोद्धार र पुनर्निर्माण गर्न चीनले सहयोग गर्ने प्रतिबद्धता व्यक्त गरेको थियो । त्यसै क्रममा साततले दरबारको जीर्णोद्धार गर्न चीन र नेपालबीच सम्झौता भएको थियो । सम्झौतामा चीनको Agency for International Economic Cooperation (AIEC) को तर्फबाट Zhang Fan ले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए भने नेपालको राष्ट्रिय पुनर्निर्माण प्राधिकरणको तर्फबाट पिताम्बर घिमिरेले हस्ताक्षर गरेका थिए । जीर्णोद्धारको जिम्मेवारी चीनको Chinese Academy of Cultural Heritage लाई सुम्पिएको थियो । सम्झौता भएको ४५ महिनाभित्र दरबारको जीर्णोद्धार सम्पन्न गर्ने सम्झौता भएको थियो ।"@en ;
