<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Kṣamāpūjā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Akṣamāpūjā(ritual of atonement) was performed prior to the restoration and reconstruction of the Sātatale Durbar and other earthquake-damaged heritage sites of Nuwakot. The ceremony was attended by Rājana Śreṣṭha, Mayor of Bidur Municipality, and Deputy Mayor Prabhā Bogaṭī, among other representatives.चीन सरकारको सहयोगमा पुनर्निर्माण भइरहेका साततले दरबार लगायतका सम्पदाहरूको जग संरक्षणको लागि भूमिपूजा गरिएको थियो ।उक्त पूजामा बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ र उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272> ;
    rdfs:comment "Akṣamāpūjā(ritual of atonement) was performed prior to the restoration and reconstruction of the Sātatale Durbar and other earthquake-damaged heritage sites of Nuwakot. The ceremony was attended by Rājana Śreṣṭha, Mayor of Bidur Municipality, and Deputy Mayor Prabhā Bogaṭī, among other representatives.चीन सरकारको सहयोगमा पुनर्निर्माण भइरहेका साततले दरबार लगायतका सम्पदाहरूको जग संरक्षणको लागि भूमिपूजा गरिएको थियो ।उक्त पूजामा बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ र उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
