<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272_5> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Worship to strengthen the foundation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Abhūmipūjā(ritual to strengthen the foundation) was conducted for the foundation conservation of heritage structures being renovated the Sātatale Durbar, and the Taleju Ghara, which is being reconstructed with the support of the Government of China. The ceremony was attended by Saubhāgya Pradhānāṅga, Director General of the Department of Archaeology, Rājana Śreṇṭha, Mayor of Bidur Municipality, Deputy Mayor Prabhā Bogaṭī, and other public representatives.चीन सरकारको सहयोगमा जीर्णोद्धार भइरहेको साततले दरबार एवं पुनर्निर्माण भइरहेको तलेजु घरको जग संरक्षणको लागि भूमिपूजा गरिएको थियो । उक्त पूजामा पुरातत्त्व विभागका महानिर्देशक सौभाग्य प्रधानाङ्ग, बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ, उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी लगायत जनप्रतिनिधिहरू पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f2fd559b-9b9c-4c38-a353-9ee22dad0272> ;
    rdfs:comment "Abhūmipūjā(ritual to strengthen the foundation) was conducted for the foundation conservation of heritage structures being renovated the Sātatale Durbar, and the Taleju Ghara, which is being reconstructed with the support of the Government of China. The ceremony was attended by Saubhāgya Pradhānāṅga, Director General of the Department of Archaeology, Rājana Śreṇṭha, Mayor of Bidur Municipality, Deputy Mayor Prabhā Bogaṭī, and other public representatives.चीन सरकारको सहयोगमा जीर्णोद्धार भइरहेको साततले दरबार एवं पुनर्निर्माण भइरहेको तलेजु घरको जग संरक्षणको लागि भूमिपूजा गरिएको थियो । उक्त पूजामा पुरातत्त्व विभागका महानिर्देशक सौभाग्य प्रधानाङ्ग, बिदुर नगरपालिकाका प्रमुख राजन श्रेष्ठ, उपप्रमुख प्रभा बोगटी लगायत जनप्रतिनिधिहरू पनि सहभागी भएका थिए ।"@en ;
