        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the Caitya"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This caitya bears no inscription, however, an inscription on the caitya to its north (BUN0016) mentions that two of the fivecaityaswere constructed at the same time. It can therefore be surmised that this monument was also commissioned by Harṣamuni Śākya in 1964."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f40297a8-5fc8-11ea-b4c2-0242ac130006> ;
