    rdfs:label "Construction of caitya (LAL1921-004)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Thecaitya(LAL1921-004) in thehitipremises has Mānadeva Era 182, which corresponds to 758 CE, inscribed on it. Other details have already eroded. The inscription probably recorded the establishment of thecaitya."@en ;
