<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f490c202-ae8d-4311-a698-2b6a81d5d00a_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a jaḥdhuṃ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "At the site of the Subāhāḥ Hiti, a merit-givingjaḥdhuṃ(water trough) was established. An inscription mentions the term \"jareṃ\" for thejaḥdhuṃ, which later evolved into \"jaḥdhuṃ\" in Nepalbhasa. Currently, no trace of thisjaḥdhuṃremains at the location. According to locals, a wall once stood east of thehiti, and thejaḥdhuṃwas attached to it."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f490c202-ae8d-4311-a698-2b6a81d5d00a> ;
    rdfs:comment "At the site of the Subāhāḥ Hiti, a merit-givingjaḥdhuṃ(water trough) was established. An inscription mentions the term \"jareṃ\" for thejaḥdhuṃ, which later evolved into \"jaḥdhuṃ\" in Nepalbhasa. Currently, no trace of thisjaḥdhuṃremains at the location. According to locals, a wall once stood east of thehiti, and thejaḥdhuṃwas attached to it."@en ;
