        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the past, when this phalcā fell into disrepair, it was rebuilt under the leadership of two brothers, Devadatta Thāpā and Relāja Thāpā. The reconstruction took place during the tenure of Rhituvaṇa Thāpā, the then pramāṇa of Thecho settlement, with the participation of local jyāpu and mālākāra communities.विगत ब्रह्मायणी देवीको अग्र भागमा भएको फल्चा जीर्ण भएकाले देवदत्त थापा र रिलाज थापा दुई दाजुभाईको अगुवाईमा थेच्व बस्तीका तत्कालीन प्रमान रीथुवण थापाको समयमा अन्य स्थानीय ज्यापु र मालाकारको सहभागितामा फल्चाको पुनर्निर्माण गरियो ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f4910f52-d4b9-4396-be82-0c7c56fff5c3> ;
    rdfs:comment "In the past, when this phalcā fell into disrepair, it was rebuilt under the leadership of two brothers, Devadatta Thāpā and Relāja Thāpā. The reconstruction took place during the tenure of Rhituvaṇa Thāpā, the then pramāṇa of Thecho settlement, with the participation of local jyāpu and mālākāra communities.विगत ब्रह्मायणी देवीको अग्र भागमा भएको फल्चा जीर्ण भएकाले देवदत्त थापा र रिलाज थापा दुई दाजुभाईको अगुवाईमा थेच्व बस्तीका तत्कालीन प्रमान रीथुवण थापाको समयमा अन्य स्थानीय ज्यापु र मालाकारको सहभागितामा फल्चाको पुनर्निर्माण गरियो ।"@en ;
