<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f4910f52-d4b9-4396-be82-0c7c56fff5c3_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding of the monument"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the 1990s, the traditional phalcā was demolished and replaced with a concrete structure. After the earthquake of 2015 CE, most of the heritage structures in the Kvaylāchi area were restored to their original forms (one of the ward members, Maharjana, male, age 32) . This phalcā was also reconstructed in its traditional style. Currently (November 2024), the reconstruction of the phalcā is underway with a budget of 6 million rupees allocated by Godāvarī Municipality.फल्चालाई सन् १९९० को दशकतिर भत्काई कंक्रिडको संरचना उठाइएको थियो । पछिल्लो भूकम्प पश्चात् क्वय्‌लाछि परिसरका धेरैजसो सम्पदाहरू पुरानै स्वरूपमा बन्दै गर्दा यो फल्चालाई पनि मौलिक स्वरूपमा फर्काइएको हो (one of the ward members, Maharjana, male, age 32) । हाल (नोवेम्बर २०२४) गोदावरी नगरपालिकाबाट छुट्याइएको ६० लाख बजेटबाट फल्चाको पुनर्निर्माण कार्य भैरहेको छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f4910f52-d4b9-4396-be82-0c7c56fff5c3> ;
    rdfs:comment "In the 1990s, the traditional phalcā was demolished and replaced with a concrete structure. After the earthquake of 2015 CE, most of the heritage structures in the Kvaylāchi area were restored to their original forms (one of the ward members, Maharjana, male, age 32) . This phalcā was also reconstructed in its traditional style. Currently (November 2024), the reconstruction of the phalcā is underway with a budget of 6 million rupees allocated by Godāvarī Municipality.फल्चालाई सन् १९९० को दशकतिर भत्काई कंक्रिडको संरचना उठाइएको थियो । पछिल्लो भूकम्प पश्चात् क्वय्‌लाछि परिसरका धेरैजसो सम्पदाहरू पुरानै स्वरूपमा बन्दै गर्दा यो फल्चालाई पनि मौलिक स्वरूपमा फर्काइएको हो (one of the ward members, Maharjana, male, age 32) । हाल (नोवेम्बर २०२४) गोदावरी नगरपालिकाबाट छुट्याइएको ६० लाख बजेटबाट फल्चाको पुनर्निर्माण कार्य भैरहेको छ ।"@en ;
