<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f4ea3adf-5fdc-4382-bf29-adec17727932_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "(Re)construction"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This was a historical site with a remnant of a traditionalphalcāprior to the construction of the current structure, as stated in the 'description' above. As part of the current heritage revival movement, the Kirtipur Metropolitan City built it based on the memory (of the plinth) of local elders. The foundation stone was laid on the 26th of Phālguna in 2022 CE ((VS 2078). The building took seven months to complete."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f4ea3adf-5fdc-4382-bf29-adec17727932> ;
    rdfs:comment "This was a historical site with a remnant of a traditionalphalcāprior to the construction of the current structure, as stated in the 'description' above. As part of the current heritage revival movement, the Kirtipur Metropolitan City built it based on the memory (of the plinth) of local elders. The foundation stone was laid on the 26th of Phālguna in 2022 CE ((VS 2078). The building took seven months to complete."@en ;
