<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f5a48d0e-2f70-4721-abb2-614f7311dec9_16> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Encounter with invaders from Bhaktapur"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A band of invaders from Bhaktapur, under the leadership of Nīlanārāyaṇa Thakura, infiltrated Sankhu. However, bolstered by the blessings of Vajrayoginī, King Jagajjaya Malla mobilized the citizens of Sankhu, ultimately repelling the invaders and killing 16 of them. The remaining 17 aggressors were subsequently apprehended and escorted as captives to Kathmandu."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f5a48d0e-2f70-4721-abb2-614f7311dec9> ;
    rdfs:comment "A band of invaders from Bhaktapur, under the leadership of Nīlanārāyaṇa Thakura, infiltrated Sankhu. However, bolstered by the blessings of Vajrayoginī, King Jagajjaya Malla mobilized the citizens of Sankhu, ultimately repelling the invaders and killing 16 of them. The remaining 17 aggressors were subsequently apprehended and escorted as captives to Kathmandu."@en ;
