        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a door, window and toraṇa."@en ;
    dcterms:description "During the reign of Raṇa Bahādura Śāha, his queen Rājarājeśvarīdevī made an offering to the Vajrayoginī Temple.She generously donated a decorative covering crafted from gilded sheets for the entrance to the sanctum, along with atoraṇapositioned above it, and a window."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f5a48d0e-2f70-4721-abb2-614f7311dec9> ;
