        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Theft in the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A theft took place at the Vajrayoginī Temple when a group of individuals arrived in a vehicle, armed with pistols. Local residents attempted to apprehend the thieves, resulting in two individuals being shot and injured by the assailants. Eventually, the thieves were apprehended along with the stolen items and turned over to the police."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f5a48d0e-2f70-4721-abb2-614f7311dec9> ;
    rdfs:comment "A theft took place at the Vajrayoginī Temple when a group of individuals arrived in a vehicle, armed with pistols. Local residents attempted to apprehend the thieves, resulting in two individuals being shot and injured by the assailants. Eventually, the thieves were apprehended along with the stolen items and turned over to the police."@en ;
