<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f5a48d0e-2f70-4721-abb2-614f7311dec9_3> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Temporary removal of spirit"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The process of repairing and repainting the face of Vajrayoginī began on the 11th day of the bright fortnight of Phālguna, with the removal of her vital essence from the statue. This event, known as (Nev.)lãpu chāygu,lasted for a month until life was ritually placed back into the statue on the 11th day of the bright fortnight of Caitra."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f5a48d0e-2f70-4721-abb2-614f7311dec9> ;
    rdfs:comment "The process of repairing and repainting the face of Vajrayoginī began on the 11th day of the bright fortnight of Phālguna, with the removal of her vital essence from the statue. This event, known as (Nev.)lãpu chāygu,lasted for a month until life was ritually placed back into the statue on the 11th day of the bright fortnight of Caitra."@en ;
