        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering silver for toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Jayadharma and Ugramāla Malla presented King Pratāpa Malla with 398tolāsof sterling silver and 229tolāsof pure silver as a contribution towards making atoraṇa. It is likely that the silver was deposited at the temple by various devotees on separate occasions as offerings to the deity."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f5a48d0e-2f70-4721-abb2-614f7311dec9> ;
