        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Strange noise inside the temple"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Vajrayoginī Temple experienced strange noises resembling the sound of large utensils falling, but the source of the noises could not be determined. King Pārthivendra Malla was notified of the incident, and a special ritual for auspiciousness was performed in response."@en ;
