<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f5fd9fa9-e509-431e-9b29-6ea83130803f_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Damage by earthquake"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Previously, thephalcāwas a two-story structure adorned with traditional tiles on its roof. Tragically, the upper floor suffered collapse during the devastating earthquakes of 2015 CE. As of April 2023 CE, the renovation of the upper floor remains incomplete, awaiting proper restoration. In the interim, local residents have taken measures to preserve the structure by covering the roof with corrugated metal sheets. Additionally, they have carefully stored the load-bearing struts, ensuring their safekeeping for future use."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f5fd9fa9-e509-431e-9b29-6ea83130803f> ;
    rdfs:comment "Previously, thephalcāwas a two-story structure adorned with traditional tiles on its roof. Tragically, the upper floor suffered collapse during the devastating earthquakes of 2015 CE. As of April 2023 CE, the renovation of the upper floor remains incomplete, awaiting proper restoration. In the interim, local residents have taken measures to preserve the structure by covering the roof with corrugated metal sheets. Additionally, they have carefully stored the load-bearing struts, ensuring their safekeeping for future use."@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/agent/antigravity_agent> ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/activity/heritagegraph_kg_construction> ;
    hg:eventIndex 0 ;
    hg:extractionMethod "source_table" ;
    hg:isEventOf <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f5fd9fa9-e509-431e-9b29-6ea83130803f> .

<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f6194470-465d-4a99-a33f-d8a92d67c537_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Enshrinement ;
    rdfs:label "Laying the foundation of Viṣṇu Mandira"@en ;
    dcterms:description "According to Dhanavajra Vajrācārya, an inscription dating to the early medieval period from the reign of Yakṣa Malla once existed at this site. The record stated that Yakṣa Malla installed a golden image of Nārāyaṇa equal in height to his deceased son Jayarāja Malla, laid the foundation of a Viṣṇu temple, and raised adhvajāin his memory. As of June 2025, this inscription is no longer extant at the site.धनवज्र वज्रावार्यलका अनुसार यहाँ पूर्व मध्यकालिन यक्ष मल्लको शासनकालको एक अभिलेख रहेको छ । यक्ष मल्लले आफ्नो दिवंगत छोरा जयराज मल्लको सम्झनामा उनको कद बराबरको सुनको नारायणको मूर्ति स्थापना गर्नुका साथै विष्णु मन्दिरको जग हाल्ने र ध्वजा चढाएको थियो । हाल (जुन, २०२५) मा यो अभिलेख यस ठाउँमा उपलब्ध छैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f6194470-465d-4a99-a33f-d8a92d67c537> ;
    rdfs:comment "According to Dhanavajra Vajrācārya, an inscription dating to the early medieval period from the reign of Yakṣa Malla once existed at this site. The record stated that Yakṣa Malla installed a golden image of Nārāyaṇa equal in height to his deceased son Jayarāja Malla, laid the foundation of a Viṣṇu temple, and raised adhvajāin his memory. As of June 2025, this inscription is no longer extant at the site.धनवज्र वज्रावार्यलका अनुसार यहाँ पूर्व मध्यकालिन यक्ष मल्लको शासनकालको एक अभिलेख रहेको छ । यक्ष मल्लले आफ्नो दिवंगत छोरा जयराज मल्लको सम्झनामा उनको कद बराबरको सुनको नारायणको मूर्ति स्थापना गर्नुका साथै विष्णु मन्दिरको जग हाल्ने र ध्वजा चढाएको थियो । हाल (जुन, २०२५) मा यो अभिलेख यस ठाउँमा उपलब्ध छैन ।"@en ;
