<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f6f28540-6aa7-4a61-abd1-03d8250aa25f_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Reconstruction of the Sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the 2015 earthquakes damaged the Building, the locals then decided to revive its former state. As of January 2022, the Sataḥ is under construction with the fund provided by the Shankharapur Municipality. Initially, the Sataḥ had five bays with a three-bayphalcāattached to the west. The present reconstruction merges both structures into onesataḥof seven bays on the ground floor, making the Sataḥ larger than it originally was."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f6f28540-6aa7-4a61-abd1-03d8250aa25f> ;
    rdfs:comment "After the 2015 earthquakes damaged the Building, the locals then decided to revive its former state. As of January 2022, the Sataḥ is under construction with the fund provided by the Shankharapur Municipality. Initially, the Sataḥ had five bays with a three-bayphalcāattached to the west. The present reconstruction merges both structures into onesataḥof seven bays on the ground floor, making the Sataḥ larger than it originally was."@en ;
