<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f771b0b6-0d77-4d03-9578-ddef947a93f6_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Inscription"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records only a date and does not specify the act or purpose for which it was carved. Since the inscription is engraved on a stone wall, it is likely that it was executed at the time a stone retaining wall was constructed to reinforce the Hāratīdevasthala.यस अभिलेखमा मिति मात्र कुँदिएको छ, कुन काम गर्दा अभिलेख राखिएको भन्ने कुरा लेखिएको छैन । ढुङ्गाको भित्तामा अभिलेख कुँदिएकोले हारतीको देवस्थललाई मजबूत बनाउन ढुङ्गाको पर्खाल (retaining wall) लगाउँदा अभिलेख कुँदिएको हुनसक्छ ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f771b0b6-0d77-4d03-9578-ddef947a93f6> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription records only a date and does not specify the act or purpose for which it was carved. Since the inscription is engraved on a stone wall, it is likely that it was executed at the time a stone retaining wall was constructed to reinforce the Hāratīdevasthala.यस अभिलेखमा मिति मात्र कुँदिएको छ, कुन काम गर्दा अभिलेख राखिएको भन्ने कुरा लेखिएको छैन । ढुङ्गाको भित्तामा अभिलेख कुँदिएकोले हारतीको देवस्थललाई मजबूत बनाउन ढुङ्गाको पर्खाल (retaining wall) लगाउँदा अभिलेख कुँदिएको हुनसक्छ ।"@en ;
