<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f771b0b6-0d77-4d03-9578-ddef947a93f6_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of the caitya (LAL3020-007)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the names of her late grandfather Mānadāsa Rājakarṇikāra, late grandmother Siddhika, late father Pūrṇadāsa, late mother Aṣṭamāyā, and other deceased relatives, Pūrṇadevī Rājakarṇikāra commissioned the construction of acaitya(LAL3020-007) in the courtyard where the Hāratīdevasthalais located. She was assisted in this undertaking by her brother Dhirjadāsa Rājakarṇikāra of Maru Tole.दिवंगत बाजे मानदास राजकर्णिकार, दिवंगत बज्यै सिद्धिक, दिवंगत बुबा पूर्णदास, दिवंगत आमा अष्टमाया लगायतका व्यक्तिहरूको नाममा पूर्णदेवी राजकर्णिकारले हारती देवस्थल रहेको चोकमा चैत्य (LAL3020-007) निर्माण गरेकी गरेकी थिइन् । त्यस काममा उनलाई मरु टोल निवासी भाइ धिर्जदास राजकर्णिकारले सहयोग गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f771b0b6-0d77-4d03-9578-ddef947a93f6> ;
    rdfs:comment "In the names of her late grandfather Mānadāsa Rājakarṇikāra, late grandmother Siddhika, late father Pūrṇadāsa, late mother Aṣṭamāyā, and other deceased relatives, Pūrṇadevī Rājakarṇikāra commissioned the construction of acaitya(LAL3020-007) in the courtyard where the Hāratīdevasthalais located. She was assisted in this undertaking by her brother Dhirjadāsa Rājakarṇikāra of Maru Tole.दिवंगत बाजे मानदास राजकर्णिकार, दिवंगत बज्यै सिद्धिक, दिवंगत बुबा पूर्णदास, दिवंगत आमा अष्टमाया लगायतका व्यक्तिहरूको नाममा पूर्णदेवी राजकर्णिकारले हारती देवस्थल रहेको चोकमा चैत्य (LAL3020-007) निर्माण गरेकी गरेकी थिइन् । त्यस काममा उनलाई मरु टोल निवासी भाइ धिर्जदास राजकर्णिकारले सहयोग गरेका थिए ।"@en ;
