    rdfs:label "Offering of dalūcā (lamps)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "In the names of the late Harṣa Bahādura Rājakarṇikāra and the late Pūrṇamāyā Rājakarṇikāra, members of their family donated fifty-fivedalūcā.दिवंगत हर्ष बहादुर राजकर्णिकार र दिवंगत पूर्णमाया राजकर्णिकारको नाममा परिवारका सदस्यहरूले ५५ वटा दलूचा चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f771b0b6-0d77-4d03-9578-ddef947a93f6> ;
