    rdfs:label "Repair of the Shrine"@en ;
    dcterms:description "After the Shrine sustained minor damages in the 1934 earthquakes, it was renovated collectively by the members of Dhvākhā Bāhāḥ and Gaṃ Bāhāḥ. During this renovation, the above-mentionedcaityaestablished on the ground was moved to the top of the Shrine as its finial."@en ;
