    rdfs:label "Restoration of Lo Gekar"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The temple was restored between 2003-2005 by The American Himalayan Foundation under the leadership of John Sanday (Sanday Associates, Kathmandu).No project document could be located.The work included the rebuilding of the main temple's roof and the cleaning and consolidation of the murals in the sanctum."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f7f45a9a-350f-49bb-ae23-647492f2c434> ;
