    rdfs:label "Initial construction of Bāsimali Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A Tāmrākāra family from Cāsukhela, Bhaktapur took part in the construction of thisphalcā. Virarāja (Vīrarāja) and Ṇarshiṃ (Narsiṃha) commissioned this monument (the inscription calls itsatala) and established aguṭhīto manage its anniversary rituals and other events."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f8366c56-539c-11ea-b4c2-0242ac130006> ;
