<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f9981a4f-20d0-4543-b55f-eec110d5b854_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Selection of the rock"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription records the selection of this particular rock for a certain construction at the Inā Ṭola in Bhaktapur. The place likely refers to one of the two Inā Ṭolas (Inācva and Ināgāḥ) in present-day Bhaktapur. It also mentions the names of two individuals, Tavadhīka and Harinārāyaṇa, who appear to have claimed the stone for a specific construction project."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f9981a4f-20d0-4543-b55f-eec110d5b854> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription records the selection of this particular rock for a certain construction at the Inā Ṭola in Bhaktapur. The place likely refers to one of the two Inā Ṭolas (Inācva and Ināgāḥ) in present-day Bhaktapur. It also mentions the names of two individuals, Tavadhīka and Harinārāyaṇa, who appear to have claimed the stone for a specific construction project."@en ;
