<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f9bfb983-9500-4d2c-b612-7bd0bfc0b189_0> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Sacrifice of a goat during kṣamāpūjā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A he-goat was sacrificed here at the Indrāyaṇī Pīṭha as well as part of the worship of absolution (kṣamāpūjā) performed at various temples of Nuwakot before removing the finial of the Bhairavī Mandira (NWK0040) for renovation."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f9bfb983-9500-4d2c-b612-7bd0bfc0b189> ;
    rdfs:comment "A he-goat was sacrificed here at the Indrāyaṇī Pīṭha as well as part of the worship of absolution (kṣamāpūjā) performed at various temples of Nuwakot before removing the finial of the Bhairavī Mandira (NWK0040) for renovation."@en ;
