<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/f9bfb983-9500-4d2c-b612-7bd0bfc0b189_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:RitualEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Sacrifice of a goat"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Sāmrājyalakṣmī, the first queen of Rājendra Vikrama Śāha, sponsored the recitation for invoking blessings (svastivācana) at the Indrāyaṇī Ghāṭa and offered a he-goat sacrifice at the Indrāyaṇī Ghāṭa, along with other temples in Nuwakot. She had come to Nuwakot to observe the annual procession of Bhairavī and was so overwhelmed by the powers of the goddess that she carried out these activities."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/f9bfb983-9500-4d2c-b612-7bd0bfc0b189> ;
    rdfs:comment "Sāmrājyalakṣmī, the first queen of Rājendra Vikrama Śāha, sponsored the recitation for invoking blessings (svastivācana) at the Indrāyaṇī Ghāṭa and offered a he-goat sacrifice at the Indrāyaṇī Ghāṭa, along with other temples in Nuwakot. She had come to Nuwakot to observe the annual procession of Bhairavī and was so overwhelmed by the powers of the goddess that she carried out these activities."@en ;
