<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_10> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Erecting a pillar with caitya (BKT0570-012)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Samantarāja, a resident of Khaumā Ṭola, together with his wife Putalī, son Munirāja, and other family members, erected a column with acaityain front of the temple. They also endowed oneropanīof land asguṭhīto ensure the performance of daily and annual worship at thecaitya.खौमा टोल निवासी समन्तराजले श्रीमती पुतलि, छोरा मुनिराज लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर मन्दिरअगाडि चैत्यसहितको स्तम्भ स्थापना गरेका थिए । उनीहरूले स्तम्भमाथि रहेको चैत्यको नित्यपूजा र वर्षवर्द्धनपूजा गर्न एक रोपनी खेत पनि गुठी राखिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Samantarāja, a resident of Khaumā Ṭola, together with his wife Putalī, son Munirāja, and other family members, erected a column with acaityain front of the temple. They also endowed oneropanīof land asguṭhīto ensure the performance of daily and annual worship at thecaitya.खौमा टोल निवासी समन्तराजले श्रीमती पुतलि, छोरा मुनिराज लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर मन्दिरअगाडि चैत्यसहितको स्तम्भ स्थापना गरेका थिए । उनीहरूले स्तम्भमाथि रहेको चैत्यको नित्यपूजा र वर्षवर्द्धनपूजा गर्न एक रोपनी खेत पनि गुठी राखिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
