<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_11> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Paving with stones"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mohanamayā Vajrācārya of Caturbrahmā Mahāvihāra (BKT0400), Bhaktapur, with her son Herāratna, daughter-in-law Aṣṭamāyā, and other relatives, sponsored the stone paving of the temple courtyard.भक्तपुरको चतुर्ब्रह्म महाविहार (BKT0400) निवासी मोहनमाया वज्राचार्यले छोरा हेरारत्न, बुहारी अष्टमाया लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर मन्दिरमा ढुङ्गा छापेकी थिइन् ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Mohanamayā Vajrācārya of Caturbrahmā Mahāvihāra (BKT0400), Bhaktapur, with her son Herāratna, daughter-in-law Aṣṭamāyā, and other relatives, sponsored the stone paving of the temple courtyard.भक्तपुरको चतुर्ब्रह्म महाविहार (BKT0400) निवासी मोहनमाया वज्राचार्यले छोरा हेरारत्न, बुहारी अष्टमाया लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर मन्दिरमा ढुङ्गा छापेकी थिइन् ।"@en ;
