<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_15> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a patāḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Ratnamuni Śākya, grandson of Harṣajyoti Śākya of Khaumā Bāhāḥ, Bhaktapur, and son of Candrajyoti Śākya, together with his wife Degulakṣmī Śākya, offered apatāḥ(ritual banner) to the temple.भक्तपुर खौमा बाहा: निवासी हर्षज्योति शाक्यका नाति, चन्द्रज्योति शाक्यका छोरा रत्नमुनि शाक्यले श्रीमती देगुलक्ष्मी शाक्यसँग मिलेर मन्दिरमा पता: चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Ratnamuni Śākya, grandson of Harṣajyoti Śākya of Khaumā Bāhāḥ, Bhaktapur, and son of Candrajyoti Śākya, together with his wife Degulakṣmī Śākya, offered apatāḥ(ritual banner) to the temple.भक्तपुर खौमा बाहा: निवासी हर्षज्योति शाक्यका नाति, चन्द्रज्योति शाक्यका छोरा रत्नमुनि शाक्यले श्रीमती देगुलक्ष्मी शाक्यसँग मिलेर मन्दिरमा पता: चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
