<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_16> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Budhācārya Kuberasiṃ, together with his wife Dhaṃlāni and other family members, installed a coppertoraṇaabove the inner door leading to the sanctum sanctorum (garbhagṛha).बुधाचार्य कुबेरसिंले श्रीमती धंलानि सहित परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर गर्भगृहभित्र प्रवेश गर्ने भित्रपट्टिको ढोकामाथि तामाको तोरण चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Budhācārya Kuberasiṃ, together with his wife Dhaṃlāni and other family members, installed a coppertoraṇaabove the inner door leading to the sanctum sanctorum (garbhagṛha).बुधाचार्य कुबेरसिंले श्रीमती धंलानि सहित परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर गर्भगृहभित्र प्रवेश गर्ने भित्रपट्टिको ढोकामाथि तामाको तोरण चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
