<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_17> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering throne to Lokeśvara"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mānabira Siṃ, with his son Sukumā and daughter Tavdhi, and other relatives, dedicated anāsana(pedestal) for the image of Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara.मानबिरसिंले छोरा सुकुमां, छोरी तवधिक लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर पद्मपाणि लोकेश्वरको लागि आसन चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Mānabira Siṃ, with his son Sukumā and daughter Tavdhi, and other relatives, dedicated anāsana(pedestal) for the image of Padmapāṇi Lokeśvara.मानबिरसिंले छोरा सुकुमां, छोरी तवधिक लगायत परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर पद्मपाणि लोकेश्वरको लागि आसन चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
