<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_18> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of khasis (door jambs)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Kabiṃnarasiṃ and his wife Mati Thakuṃ, along with their family, offered a pair of brasskhasipanels on both sides of the inner doorway of the sanctum sanctorum (garbhagṛha).कबिंनरसिं र उनकी श्रीमती मति थकुंले परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर गर्भगृहको भित्रपट्टिको ढोकाको दायाँबायाँ पित्तलको पाताले मोडिएको खसि चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Kabiṃnarasiṃ and his wife Mati Thakuṃ, along with their family, offered a pair of brasskhasipanels on both sides of the inner doorway of the sanctum sanctorum (garbhagṛha).कबिंनरसिं र उनकी श्रीमती मति थकुंले परिवारका सदस्यहरूसँग मिलेर गर्भगृहको भित्रपट्टिको ढोकाको दायाँबायाँ पित्तलको पाताले मोडिएको खसि चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
