<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_2> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Replacing jhiṅgaṭī with gilded roof"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhīmasiṃha Mānandhara used the profits from his trade with Tibet to replace the uppermost roof tiles with a gilded roof, overlaying the space previously covered withjhīṅgaṭītiles.मानंध्र भिमसिं (भीमसिंह मानन्धर) ले तिब्बत व्यापारबाट कमाएको पैसाले मन्दिरको सबभन्दा माथिल्लो छानामा राखिएको झिङ्गटीको ठाउँमा सुनको मोलम्बा लगाइएको छाना राखिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Bhīmasiṃha Mānandhara used the profits from his trade with Tibet to replace the uppermost roof tiles with a gilded roof, overlaying the space previously covered withjhīṅgaṭītiles.मानंध्र भिमसिं (भीमसिंह मानन्धर) ले तिब्बत व्यापारबाट कमाएको पैसाले मन्दिरको सबभन्दा माथिल्लो छानामा राखिएको झिङ्गटीको ठाउँमा सुनको मोलम्बा लगाइएको छाना राखिदिएका थिए ।"@en ;
