<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_3> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of brass threshold"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Naravīra, Machīnara, and Chaturumuni jointly offered the threshold for the inner door leading into the santum sanctorum (garbhagṛha) of Lokeśvara.नरवीर, मछीनर र चतुरुमुनि तीन जनाले मिलेर लोकेश्वरको गर्भगृहभित्र प्रवेश गर्ने भित्रपट्टिको ढोकामा threshold चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "Naravīra, Machīnara, and Chaturumuni jointly offered the threshold for the inner door leading into the santum sanctorum (garbhagṛha) of Lokeśvara.नरवीर, मछीनर र चतुरुमुनि तीन जनाले मिलेर लोकेश्वरको गर्भगृहभित्र प्रवेश गर्ने भित्रपट्टिको ढोकामा threshold चढाएका थिए ।"@en ;
