<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell (BKT0570-002)"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A bell (BKT0570-002) was installed in the Lokeśvara temple; the inscription engraved on it does not record the donor’s name.लोकेश्वर मन्दिरमा घण्टा (BKT0570-002) चढाइएको थियो । घण्टामा कुँदिएको अभिलेखमा दाताको नाम उल्लेख गरिएको छैन ।"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fa3a74b1-ee19-4b08-bd78-4d9c72befbbe> ;
    rdfs:comment "A bell (BKT0570-002) was installed in the Lokeśvara temple; the inscription engraved on it does not record the donor’s name.लोकेश्वर मन्दिरमा घण्टा (BKT0570-002) चढाइएको थियो । घण्टामा कुँदिएको अभिलेखमा दाताको नाम उल्लेख गरिएको छैन ।"@en ;
