    dcterms:description "The Phalcā was recently rebuilt with the fund provided by the Shankharapur Municipality. The Suntvāḥ Ṭola Sudhara Samiti, a local committee formed for the conservation of the area, had also contributed some money that was insufficient for the reconstruction."@en ;
