<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fb345afd-944e-49a0-a46a-441395076f6c_1> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a sataḥ"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Aṣṭamī Sevā Guthi, a religious trust of 28 people including the guru of the Jyāthā Ṭola Devānanda Prajāpati, senior Tuisiṃ, and manager Visuṃdla, constructed another rest house (sataḥ) in front of the temple."@en ;
