        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A donor erected a rest house (phalcā) in memory of his late father, Mahaṃtasī, and dedicated it to him, his mother, wife, and son, with prayers for their eternal peace. The donor's name was unfortunately illegible, as it was obscured by concrete."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fb345afd-944e-49a0-a46a-441395076f6c> ;
