<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fb345afd-944e-49a0-a46a-441395076f6c_4> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of new statue of Viśvakarmā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Matyaṃsiṃ Prajāpati and his wife, Manamati, along with their sons and grandsons, replaced the old, worn-out statue of Viśvakarmā with a new one, wishing for the eternal peace of their deceased family members. They also established a religious trust with land and money for the statue’s anniversary rituals."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fb345afd-944e-49a0-a46a-441395076f6c> ;
    rdfs:comment "Matyaṃsiṃ Prajāpati and his wife, Manamati, along with their sons and grandsons, replaced the old, worn-out statue of Viśvakarmā with a new one, wishing for the eternal peace of their deceased family members. They also established a religious trust with land and money for the statue’s anniversary rituals."@en ;
