    rdfs:label "Repair of the statue of Viśvakarmā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Digusivā Guthi, a religious trust responsible for serving the Prajāpati community's lineage deity, headed by Cidhisiṃha, renovated the dilapidated statue of Viśvakarmā and gilded it. The statue was taken around the city before being established inside the sanctum."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fb345afd-944e-49a0-a46a-441395076f6c> ;
