        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering of a bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A bell offered by Mānakumārī and others is kept in front of the temple. The iron grill covering the bell for protection makes a reader difficult to read the inscription. One name that could be read is 'Mānakumārī'."@en ;
