<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fd8edca5-50d5-43ed-9fc1-b2f0512e7002_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Inscription on entrance"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Ancient inscription carved on the entablement of the temple, to the right above the door.Yogi Naraharinath mentions an inscription of Udhyot Chand dated of ŚS 1313 (1391 CE) (Naraharinath 1956, p. 208, cited inSharma 2012, p. 67). It is currently unclear whether this is the inscription in question."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fd8edca5-50d5-43ed-9fc1-b2f0512e7002> ;
    rdfs:comment "Ancient inscription carved on the entablement of the temple, to the right above the door.Yogi Naraharinath mentions an inscription of Udhyot Chand dated of ŚS 1313 (1391 CE) (Naraharinath 1956, p. 208, cited inSharma 2012, p. 67). It is currently unclear whether this is the inscription in question."@en ;
