<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fdb69fc2-0782-4930-8ef8-df57c79c1006_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:DestructionEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Replacing clay statue with stone one"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Previously, the sanctum of thebāhāḥhoused a clay statue of Akṣobhya. However, when this clay statue became damaged, Dānamāyā Vajrācārya replaced it with a new statue made of stone, preserving the representation of Akṣobhya within the sanctum."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fdb69fc2-0782-4930-8ef8-df57c79c1006> ;
    rdfs:comment "Previously, the sanctum of thebāhāḥhoused a clay statue of Akṣobhya. However, when this clay statue became damaged, Dānamāyā Vajrācārya replaced it with a new statue made of stone, preserving the representation of Akṣobhya within the sanctum."@en ;
