<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fde1a7e2-5e0d-4dd6-bdeb-12b861aec8d6_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Construction of a capāḥ and endowment of lands"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Mahantasiṃ Bhāro from the Nhulache Nani at the Indulācheṭolain Devapattana built a rest house (capāḥ) south of the Piṅgalāmāī shrine in the name of his mother Padmāvati. He also endowed tworopanīs of land in the name of Vajreśvarī, another name for Piṅgalāmāī."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fde1a7e2-5e0d-4dd6-bdeb-12b861aec8d6> ;
