<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fe209a6f-0543-4c9d-96d6-d5bbb307c227_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:TransferOfCustody ;
    rdfs:label "Initial construction, land endowment and formation of guthi"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhāgīsiṃha Bhāro (Amātya) and his brother Siddhisiṃha Bāro jointly sponsored the initial construction of the Phalcā and Jaḥdhuṃhiti in memory of their father Manoharasiṃha Bhāro. They had also endowed sixropanīsof land and formed aguthito continue annual and other rituals at the Phalcā."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fe209a6f-0543-4c9d-96d6-d5bbb307c227> ;
    rdfs:comment "Bhāgīsiṃha Bhāro (Amātya) and his brother Siddhisiṃha Bāro jointly sponsored the initial construction of the Phalcā and Jaḥdhuṃhiti in memory of their father Manoharasiṃha Bhāro. They had also endowed sixropanīsof land and formed aguthito continue annual and other rituals at the Phalcā."@en ;
