<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fe209a6f-0543-4c9d-96d6-d5bbb307c227_1> a crm:E12_Production,
        crm:E5_Event,
        hg:Production ;
    rdfs:label "Rebuilding the Phalcā"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The Department of Archaeology reconstructed Sāḥgaḥ Mandaḥ Phalcā in 2008 CE under the leadership of Sukra Sagar Shrestha (Shokoohy and others2014, p. 162). Before it was rebuilt, only a square plinth along with theśivaliṅga andjaḥdhuṃhad persisted for decades, but no other remnants of the older strcuture."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fe209a6f-0543-4c9d-96d6-d5bbb307c227> ;
