<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/fe31a222-7251-4f81-984d-55caf99e4abf_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Inscription parsing Ripu Malla"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Transliteration of the inscription, based on Y. Naraharinath's reading (1956) and direct observation.1. Oṃ maṇi padme hum||ripu[malla] … (Tibetan)2. …ripumalla rājaranī(ti)…lekośa3. …likhapitā 1 nirjitāhitapakṣeṇa ripumallenabhūbhu4.sādhanījinakatvā…ripumalla cirajya||lekanathapadadhyānalavu5.ratnatrayāmidhā||likhitāripumallena vi… sarvāth sādhanī"@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/fe31a222-7251-4f81-984d-55caf99e4abf> ;
    rdfs:comment "Transliteration of the inscription, based on Y. Naraharinath's reading (1956) and direct observation.1. Oṃ maṇi padme hum||ripu[malla] … (Tibetan)2. …ripumalla rājaranī(ti)…lekośa3. …likhapitā 1 nirjitāhitapakṣeṇa ripumallenabhūbhu4.sādhanījinakatvā…ripumalla cirajya||lekanathapadadhyānalavu5.ratnatrayāmidhā||likhitāripumallena vi… sarvāth sādhanī"@en ;
