        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Offering stone toraṇa"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Cidhi, Juju, Muni and their mother Bha Thakuṃ had jointly offered carved stone toraṇa with Hariharihariharivāhana Lokeśvara and other deities over the entrance to the sanctum. Together they offered carved pylons to Lokeshwar and other deities."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ff0b3390-3e1d-4e7b-8967-ea1392119b18> ;
