    rdfs:label "Repair of bell"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Bhakta Bahādura Tāmrākāra, a resident of Taṃgala Ṭola, repaired the bell offered by Jagadvīpeśvarī. In doing so, he wished for the late Keśarīmāyā Tāmrākāra to find enlightenment."@en ;
