    rdfs:label "Theft of silver jewels and new offering"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The silver jewels worn by the Nāmasaṅgīti statue were stolen at the beginning of 2022 CE (VS 2079). As a result, the descendants of late Maṅgalalāla and Sunamāyā Maharjana offered the missing items."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ff56f30d-fc86-4e51-9e27-4e350f151f35> ;
