<https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/event/ffb6b9de-98f7-4dc6-bf8e-3f43095471ae_0> a crm:E5_Event,
        hg:HistoricalEvent ;
    rdfs:label "Establishment of the Mahiṣāsuramardinī statue"@en ;
    dcterms:description "The inscription in the sanctum records that Lakṣasiṃha and his brother, the sons of Śukrasiṃha Bhāro, established the statue during the reign of King Śivasiṃhadeva. It also reveals that the main settlement of Nuwakot was formerly known as Brahmanagara, and Jagatasiṃha Bhāro served as the main administrative officer (pramāna) of the region at that time.The inscription is edited in D. Vajrācārya and Ṭ. Śreṣṭha VS 2032, second part, p. 7, and reads as follows:L1 ...... नेपालके श्रीव्रह्मनगरे गंदकिस्था-L2 ने ॥ श्रीश्रीश्रीभगवति देवि थापना दि-L3 ...... गङ याँतछें ॥ भंद्रि श्रीशुक्रसिंह भारो ज्ये-L4 ष्ठ पुत्र लक्षसिंह भारो मध्य पुत्र पि-L5 ...... त्त भारो ॥ थ्वते उभयस याङान श्रीL6 ...... दिन सर्व्वदा ॥ शुभ ॥ सम्वत् ७३७ वै ....L7 .... अस्तम्यायां तिथौ ....L8 कर्ण्ण मुहूत्रेः वृहस्पतिवासरे मेष ....L9 राशिगते चन्द्रमसि ॥ श्रीश्रीशिवसिंहदेवविजय-L10 राजे ॥ प्रमान जगतसिंह भारो । .... प्रमानL11 जुरो । दोरखप्यात नामन ...."@en ;
    crm:P12_occurred_in_the_presence_of <https://data.cairnepal.org/heritage/resource/monument/ffb6b9de-98f7-4dc6-bf8e-3f43095471ae> ;
    rdfs:comment "The inscription in the sanctum records that Lakṣasiṃha and his brother, the sons of Śukrasiṃha Bhāro, established the statue during the reign of King Śivasiṃhadeva. It also reveals that the main settlement of Nuwakot was formerly known as Brahmanagara, and Jagatasiṃha Bhāro served as the main administrative officer (pramāna) of the region at that time.The inscription is edited in D. Vajrācārya and Ṭ. Śreṣṭha VS 2032, second part, p. 7, and reads as follows:L1 ...... नेपालके श्रीव्रह्मनगरे गंदकिस्था-L2 ने ॥ श्रीश्रीश्रीभगवति देवि थापना दि-L3 ...... गङ याँतछें ॥ भंद्रि श्रीशुक्रसिंह भारो ज्ये-L4 ष्ठ पुत्र लक्षसिंह भारो मध्य पुत्र पि-L5 ...... त्त भारो ॥ थ्वते उभयस याङान श्रीL6 ...... दिन सर्व्वदा ॥ शुभ ॥ सम्वत् ७३७ वै ....L7 .... अस्तम्यायां तिथौ ....L8 कर्ण्ण मुहूत्रेः वृहस्पतिवासरे मेष ....L9 राशिगते चन्द्रमसि ॥ श्रीश्रीशिवसिंहदेवविजय-L10 राजे ॥ प्रमान जगतसिंह भारो । .... प्रमानL11 जुरो । दोरखप्यात नामन ...."@en ;
