    dcterms:references "Sources and references Inscription identification number BKT0810_I_001 Sources Stone inscription from NS 798 affixed to the west wall of the Hiti premises. Dimensions: H 92 cm, W 56 cm. References: R. Tevārī et al. VS 2019, pp. 25–28; Ś. Rājavaṃśī VS 2020, pp. 20–21; Regmi 1966, pp. 178–181; Vaidya & Shrestha 2002, pp. 149–152; B. Pauḍela VS 2065, pp. 52–53. This inscription was originally placed within the large garden of the Bhaktapur palace complex. It was later relocated and affixed to the western wall of the Bālākhu Hiti (Ś. Rājavaṃśī VS 2020, p. 20)."@en ;
