    dcterms:references "Sources and references Inscription identification number LAL0220_I_001 Sources Inscription of NS 906 Dhau Bāhāḥ, inscription of NS 906. Locke (1985,146) has mistakenly read the date of the inscriptions as NS 706 . Moreover, he states that the toraṇa mentioned in the inscription is the toraṇa which is installed above the main door. However, the toraṇa mentioned in the inscriptions is offered to the image of Maitreya Bodhisattva."@en ;
